dresses if the pockets were not there.\",\"title\":\"Cool and pretty house dress :)\"},{\"name\":\"Hel███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought two of these house dresses.  Love the pockets and needed light weight for the Summer.  Suggest you wash first.  I put it on delicate.\"},{\"name\":\"Lou\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"For around the house during hot summer months in SoCal, these are great. Washed in cold water; low dry temp after receiving and they came out wrinkle free. They fit to size; at least for me: 5\'6\\\" 160 lbs. XL. Was pleased; material a tad thin perhaps. Will be interesting to see how they wear. Be careful zipping up the half zipper, it likes to catch of the placard.  Will order more when available ... most colors were gone.\",\"title\":\"Nice duster; thin fabric for hot weather\"},{\"name\":\"LAAS\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased this for my mother. She loves it!! She wears it every day. Had to purchase more in the other colors\",\"title\":\"Love it!\"},{\"name\":\"Suz███eam███ez\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Very cute. Good to wear around the house and even a quick trip to take out the trash if you oversleep! I deducted one star for comfort because the tag is sewn in with the itchiest thread ever! And it was a little annoying to try and cut it out which I did. That helped!\",\"title\":\"Around the house\"},{\"name\":\"Judy\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I expected a house dress.\",\"title\":\"Too thin and only qualifies for sleeping.\"},{\"name\":\"Lit███uck███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"i like the nice cool seersucker material.  It is about 3  inches too short %26 generally skimpily made allover. Hope the seams hold in the washer.  Very comfortable. Runs small.\",\"title\":\"Okay, but wouldn\'t buy again.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Flimsy material, runs small, easily torn.\",\"title\":\"Not well made\"},{\"name\":\"Rod███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Thiis gown is as terrible as the paper gowns at the hospital.\",\"title\":\"Awful\"},{\"name\":\"Sandy\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I do not like fabric.. to thin runs small\",\"title\":\"Duster\"}]',NULL,23.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Pajamas & Loungewear\",\"Womens Nightshirts & Gowns\"]'),(48,'Block Heels','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/J-Adams-Camila-Block-Heeled-Strappy-Sandals-for-Women-Nude-PU-9_d5872ecb-fbad-4678-adb5-c19749e587c2.014f1bb7b39a2b141a8bd801d3fb6c51.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"5.5\",\"6\",\"6.5\",\"7\",\"7.5\",\"8\",\"8.5\",\"9\",\"9.5\",\"10\",\"11\"]','[\"Black Vegan Suede\",\"Marigold Vegan Suede\",\"Nude Vegan Leather\",\"Nude Vegan Suede\",\"Snake PU\",\"Tan Vegan Leather\",\"White Vegan Leather\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Tay███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"very cute! Perfect height for walking\",\"title\":\"Love these shoew\"},{\"name\":\"TN\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is my first pair of strappy heels and I am so in love! The shoe is surprisingly light, and the straps are supportive in all the right places (most importantly, around my ankle) so trying these on and walking around my apartment felt like a breeze. The heel is about three inches tall, which is personally my ideal heel height if I\'m looking to walk long distances. Very, very happy with these shoes and looking forward to pairing them with some cute jeans. \\n\\nI\'m usually a size 6.5 in sandals and heels and these fit just right.\",\"title\":\"Perfect size, perfect look!\"},{\"name\":\"TN\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is my first pair of strappy heels and I am so in love! The shoe is surprisingly light, and the straps are supportive in all the right places (most importantly, around my ankle) so trying these on and walking around my apartment felt like a breeze. The heel is about three inches tall, which is personally my ideal heel height if I\'m looking to walk long distances. Very, very happy with these shoes and looking forward to pairing them with some cute jeans. \\n\\nI\'m usually a size 6.5 in sandals and heels and these fit perfectly.\",\"title\":\"So cute and comfy!\"},{\"name\":\"MO\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These heels are the perfect height to wear daily. I love that I can pair them with just about anything. The straps are so cute too!\",\"title\":\"Perfect everyday heel\"},{\"name\":\"Jbone\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These shoes are perfect an ordinary outfit pop. I chose the marigold and very happy with the color, material and the quality of the shoe.\",\"title\":\"Great Style and good quality\"},{\"name\":\"LA\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Cute little shoe. Blush/Nude color goes with anything\",\"title\":\"Cute\"},{\"name\":\"She███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very comfortable, if you\'re not big on wearing heels this is the perfect shoe. The heel isn\'t too high or low, it\'s just right and still very stylish and on trend.\",\"title\":\"Stylish and Chic\"},{\"name\":\"Eli███eth███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"they will not stay on my heel the strap falls down. their cute but i will return them\"},{\"name\":\"Fra███ne\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The shoe looks beautiful however, the elastic/buckle portion is poorly made. Seems as if they will break away with the first wear.\",\"title\":\"Wanted to love…\"},{\"name\":\"Tonya\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,41.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Womens Shoes\",\"Heels\",\"Block Heels\"]'),(49,'Plus Size Activewear','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/TheLovely-Women-Plus-Front-and-Back-Reversible-Spaghetti-Strap-Flowy-Cami-Tank-Tops_7640a0fc-19be-4667-9f8e-18c1e84ff551.655627375df98cdf24bb4e27423bfd08.jpeg\"',4.10,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\"]','[\"Army Green\",\"Ash Grey\",\"Ash Mocha\",\"Ash Olive\",\"Ash Rose\",\"Black\",\"Blue Grey\",\"Bone\",\"Bright Blue\",\"Brown\",\"Candy Pink\",\"Cement\",\"Charcoal\",\"Cocoa\",\"Copper\",\"DK Burgundy\",\"DK Olive\",\"DK Plum\",\"DK Rust\",\"Deep Camel\",\"Deep Coral\",\"Deep Sky\",\"Dusty Banana\",\"Dusty Blush\",\"Dusty Green\",\"Dusty