 bra is supportive enough for lazing around the house or a quick store run.\"},{\"name\":\"Dav███A.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really like this bra. The bra feels good, comfortable, and helps shapes my breast.  Being a male and having breast I needed the proper support. I enjoy wearing this bra now.\",\"title\":\"Great feeling bra\"},{\"name\":\"Dav███A.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'ve been wearing this bra for the last few months. As a male with large boobs this bra really change my life. My boobs don\'t bounce as much. The bra is very very comfortable and support. I\'m very happy with this bra.\",\"title\":\"Nice comfortable bra\"},{\"name\":\"Megan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Will buy more of these (30H)\\nIt\'s taken a long time to find a bra that actually fits so I really love this one. It\'s really soft, fits incredibly well. No ubi-boob, and it actually supports me unlike some bralettes that are basically just cloth covers. I am buying this again.\"},{\"name\":\"LaRae\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really like this bralette. It is comfortable and gives good support while also  being pretty. Sometimes you get what you pay for. I believe it to be worth it.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Super comfy! I am making an effort to switch to unlined bras, and suffice it to say that\'s a difficult goal when you are a 34K (US). This bra seems to run a little small in the cup and band, but it was comfortably snug and still fit the girls well. I like the stretch of the lace, and the middle seam up each cup is not too thick.\"},{\"name\":\"Ray\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Pretty but tight.\\nI really like this bralette. It‚Äôs beautiful and the lace is soft, however, the band is a very tight and it has five hooks in the back, which is more than I expected. I‚Äôm a 32GG and I sized up to an H and I‚Äôm glad I did. I think I could have also sized up to a 34.\"},{\"name\":\"Nicci\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This bralette is so near perfection! My only complaint, is that the lacy straps are very itchy for me, even after several washes. Swap the lacy straps out for the wide, padded straps of the Charlotte lace bra, and I swear you will have the most supportive, comfortable, and cutest bralette ever made for larger busts. I will beg, if necessary. Lol\\n\\nThe band does run small by one size, but the cup size stays the same - I\'m typically a 34 FF/H, but went for the 36 FF/H.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Wanted to love this so badly, but it only works ‚Äúokay‚Äù for me. \\n\\nPros:\\nSuper cute, great color, sturdy comfortable lace material \\n\\nCons:\\nJ hook conversion brought a lot of pain to my shoulders due to it changing the weight distribution. \\n\\nStyle didn‚Äôt keep my breasts in place, when moving/ bending my boobs would try to escape out the middle. I was unable to make adjustments to reduce this happening. I have full on top breasts which contributes to this. \\n\\nThe flexible side boning would dig  into my skin and leave minor bruising underneath my armpits. The boning didn‚Äôt prevent the fabric from rolling so I eventually just cut the pieces out which made it so much more comfortable\"}]',NULL,50.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Bras\",\"Wireless Bras\"]'),(118,'Mens Robes','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Authentic-Hotel-and-Spa-Unisex-Navy-Blue-Turkish-Cotton-Terry-Bath-Robe-with-White-Block-Monogram-Z-S-M_9488963b-5227-433d-8722-4ca23e840c3c_1.39eae61f6cd04a66fdd03cc599d32c00.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"Large / XLarge\",\"Small / Medium\"]','[\"Gray\",\"Navy\",\"Pink\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Dei███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love it. And the monogram adds to it.💜\"},{\"name\":\"Nurya\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful, great confort and good quality\",\"title\":\"Cozy bathrobe\"},{\"name\":\"Terri\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"it was nice...a gift for my daughter...for the price I thought it would be more plush...very disappointed for the money I paid...\",\"title\":\"disappointed\"},{\"name\":\"Hai███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,63.74,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Pajamas and Robes\",\"Mens Robes\"]'),(119,'Comforter Sets',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/All-Season-Camel-3-Piece-Twin-Size-Down-Alternative-Comforter-Set-with-Corner-Tabs_3cbe9642-ba71-447b-8a28-c4a3d08e9374.8afbe27421b602dc7c9d75a03b5981b2.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"Twin\",\"Queen\",\"King\"]','[\"Aqua Blue\",\"Blue\",\"Camel\",\"Gray\",\"Green\",\"Ivory\",\"Navy\",\"Peach\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Pri███ss\",\"rating\":5,\"title\":\"Perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the color, comfort and weight.\",\"title\":\"Just as advertised\"},{\"name\":\"Pam███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It is light weight! Something I\'ve been looking for period I have hot flashes, it looks good and I didn\'t have to kick it off of me all night.  Hollywood highly recommended highly recommended.\\nHow do you recommend it? Can you wipe the rubber bombing place outside? Sister mary\'s next class then you\'r\",\"title\":\"It feels so cozy and is beautiful\"},{\"name\":\"Duc███0\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was happy with this purchase. Washed up nicely, soft and feels of good quality. Perfect for our guest house.\",\"title\":\"Good comforter!\"},{\"name\":\"Aly\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the color of the comforter and that it has natural wrinkles to it, it makes my room feel very homey. \\n\\nVery warm and thick - definitely for a cooler temp house.\"},{\"name\":\"Sara\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fabric was soft and it was light weight so it\'s great for the summer. The corners have a spot to tie into a duvet which is a nice addition.  Still had a fluff to it and that makes it look nice in the bed. Loved that the twin comes with two shams\",\"title\":\"Would buy again\"},{\"name\":\"Ann\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"After weeks of scouring the Internet for the perfect guest bedroom comforter look, I found it with this set. The camel color is not too dark, which is perfect.  It is beautiful, soft, and I love the \\\"natural, permanent winkles\\\" look. It is lightweight though, so I can\'t see it as \\\"all-weather\\\" and will add a blanket underneath in winter. If you are looking for a big, fluffy, smooth comforter, this is not it - even the photos show it as a thinner, wrinkled one, which is exactly what I personally was looking for to add character to the bed.\",\"title\":\"Just what I was searching for...\"},{\"name\":\"Jam███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love love the feel, texture and quality of this comforter. Didn\'t use it as yet but I love it so much and the quality looks so high end with order more for myself and sister.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful and soft\"},{\"name\":\"anita\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"the color was was a little off as my drapes were cream, this was a little off. but it was exactly what I wanted. \\ni have a high matress so i ordered a Queen. fiits my full bed exactly.\\nvacume packed so expect wrinkles.  but through them in dryer. love it. \\nits not heavy or plush . but nice for the ptice.\",\"title\":\"exactly what I wanted\"},{\"name\":\"Tori\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Overall a very beautiful set. However, it was returned because it did not fit my king size bed. It seemed to run very small. It didn\'t even cover my sheets. I was very disappointed.\",\"title\":\"Disappointed with size\"}]',NULL,35.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Comforters\",\"Comforter Sets\"]'),(120,'Heating Mattress toppers','[\"Reviewers highlighted: warmth, comfort, for winter\",\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/JUSTLET-Electric-Heated-Mattress-Pad-8-Temperature-Control-Zone-Safe-Auto-Shut-off-White-Twin_6dc8f0ce-18db-4947-8a23-748cf51c9d36.9213881c3c42d17b3be31a41576e39fc.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"Twin\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\"]','[\"Gray\",\"White\",\"White-2\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"JZ\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Does what\'s advertised. Seems like a quality product. I like the simplicity of the controls, which always has a time limit and remembers the previously used settings.\",\"title\":\"Very cozy and great controls.\"},{\"name\":\"PATG5\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought this as a surprise for my husband. He is cold all the time due to medications. He loves it! I highly recommend it!\",\"title\":\"Excellent product!\"},{\"name\":\"Tree\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Heats up nicely, It has really nice material, well made. \\nKing mattress pad fits perfectly without the corners being hard to pull on! Highly recommended!\",\"title\":\"Extremely comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Renee\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought for my daughter as a gift and she loves it. Raves about how cozy her bed is and how well she sleeps in the warmth. Recommends it to all her friends\",\"title\":\"Great buy!\"},{\"name\":\"Patty\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"its  worth its money like i said i love it its better then the electric blank  wish i had it   sooner\",\"title\":\"love it\"},{\"name\":\"Dawn\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought this for our full size bed and thus far we have had no issues with it. Even when we don\'t use it it still helps with keeping my back and legs from getting as cold as they did on just the mattress and sheets. So it\'s a win for me. Wintertime is hard on an achy body.\",\"title\":\"so far so good\"},{\"name\":\"MjmRK\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"out of the box, was very thin. We could easly feelthe wires. Afterplugging it in , and leaving it for an hour  it was barely warm,  definitely not as hot as expected based on other heated pads we have had in the past. Then we noticed the controllers were  halfway down the side of the bed, and would not reach the bedside tables......packed it up and sent back..\",\"title\":\"piece of junk\"},{\"name\":\"Babs\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Beware there is no padding in this heated mattress cover,  The wires are easily felt through this pad, I didn\'t even try it out or completely unfold it.   I knew as soon as I took it out of the plastic bag I was going to have to return it.  No way could this be a   comfortable pad or stand up to machine washing.\",\"title\":\"Beware!\"},{\"name\":\"Eric\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Received an email saying the product was delivered, it was not! Went through the proper channels to remedy the situation and never received any contact from the seller.\",\"title\":\"no show\"},{\"name\":\"Den███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Vacuum packed, yet stated not to mash it up too much when storing. \\nThe cord from the foot of the bed conductor barely reaches halfway back up the bed.\\nVery long cord to plug into wall.\",\"title\":\"Cords too short\"}]',NULL,109.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Mattress Toppers & Pads\",\"Heating Mattress toppers\"]'),(121,'Dietary supplements',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Health-King-HernEase-Tea-60-Ct_9c7d32ef-28a2-4b7e-9551-ff91571ac9b3.7be7c9fd9d48da3b3d51378c1012f6e0.jpeg\"',3.00,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Dosage\",\"value\":\"3.00 Capsule(S)\"},{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"As a dietary supplement, take 3 capsules 3 times daily on empty stomach.\"},{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"none\"}]','[{\"name\":\"yam███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"All I can say is it worked for me and also for a friend of mine.\"},{\"name\":\"Ric███d C███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I didn\'t experience any improvement at all after taking two complete bottles of this product. I believe it is a total fraud and farce--just a scam to rip you off. It is a very costly product with absolutely no benefit for the condition it is supposed to treat. [This review was collected as part of a promotion.]\",\"title\":\"Would never consider getting HernEase again---a farce\"}]','Balanceuticals - Hernease - 60 Capsules              Supplement Facts    Serving Size: 3 Capsules    Servings Per Container: 20          Amount Per Serving   %DV        Proprietary Blend of Multiple Herbal Extracts   1430 mg  *    &nbsp;&nbsp; Lindera        &nbsp;&nbsp; Vladimira Root        &nbsp;&nbsp; Fennel Seed        &nbsp;&nbsp; Blue Citrus Peel        &nbsp;&nbsp; Areca Nut        &nbsp;&nbsp; Chinaberry        &nbsp;&nbsp; Evodia        &nbsp;&nbsp; Citrus Seed            *Daily Value Not Established.',43.99,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Balanceuticals - Hernease - 60 Capsules              Supplement Facts    Serving Size: 3 Capsules    Servings Per Container: 20          Amount Per Serving   %DV        Proprietary Blend of Multiple Herbal Extracts   1430 mg  *    &nbsp;&nbsp; Lindera        &nbsp;&nbsp; Vladimira Root        &nbsp;&nbsp; Fennel Seed        &nbsp;&nbsp; Blue Citrus Peel        &nbsp;&nbsp; Areca Nut        &nbsp;&nbsp; Chinaberry        &nbsp;&nbsp; Evodia        &nbsp;&nbsp; Citrus Seed            *Daily Value Not Established.\"}]','[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Vitamins and Supplements\",\"Dietary supplements\"]'),(122,'Seasoning mixes & blends','[\"Best seller\",\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/OLD-BAY-Kosher-Classic-Seafood-Seasoning-6-oz-Can_65a33fb4-d35f-4a1d-9d90-2dda3ccb8a8d.d9c05f29528c682bc64ffc59c4cdf4d7.jpeg\"',4.50,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Tips:Season burgers & chicken & seafood.Sprinkle on fries, corn-on-the-cob & everything.Toss on wings, pasta & popcorn.\"},{\"name\":\"Safe Handling Instructions\",\"value\":\"DO NOT USE IF SEAL UNDER LID IS BROKEN OR MISSING\"}]','[{\"name\":\"chi███npi███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It’s easy to see why Old Bay has been popular for over 75 years, and why it appears on restaurant tables next to the salt and pepper. Its blend of flavors enhances anything just needing a little extra zing. Its primary ingredient is celery salt, with spices, including red and black pepper, and paprika. There’s just enough heat from the red pepper that makes it spicy, but not too spicy. My favorite use for it is instead of a dry rub on pork ribs, chicken or other grilled or roasted meats (try it on roast turkey!), and it’s an absolutely indispensable ingredient in a Low Country Boil (crab, shrimp, sausage, corn on the cob, pearl onions, potatoes). It’s an excellent flavor addition to macaroni or potato salad, guacamole, deviled or scrambled eggs, baked potatoes, dips, clam chowder, tomato juice, and even popcorn – and of course simple boiled or steamed crab, lobster, shrimp or scallops. Eating healthy? Sprinkle a little Old Bay on half an avocado or spread the avocado and Old Bay on toasted bread. Low-sodium, “hot”, blackened, garlic/herb and lemon/herb versions are also available, as well as a prepared tartar sauce. There’s virtually no limit to its uses and I therefore highly recommend it.\",\"title\":\"Classic Chesapeake Bay Seafood Seasoning\"},{\"name\":\"h22o\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It just so happened my wife had just made a batch of chicken salad and I had \\\"Old Bay\\\"seasoning to add to it. These folks have been making this seasoning for 75+ years now...main ingredients celery salt, red and black pepper, paprika and this secret ingredient of mixed spices which makes one of the best seasonings for Poultry,Seafood, Meats and salads....so as you can see by the pictures, I dusted my chicken salad sandwiches... and her ritz crackers with \\\"Old Bay\\\" and what a nice spicy taste with a hint of celery to the taste...I will always have this spice on hand...it\'s a great addition to your spice rack plus there are some great recipes and tips, on the can that are helpful in adding a great spice to your next meal...\",\"title\":\"75 years and going strong...\"},{\"name\":\"ble███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'ve always known that Old Bay is great for steamed shrimp. But, I wanted to try it on other things. Well, let me tell you, I now love it on chicken. Just sprinkle it on and bake it or... how ever you want to prepare it. It really can be used on anything just like any other seasoning. I also tried it on ground beef. Again, very tasty. I like to make my own mayo and I like to try different seasonings in it. Old Bay is a very unique flavor to try. It is not like any other spice or combination of spices. I would try it on almost anything, I think. And I intend to. I really made use of the tips and recipe ideas printed on the can. They are very useful. I also like that it\'s in a can, not a glass or plastic bottle or jar. The lid has 3 ways to dispense it: spoon, pour or sprinkle. Great for summer BBQ, too.\",\"title\":\"Not Just for Shrimp anymore\"},{\"name\":\"Mon███23\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Old Bay is the classic American seasoning for crab and shrimp boils from the North East to the South. A fish bake, low land boil, or beach side lobster bake just isn\'t the same without it. But don\'t miss the chance to sprinkle in potato salad, on grilled beef and chicken. Mix with melted butter to baste your turkey and in your battered fried chicken. It adds a pleasant zing to anything it\'s mixed with and naturally enhances the flavor of just about every savory dish. Old Bay is a regular on my kitchen table next to the salt and pepper shaker and Crystal hot sauce. If you like to use seasoned salt, you will love Old Bay.\",\"title\":\"A classic for a reason\"},{\"name\":\"Wah███ah\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Old Bay can be used on everything. I put old bay on tuna salad, deviled egg,\",\"title\":\"OLD BAY\"},{\"name\":\"phy███nsc███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'ve heard of Old Bay Seasoning for years but never took the occasion to purchase and try it.\\n\\nI\'ve heard others rave about this seasoning, but as it seemed to be stressed mostly for seafood, and I\'m not that big a seafood eater, I passed on it. Then I got my free sample. I have to say that I\'m a convert. It boasts being for Seafood, Poultry, Salads and Meats. I\'ve tried it with them all and am impressed. Who would think that a blend of Celery Salt, and spices (including Red Pepper and Black Pepper) and Paprika could be so good? Well I do now!\\n\\nI first tried adding it to my salad Vinargrette and it was delicious. Then on to adding it into the breading of some fried fish. I even tried it with Fried Green Tomatoes with great results. Next, some fried chicken, and finally some steak. I\'m a convert! I can\'t wait to try it with even more things!\\n\\nI highly recommend this product\",\"title\":\"Excellent Seasoning!\"},{\"name\":\"rrr███rrr███rrr██████\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Old Bay Seasoning\\nOld Bay seasoning comes in a 6 ounce can which will probably last you a year or more. The seasoning is used for seafood, poultry, Seafood. Meats, Salads, basically everything. On the side of the container is a crab cake recipe. I have made these crabcakes according to this recipe and these are the best Maryland crab cakes I have ever eaten. They also gave you several other recipes for steamed shrimp, spicy marinated chicken, and steamed crabs. Basically you can use the seasoning for anything. I made the Spicy Marinated Chicken recipe on the Old Bay container and used it on a whole chicken tonight and put it in the oven and it was delicious, a little goes a long way. I also used it on a whole baking chicken. Old Bay Seasoning gave the chicken a nice golden brown covering. The chicken was moist and tasted wonderful. When boiling shrimp old bay seasoning in the water adds a delicious taste to the shrimp. This seasoning is made in the USA which is a selling point for me. The container is a bright yellow and red so easy to spot in my cabinet among the hundred other spices that all look alike.\",\"title\":\"Great for crab cakes\"},{\"name\":\"Kry███nia███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I\'d think twice about using the pick up department at certain locations. This damaged container should\'ve even been on the shelves let alone consciously give to a customer. The, obviously contaminated by default, food product was willingly picked to be sat in the back of a disabled person\'s car. As for the actual food seasoning I have no gripes with it, it\'s excellent for exactly what they make it for and more. This review was just tainted.\",\"title\":\"Crushed By Their Pick Up Department\"},{\"name\":\"kat███en\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I\'m got a broken package and the foil was not sealed, but you could see it was closed like it wasn\'t tampered with, but it didn\'t get glued properly and the guy wanted me to mail it back to get a refund now I bought some other item all they did was give me my money back I\'m\",\"title\":\"Mad\"},{\"name\":\"Suz███e\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"this is the SECOND time I\'ve gotten a can of this with the seal faulty! what\'s up with that?!\",\"title\":\"safety seal failure\"}]','Celery Salt (Salt, Celery Seed), Spices (Including Red Pepper and Black Pepper), and Paprika.',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Celery Salt (Salt, Celery Seed), Spices (Including Red Pepper and Black Pepper), and Paprika.\"}]','[\"Food\",\"Pantry\",\"Herbs, spices & seasoning mixes\",\"Seasoning mixes & blends\",\"Seasoning mixes & blends\"]'),(123,'Colored Sheets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-100-Cotton-600-Thread-Count-4-PCs-Sheet-Set-Easily-Fit-upto-21-Inch-Deep-Pockets-Solid-King-Light-Blue_452cb4b8-8cb7-4fe1-b26d-775d63a82a58.0915815ffb34d7db2a24b463903e261c.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"Alaska King\",\"California King\",\"Emperor\",\"Grand King\",\"King { 6-PCs Set }\",\"Queen { 6-PCs Set }\",\"RV King\",\"Short Queen\"]','[\"Black {Solid}\",\"Black {Stripe}\",\"Burgundy Solid\",\"Burgundy Stripe\",\"Burgundy {Solid}\",\"Burgundy {Stripe}\",\"Chocolate Solid\",\"Chocolate Stripe\",\"Chocolate {Solid}\",\"Chocolate {Stripe}\",\"Dark Grey {Solid}\",\"Dark Grey {Stripe}\",\"Ivory Stripe\",\"Ivory {Solid}\",\"Ivory {Stripe}\",\"Light Blue {Solid}\",\"Light Blue {Stripe}\",\"Navy Blue {Solid}\",\"Navy Blue {Stripe}\",\"Purple Solid\",\"Purple Stripe\",\"Purple {Solid}\",\"Purple {Stripe}\",\"Sage Green {Solid}\",\"Sage Green {Stripe}\",\"Silver Grey {Solid\",\"Silver Grey {Stripe\",\"Taupe Solid\",\"Taupe Stripe\",\"Taupe {Solid}\",\"Taupe {Stripe}\",\"Turquoise Solid\",\"Turquoise Stripe\",\"Turquoise {Solid}\",\"Turquoise {Stripe}\",\"White Stripe\",\"White {Solid}\",\"White {Stripe}\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Recommended first wash is Dry cleaning for longest color retention. From next wash, machine / hand wash is suggested. Do not bleach / soak. Wash dark colors separately and dry in shade. Recommended water temperature upto 40 degrees Celsius. Medium-Heavy ironing required after wash.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Xaw███po\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'ve had the Amay 100% Cotton 600-Thread Count Sheet Set for several months now, and they still look and feel brand new. The durability of these sheets is remarkable. The fabric has held up exceptionally well to multiple washes, and there is no pilling or fading. Even with the deep pockets, they remain securely in place on my California King mattress. I couldn\'t be happier with their long-lasting quality.\",\"title\":\"Built to Last!\"},{\"name\":\"Yis███ekn███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these sheets. My bed feels so much more comfortable and I slept very well. No complaints whatsoever ever. Would order again in the future!\",\"title\":\"Very cozy!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Brian\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay 100% Cotton 600-Thread Count 4-PCs Sheet Set in Turquoise has been a game-changer for my sleep experience. From the moment I laid down, I felt like I was sleeping on a cloud. The 600-thread count provides a level of softness and smoothness that is unmatched, making these sheets a true indulgence. The California King size fits my bed perfectly, and the deep pockets are an absolute lifesaver. I have a thicker mattress, but these sheets easily accommodate it, with no slipping or bunching up. The convenience of not having to readjust the sheets every night is a major plus.\",\"title\":\"Sleeping on Cloud Nine!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m in love with the Amay 600-Thread Count Sheet Set in Turquoise. The color is a dream, and the 100% cotton fabric is both comfortable and breathable. The deep pockets are a fantastic feature, ensuring a snug fit on my mattress. It\'s clear that quality is a priority with Amay. This sheet set has exceeded my expectations in every way!\",\"title\":\"Perfect\"}]',NULL,102.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Colored Sheets\"]'),(124,'Womens Casual Shoes','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/LifeStride-Womens-Zee-Loafers-Medium-Wide-Width_d8eb12c4-476e-4337-9a73-2e7df8448cc1.b9040cb515dd3877ed8fb35f01a45c65.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"5\",\"5.5\",\"6\",\"6.5\",\"7\",\"7.5\",\"8\",\"8.5\",\"9\",\"9.5\",\"10\",\"11\",\"12\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black Athena/Patent\",\"Black Gator\",\"Black Patent\",\"Dark Chocolate Croco\",\"Gray\",\"Grey/Silver\",\"Navy\",\"Navy Athena/Patent\",\"Navy Patent\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Spot or Wipe Clean\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Kat███N\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these shoes!  Great addition for flats. Updated loafer with distinctive trim features... patent leather accents and stitched trim around the sole. Love that there is no distinct “heel”. Very comfortable!\",\"title\":\"Updated loafer\"},{\"name\":\"MM52\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Just what I was l looking for … attractive & comfortable right out of the box.  Looks great with pants and true to size. Shoe bottoms provide cushion and secure footing\",\"title\":\"Look is great and so it fit.  Love these\"},{\"name\":\"Aly███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is my favorite shoe I bought these to replace the ones I have now because I wore down the sole\",\"title\":\"Backups\"},{\"name\":\"Lif███rid███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought this shoes to fit them with my classic trousers.. And it was a great match\\r\\nThese can be worn with anything \\r\\nMy size is 11US and they don\'t lok huge they lok so classy\",\"title\":\"Feet lock\"},{\"name\":\"Cou███eyL███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great so far! I bought these to replace one of my favorite pairs of shoes the LifeStride Zest Slip on. I\'d say these are a great replacement. Can be worn casually with jeans or dressed up a little more. I teach all day long in these without foot pain.\",\"title\":\"Cute and comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Lin███J.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great looking shoe for business or casual. High quality. Very satisfied. Definitely will buy another color!\",\"title\":\"Excellent choice for a loafer, all day comfort,\"},{\"name\":\"Ela███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They were too big.  I liked them and i liked the way they looked. I ordered a 5.5.  I wish i had tried the 5.  I will try a 5 next time.\",\"title\":\"Cute...\"},{\"name\":\"Bes███oaf███ ev███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these loafers, had exact pair for many years and bought two more pairs with a little different pattern but same style same color. Very comfortable and very lasting wear. Thrilled with all 3 pairs.\",\"title\":\"Throwback style to my generation!\"},{\"name\":\"Oli███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"They came as pictured but were too big. I had to return them.\",\"title\":\"They look like the photo but they run big.\"},{\"name\":\"Moo███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I purchased this shoe early last year. Wear them 2x a week.  Late in the summer I walked 15 feet to my car in a minor rain and my feet were soaked. I took them off in the car, and the soles of both had parted from left to right at the ball of the foot. So, not good quality at all. I can only wear them when no rain is in sight. Lasted about 6 months.\",\"title\":\"Falling Apart\"}]',NULL,69.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Womens Shoes\",\"Womens Casual Shoes\"]'),(125,'Mens T-Shirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Guy-Harvey-Men-s-Core-Tuna-Short-Sleeve-T-Shirt_6b702046-bd51-4e39-8b2f-4e2d5de2d00d.a51611524563ed2b1d6a8e14ba2875f5.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"Bright White\",\"Estate Blue\",\"Sport Grey Heather\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"James\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Excellent quality and value. Glad I found this here. Better pricing than competitors store.\",\"title\":\"Good shirt %26 price\"},{\"name\":\"Ton███3\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Par███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,26.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Shirts\",\"Mens T-Shirts\"]'),(126,'Baby Girls Casual Dresses','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/IBTOM-CASTLE-Flower-Girl-Tutu-Tulle-Dress-Little-Big-Princess-Wedding-Bridesmaid-Party-Communion-Formal-Short-Gown-for-Kids-6-12-Months-Blue_fa699f7b-8b00-4189-980e-0da680dca928.61c719f07219e92a801cb7723a61fbaa.png\"',3.70,'[\"12-18 Months\",\"18-24 Months\",\"2-3 Years\",\"4-5 Years\",\"5-6 Years\",\"6-12 Months\",\"7-8 Years\",\"9-10 Years\",\"10-11 Years\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Champagne\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Pink\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash in cold water, line dry, do not wring and bleach\"}]','[{\"name\":\"nubia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"beautiful i loved it my daughter looked beautiful\"},{\"name\":\"Bum███bee███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"the c gold trim is scratchy, the nettingbis hard it is ti wide v necklan is to low for a five year old,should be 14.99 not 20 anything\",\"title\":\"short party dress\"},{\"name\":\"mary\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,29.62,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Baby Clothes\",\"Baby Girls Clothing\",\"Baby Girls Dresses\",\"Baby Girls Casual Dresses\"]'),(127,'Toddler Bedding Sets & Sheets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Short-Queen-Size-Tailored-Drop-Multi-Ruffled-Solid-Bed-Skirt-Adjustable-Elastic-Belt-Microfiber-Fabric-Fade-Wrinkle-Resistant-Frame-Cover-Easy-Fit-Ca_581e7b06-9611-4bda-adc5-01decc2b6fac.7208a3811ab68c737335efb0414cd845.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\",\"Full-XL\",\"Olympic / Queen\",\"Short King\",\"Short Queen\",\"Three Quarter\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blood Red\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Golden\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Ivory\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Gray\",\"Lilac\",\"Moss\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Parrot Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Sage\",\"Taupe\",\"Turquoise Blue\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\",\"Zebra Print\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"EASY TO CARE, OPTIMUM QUALITY - Made using all natural materials, Can be machine washed and get softer over time. Fabric is lab tested to make sure no-pilling, no Linting, No Balls after wash, color fastness and finally sewed then packedfor shipping. To improve durability, warm wash and light dry. Use a short dry cycle.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Cat███ine███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,43.99,NULL,'[\"Baby\",\"Toddlers\' Room\",\"Toddler Bedding\",\"Toddler Bedding Sets & Sheets\"]'),(128,'Desk Chairs','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Yoyomax-Office-Chair-Ergonomic-Home-Desk-Chairs-Computer-Chair-Comfortable-Armrests-Mesh-Chairs-Wheels-Mid-Back-Task-Lumbar-Support_02df8f38-dee0-4112-b83a-03898c82de42.2171ded0895a33cda201592a5a20b3cf.jpeg\"',4.60,'[]','[\"Black\",\"Gray\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Wipe clean with wet cloth\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ben\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This was one of the few light-colored chairs that I could find in my budget. And it really looks great. It\'s a great task chair and over the past week my wife and I have been sharing it and it\'s holding up great. I\'m a bigger guy and my wife is is nowhere near my size and it\'s holding up pretty well. \\n\\nThe instructions could have been a bit more clear. It\'s the classic Xeroxed pages type instruction sheet, but it was nice that the pieces were packed in a vacuum seal set.\",\"title\":\"Easy assembly and sits great!\"},{\"name\":\"San███p\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The chair was packaged very well for transit. It took about 25 minutes to assemble. My first impression was that it gives a very nice quality feel when you sit on it. It also seemed very comfortable. What I liked the best was the vibrant grey color. I was little apprehensive in going for grey, having seen\",\"title\":\"Comfortable chair at a great price\"},{\"name\":\"Lou███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is definitely a sleek looking chair. I feel professional as I work home now. It\'s also very comfortable - no complaints as I\'ve been using this for long hours for days now. While assembling this chair, I noticed how the materials are really good quality. Aside from being aesthetically pleasing, i can say that the parts are pretty heavy duty as well.\",\"title\":\"Sleek design and good quality\"},{\"name\":\"Sub███h\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It came in a neat package with sufficient details to assemble. Comfortable chair. \\nSince working from home, i was looking for a good ergonomic chair. This ended my search. Good one.\",\"title\":\"Perfect choice for an Ergonomic Chair\"},{\"name\":\"Tah███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this little chair. I needed something nice and cost effective for my home office and found this chair. Took a risk on it, but it looks great, is super comfortable, and was really easy to assemble!\\n\\nFor 70 bucks I am really glad I made this purchase and would highly recommend it!\",\"title\":\"Awesome chair!\"},{\"name\":\"Nee███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Its a nice comfortable chair that can easily fit me, a 6.2 ft, 220 lb person. I bought this chair to help with my extended work from home duties during this pandemic, since my back was breaking after sitting on our dining chair for a few months, to i thought to spend some bucks on myself. \\nThis chair is not super expensive, like some other recommended ones in our office chatter, but a bang for buck when it comes to features:\\n- It has adjustable height that can easily fit me as well as my daughter\\n- Adjustable back support, can be loosened or tightened up as required\\n- Hand rest support\\n- Swirls around (i don\'t use it, but good for kids)\\n- Very breathable since its mesh build\\n- Nice and comfortable so i\'m not tired at the end of every day\\n\\nOn top of other features as mentioned above, the back support is the best one i can vouch for, and that alone gives it a five star in my opinion.\",\"title\":\"Excellent back support\"},{\"name\":\"aks███i\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Really awesome chair! I got this chair for my mom as she works from home and it is important for her to have proper lumbar support. She preferred this chair over her $300 chair! I would call that a success. I highly recommend this product!\",\"title\":\"Amazing Product!!\"},{\"name\":\"Shr███ha\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought this a couple of weeks ago and it is one of the best purchase I have done. The chair is very comfortable. It has cushions and back support is really good and has helped with my back pain. Height as well as the back of the chair is adjuatable which is something I was willing to pay extra for. But this chair is comparatively cheaper in terms of cost and offers all the benefits any luxury chair offers. I would definitely recommend this product for everyone, for students, gamers and professionals for their work from home settings.\",\"title\":\"Great product at a reasonable price\"},{\"name\":\"Cha███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I am not happy with the product delivered. Arm wrest bold fitting we\'re broken condition.\",\"title\":\"Not Good, arm wrest bold fitting were broken.\"},{\"name\":\"Evan\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"the support that runs along the back and attaches to the bottom broke in less than 5 months, I am 184lbs and 6\\\"0 tall so it should be able to support me\",\"title\":\"bad quality plastic\"}]',NULL,127.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Furniture\",\"Office Furniture\",\"Desk Chairs\"]'),(129,'School Backpacks','[\"In 100+ people\'s carts\",\"Rollback\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Cars-Kids-17-Light-Up-Lightning-McQueen-Backpack-Multi-Color_1a7ef37c-f7e5-4e80-8570-a75a8a507b4a.ece4dc6686de86e595e62333c3cddcf3.jpeg\"',4.80,'[]','[\"Assorted\",\"Cars Multi-Color\",\"Frozen Multi-Color\",\"Minecraft Light Up Multi-Color\",\"Princess Multi-Color\",\"Spider-Man Multi-Color\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Spot Wipe and Clean\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jul███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"love this backpack the light is so cute, its just like the picture lots of room for my kids supplies. definitely recommend.\",\"title\":\"so cute perfect size for my 6 year old.\"},{\"name\":\"shy███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"it does light up when you push on the backpack\",\"title\":\"great quality\"},{\"name\":\"C\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My son loves the backpack and that\'s all that matters to me.\"},{\"name\":\"Lau███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s pretty big and holds a good amount of stuff (my son is 8 and in 3rd grade) the lightning bolt on the front of it lights up when touched. My son loves it!\",\"title\":\"Disney Pixar “Cars” school bookbag.\"},{\"name\":\"Dani\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My son absolutely loves this Minecraft backpack! I actually didn\'t know that it could light up until after I bought it 😂 so that was a plus! We found a Minecraft lunchbox and thermos to match 😊 Anyway, this backpack is very good quality and seems like it\'ll hold up. No issues. The lights work just fine. A decent price (like $15) instead of going somewhere and getting something similar for double the price.\",\"title\":\"1st Grader Loves This!\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My son loved this backpack! It lights up!\",\"title\":\"Back to school\"},{\"name\":\"Jul███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"very nice backpack perfect size for my 10 year old. he loves the flashing lights on the TNT. definitely recommend.\",\"title\":\"awesome backpack\"},{\"name\":\"Tonia\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"My daughter loves this book bag especially the light up feature. Her new thing is “my book bag lights up and you don\'t” it Has pockets to put all her necessary school items and is thick and sturdy.\",\"title\":\"My book bag lights up and yours don\'t!!\"},{\"name\":\"Myr███a\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This backpack is really good so far it is very big. I am going to be a senior in high school and this fits all of my stuff. The only thing about it though is the glitter there\'s no protect on it so it does come off. My bed is literally so glittery Right now I haven\'t even used it at all, but the glitter is coming off but other than that it\'s true good material. I can\'t wait to see how far it gets.\",\"title\":\"The glitter comes off people\"},{\"name\":\"Maria\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Snow White has black lips! The color is wrong.  My little daughter is so disappointed\",\"title\":\"Wong color\"}]',NULL,16.94,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Bags & Accessories\",\"Backpacks\",\"School Backpacks\"]'),(130,'Young Adult Sweatshirts & Hoodies','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fantaslook-V-Neck-Sweatshirts-for-Women-Casual-Long-Sleeve-Tops-Oversized-Sweatshirt-With-Pockets_46693c81-0216-440f-bda9-ce972fab1b99.52ef9332e7e77b7aaf253d3cd4f51e48.jpeg\"',4.30,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Caramel\",\"Dark Green\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Pink\",\"Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash or hand wash /Line Dry /Do Not Bleach\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Sun███ne\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love pockets and warmth and comfortable. This was my 3rd color in this top. I wear them with leggings and boots. So cute.\",\"title\":\"Comfortable and cute.\"},{\"name\":\"Candy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It is the perfect thickness for being able to get the most useful time out of it. So soft and the best thing is the deep pockets!! I want pockets in at least one piece of clothing that I\'m wearing. These pockets are surprisingly deep. For the price, you can\'t get a better product. I bought a blue and a pink one. You won\'t be disappointed. Size-Medium\",\"title\":\"LOVE THEM!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Che███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The sweatshirt is buttery soft and warm. It fits true to size and is a nice length to wear with leggings.\",\"title\":\"Soft, Warm, Comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Che███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Soft great clothes. Wash well keep shape, I cold wash everything hang dry for short time then dryer. No shrink no color fade little wrinkled but in dryer with dryer sheet takes care of it Glad this Company makes good clothing!  Sealed for shipping is a plus-no chemicals, used for rodents or insects. \\nLooking forward to see mireitems from them♥️\",\"title\":\"Fantaslook Fantastic Clothing. Buy buy buy!\"},{\"name\":\"Mary\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Honestly, I wish all of my clothes felt as soft and comfortable as this sweatshirt. It\'s thinner than most winter weather clothing so it\'s perfect for our Spring this year and since I\'m colder now when indoors, it\'s perfect for me. \\nI do wish I had gotten a larger size to get the real effect of an oversized sweatshirt but this one looks and fits just fine.  Bonus…pockets\",\"title\":\"Extremely soft\"},{\"name\":\"son███blu███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Everything except the actual color was great. I really wanted true red but it ended up more pink.\",\"title\":\"Color is not red.\"},{\"name\":\"Gwen\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"It is sooo soft and I wanted to keep it but it is not at all oversized. I got the size that the size chart said I should and it was too small for my chest. I loved the color and it felt almost like suede it was so soft but I have to return.\",\"title\":\"Size up at least 2 sizes\"},{\"name\":\"Jane\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"It is air packed into a bag and you can not get the wrinkles out. It is like they are ruining this shirt which could be a nice buy.\",\"title\":\"This could be nice if not wrinkled beyond help\"},{\"name\":\"con███ed\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I\'m very disappointed with this shirt. It is NOT a sweatshirt it is very thin stretchy material not even close to what it describes. Walmart is mostly third party seller\'s now and very misleading. I didn\'t know it was coming from China, because Walmarts app makes it look like it is shipped by Walmart. I ordered it November 26 and finally got it Dec. 16 after I sent 2 or 3 messages to the seller. I could have ordered the same shirt from Temu and got it for less $ and got it faster than ordering from Walmart. Check out the Temu app 98% of the same thing that Walmart sells but doesn\'t cost as much. Everything on Temu comes from China but so does most of Walmarts stuff. Comes in about 2 weeks from Temu and if you order the same thing from Walmart it seems to take longer.\",\"title\":\"not a sweatshirt\"},{\"name\":\"Luci\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I was told I couldn\'t return it because the machine was down for over a month and they didn\'t know when or if it would be repaired!  I have no idea how I\'m going to return the shirt. I\'ve never heard of anything like this!\",\"title\":\"Unbelievable!\"}]',NULL,69.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Young Adult\",\"Young Adult Clothing\",\"Young Adult Sweatshirts & Hoodies\"]'),(131,'Womens Blouses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Asklazy-Women-s-Summer-Sleeveless-Chiffon-Blouse-Business-Casual-Tank-Flowy-Tops-for-Women-US-Size-D-Red-L_7ac5a42c-f533-40c1-bbad-9d76e591f1ef.855b6703264bb785ebf9a6edddefda73.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Beige White\",\"Black\",\"D Red\",\"Gray\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Pink\",\"Royal Blue\",\"White\",\"Wine Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Both Machine Wash and Hand washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"She███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got the blouse in white. The fit and quality of the material was good. I am looking to purchase again in other colors available.\",\"title\":\"Blouse exceeded expectations.\"},{\"name\":\"Julio\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"What a beautiful and finest blouse. My girlfriend loved it. She looks so cute and young. The design is casual and modern. It could be combined with a lot of options like jeans and shorts . The fabric is really good and resistant with a perfect perspiration. The color red is really intense, and it does not fade during the washing routine. I give it a 10 !\",\"title\":\"What a beautiful and finest blouse....\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Not having seen the product before purchasing took a risk with the purchase.  It turned out to be of very good quality and the fit was also very good.  Like the shirt and would buy it again.\",\"title\":\"Good fit and excellent quality\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia ███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m not usually a fan of chiffon fabrics, but this one has a smooth layer between the outside and my skin. It hardly felt like I was wearing a shirt. Comfortable - lots of underarm room!\",\"title\":\"Awesome shirt\"},{\"name\":\"Mus███a C███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Looks simple and beautiful. Great to wear at work or casual activities. Modern look. it is not cotton as I wish it was but feels very comfy and soft. it is hard to find this kind at this price. Looks very great with jeans. I really liked it much more than what I was expecting\",\"title\":\"Looks simple and beautiful. Great t...\"},{\"name\":\"AES\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I received it yesterday. Wore it under facecloth last night. It fit perfectly. Looks very cute. Fabric is very nice. Will order other colors now.\",\"title\":\"Absolutely cute.\"},{\"name\":\"Car███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The shirt is of great qualify! The material is soft and has a loosely cut fit. Red color is true to the picture.\",\"title\":\"The shirt is of great qualify! The ...\"},{\"name\":\"Jenna\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I ordered the black tank in a size small. The fabric is silky and feels like it will allow good air flow. It\'s thin, but has an under layer so it is not see through. The shirt is a bit tight under the arms, but it is flowy in the mid section which is great for covering the mom pooch. The only real downside is that it can\'t go in the dryer, but with the thinner material it should air dry quickly.\",\"title\":\"I ordered the black tank in a size ...\"},{\"name\":\"Cem███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"This blouse is very elegant and fits great on me. However it is Polyester which is not the best option. Still it is comfortable and looks good but not sure If I can use it during hot summer times. I washed it already 2 times in the washing machine and didint shrink or loose any colors so thats a good sign. will give 4 stars\",\"title\":\"This blouse is very elegant and fit...\"},{\"name\":\"Ari███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Bought my size and based on their sizing it should have fit. Super tight in the chest and almost couldn\'t get it off.\",\"title\":\"Not true to size\"}]',NULL,42.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Blouses\",\"Womens Blouses\"]'),(132,'Bed Blankets',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Whale-Flotilla-Faux-Fur-Sherpa-King-Size-Blanket-Cozy-Reversible-Fuzzy-Fluffy-Plush-Blankets-Stylish-Winter-Fall-Warm-Soft-90x104-Inch-Emerald-Green_a9f31f88-314c-4094-8324-3beda72efd78.95790b053b6340e9da6814cf04a783ac.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"60\\\" x 80\\\"\",\"90\\\" x 104\\\"\",\"90\\\" x 90\\\"\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Emerald Green\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Light Green\",\"Navy\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Cry███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"my son loved this extremely soft blanket.\"},{\"name\":\"Bar███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought this in purple and the light green. The green is a little more  muted than the photo which makes it even better. Size queen fits the bed perfect.\",\"title\":\"Warm and Soft\"},{\"name\":\"Lori\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"they are perfect for larger 11-13lbs cats. i can clean three litter boxes in about two minutes. the sifter saves so much time, and now i have much less strain on my back because i dont need to scoop. i highly recommend these, they are a game changer!\",\"title\":\"i love these!\"},{\"name\":\"mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So very soft and easy care.\",\"title\":\"Delightful\"},{\"name\":\"anita\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the quality and softness\"},{\"name\":\"Zaria\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very soft and comfortable\",\"title\":\"Great blanket\"},{\"name\":\"Dyna\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Very soft and pretty, it\'s a little thinner but I love it.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful Blanket\"},{\"name\":\"mzT\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"My 17 year old daughter loved this gift she requested a big sherpa blanket and got just that. it covers her full size bed with no problem. it isn\'t shedding but hasn\'t been washed yet so hopefully it does well\",\"title\":\"Huge soft and comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Mia\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Its very pretty, very soft but the back and front slip and slide. I bought to put on my bed but its too hard to cover up with it. I cannot find the edge to pull the blanket up over my shoulders.\",\"title\":\"poor quality\"},{\"name\":\"mar███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I just received this blanket today and it was not new, it was dirty some one used it before\",\"title\":\"Blanket\"}]',NULL,39.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Blankets\",\"Bed Blankets\"]'),(133,'Plus Size Jeans','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Roaman-s-Women-s-Plus-Size-Invisible-Stretch-Contour-Two-Tone-Embroidered-Bootcut-Jeans-26-W-Coral-Khaki-Embroidery_612bf2bb-3c25-406c-b32e-46586c24ced6.b54534b23dc37d4bb061a52cc2eb2b8a.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"14W\",\"16W\",\"18W\",\"20W\",\"22W\",\"24W\",\"26W\",\"28W\",\"30W\",\"32W\",\"12W\"]','[\"Coral Khaki Embroidery\",\"Dusty Indigo Embroidery\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Jef███y M███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really like these pocket T-:shirts! They fit very well, and are quite roomy. The choice of colors is always quite well, as well as multiple offerings of sizes.\",\"title\":\"Great T - shirts!\"},{\"name\":\"Lin███S\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Truly a shrink-less tee shirt. . Made of a soft, comfortable cotton fabric that is roomy and absorbent. I recommend these shirts highly and will definitely purchase again.\",\"title\":\"SHRINK-LESS TEE SHIRTS\"},{\"name\":\"Dav███B\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the fabric. Good fit. I\'ll wear these until they are wore out\",\"title\":\"Nice t-shirt\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███S\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fit perfectly. It never shrunk and feels light weight.\"},{\"name\":\"Wil███m Y███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are my go to summer shirts, love the pocket for my phone and they are lightweight so I don\'t get too hot.\",\"title\":\"Great buy.\"},{\"name\":\"Kim███ly ███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Of no fault of yours, I ordered the wrong t shirts for my son. These don\'t have pockets, which are necessary for his work, so he\'s not wearing them. I would return but it\'s probably too late.\"},{\"name\":\"Jo T\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This is the second time I have ordered they are easy to care for and wear well. I did have trouble with one from the first order it did shrink but none of the others did.\",\"title\":\"Will order again.\"},{\"name\":\"Jas███F\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This is a nice shirt being a blend of cotton and polyester (90/10 I believe). That makes for a nice shirt, but one that is not too heavy or stiff like cotton, by itself, can be. I hope that King Size will make a similar shirt but with no chest pocket with the same 90/10 split. They used to.\",\"title\":\"Nice shirt\"},{\"name\":\"Lin███y B███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Ok. Thin material. Not great, but ok.\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The material felt rough and was not soft. The texture was not comfortable to wear. I would not order again. Colour was more muted than advertised (more of a burgundy red).\",\"title\":\"Not sensory friendly\"}]',NULL,72.52,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Jeans\",\"Plus Size Jeans\"]'),(134,'Toddler Bedding Sets & Sheets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/b233d25c-c3be-4582-aec4-e914ad3d5a3e.9faa30a76e761b78eeb2f31dc3acdafa.jpeg\"',4.00,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\",\"Full-XL\",\"Olympic / Queen\",\"Short King\",\"Short Queen\",\"Three Quarter\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blood Red\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Golden\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Ivory\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Gray\",\"Lilac\",\"Moss\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Parrot Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Sage\",\"Taupe\",\"Turquoise Blue\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\",\"Zebra Print\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"EASY TO CARE, OPTIMUM QUALITY - Made using all natural materials, Can be machine washed and get softer over time. Fabric is lab tested to make sure no-pilling, no Linting, No Balls after wash, color fastness and finally sewed then packedfor shipping. To improve durability, warm wash and light dry. Use a short dry cycle.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Joy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This item is well made and worked perfectly for my twin XL bed. Just what I needed.\",\"title\":\"Very nice item\"},{\"name\":\"Patty\",\"rating\":3}]',NULL,27.99,NULL,'[\"Baby\",\"Toddlers\' Room\",\"Toddler Bedding\",\"Toddler Bedding Sets & Sheets\"]'),(135,'Static Guard','[\"Reviewers highlighted: price, ease of use, for crafts\",\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Purex-Sta-Flo-Liquid-Starch-Great-for-Crafts-Concentrated-64-Ounce_d2d76dd1-e575-4739-86ff-d08029f63151.a1cb50eb5867ddae25a359ca05fb5907.jpeg\"',4.70,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Starching Laundry...As easy as 1, 2, 31. Choose your preferred starch level (shake bottle well)For Spraying:Mix one part Sta-Flo® with two parts water in pump-type spray bottle.For Soaking:Light: Add 6 cups of water for each cup of Sta-Flo®.Medium: Add 4 cups of water for each cup of Sta-Flo®.Heavy: Mix half Sta-Flo® and half water.Extra-Heavy: Use undiluted Sta-Flo®.2. Spray -or- SoakSpray starch on garments as you iron to add a light starch touch.Soak laundry completely to get starch deeper into the fibers. (Do not add soap, detergent, bleach, water softener or bluing). Wring out firmly. Dry if desired.Great for blue jeans. Set washer to soak cycle and add 6 cups of Sta-Flo® to washing drum filled with warm water. Soak jeans, drain washer and spin. Do not rinse.3. Iron GarmentsIron garments while damp, for best results (or use steam iron on dry garments) Use Sta-Flo® For Your Craft IdeasSta-Flo® Paint Mixture (shake bottle well)Make your own paintMix 1 cup of Sta-Flo® liquid starch with 1 teaspoon of liquid paint or a \\\"sprinkle\\\" of dry tempera paint Sta-Flo® Paper Mache PasteStir up some paper mache paste? Whisk ½ cup of flour with 1 cup of Sta-Flo® liquid starch until smooth? Apply to project, allowing to dry in between layers? Store excess in refrigerator\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ama███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"A half a cup of this and a cup of liquid glue and you have some awesome slime!\",\"title\":\"Great for slime!\"},{\"name\":\"Ana███sia███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"As an art teacher I use this without watering it down to create paper mache sculptures! It\'s a quick drying and economical way to make art using recycled materials like newspapers. I highly recommend it!\",\"title\":\"Starch for Sculptures\"},{\"name\":\"Luv███Mut███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The product is great but dont recommend ordering it via shipping from WalMart. They didnt secure the bottle lids or wrap the bottle in plastic. One bottle opened and ruined most every thing shipped in that box.\",\"title\":\"Awesome product for pick up from store (only)\"},{\"name\":\"jo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I used this for a craft project and it was awesome! I made some cheesecloth ghosts and while it was messy, they came out adorable!!\",\"title\":\"Great stuff!\"},{\"name\":\"Sng███ilo███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The choice of our professionals for starching clothes and controlling the strength of the product dependent on the requirements.  Walmart had the very best price for this product.\",\"title\":\"Our Choice\"},{\"name\":\"xan███ppe███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My daughters needed liquid starch to make some crafts (including silly putty). I ordered this starch for pickup at my local Walmart store because they didn\'t carry it in the store. Within 2 days I was able to pick it up and my daughters loved it. The price was excellent and the quality is exactly as expected.\",\"title\":\"Great product at great price\"},{\"name\":\"Kate\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I ha.ve used starch before, mainly spray starch when I was in the Army, I never knew about this stuff I wouldn\'t want to use it for clothes anymore, but for crafts-how could you live without it. Apparently you can make mod-podge and various other things with it. I used it to make ghosts, it worked great, next Halloween I will know what I\'m doing and I might be even better.\",\"title\":\"Great stuff \\nMultitude of uses. Who knew?!\"},{\"name\":\"Dar███igh███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"A few years ago I switched from the canned spray - (like Niagara or Faultless, etc)  starch to Sta-Flo liquid starch and the results are amazing!  I do not want to go back to can starch.  Liquid Starch has a crisper look, less flaky and after you dilute, it goes a long way.  I typically mix 1/4 cup or less per half gallon.  Great value!\",\"title\":\"Fantastic Product!\"},{\"name\":\"carla\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I buy for my quilting fabric. I dilute about half %26 half into I expensive spray bottle, wrap in plastic bag so starch has time to penetrate fibers, usually overnight, %26 iron dry. Helps if using a 1700-1800 watt iron. Makes cutting %26 sewing so much easier.\",\"title\":\"Love this starch for quilting fabric\"},{\"name\":\"Kha███an\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The jug was packed with a VERY HEAVY box of. At litter. The bag busted the fabric softener and soaked everything inside. \\nMuch like the honey and yarn that recently was delivered busted and Walmart charged me AGAIN for replacement.\",\"title\":\"Jug was BUSTED due to incorrect packing.\"}]','Water, Corn Starch, Soap (Cyclocarboxypropyloeic Acid, Sodium Hydroxide), Sodium Tetraborate, Tetrasodium EDTA, Castor Oil, Sodium Hyroxymethylglycinate, Dimethicone, Sodium Metabisulfate, Fragrance.',17.61,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Water, Corn Starch, Soap (Cyclocarboxypropyloeic Acid, Sodium Hydroxide), Sodium Tetraborate, Tetrasodium EDTA, Castor Oil, Sodium Hyroxymethylglycinate, Dimethicone, Sodium Metabisulfate, Fragrance.\"}]','[\"Household Essentials\",\"Laundry\",\"Laundry Additives\",\"Static Guard\"]'),(136,'Womens Activewear','[\"Reviewers highlighted: fit, comfort\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Independent-Trading-Co-Womens-Lightweight-Cropped-Hooded-Sweatshirt-XS-Blush_fa46d014-d5a9-4f0d-a461-7bf2bd5891c4.65f8bcf7ef8163134d00fdf6e86519e2.jpeg\"',4.10,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black Camo\",\"Blush\",\"Bone\",\"Tie Dye Cotton Candy\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"6.5 oz., pre-laundered 80/20  ring spun cotton/polyester blend fleece with 100% cotton face, 40 singles Camo colors has waterbased camoflauge print Split stitch double needle sewing on all seams\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mel███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Super comfortable! Got it for lounge wear and it did not disappoint! Cozy and soft like a blanket.\"},{\"name\":\"Diane\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This got here quicker than promised and fits true to size nice material not super heavy just what I was looking for ! Thinking of the camo print next\",\"title\":\"Great crop top\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███ N.███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This hoodie is perfect! Hits at the just the right spot. Not too short. The quality is great. Soft fabric and not heavy. It arrived within a week. Overall I am very pleased with this product and have sent the link around for others to buy. I would but again.\",\"title\":\"Amazing!\"},{\"name\":\"Jos███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Cute shirt, durable n true to size. I always have issues with sizes when ordering on line so if you order this shirt get it in the size you wear cz i got a small n thats what i wear n was perfect fit, not too tight n not too loose. Cute colors, ordered the black camo one n love it!\",\"title\":\"Good!\"},{\"name\":\"Ash███M\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased this Cropped Camo Hoodie in a Medium, and just received it in the mail. The dark camo color is really pretty, and the crop hits just above my waist. I\'m 5\'3. The inside is soft, and it has some stretch to the material which is nice so it doesn\'t feel stiff.\",\"title\":\"Cropped Camo Hoddie\"},{\"name\":\"Ber███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Didn\'t read the again thought it was sold black but it is camouflage but ok with me\"},{\"name\":\"Ginny\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This is an unstructured hoodie: no zips, no pockets, loose fit. It is cropped at the waist.  I wasn\'t sure I would like it because of how loose, and unstructured it is.  But I\'ve ended up loving it because of the easy casual pullover and the cozy fleece is super soft on the inside.\",\"title\":\"Unstructured, easy fit, soft plush inside\"},{\"name\":\"Sar███C.\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I usually get mediums in things so it fits a little looser, but this is a little wider than I would expect. So I would definitely not size up, which is what I did.\",\"title\":\"A little Boxy\"},{\"name\":\"jaci\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"This hoodie is NOT camo. That is my only issue with it- the only reason for the deduction of stars. It was quite disappointing go see that this hoodie is actually just plain black. Otherwise i do like it quite a bit. The fit is good\",\"title\":\"Not camo! Solid black\"},{\"name\":\"Laura\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Very poorly made - the material is very thin and it runs small.  I returned.\",\"title\":\"Do no recommend\"}]',NULL,38.60,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Activewear\",\"Womens Activewear\"]'),(137,'Painter\'s Tape','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Duck-Clean-Release-94-in-x-60-yd-Blue-Painter-s-Tape-4-Rolls_c09c008e-bb24-48c1-a7da-e43055dd5ba6.5d9edd62972935efb754e59fb3b3a0b9.jpeg\"',4.40,'[]','[]',NULL,'[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Can\'t  best the price. Great tape. This brand is much tackier than others. Not one you want to apply over new paint even after a couple of days. It definitely has to be completely cured ans dry. Also you will not want to leave it on more than a day or two either. It works great and did a beautiful job on our baseboard project at our home after a flooring contractor trashed our baseboards being slopping with dark grout and over wetting and washing. They are like brand new. again great product, just need to be extra cautious with time.\"},{\"name\":\"Bod███rl8███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got this to use for the chalk outline on the fence. For art projects, while my daughter is doing distance learning due to COVID 19.\"},{\"name\":\"Bri███ey\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this tape. The adhesive works amazingly and doesn\'t leave residue or tear up surfaces. That\'s always important. It\'s also strong. I used it for the floor this time and it held everything together. I was able to paint the room without any plastic drop cloths moving or coming up.\\n\\nTotally worth it.\",\"title\":\"Best Painter\'s Tape\"},{\"name\":\"Shi███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"No ooze to clean up, helps make paint jobs look professional!\",\"title\":\"Delivers it\'s promise of clean release.\"},{\"name\":\"Wendy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I used for my windows\",\"title\":\"Good tape\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Sticks well perfect for my crafts\",\"title\":\"Satisfied customer\"},{\"name\":\"Sil███oos███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The perfect price for diyers.  This tape\'s strength is in its releasing power, when used on a protected surface or new paint.  It releases from the tape protected surface without doing damage nor pulling up freshly painted surfaces.  However, it still fall short of the Frogtape brand with it\'s Paint Block technology which, is designed to protect the taped surface or freshly painted surface from over spray over brushes, or over rolls when painting two medians or colors.\",\"title\":\"Releasing potential, but still falls short of frog\"},{\"name\":\"Kalah\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Walls were painted white two years ago, taped them off not to get green on them. Pulled off my existing white paint 👍 now I have to repaint. Should have just not used tape.\",\"title\":\"Peeled my existing paint\"},{\"name\":\"Donna\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered a few items delivered to my work last order. I forgot to change the address back to my home when I ordered groceries. They went to my work and called. I explained. They returned my refrigerated items, I think they are shipping the other items. I see a 10 day hold on the return money and zero communication with me about the specifics. I offered to pay more to bring to my home and was told no. Bad customer service. Leaves a bad taste about delivery. WALMART SHOULD HAVE A DOUBLE CHECK ON THEIR DELIVERY SET UP!!\",\"title\":\"Get the right delivery address!!\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Peeled paint right off walls. I do not recommend!!!\",\"title\":\"NOT clean release!!!\"}]',NULL,10.88,NULL,'[\"Home Improvement\",\"Paint\",\"Paint Supplies & Tools\",\"Hardware Tape\",\"Painter\'s Tape\"]'),(138,'Workout Leggings','[\"Flash Deal\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Sofra-Women-Plus-Cotton-High-Waist-Full-Length-Cotton-Workout-Leggings-Burgundy-Olive-S_799606c8-4c15-4e42-ab49-6492c9715c2d.31d99f6df7dfc70be3ef577b3f8a36fb.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\"]','[\"2PK-Black/Black\",\"2PK-Black/Burgundy\",\"2PK-Black/Charcoal Grey\",\"2PK-Black/H Grey\",\"2PK-Black/Navy\",\"2PK-Black/Olive\",\"2PK-Black/White\",\"2PK-Burgundy/Burgundy\",\"2PK-Burgundy/H Grey\",\"2PK-Burgundy/Olive\",\"2PK-Charcoal Grey/Charcoal Grey\",\"2PK-Charcoal Grey/White\",\"2PK-H Grey/Charcoal Grey\",\"2PK-H Grey/H Grey\",\"2PK-H Grey/Navy\",\"2PK-H Grey/White\",\"2PK-Navy/Burgundy\",\"2PK-Navy/Charcoal\",\"2PK-Navy/Navy\",\"2PK-Navy/Olive\",\"2PK-Olive/H Grey\",\"2PK-Olive/Olive\",\"2PK-Peacock/Navy\",\"2PK-Taupe/H Grey\",\"2PK-Taupe/H Red\",\"2PK-Taupe/White\",\"2PK-White/White\",\"3PK-Black/Navy/White\",\"3PK-Black/White/Charcoal\",\"3PK-Black/White/H Grey\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Burgundy\",\"Charcoal\",\"Charcoal Grey\",\"H Grey\",\"H Red\",\"Navy\",\"Olive\",\"Peacock\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Tonya\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Best biker shorts great lengh and good fabric non see through.\",\"title\":\"excellent\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i love these biker shortes so soft and comfortable\",\"title\":\"love these\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I just love love these biker shorts very comfortable very soft I used them everyday I just wish they had different colors\",\"title\":\"best biker shorts\"},{\"name\":\"Anna\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these. So comfortable for summer yoga. Got a much larger size than normal so they are comfy loose.\",\"title\":\"So comfy\"},{\"name\":\"reema\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"True to its size and perfect fit and length. Might be little warm for Summer.\",\"title\":\"Fits perfectly\"},{\"name\":\"THEO\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The fabric is thinner than I would like.  But they are 92% cotton which is very hard to find.   they are 21\\\" long which I also love.  Comfy.  Wash well.\",\"title\":\"Thin fabric but...\"},{\"name\":\"Ori███5\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The navy is very dark, almost black. The material is not as thick as I would have liked so therefore not as supportive, however they are very soft and comfortable.\"},{\"name\":\"Geo███a\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"They weren\'t quite the quality/thickness I\'ve had of others but pretty good.\",\"title\":\"Nice cotton leggings\"},{\"name\":\"Sho███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Um, not sure about these. They aren\'t very comfortable and slightly confusing in the way of length.\",\"title\":\"Eh, no thank you\"},{\"name\":\"Janet\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I bought these 21\\\" biker shorts as a two-pack, but it seems that only one is the correct length, while the other are 5\\\"-7\\\" inseam.  Not what I purchased.\",\"title\":\"Bought as a 2-pack but lengths are different\"}]',NULL,23.13,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Activewear\",\"Womens Workout Bottoms\",\"Workout Leggings\"]'),(139,'Womens Blouses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/VERABENDI-Womens-Clothes-Plus-Size-Tops-3-4-Sleeve-Shirts-Button-Dressy-V-Neck-Tunic-Blouse-M-4XL_c1956468-9301-4d95-91cc-c5eb135e68f1.f71915e49e79a27315f1f4998e86a0a1.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"M\",\"L\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\",\"4X\"]','[\"15\",\"2\",\"5\",\"6\",\"7\",\"Black\",\"Blue Flower\",\"Carbon Black\",\"Carbon Pink\",\"Dark Green\",\"Multi Green\",\"Multi Navy Blue\",\"Multi Red\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Purple Grey\",\"Wine Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash cold and do not bleach\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Lut███Hud███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was not expecting to be this impressed! It is surprisingly flattering and very soft. I have just gained 35 lbs the past 5 months and this top does a great job of hiding it! Especially on my upper arms and belly. I easily removed the decorative broach off the front of the top because it’s just not my style. Looks better without it in my opinion. If the price wasn’t so high I would order more!\",\"title\":\"This surprised me\"},{\"name\":\"Traci\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very soft and fits nicely.\",\"title\":\"Nice top!\"},{\"name\":\"oeb███g\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the color and design, but it was a tad big for 2xl. I’m 5’3 and weigh around 220-225 lives, but it was hanging a bit on me. I think an XL would have been perfect for this style.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful top\"},{\"name\":\"MJ\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"shirt washes well hangs well and it\'s very comfortable and had a great price\",\"title\":\"A good buy\"},{\"name\":\"Cyn███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Comfortable and fits well.\"},{\"name\":\"Jag███la\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I absolutely love this blouse! The material is super soft and not clingy at all. It drapes beautifully. It does tend to run a little small. Based on other reviews I ordered a size up and I’m glad I did. Fit perfectly and very flattering. Love it so much I bought several more in different colors and prints!\",\"title\":\"So comfortable!\"},{\"name\":\"GG\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I ordered my usual size in tops(3x). I love it, but its a little more snug around my belly than I\'d like. I\'m gonna take the blame for that one and just keep the top...I\'m sure I\'ll wear it eventually. Love the sleeves and I think they would be way too big if I sized up.\",\"title\":\"Nice top\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Wrinkles super easy just know even when you take out of a low temp dryer it\'s wrinkled.  It\'s type of material\"},{\"name\":\"she███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The material is flimsy. There was discoloration in several areas. It is being returned\"},{\"name\":\"she███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Flimsy material. Hangs so low. It\'s almost like a mini dress\"}]',NULL,22.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Blouses\",\"Womens Blouses\"]'),(140,'Pillow Top Mattress Toppers','[\"Best seller\",\"Flash Deal\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/MERITLIFE-Waterproof-Mattress-Pads-Full_0820cabc-f310-4417-aef0-4d8dd301196f.1309db2917e279fb32fb4829c7717737.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\"]','[\"Gray\",\"White\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Ada\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love it!Easy to put on the bed,comfortable and waterproof!\",\"title\":\"Awesome mattress comfort!\"},{\"name\":\"Ivan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It is not super thick, so I think your results may be different depending on what kind of mattress you put it on but it works nicely on mine. I also think it has helped with coolness a little bit. I’ve been sleeping on it for about two months and have had no issues. I also didn’t let it sit out in the sun. It had no odor, so I just unboxed it and let it sit on my bed to fluff while I washed my linens.\",\"title\":\"Lightweight Mattress Topper\"},{\"name\":\"GAU███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This mattress topper ended up being perfect for me! It is very comfortable with just the right amount of plush, and it fits my 6-inch mattress perfectly. I move a little bit during the night and it stays on perfectly, with no need to adjust. I actually have a little bit of trouble waking up in the morning due to how soundly I sleep with this mattress topper, no joke!\",\"title\":\"Great night\'s sleep!\"},{\"name\":\"Abh███t\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great quality! The mattress topper is also very deep and will easily fit a deep mattress. My mattress is about 14 1/2 in. deep and the mattress pad fit perfectly, with plenty of room to spare. It should easily fit a mattress that is several inches deeper than mine\",\"title\":\"Quilted Mattress Pad / Topper - Superior Quality\"},{\"name\":\"Ang███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"OMG,I absolutely love it,I wish I would’ve brought this sooner.Very comfortable, soft, I’ve been getting the best sleep ever.\",\"title\":\"Sleeping on clouds\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███dri███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very nice cotton cooling mattress topper cover;am allergic to others materials and with these cotton cover no problem,Thanks so much\",\"title\":\"Wonderful Cover Mattress\"},{\"name\":\"Karen\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I read the reviews before I bought this and I thought they were all too good to be true. When I got this in the mail and opened it I was amazed at the Quality. After sleeping on it I know now that all those reviews or right on it\'s very comfortable and it keeps you cool when it\'s hot outside\",\"title\":\"A little slice of heaven\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"the mattress pad is nowhere near as pictured. it has hardly any cushion. it makes very little difference on the bed. it is true to color. i did lay this out overnight as per the instructions, and it made no difference.  very disappointed. it was returned.\",\"title\":\"not near as pictured\"},{\"name\":\"Den███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"False advertising. Nothing about this product is fluffy or plush. Im so disappointed in the product. Im definitely returning this product.\",\"title\":\"Unsatisfied\"},{\"name\":\"Amie\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It says that it is either four or 6 inches of thickness and it’s probably not even 2 inches thick. More like one. And I spent a really long time sifting through all the mattress pads and trying to find the thickest one that also had good reviews, and go figure… It is nothing like what was described in the product details\",\"title\":\"Not extra thick at all\"}]',NULL,99.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Mattress Toppers & Pads\",\"Pillow Top Mattress Toppers\"]'),(141,'Sateen Sheets','[\"Reviewers highlighted: wash, softness, comfort\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/TENCEL-Lyocell-Queen-Sheet-Set-500-Thread-Count-Temperature-Regulating-Ultra-Soft-Silky-4-Piece-Set-Taupe-by-Aireolux_35225995-1c24-4a55-992f-954d5890d957.8dbcd93ae46baf930068ae306237b6cf.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\"]','[\"Arctic White\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Ivory\",\"Light Blue\",\"Taupe\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash, Tumble Dry, Do not Bleach, Do not Dry Clean, Warm Iron when needed, Do not iron on Elastic portion.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Chr███ie0███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I got the Aireolux 500 total count Sateen Lyocell Cotton full size sheet Set in white for my daughters bed and I\'m so glad I did. From the moment I opened the box I was impressed with how fancy they were from the packaging to the satin feel of the sheets. They are so very soft and comfortable. I\'m very jealous I didn\'t buy them for myself so of course they are in my wish list. Definitely recommend these sheets, you just have to feel the difference to understand the hype.\",\"title\":\"Complete Luxury\"},{\"name\":\"Sara\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I had to wash a few times to get the initial smell out but after that I have enjoyed these sheets. Nothing amazing to report but for the price, I am satisfied.\",\"title\":\"So far so good\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ina███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This sheet set is a classic white color. The sheets feel cool and crisp. I love the way they feel against my skin, especially in the summer heat. The style is timeless, you can\'t go wrong with a white sheet set.\",\"title\":\"Soft and luxurious\"},{\"name\":\"Kip███g\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These sheets come in a very beautiful package sealed with a lovely  ribbon.  The presentation would make a wonderful gift.   The sheets are very thick and soft and feel amazing on my bed.   They washed up well and did not wrinkle after I pulled them out of the dryer to get them on the bed.   The color is bright white and they feel just amazing because they have the ability to keep me cool at night and they do not get hot which is very important to me.   Overall these are wonderful sheets that I will enjoy for years to come.\",\"title\":\"Very thick and soft\"},{\"name\":\"adr███ne\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These sheets have an incredible satiny/silky feel to them. I hope they retain this luxurious feeling after many washes. So far they have only been washed twice but are already my favorite sheets. The stitching is quality, and the all-around elastic fitted sheet and elastic True Grip corners are awesome. I never have to worry about the dreaded corner coming up when I move around in bed. The sheets also come nicely packaged in a tasteful white box and satin tie. These sheets would make an excellent wedding present. The pillowcase feels nice and cool when I lay my head on it, and the lyocell material is very breathable. Highly recommended.\",\"title\":\"Luxurious feel\"},{\"name\":\"jof███7\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Aireolux 500TC Sateen Lyocell Cotton Sheet Set White is the highest quality sheets that I have slept on. To start off, the packaging that the sheets come in feels like you are opening a gift and has a beautiful presentation. A thank you note and literature to familiarize yourself with what goes into making Aireolux Sheets. They are so soft to the touch and the stitching is impeccable. The 500 thread count sheets are 100% Lyocell with Temperature Regulating Technology and Moisture Wicking. The greatest part? They are made from Eucalyptus Trees that are renewably grown on biodiverse farms. I have never had sheets that have made me this happy sleeping in the night. You can tell that these sheets last a long time. I cannot imagine using anything else!\",\"title\":\"Stunning!\"},{\"name\":\"TGi███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These sheets are so soft and luxurious! Even the packaging is luxurious.  They are super high quality and comfortable.  The satiny soft sheen is beautiful and I want these on every bed in my house now! These make me feel spoiled.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful sheet set\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Softest sheets ever!  Top quality. This is my second set.\",\"title\":\"High Quality Soft Luxury Sheets\"},{\"name\":\"Srw\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The flat top sheet is too narrow.  It only over hangs each side of mattress by 2 inches.  So when in the bed the sheet is too narrow for 2 adults to share together.\"},{\"name\":\"Jerry\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I ordered aireolux tencel sheets looked wonderful but they feel like they have fiberglass in them. I am so disappointed\"}]',NULL,83.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Sateen Sheets\"]'),(142,'Shop Curtains','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-Rod-Pocket-Window-Curtain-Panel-Silver-Grey-84-Inch-Wide-by-72-Inch-Long-1-Panel_33b99fdc-7f36-477d-84c1-e82d972c218c.9a3212860a5acaa95d8d9e14a5b7a0da.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"84 W x 108 L\",\"84 W x 120 L\",\"84 W x 132 L\",\"84 W x 72 L\",\"84 W x 84 L\",\"84 W x 96 L\",\"100 W x 108 L\",\"100 W x 120 L\",\"100 W x 132 L\",\"100 W x 72 L\",\"100 W x 84 L\",\"100 W x 96 L\"]','[\"Baby Pink\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Burgundy\",\"Fresh Green\",\"Gray\",\"Greyish White\",\"Ivory\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"True Red\",\"White\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"jot███j\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love that these curtains come in a variety of colors and sizes. I was able to find the perfect curtains to match my living room decor. I also appreciate that the curtains are available in different lengths, so I was able to find the perfect fit for my windows.\",\"title\":\"Available in a Variety of Colors and Sizes\"},{\"name\":\"gac███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These curtains were so easy to install. I just hung them on my existing curtain rods, and they were perfect. They\'re also machine-washable, which is a huge bonus. I can\'t believe how easy these curtains are to care for.\",\"title\":\"Easy to Install and Care for\"},{\"name\":\"pes███sa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I wanted to add a touch of elegance to my living room, and the Amay Ivory Curtain Panel did just that. The ivory color is gorgeous and adds a soft, sophisticated look to the room. The curtains drape beautifully and provide a luxurious feel. They\'ve truly transformed the aesthetics of my space. I couldn\'t be happier with how they make my room look and feel. We\'ll be purchasing again from this seller!!!\",\"title\":\"Elegant Appearance\"}]',NULL,120.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(143,'Boys Sandals','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/HOBIBEAR-Boys-and-Girls-Classic-Graphic-Garden-Clogs-Slip-on-Water-Shoes-Toddler-Little-Kids-Big-Kids_4d43a2ad-82fd-4d3a-bf33-ba1ee94b9a8e.3e8c2f121263e0433c0d3d8d90a9ae25.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"1.5 Little Kid\",\"2 Little Kid\",\"2.5 Little Kid\",\"4 Big  Kid\",\"4 Big Kid\",\"6 Toddler\",\"7 Toddler\",\"8 Toddler\",\"9 Toddler\",\"10-11 Little Kid\",\"11 Little Kid\",\"12 Little Kid\",\"13 Little Kid\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Gray\",\"Purple\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"dana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My son is very picky so spending $50 on name brand shoes was silly. I found these for $17 and I\'m so happy! He hasn\'t taken them off and loves the charms that came with the shoes. Overall, I\'m super happy with purchase. There\'s a definite difference in quality compared to name brand but for my messy, growing young son, these make perfect sense for us.\",\"title\":\"Affordable and cute!\"},{\"name\":\"Hey███ahH███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My toddler loves them. Seems pretty comparable to crocs in terms of feel and quality. Light weight, moderate grip, easy to put on and take off. We have Mario charms from crocs plus they came with their own charms. Would recommend for the value, esp at this age when they grow out of shoes so quickly\",\"title\":\"Pretty comparable to crocs\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ina███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These Crocs look good and my kids love them. got all three for just about the same price as one pair of regular crocs. also got the charms and they look very cute, good quality. very happy I found these instead of spending a bunch of money on the regular crocs brand which has become totally overpriced\",\"title\":\"great alternative to regular Crocs\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███le\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These clogs came nicely packaged so the shoes wouldn\'t get smashed during shipping. My son absolutely loves these shoes. He is 11 and we have a hard time finding inexpensive clogs that are not Crocs. These fit perfectly and he says they are more very comfortable. They came with a set of 4 cute charms to pop in the holes of your shoes. He wanted the dinosaur and dolphin and I put the rainbow and princess crown on my old clogs. I wish they made bigger sizes, but 4 is as large as they go. I would buy more in bigger sizes, if possible.\",\"title\":\"Comparable to Crocs, son loves them\"},{\"name\":\"KP\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My 3 yr old loves his “crocs” and they’re so easy and comfortable for him to put on himself. Love that they work well as water shoes\",\"title\":\"Great croc dupes\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ina███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"my kids like these they are on par with regular crocs but much more affordable\",\"title\":\"good quality good price\"},{\"name\":\"Olu███eun███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i love it and my son loves it too. beautiful and comfortable. Product material also looks durable\",\"title\":\"Worth it\"},{\"name\":\"Boy███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"If you’re looking for a good quality knock off of crocs, you’ve found them! This is my third pair I’ve bought for my boys and they are great! They seem to have a decent durability as far as wear and tear. Sizing is a little confusing, so I’d recommend sizing your child’s feet per instructions,\",\"title\":\"Perfect summer shoe for kids and toddlers\"},{\"name\":\"Gor███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The kids love them. I also bought a 100 count bag of pop-in decorations and they constantly swap them in and out.\",\"title\":\"Great Purchase!\"},{\"name\":\"Mad███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Only lasted one month before the back straps started to come off regularly. 2 months in they\'re completely gone. Still technically usable but do fall off occasionally.\",\"title\":\"Only lasted 2 months\"}]',NULL,49.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Kids Shoes\",\"Boys Shoes\",\"Boys Sandals\",\"Boys Sandals\"]'),(144,'MaryRuth Organics',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/MaryRuth-s-USDA-Organic-Women-s-Multivitamin-Liquid-Liposomal-Vanilla-Peach-Sugar-Free-Vegan-15-22-fl-oz_5d303f04-8275-402e-9696-859be58833db.c9f2898f80836e95c54adeb1b360762a.jpeg\"',4.30,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Dosage\",\"value\":\"1 Tablespoon (15 mL)\"},{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Take 1 Tablespoon (15 mL) daily. Can be taken directly or added to your choice of blended beverage, or as a topping on a variety of foods.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Angel\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So far so good been taking them for about a week I have more energy less hot flashes feel good\",\"title\":\"So far so good\"},{\"name\":\"Ruth\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the quality and liposomal so more is absorbed and goes to intestines, so can\'t bother stomach. Great in juice/water, but small squirt per sippy cup.\",\"title\":\"Best possible multi-vitamin!\"},{\"name\":\"Jea███tte███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I checked prices in Walmart and also at the Mary Ruth website to compare prices. Walmart had a great price on it this time.\",\"title\":\"Great vitamin for the kiddos.\"},{\"name\":\"Lil███ppe███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Did four stars as I\'ve not yet used it. I\'m finishing up my other vitamins.\",\"title\":\"Like liposomal effect\"},{\"name\":\"Mary\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Just arrived so have only taken once, but can say their customer service was excellent. shipped via fedex! taste is NOT great, but didn\'t expect it to be. worth a try\",\"title\":\"great customer service\"},{\"name\":\"Nav\",\"rating\":1,\"title\":\"Seal broken\"},{\"name\":\"Kim███ly1███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It is thick and tastes oily. The sweet flavor unfortunately did not help. I wish I could have used it to experience the benefits.\",\"title\":\"Not for me\"},{\"name\":\"Kim\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"it tastes like stomach bile\"},{\"name\":\"Nikki\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This is the nastiest stuff I have ever tasted in my life! No way I could get it down without gagging.\",\"title\":\"Horrible\"},{\"name\":\"Asisa\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I believe it may be the omega that is added to this multivitamin blend that is causing it to smell and taste very fishy. It has a very strong fish oil taste, and which the flavoring cannot mask. It\'s so potent that even blending it in a protein shake, you still taste it. You can even smell it. Though I am a customer of Mary Ruth products. This one would be a no for me. They need to rework the formula to figure out a way to make it a little bit more digestible as far as taste is concerned.\",\"title\":\"Yuck!!\"}]','Vitamin A (as Retinyl Palmitate), Vitamin D (as Cholecalciferol), Vitamin E (as D-Alpha Tocopherol), Folate (as L-Methylfolate Calcium), Vitamin B12 (as Methylcobalamin), Magnesium (as Magnesium Bisglycinate), Zinc (as Zinc Bisglycinate). Liposomal Proprietary Blend: Organic Sunflower Seed Oil (Organic Phosphatidylcholine, Organic Phosphatidylserine, Organic Phosphatidylinositol) Proprietary Botanical Blend: Maca Root Extract, Saw Palmetto Berry Oil, Chaste Tree Berry Extract, Red Clover Flower Extract, Raspberry (Rubis strigosus) Berry Extract, Lutein (from Marigold (Tagetes erecta L.) Flower), Omega-3 Docosahexaenoic Acid (from Algal Oil) Omega-9 Oleic Acid (from Sunflower Seed Extract) Proprietary Mixed Tocopherol Blend: d-gamma tocopherol, d-delta tocopherol, d-beta tocopherol Boron (as Boron Citrate) Vitamin K2 (as Menaquinone-7)',28.49,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Vitamin A (as Retinyl Palmitate), Vitamin D (as Cholecalciferol), Vitamin E (as D-Alpha Tocopherol), Folate (as L-Methylfolate Calcium), Vitamin B12 (as Methylcobalamin), Magnesium (as Magnesium Bisglycinate), Zinc (as Zinc Bisglycinate). Liposomal Proprietary Blend: Organic Sunflower Seed Oil (Organic Phosphatidylcholine, Organic Phosphatidylserine, Organic Phosphatidylinositol) Proprietary Botanical Blend: Maca Root Extract, Saw Palmetto Berry Oil, Chaste Tree Berry Extract, Red Clover Flower Extract, Raspberry (Rubis strigosus) Berry Extract, Lutein (from Marigold (Tagetes erecta L.) Flower), Omega-3 Docosahexaenoic Acid (from Algal Oil) Omega-9 Oleic Acid (from Sunflower Seed Extract) Proprietary Mixed Tocopherol Blend: d-gamma tocopherol, d-delta tocopherol, d-beta tocopherol Boron (as Boron Citrate) Vitamin K2 (as Menaquinone-7)\"}]','[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Vitamins and Supplements\",\"MaryRuth Organics\"]'),(145,'Shop Curtains','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-Grommet-Top-Blackout-Curtain-Panel-Greyish-White-72-Inch-Wide-by-120-Inch-Long-1Panel_561e2602-7d06-4383-a857-6a5a15f55ac7.8f10fde529278f5fe4211692a6b65d42.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"60 W x 108 L\",\"60 W x 120 L\",\"60 W x 132 L\",\"60 W x 72 L\",\"60 W x 84 L\",\"60 W x 95 L\",\"72 W x 108 L\",\"72 W x 120 L\",\"72 W x 132 L\",\"72 W x 72 L\",\"72 W x 84 L\",\"72 W x 96 L\"]','[\"Baby Pink\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Burgundy\",\"Gold\",\"Green\",\"Gray\",\"Greyish White\",\"Ivory\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Red\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Susie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"As a daytime sleeper, it\'s always been a challenge to block out the sunlight and noise. This curtain panel, at 60 inches wide by 108 inches long, is the ideal solution. It\'s easy to install, and the grommet top design adds a stylish touch. Plus, it genuinely blocks out the light, creating a peaceful, dark environment for me to sleep during the day. The quality is excellent, and I\'m thrilled with my purchase.\",\"title\":\"Love these\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey has surpassed my expectations. Not only do they provide exceptional blackout capabilities, but they also add a touch of elegance to my room. The grey color complements my décor perfectly. The curtains are easy to install and slide smoothly on the grommets. The size is generous and fits my window effortlessly. If you\'re looking for curtains that combine style and functionality, these are an excellent choice. Totally satisfied with this purchase!!!\",\"title\":\"Aesthetic and Functional Addition\"},{\"name\":\"Mor███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These curtains strike the perfect balance between elegance and functionality. The grey color is sleek and modern, and the grommet top design makes them easy to install. I appreciate how well they block out light and noise, creating a serene atmosphere in my living space.\",\"title\":\"Great for price\"},{\"name\":\"Sta███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently updated my living room with the \\\"Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel\\\" in grey, and I couldn\'t be happier. The 60-inch width by 108-inch length is perfect for my large windows. These curtains are not only functional but also stylish. They add an elegant touch to the room, and the blackout feature is fantastic for movie nights or when I want to escape the outside world. The quality of the fabric and grommet design are impressive. I highly recommend these curtains for anyone looking to elevate their home decor.\",\"title\":\"Great product\"},{\"name\":\"Jef███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"A significant difference in my home. Its grey color adds a touch of sophistication to my decor, and the blackout feature ensures that I get a restful night\'s sleep. The 60x108 size is perfect for my window, and the grommet top design makes it easy to hang. This panel is a wonderful blend of quality and comfort, providing both style and functionality. It\'s a must-have for anyone looking to enhance their living space.\",\"title\":\"Quality and Comfort Combined!\"},{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey. It\'s like having a piece of elegance and tranquility in my room. The blackout feature is incredible; it completely eliminates outside light, allowing me to enjoy total darkness when needed. The 60x108 size is generous and covers my window beautifully. If you want to transform your space into a serene retreat, look no further than this curtain panel.\",\"title\":\"Elegance in One Panel!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey is a fantastic addition to my home. The 60-inch width by 108-inch length provides ample coverage, and the blackout feature is incredibly effective. My room is now dark and cozy, perfect for a good night\'s sleep.\",\"title\":\"Great product\"},{\"name\":\"Diana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently purchased the Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey, and I could be happier with my choice. These curtains not only look stylish with their sleek grey color but also perform exceptionally well. The blackout feature is incredible; it truly blocks out all unwanted light, providing a peaceful and dark environment for sleeping or watching movies during the day. The 60-inch width and 108-inch length were perfect for my window, and the grommet top design makes them easy to hang. If you\'re in search of both style and functionality in curtains, look no further.\",\"title\":\"Stylish and Effective\"},{\"name\":\"Novo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased the Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey, 60 Inch Wide by 108 Inch Long, and I am extremely satisfied with its performance. These curtains truly deliver on their promise of blackout capabilities. They effectively block out all external light, making my bedroom a perfect sanctuary for a good night\'s sleep, even during daylight hours. The quality of the fabric is excellent, and the grommets make them easy to install. I highly recommend these curtains to anyone in need of a reliable blackout solution.\",\"title\":\"Exceptional Blackout Performance\"},{\"name\":\"lav███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I will start by saying all the parts for this project came from Walmart including the mounting bracket, curtain rod, black-out curtains, and curtain ties. The curtains will black out all of the light from the parking lot at night and dim the light in the room to be able to nap during the day. Overall very happy with the color and performance of the curtains.\",\"title\":\"Works really well for muting light\"}]',NULL,130.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(146,'For you Health & Beauty',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Neutrogena-Healthy-Skin-Glow-Perfector-Concealer-Pen-Fair-1-oz_8a333b57-9cbd-4709-b427-f8264eb737a4.fea3170542224ac6b947534ea7ce768c.jpeg\"',4.20,'[]','[\"Deep\",\"Fair\",\"Light\",\"Medium\",\"Neutral\",\"Tan\"]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Shake well and slowly click the concealer pen until you see the formula. Apply on bare skin or over makeup to brighten and highlight. Blend until smooth with a brush or your fingertips. Questions? Call toll free 800-480-4812 or 215-273-8755 (collect) or visit www.neutrogena.com\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Pol███hee███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I like Neutrogena products very much. this is why I chose this cover up. I think it will serve me well  - also, this was a great value.\",\"title\":\"always a wonderful brand to buy\"},{\"name\":\"Kari\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I did not receive this item\"},{\"name\":\"Bar███a\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Kel███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Kelly\",\"rating\":5}]','Water, Glycerin, Methyl Trimethicone, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Dimethicone, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Butylene Glycol Dicaprylate/Dicaprate, Phenyl Trimethicone, Pentylene Glycol, Lauryl PEG-10 Tris(Trimethylsiloxy)silylethyl Dimethicone, Tocopheryl Acetate, Isododecane, Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, Silica, Polyphenylsilsesquioxane, Panthenol, Magnesium Sulfate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Aluminum Hydroxide, Caprylyl Glycol, Glyceryl Caprylate, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Titanium Dioxide, Mica, Iron Oxides',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Water, Glycerin, Methyl Trimethicone, Hydrogenated Polyisobutene, Dimethicone, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Butylene Glycol Dicaprylate/Dicaprate, Phenyl Trimethicone, Pentylene Glycol, Lauryl PEG-10 Tris(Trimethylsiloxy)silylethyl Dimethicone, Tocopheryl Acetate, Isododecane, Cetyl PEG/PPG-10/1 Dimethicone, Silica, Polyphenylsilsesquioxane, Panthenol, Magnesium Sulfate, Disteardimonium Hectorite, Dimethicone/Vinyl Dimethicone Crosspolymer, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Aluminum Hydroxide, Caprylyl Glycol, Glyceryl Caprylate, Trisodium Ethylenediamine Disuccinate, Titanium Dioxide, Mica, Iron Oxides\"}]','[\"Shop with Purpose\",\"Built for Better\",\"For You\",\"For you Health & Beauty\"]'),(147,'Plus Size Activewear',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/TheLovely-Women-Plus-Relaxed-Fit-Long-Sleeve-Round-Neck-Hem-Jersey-Tee-Shirt-Top_b4e984d9-ec83-4f2d-a229-9bc17468d76c.1773ccdcd3b38c2a159c01581b54edb8.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\"]','[\"Americano\",\"Army Green\",\"Ash Blue\",\"Ash Grey\",\"Ash Mint\",\"Ash Rose\",\"Black\",\"Blue Grey\",\"Blue Mint\",\"Bright Blue\",\"Copper\",\"DK Burgundy\",\"DK Olive\",\"DK Plum\",\"DK Rust\",\"Deep Camel\",\"Deep Coral\",\"Dusty Teal\",\"Egg Shell\",\"Eggplant\",\"Fuchsia\",\"Golden Mustard\",\"Grey Mist\",\"Khaki\",\"LT Brown\",\"LT Green\",\"LT Navy\",\"LT Rose\",\"Magenta\",\"Rose\",\"Ruby\",\"Teal\",\"Titanium\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"TIF███Y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are good quality for the price and they fit well. I have very large hips and butt and there is plenty of swing in these to help disguise my \\\"fluffiness\\\"! They launder well but pill a bit if you put them in the dryer, so I turn them inside out to wash, and hang to dry. I have bought several of these, and the customer service was terrific when one out-of-stock color failed to arrive - I emailed them and they responded promptly and sent me a replacement color of my choosing. I wear these to work with leggings and boots.\",\"title\":\"Very good value\"},{\"name\":\"Panda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"True to size love the above knees top I wear it with leggins.....light weight as well \\nHighly recommended  it\"},{\"name\":\"Becky\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Absolutely perfect fit. Love the way it fits perfect.\",\"title\":\"Love top\"},{\"name\":\"Poo███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I liked that it was a great fit and works with all my skinny jeans and leggings\",\"title\":\"Perfect fit\"},{\"name\":\"Panda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Yes I love it I where it w/ leggin,I got three of them ,one has a slit in the back so waiting on a anwser to see if I can return it thank you\"},{\"name\":\"Romeu\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this shirt!!!! It is true to size, very comfortable, covers everything, and I love the pockets!! Im gonna buy it in different colors. I am a plus size girl and cant believe how good it fits\",\"title\":\"I love it!!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Toni\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"LOVE IT!!!  May run a bit small, it\'s good quality and GREAT price! I lost a lot of weight and like to cover my bat wings it\'s the perfect length sleeve, I bought medium, I am 5\'5\",\"title\":\"Perfect T\"},{\"name\":\"rsc███te\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The fit was true to size, I got an XL it was quite long. The only issue is it was not a red, red. Because I needed it for my costume I returned it. However, I would buy this in black.\",\"title\":\"Nice shirt, didn\'t like color\"},{\"name\":\"Mlove\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Just don\'t buy Horrible sizes \\nSleeve are super tight. Would fit my 9 year old\",\"title\":\"No\"},{\"name\":\"JLi███rd\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,18.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Activewear\",\"Plus Size Activewear\"]'),(148,'Womens Tank Tops','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Pntutb-Womens-Plus-Size-Clearance-Women-s-Casual-Sleeveless-Chiffon-Crewneck-Solid-Blouse-Pullover-Tank-Tops-Shirt-Rollback-Clothes_93b4e66b-fa7b-4020-9b9b-18d7a19f9e1e.6e841d91f71f8306686f36e2c2f7e055.jpeg\"',3.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"XXXL\",\"XXXXL\",\"XXXXXL\"]','[\"Army Green\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Brown\",\"Gray\",\"Green\",\"Mint Green\",\"Navy\",\"Pink\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash; Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ala███\",\"rating\":3}]',NULL,6.09,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Tank Tops\",\"Womens Tank Tops\"]'),(149,'Insoles',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Valsole-orthopedic-insoles-supports-the-arch-of-the-foot-for-heel-pain-heel-spurs-flat-foot-plantar-fasciitis-knee-pain_e378b519-2689-4817-8b22-9ef3a7a26e17.52796ceae9b633d340a35f00061851eb.jpeg\"',3.90,'[\"Mens 4-4 1/2 | Womens 6-6 1/2\",\"Mens 5-5 1/2 | Womens 7-7 1/2\",\"Mens 6-6 1/2 | Womens 8-8 1/2\",\"Mens 7-7 1/2 | Womens 9-9 1/2\",\"Mens 8-8 1/2 | Womens 10-10 1/2\",\"Mens 9-9 1/2 | Womens 11-11 1/2\",\"Mens 10-10 1/2 | Womens 12-12 1/2\",\"Mens 11-11 1/2 | Womens 13-13 1/2\",\"Mens 12 - 12 1/2 | Womens 14 - 14 1/2\",\"Mens 13 - 13 1/2 | Womens 15 - 15 1/2\"]','[\"Blue\",\"Red\",\"Sky-Blue\"]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"The current insoles of your shoes are probably removable. Start by removing them. Place the new Orthoctics insoles in the shoes.\"},{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"(1).Orthotic arch support insoles are usually thick, loose shoes is good choice.Better to wear the insoles in wider shoes.(2).Measure the length of your feet from toes to heel correctly and then find an insole size for your shoes.if needed, trim a little along the outline (on forefoot of insoels near toes).(3).Remove the original insoles, Clear the shoes, Align and trim insoles, Insert the new arch support insoels.(4).please replace your insoles every 3 months to keep your foot healthy. Clean with warm water. Not machine-wash.(5).Please start use the orthotic insoles from wearing 5 hours a day, then add use time day by day to get used to arch support\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ger███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are undoubtedly the most comfortable insoles I\'ve ever purchased. I\'m waiting for my second order to come in for another pair of shoes.\",\"title\":\"Worth every penny!\"},{\"name\":\"Eva███lin███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have had to wear inserts for a decade because of high archs.\\nThese work fabulous, I paid a podiatrist $400 for my inserts, these work and I saved a lot.\",\"title\":\"As good a podiatrist insert\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fits nicely in shoe and helps to relieve the pain.\",\"title\":\"Fits\"},{\"name\":\"Ste███nie███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These insoles are great. They have really helped my feet on my daily walks\\n The arch works well for me, and they\'re very comfortable.\",\"title\":\"Have helped my feet a lot\"},{\"name\":\"Deb\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Nice insert but the heel is too high, my foot keeps slipping out of my shoe.\",\"title\":\"Heel is too high\"},{\"name\":\"Marie\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"These are OK, but a little too hard and hurt my arch. Wouldn\'t recommend.\"},{\"name\":\"Cyndi\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Very hard, felt like walking on rocks.\",\"title\":\"Too hard.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"the wrong size was sent I\'m a 10 and a half they send a five and a half\"},{\"name\":\"Tim███y\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"vendor says order was delivered  but i have security cameras and the order was never delivered. and to my knowledge i have not received a refund.\",\"title\":\"order never received\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███k\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Size fits but it slides my foot outward and makes my feet very uncomfortable.\",\"title\":\"Very uncomfortable\"}]',NULL,17.99,NULL,'[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Foot Care\",\"Insoles\"]'),(150,'Size 4 Diapers','[\"500+ bought since yesterday\",\"In 200+ people\'s carts\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Parent-s-Choice-Dry-Gentle-Diapers-Size-4-192-Count-Select-for-More-Options_7c44d46d-0746-4bb4-9cf2-d7dde790fcde.dd5ded9351c125ab6aff999af4031673.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"Newborn\",\"1\",\"2\",\"3\",\"4\",\"5\",\"6\",\"7\",\"8\"]','[]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Apr███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Okay I\'ll admit it, I was a huge believer in paying more for diapers until I tried these! I can not believe how well they work! I only used a big name brand of diapers with my first and tried to continue that with my second child but he was getting leaks. We tried different styles and found some that work but it gets really expensive. These work just as well if not better and are much more affordable! The stretchy tabs work so well! They\'re super absorbent, haven\'t caused any rashes on my baby who has extremely sensitive skin, and I love the feel of them! Definitely recommend!\",\"title\":\"Make the switch!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have found that these work just as well if not better than name brands. They provide hours of absorbency and as long as the size is correct are great at preventing blowouts. I prefer these over other store brands because Parents choice fits my baby better.\",\"title\":\"Only diapers I buy\"},{\"name\":\"AuKay\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Good diapers, not the softest nor thickest but so far I haven\'t had any leaks. The package says it is “wiggle-proof leak barrier”and so far it\'s doing a good job at it. It does sags a lot after 4 hours so I haven\'t been able to test longer than that. I like the elastic waistband in the back, which makes it more comfortable for my active toddler. The prints are cute, gender neutral jungle theme and a pack comes with 2 different prints. Like with most diapers, it has a wetness indicator. My son is 31 lbs at 2.5 years and size 4 fits him well. There\'s also an indicator that tells you when your child is ready to move up to the next size and I found that very useful.\",\"title\":\"Cute prints, good diapers\"},{\"name\":\"kwe███tin███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I had high hopes for these diapers. They are definitely soft and stretchy. They are better price than some of the other bigger brands. But they don\'t keep up with those bigger brands. If I had to compare, they are similar to luvs. They do not hold nearly as much as your other big brand diapers. At first I thought they were going to be OK because if you change in your baby often enough then the amount of urine it hole is not bad. It does not hold very well or at least it feels very thin. As in the diaper gets filled very quickly and you\'ll notice more changes are needed. Which to me means that the baby skin is now constantly wet. The other problem I had was my child did have a blowout using these diapers. We haven\'t had a blowout in months. These diapers couldn\'t handle what needed to be done.\",\"title\":\"This did not meet my expectations.\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███s\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Love that size 8 is an option now and excited to try them as my autistic child is not fitting in the size 7\'s very well anymore, BUT WHY ARE THEY MORE MONEY THAN THE OTHER SIZES FOR LESS DIAPERS?! For Every other size the big box is $27 and some change but the big box of size 8 with of course less diapers (as usual the higher the sizes the less you get) is $35 and some change... that does not make sense and it really is a bummer for moms with special needs children who are unable to be potty trained at the moment but keep growing. I hope you fix that Walmart.\",\"title\":\"Why so much more money?!\"},{\"name\":\"megan\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I have used these diapers in size 2 several times for the price. Recently, I bought a pack and then I noticed that my 5 month old was getting smaller! The diapers were so big on her. I actually ordered formula because I was so worried that I wasn\'t making enough milk for her. Turns out, the diaper size was just inconsistent. I wasted money on formula and could have just bought the more expensive diapers.\",\"title\":\"Sizing changes\"},{\"name\":\"STE███NIE███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"i am assuming there was a problem with the machine during manufacturing because this is the 5th diaper in the first package of our first box that was missing the left blue velcro strap. Hopefully this problem gets resolved quickly because that is starting to add up! otherwise it would be a 5 star. very disappointed because we love these diapers!\",\"title\":\"machine problems\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███n\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These diapers used to never give me problems. Now that the absorbents are separated into three different lines they swell up so fast and leak as well. Also having problems with the sticky tabs popping off and the whole diaper is useless afterwards. Waste of money.\",\"title\":\"Not the same\"},{\"name\":\"Nic███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered size 6 diapers and missed the substitution notification/response window because I was in a meeting a work. Instead of subbing them for ANOTHER brand size 6, they picked a size 5?? Tell me what I’m supposed to do with a box of diapers that are too small for my child? Unacceptable rationale and I would have preferred them they take the item off the list.\",\"title\":\"Item return- substituted item is the wrong size\"},{\"name\":\"K\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I\'ve used these diapers on both of my kids for the past 4 years with no issues whatsoever. Last time I bought them, I noticed that they were different and the tabs were shorter. Now, my kids are soaking their pants after an hour because these diapers leak!! Just horrible. Why would you change the diapers when they work just fine?! The first night they wore diapers from the new box, my bed was completely soaked 1 hour after I put them both to bed with new clean diapers. I am so mad and now have to find a different (probably more expensive) brand of diapers that work for my kids. Unbelievable.\",\"title\":\"DIAPERS LEAK NOW\"}]','SAP, NON WOVEN, ADHESIVES, ELASTICS',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"SAP, NON WOVEN, ADHESIVES, ELASTICS\"}]','[\"Baby\",\"Diapering\",\"Diapers\",\"Size 4 Diapers\"]'),(151,'Plus Size Underwire Bras','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/No-Boundaries-Women-s-All-Over-Lace-Push-Up-Bra-with-Sugarcup-Sizes-34A-40DD_b352bd06-d31c-4063-95e4-5885535597be.2464d369fcdb16a74683b90c12cc0173.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"32B\",\"32C\",\"32D\",\"34A\",\"34B\",\"34C\",\"34D\",\"34DD\",\"36A\",\"36B\",\"36C\",\"36D\",\"36DD\",\"38B\",\"38C\",\"38D\",\"38DD\",\"40C\",\"40D\",\"40DD\"]','[\"BB Pink\",\"Black Soot\",\"Teal Marina And Deco Turq\",\"Tossed Floral\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash cold with similar colors. Only Non-chlorine bleach when needed. Air dry. Do not iron.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Deb███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love it. bought in several colors.\",\"title\":\"No Boundaries Padded Pushup Bra\"},{\"name\":\"Kim███ly\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have looked forward to my no boundaries bra I always get from Walmart, and have often favored that one over my more expensive Victoria\'s Secret or other bra that in comparison the cheap Walmart one always won. Recently no boundaries started their first ever “sugarcane” plant cup and I believe that\'s cool I can\'t tell a difference yet. Perhaps it\'s like a more stiff cup that keeps its shape unlike the others which is a plus especially for women with smaller busts and whom rely on the push up for the shape of their cup. The colors and styles have always been pretty cute as well! The retro daisy likght blue they recently had was my all time favorite style I bought two just because I loved the light blue and the bright colors amidst it. Retro daisy was a cool name for the theme of that style. 10/10 \\nCurrently the hot pink was my choice on this new one but I wish it came in the retro daisy style.\",\"title\":\"I have been a fan for years\"},{\"name\":\"LuLu\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Just enough push up. Feels hard though not soft. Firm and stiff. Good price.\",\"title\":\"Nice\"},{\"name\":\"Mel███e\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This bra is very cute however it\'s very scratchy and not great to wear for long periods of time. It will definitely push your breasts together in a flattering way however they do have a little..lump?. around the nipple part that isn\'t super noticable but there nonetheless.\",\"title\":\"Looks over functionality.\"},{\"name\":\"Shay\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"bought one at the store. loved it. decided to order the same one online and the quality and material was cheap\",\"title\":\"good enough\"},{\"name\":\"She███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The bra already came with the top edge of the cups flared outward. Because of this the bra is extremely visible through shirts.\",\"title\":\"Poor Quality\"},{\"name\":\"jodi\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"id have to get a 36 d to fit in this, ive wore the same bra size for 20 years, still a 34 c, i dont like the lace either, wouldnt recommend\",\"title\":\"same bra diffrent size\"},{\"name\":\"Laura\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I have bought these in the past and like them. The style has changed a little, for the worse. The sides used to be double lined with a spandex material under the lace. Now they just have the lace on the sides. The lace is itchy and doesn\'t give as much support as the old style. It\'s probably a cost cutting measure, but I think the bras will wear out faster and are not as comfortable.\",\"title\":\"The material and style changed for the worse.\"},{\"name\":\"Jes███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I\'ve worn this bra for years because it was perfect. This has been reworked, I don\'t know if it\'s the “sugarcup” or what, but it\'s a little smaller, the material is scratchier, the cups are rigid and uncomfortable, it\'s only half as padded. I hate it. And I hate that I need to find a new go to bra. It sucks now, don\'t waste your time or money.\",\"title\":\"Not what it used to be\"},{\"name\":\"Cece\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The fabric is not the same as it was a few years back. The bra is scratchy and it stays damp when you get it wet or sweaty. I wore it to work once and never again. This bra is to be worn for a short period of time and in cool weather. I don\'t recommend buying this product.\",\"title\":\"Do not purchase!\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Plus Size Bras, Panties, & Lingerie\",\"Plus Size Bras\",\"Plus Size Underwire Bras\"]'),(152,'Maternity Blouses & Shirts',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Bearsland-Female-Long-Sleeve-Maternity-Nursing-Top-Breastfeeding-Shirts-3-Pack_ee44c40a-fac4-4b37-848f-22a3cf5d130c.0903c82b6ab0fe200357f3ba690120f2.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]','[\"Black pink/Sky blue/Pink\",\"Dark gray/Blue gray stripe/ltblue\",\"Gray/Purple/Red deer\",\"Green pink/Blue/Gray Black\",\"Ltgray/Blue/Ltgreen\",\"Orange/Black/Brown\",\"Red/Green/Black gray\",\"Red/Sky blue/Black green\",\"Red/Yellow/Gray deer\",\"Yellow/Blue/Purple\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine(with laundry bag)or Hand Wash Cold/Tumble Dry with Low Heat/Do Not Bleach/Iron on Low Heat/lay flat to dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Dan███le\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was amazed how well these shirts hide spit up and all kids of wetness and stains. They are super comfortable and opaque. These shirts are warm, easy to wash, quality, and really cute! They were such a lifesaver for me after my winter baby. I live in these all the time! Get the size you were before baby since these run bigger.\",\"title\":\"Super comfortable and hides stains well!\"},{\"name\":\"Regan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The shirt runs a bit big but is so comfortable  perfect or breast feeding pumping momma\'s.Love that they came in a pack of three!!\",\"title\":\"Great nursing shirts,Love these!\"},{\"name\":\"New███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Easy access for baby. Comfortable soft fabric.Will probably buy more\",\"title\":\"Perfect for cold weather breastfeeding\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Comfortable, flattering, and functional. Maternity wear tends to be so frumpy, but these look like normal shirts while still being great for nursing.\",\"title\":\"Functional and attractive\"},{\"name\":\"Gina\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I think for the price these tops are good especially for the nursing stage. They are fairly casual looking so I honestly think they can be put to use even afterwards. They are soft and cozy. I haven\'t washed them or worn them yet (only tried on) so we will see how they stand up to laundry and wear.\",\"title\":\"Cute design, soft material\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ine███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Easy to use. They help keep you warm while nursing. The fabric is pretty thin, which I thought it was going to be thicker but it is comfortable. I love the colors. Sizes run a little big though. I would recommend and buy again, they just aren\'t warm enough for winter.\",\"title\":\"Pretty happy\"},{\"name\":\"Emili\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"the material is super soft, definitely love it. and the colors are super cute. the fit is flowy on me so i probably could have been ok with a size smaller (I\'m 5\'8 and 145lb and usually wear a medium but i got a size up since I expected to gain weight) but still love it and will probably order more\",\"title\":\"soft and cute\"},{\"name\":\"Jada\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I love the colors I purchased the shirts in. They held up even after washing. I haven\'t started nursing yet, but thus far I think the design will work for that purpose.\",\"title\":\"Nice Quality\"},{\"name\":\"KB\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Nice looking. Can\'t tell it\'s nursing\",\"title\":\"Looks good\"},{\"name\":\"Anna\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I love the colors and design of the tops, but due to the differences between fabric textures and colors, two run smaller than the third. Also, the white at the top of the tritone shirt is quite sheer, so I\'m not too willing to wear it. Otherwise, great length and good design for nursing/pumping! I just wish they were all as comfortable and stretchy as the blue striped one.\",\"title\":\"Not all created equal\"}]',NULL,39.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Maternity Clothing\",\"Maternity Tops & T-Shirts\",\"Maternity Blouses & Shirts\"]'),(153,'Cardigans for Women','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/2a71b9bd-e544-4599-8abe-1a8a853acf14.aae2955aba2fc112a72815280c5d92f1.jpeg\"',4.30,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Bright Green\",\"Deep Rose\",\"Gray\",\"Khaki\",\"Magenta\",\"Medium Purple\",\"Milky White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable Wash in Cold Water and Dry On Low Heat\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Swe███ali███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fantastic layering piece, nice and warm (live in VA), can\'t go wrong.\",\"title\":\"Adorable\"},{\"name\":\"Aly███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So comfy and cute for dresses!\"},{\"name\":\"Lisa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I wear this everywhere. I love the way it looks and fits.\",\"title\":\"Very nice\"},{\"name\":\"Roc███le\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very pretty color (Purple), soft cardigan, I love the way it feels, I wear a large but i brought a XL just in case it doesn\'t fit, it fits perfect!!!! I\'m one HAPPY Lady, 5 STARS from me\",\"title\":\"PERFECT BUY\"},{\"name\":\"Bar███a\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"like this sweater veey much.fit well and looked great on\",\"title\":\"satisfied customer\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███ka\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Quality was not good as depicted in the product description\",\"title\":\"Not satisfied with the quality of the product\"},{\"name\":\"MIS███L\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Chaka\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Bry███a\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Sam███ha\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,31.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Sweaters\",\"Cardigans for Women\"]'),(154,'Plus Size Pants','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/TIYOMI-Women-s-Plus-Size-Pants-Full-Length-3X-Brown-Ankle-Leggings-Stretchy-Soft-Casual-Butt-Fit-Solid-Color-Bottom-Autumn-Winter-Wear-Out-3XL-22W-24_d0fadbc4-c4a9-43ca-98e8-9a36cbc830a7.71bb36f929e63a27ed7d3a43240762c6.jpeg\"',4.10,'[\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\"]','[\"4609-Black\",\"4609-Dark Grey\",\"4609-Floral Black\",\"4609-Leopard\",\"4609-Navy Blue\",\"4609-Polka Dots\",\"4609-Star1\",\"4609-Star2\",\"4610-Leoaprd Side\",\"4610-Side Stripe\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Black Camo\",\"Black Floral Side\",\"Black Leopard\",\"Black Leopard Side\",\"Blue Tie Dye\",\"Brown\",\"Camo\",\"Camo Side\",\"Christmas\",\"Dark Grey\",\"Flower\",\"Halloween\",\"Leoaprd Side\",\"Leopard\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Orange\",\"Polka Dots\",\"Purple Tie Dye\",\"Red Plaid\",\"Red Plaid Side\",\"Snakeskin Pattern\",\"Tie Dye\",\"Wine Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"G\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The price was too high but it seems like a good quiet.\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s a great fit nice and warm not thin material I\'m going to order me some more love them\"},{\"name\":\"mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the leggings. These fit as expected and do not roll down at all. I often wear these under a dress to help keep me warm. I am sure it can be worn under a long shirt or sweater. Overall, these are great, I may by another pair on a different color.\",\"title\":\"True to size\"},{\"name\":\"wee███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"so comfortable fit to size\"},{\"name\":\"Jea███te\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Well, I have a hard time finding the right leggings, but when I came across these, I saw beautiful prints and in my size. When they arrived, I was even more surprised at how they looked and felt soft.  They fit just perfectly, then I decided to order another, and you can\'t beat the price. I\'m love my new leggings. Thank you!\",\"title\":\"best leggings\"},{\"name\":\"Coki\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is my second order. Have 4 pairs in different colors. Cannot beat price, size, quality. Fast delivery.\",\"title\":\"Camo Leggings\"},{\"name\":\"Adr███ne\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are the most comfortable and best fitting capri leggings I have ever purchased.\",\"title\":\"Gotta Love Um\"},{\"name\":\"Leah\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"not at all what i expected. they are just run of the mill leggings,  a little on the thin side %26 zero tummy control.\",\"title\":\"thin material\"},{\"name\":\"Sally\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"No “hidden pockets” or pockets for cell phone.\",\"title\":\"Not so great\"},{\"name\":\"Lisa\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I bought a pair in the store that looks just like these. EXCEPT  these were a knock off cheap excuse that ripped in the seam the first time I wore them. total trash!\",\"title\":\"Trash\"}]',NULL,28.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Pants\",\"Plus Size Pants\"]'),(155,'Metallic Decorative Baking','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Bakell-Royal-Gold-Tinker-Dust-5g-x1-Jar-Edible-Glitter-for-Cake-Decorating-Cupcakes-Cookies-and-Other-Desserts_289a90fe-96e7-453d-89a0-1456edddac8f.8fb8313606c728bb882ce15ad7e0b866.jpeg\"',4.70,'[]','[\"Antique Rose Gold\",\"Black Shimmer\",\"Bright Gold\",\"Brown\",\"Burgundy\",\"Champagne Gold\",\"Christmas Green\",\"Christmas Red\",\"Classic Green\",\"Classic Red\",\"Cranberry\",\"Creamsicle Orange\",\"Deep Blue\",\"Deep Pink\",\"Deep Purple\",\"Emerald Green\",\"Gold\",\"Ivory\",\"Leaf\",\"Lilac Purple\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Neon Blue\",\"Neon Green\",\"Neon Orange\",\"Neon Pink\",\"Neon Yellow\",\"Olive Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink Rose\",\"Pollipop Purple\",\"Pumpkin Orange\",\"Rose Gold\",\"Royal Gold\",\"Silver\",\"Silver Sage\",\"Soft Blue\",\"Soft Green\",\"Soft Olive Green\",\"Soft Pink\",\"Soft Purple\",\"Soft Rose Gold\",\"Sunflower Yellow\",\"Teal\",\"Turquoise\",\"White Pearl\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Reb███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Comes in a very tiny container but you don\'t need a lot. It was a great addition to the punch I made for a party.\",\"title\":\"Don\'t let the size fool you\"},{\"name\":\"Jus███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"AMAZING PRODUCT! Came perfectly packaged, it was perfectly edible and it was perfectly glittery! I purchased several edible glitters from Bakell for my purchase here on Walmart and my package came way faster than it said it wold! When I got the product, it looks like really fine, sparkly pixy dust... except you can eat it!  I sprinkled the edible glitter tinker dust on our strawberries and cupcakes and it looked incredible! I attached a picture of what some of the glitters looked like on our deserts and strawberries! \\n\\nNow I want to TRY ALL THE COLORS they have! Perfect 10/10!!\",\"title\":\"The PERFECT edible glitters,\"},{\"name\":\"Lalab\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Ver very small container but worked perfectly\",\"title\":\"Good product\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Perfect on my mom\'s 90th birthday cake\",\"title\":\"Edible Gold Dust\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Ridiculously small amount for the money charge and extra shipping..\\n1.5 diameter and height. Pretty and arrived fast but I will be judicious using it\",\"title\":\"Too expensive\"},{\"name\":\"Rob███ird███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Tara\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Che███\",\"rating\":5}]','Mica-Based Pearlescent, Iron Oxide',12.39,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Mica-Based Pearlescent, Iron Oxide\"}]','[\"Party & Occasions\",\"Party Supplies\",\"Party Supplies by Color\",\"Metallic Party Supplies\",\"Metallic Decorative Baking\"]'),(156,'Men\'s Movies and TV Tees','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Men-s-Star-Wars-Yoda-Best-Dad-Cartoon-Graphic-Tee-Kelly-Green-X-Large_2b1eacc4-4310-40de-b6c5-928bf62a924e.7ce137f7403eef5a06cb3e611aede839.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"Big & Tall\",\"Men\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"Kelly Green\",\"Kelly Heather\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash & Tumble dry\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My brother, a father 2 young ones loved nnnnnn so does “pa”!\",\"title\":\"Great fit n cute shirt.\"}]',NULL,18.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Graphics Shop\",\"Graphic Tees\",\"Movies & TV Tees\",\"Men\'s Movies and TV Tees\"]'),(157,'Girls Dress Shoes','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/PatPat-Little-Kid-Girls-Princess-Shoes-Toddler-Sequin-Shoes-Sweet-3D-Bow-Tie-Shiny-Rhinestone-Pearl-Fairy-Leather-Shoes-for-Gift-Gold-Size-5-5-11-5_3d1475b0-ae98-45ec-8d76-a67a82ab5322.733cab3e601aa2ad92c8701515ffed6a.webp\"',5.00,'[\"Toddler US 5.5\",\"Toddler US 6\",\"Toddler US 6.5\",\"Toddler US 7.5\",\"Toddler US 8\",\"Toddler US 8.5\",\"Little Kid US 9\",\"Little Kid US 9.5\",\"Little Kid US 10.5\",\"Little Kid US 11\",\"Little Kid US 11.5\",\"Little Kid US 12\",\"Little Kid US 12.5\"]','[\"Gold\",\"Pink\",\"Pink 1#\",\"Silver\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Avoid high temperatures and direct sunlight. Use a dry cloth to clean the synthetic leather.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Emily\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got these for my niece. The shoes look exactly like the picture. The shoes are a true fit and have so far lasted.\",\"title\":\"The shoes look exactly the picture.\"}]',NULL,28.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Kids Shoes\",\"Girls Shoes\",\"Girls Dress Shoes\"]'),(158,'Womens Dresses',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/LookbookStore-Women-s-Above-Knee-Length-Tiered-Babydoll-Denim-Dress-Button-Down-A-Line-Dress-Roadknight-Blue-Size-S_7b2be7d2-154a-4a7e-b0ac-5e2feb10dc1e.aefc22296b9309ba43472d4d3ea6c81a.jpeg\"',4.30,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"27\",\"28\",\"Denim Dress-Baroque Rose\",\"Denim Dress-Bay Blue\",\"Denim Dress-Foxy Gray\",\"Denim Dress-Reef Blue\",\"Denim Dress-Roadknight Blue\",\"Denim Dress-Twilight Blue\",\"Denim Dress-White\",\"Denim Dress-Wishful Blue\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Gentle Machine Wash; Hand Wash Cold\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Tra███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The denim dress is nicely made and comfortable , I am 5\'4 and 124 lbs ordered small \\nI like the design of the dress  \\n\\nI could had worn xsmall \\nBut still very cute with sandles and  will be cute in the fall with boots\",\"title\":\"Cute\"},{\"name\":\"Libby\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This dress is very cute and seems well made. The fit is loose, except through the shoulders. I ordered a medium but could have sized down, except for the shoulders. I\'m looking forward to wearing it. I think I will get a lot of use out of it.\",\"title\":\"Good purchase\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Cute and lightweight denim dress ! Runs true to size although a little tight across the chest part ( if you are a little fuller up top ) \\nGreat price and versatile piece !\"},{\"name\":\"Dee\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Runs true to size.  Real denim, great quality, plus I was happy with the fit.\\nBought a large: fits a 36D bust, hides a tummy without looking like a tent. It\'s a flattering style\",\"title\":\"Super cute dress with a great fit\"},{\"name\":\"lau███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have worn this more than any other dress this summer. I am 5\'5\\\" and this is just a tad bit shorter than I usually buy (I\'m also 40  ), but hasn\'t stopped me from wearing it. I am a true size 8 and sized down for a small.\",\"title\":\"Love!\"},{\"name\":\"Tammy\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I ordered a large but I was sent a xl. I would like a return the item. In the future if the size could be checked before it is sent out\",\"title\":\"Sent a incorrect size dress\"},{\"name\":\"ner\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"It is cute but runs quite big and is shorter than expected. I am older and 5\'2”. It hits well above my knee and I was hoping to hit at or just above the knee. I wear a large or extra large to cover hips. I order X-Large and could have order L.\",\"title\":\"Cute but …\"},{\"name\":\"Ope███ole███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This is my second version of this dress. I prefer the darker colored blue I previously purchased. Material seemed “thinner” to me but that could just be my imagination due to color. Still a nice easy to put together outfit. Dresses up or down easily. Nice to travel in (as long as you aren\'t reaching up for overhead bins as dress will hike up.) I think it runs a tad smaller and shorter. It\'s great for me since I\'m 5\'2. A taller person might not appreciate how short it would be on them.\",\"title\":\"Another stylish purchase that\'s comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Bam███na4███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Runs short,  it has a dark blue ring around the hem at bottom\"},{\"name\":\"Joan\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I always take a 10 dress %26 to the size chart I ordered a M. I received my Jean dress for our western night on our cruise %26 it\'s way to small..\",\"title\":\"Jean dress\"}]',NULL,40.29,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"Womens Dresses\"]'),(159,'Boys Socks','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Wonder-Nation-Boys-Cushioned-Ankle-Socks-10-Pack-Sizes-S-4-8-5-L-3-9_20f1e94c-d372-4fe1-a354-637182444f74_1.f61ecc447846581adb30c922872be49d.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"L (3-9)\",\"S (5-6.5)\",\"M (9-2.5)\"]','[\"Black\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash cold with like colors. Use only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low. Do not iron.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Wal███tCu███mer███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They are cotton socks which cotton is usually expensive but these were pretty comfortable price wise the quality was great compared to other brands. My son loved these socks and is excited to wear them for school. They also arrived pretty fast I\'m sure they arrived the next day after I ordered them the night before.\"},{\"name\":\"BAMM\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i like to shop online because unfortunately in my city of Milwaukee they Lock up socks and other items😡 because of shoplifting!! than I\'ll have to try and track an employee down with a key to unlock the socks and says they\'ll take them to the register🤷‍♂️ BUT IM NOT FINISHED SHOPPING YET!! Otherwise I\'ll drive miles away to a location where everything isn\'t under lock and key.ITS A VERY SAD WORLD AND TIME WE\'VE BECOME!!\",\"title\":\"grandkids needed new socks for summer fun\"},{\"name\":\"Bri███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Decent pair of socks\"},{\"name\":\"Renee\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The socks are fine.  They\'re socks for my 5 yr old grandson.  \\n\\nMy irritation comes with the way they were delivered.  I ordered all of his back to school clothes and each piece was delivered separately on separate days.  His socks and underwear weren\'t even packaged; just labeled and thrown on the porch! Walmart can\'t afford a box or bag to put them in? And why was each piece delivered throughout the last two weeks separately? It makes no sense.  I understand you want it delivered as fast as possible, but it makes more sense to put it all together in a box and make one trip.\",\"title\":\"Yep, they\'re socks.\"},{\"name\":\"MSk███y01███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I received this item today!!!\",\"title\":\"No way\"},{\"name\":\"Ang███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The material is nice, like the style but these were too small. Returning for a larger size.\",\"title\":\"Boys Socks\"},{\"name\":\"lil███ter███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I used to like purchasing these socks for my 6 year old grandson. They were the correct size, thickness and used to last him until his next size increase.  The last large pack that I bought was an unfortunate issue!  Of the large pack I bought…. within the first month, 3 pair came apart at the ankle seams.  I didn\'t think anything of last months 2/3 pair I had to toss.  These had only been through a couple of washes!!  Such a shame so much use left in the rest of the socks.\",\"title\":\"Unfortunate purchase this time around.\"},{\"name\":\"Ana███sia███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered size large for my 5 year old, which on the website showed sizes 9-11 (which one would assume is a toddler sizing it since it\'s large). I received size “Large sizes 3-9” and they\'re gigantic. \\nVery annoying because I now have to go to the store to return and I still need socks for my little guy.\",\"title\":\"Sizing wrong!\"},{\"name\":\"Dott\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I normally love Wonder Nation, and if you read my many reviews, you will see that. I bought these for back to school,but the size was too small for my older boy,so I gave them to the youngest boy. The socks get pilling right away, and after a normal day at school, the whole toe end of the socks is blown out as you see in my photos. This current production of socks are not worth buying as they do not last even a week of wear. I won\'t be buying any more socks of this brand until they improve them.\",\"title\":\"Nope\"},{\"name\":\"Lin███y\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered a Large based on what the website description says. \\nLarge is listed as 9-11, I received size 3-9. See photo\",\"title\":\"SIZING IS WRONG\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Boys Clothing\",\"Boys Socks\"]'),(160,'Party Dresses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Aiyino-Women-s-Sleeveless-Hollow-Out-Twist-Bodycon-Dress-Wrap-Slim-Fit-Party-Evening-Dresses-L-Royal-Blue_2e18b5d1-2317-4030-a666-0a85f3f434ee.970aba0d006e4a4fe0b71237a79cf1b3.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black Flower\",\"Blue Leaf\",\"Green\",\"Gray\",\"Grey Leaf\",\"Pink\",\"Purple Gradient\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Yellow Gradient\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"soz███mac███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Every now and then I try to get out of my comfort zone and with this dress, it was definitely that however, I was so surprised how much I liked it once it was on. I ordered a size large, which is my usual size, and it fit perfectly, and was not overly revealing, which is what I was looking for. I love that it is classic black.\",\"title\":\"Loved this dress and very tts\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The dress did not have a size tag but I believe it is a medium. This dress was SO cute and a very pleasant surprise. The cutouts are flirty and fun and the black color makes the dress very slimming. Throw a blazer over this for a workday outfit or add a pop with some colored heels for a sexy date night!\",\"title\":\"Flirty Sexy Date Night Dress\"},{\"name\":\"soz███iam███eni█████████\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Tjis durable fabric twist open front dress is very cute and comfortable. The fabric and style is great for a summer day at the beach or for a day out with friends and family. I have matched this dress with a simple pair of shoes. I am wearing a size XLarge. My measurements are Height 5\'6 Waist 28\\\" Hip 48\\\" Bra 36C\",\"title\":\"Twist Out Open Front Dress size XLarge\"},{\"name\":\"soz███ild███eph██████\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This size M dress is super sleek and sexy. I\'m a five feet five woman at 145 lbs, waist 29, hips 38, and chest 34A. It could be a casual or a dressy dress. Also, its price and range of color selections to choose from without breaking the bank makes this the ultimate go to. Get it now. At first glance, it looks asymmetrical, but if you move it a little, it is not.\",\"title\":\"Size M dress for petite or average sized woman.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got this black dress in a size small and it fit pretty loose and long on me but I\'m very short. I really liked the cut out design in the middle I thought it was very stylish. The material was extremely soft too. I think this would be super cute on a night out just size down if you want a tighter fit.\",\"title\":\"Very stylish and cute dress\"}]',NULL,19.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"Party Dresses\"]'),(161,'Wireless Bras','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/The-Lucille-Microfiber-Lace-Trim-Bralette_cd28bfbb-d098-4ad3-8a03-cd1472988442.b2fb9ade9f06f415b95cea8f9501fcbd.jpeg\"',4.90,'[\"36BCD\",\"36DDFG\",\"38BCD\",\"38DDFG\",\"40BCD\",\"40DDFG\",\"42BCD\",\"42DDFG\",\"44BCD\",\"44DDFG\",\"46BCD\",\"46DDFG\",\"48BCD\",\"50BCD\",\"52BCD\",\"54BCD\",\"56BCD\"]','[\"Black\",\"Whisky Rose\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash. Do not bleach. Line dry. Iron as needed using low temperature.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Che███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"We love these bras. My daughter couldn\'t wear a regular bra until she came across these. Now she wears one of these everyday. They are pretty with the lace around the tops. I say they are not the Nola though.\",\"title\":\"We love these bras. My da\"},{\"name\":\"Che███ E.███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These bras are comfortable and a pretty color. The lace detail makes it seem more feminine. I only wish they would be back the Nichole bra.\",\"title\":\"Perfectly Good bras\"},{\"name\":\"Gin███.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this! The band doesn\'t roll - it doesn\'t stretch out. And it has some support to it! A wide back is the most important feature --- it minimizes any additional \\\"armpit rolls\\\" Everything lays just RIGHT on this. I have a smaller chest for a plus gal (44D) and it fits great!\",\"title\":\"Plus Size Bralette for a small chest!\"},{\"name\":\"Meg███M.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This bra holds/supports well and is so comfy I can sleep in it. There is no wire and looks great under any type of clothing I have worn. The lace gives it an extra feminine feel. It fits well and I am between a B and C cup. It is perfect for the in between size!\",\"title\":\"This bra holds/supports well and\"},{\"name\":\"San███ G.███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am a 48A and finding a bra in that size is almost impossible. Not only did I find a bra in that size (the B/C/D cup), it fits perfectly, and is pretty in the whiskey rose - with just enough lace . I can wear this bra all day and it is still comfortable at the end of the day. So glad I found this style, now hoping to get Leading Lady to make it in nude/beige.\",\"title\":\"Comfort, Support and Lacy all in one bra\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have been looking for an everyday bra my whole life...I\'m 75! Finally found this one...no pain, no slipping, no band rolling...I can actually wear it all day. Plenty of support, my breasts are \\\"relaxed\\\" as they say and with this bra they don\'t just puddle in the bottom of the cup! I normally wear a 48 D but was sold out...got the 50 BCD and it\'s fine. I would wear a bra with more projection for dress but for everyday this is the bra of my dreams!\",\"title\":\"At last!...\"},{\"name\":\"Che███ E.███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These bras are comfortable and a pretty color. The lace detail makes it seem more feminine. I only wish they would be back the Nichole bra.\",\"title\":\"Perfectly Good bras\"},{\"name\":\"Anon\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I ordered a 44 ddfg. I think I should have gotten the 42 and been better off. I was at 43 inches and always order a 44 for safety but in the weeks it took to ship I now measure at 42. So that\'s luck for ya. But other than that I will wear it cus I live in canada and I will not deal with the hassle. It\'s a beautiful bra and I will make it work! Would recommend just measure yourself exactly.\",\"title\":\"Very nice\"},{\"name\":\"Ell███Fou███ux\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"In switching from underwires to bras without wire, I find this bra very comfortable. I can\'t even feel that I\'m wearing a bra! The only thing is that my shape/form is not as attractive as with an underwire but at this point I\'m not concerned about that. It\'s a great bra!\",\"title\":\"Wearing It Daily And Love It!\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███lin███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I ordered this bra had to return for a bigger size and still was not big enough. Exchanging and returning products through the site is super easy and stress free. This bra would have been great if it was bigger but I felt both sizes ran ready small on this one.\",\"title\":\"Wanted to love it\"}]',NULL,20.25,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Bras\",\"Wireless Bras\"]'),(162,'Water Flavoring','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Stur-Black-Cherry-Liquid-Water-Enhancer-Drink-Mix-1-62-fl-oz-Bottle-10-Pack_3778408a-48a8-4f3e-9ed5-4312182b3cba.528f9c5d9b8a3ae1b10a1cfc10cfdcc9.png\"',4.10,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Squeeze for into 8 fl oz of water\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Lau███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got the wrong flavor. I ordered the Blue %26 Blackberry but all 10 were Black Cherry. I\'m giving 5 stars because Dyla went above and beyond to make this right. They allowed me to keep the wrong flavor but shipped the correct one very quickly. Great customer service. Also, I\'ve tried 5 flavors because I got a variety pack first and my favorite is definitely the Blue %26 Blackberry. Second favorite is probably Strawberry Watermelon. Would like to try the Lemonade sometime too if I can ever find it at a decent price.\",\"title\":\"Great customer service on shipping mistake.\"},{\"name\":\"Das███mom███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love this stuff. Don\'t understand why it\'s not sold in store.\",\"title\":\"Makes water taste better naturally.\"},{\"name\":\"Pwe███r\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Unlike some others, I didn\'t have any issues...received all 10 bottles.  Since this is the only safe water enhancer on the market wouldn\'t think of using anything else.  Buying from this seller instead of directly from Stur saved me $10.92!\",\"title\":\"LOVE the Blue\"},{\"name\":\"Hazel\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The price for 10 bottles in a variety of flavors for Stur attracted our attention, so we ordered this item.  When we received only 7 of the bottles on Dec 22, we attempted contacting the supplier, Dyla, directly as the shipment included a packing slip from the supplier.  The number listed on their site did was not answered even though we called during business hours.  We listed all of this as a complaint to Walmart and received a customer service response.  We were informed that an incorrect phone number had been listed and that Dyla corrected that.  Dyla sent replacement items along with additional flavors for us to try as well as the cost of the item being refunded.  Needless to say, we were very impressed with this response. and look forward to making further purchases with both Dyla and Walmart.  We note that another customer has had the same issue with an incorrect number of items being sent and hope this issue is addressed by the appropriate management.\",\"title\":\"Short shipment - our outcome\"},{\"name\":\"Cha███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The package was shipped in a timely manner and as advertised. This is 2nd time I have bought from this seller. Would do it again. The expiration dates are a year in advance. an added feature.\",\"title\":\"Great Seller and good prduct\"},{\"name\":\"Danae\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Peach was the first flavor I tried of Stur, and I love it. Unfortunately it\'s no longer available because it\'s not being made. You will receive Stur Peach Mango because Peach is \\\"out of stock.\\\" It\'s ok, it\'s just not peach.\",\"title\":\"Peach Mango, not Peach\"},{\"name\":\"Vicki\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Sadly, I only ENJOYED 3 of the 10 flavors...the blue %26 blackberry, grape acai and the pomegranate cranberry *which was my favorite.*  I couldn\'t wait to finish the coconut pineapple, fruit punch and the strawberry watermelon.  But I absolutely hated the other 4 flavors so much that I threw them out.  I really lost money on this purchase.\",\"title\":\"Not what I\'d hoped for\"},{\"name\":\"Nob███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I got these today. And I\'m missing one.Grape Acai. That\'s why I\'m giving it a one star\"},{\"name\":\"Wal███e\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I\'ve been drinking Stur mix for years.  I especially love the Grape Acai and this was a good deal, I thought.  The Grape Acai is really Fruit Punch in a Grape Acai container!  Not happy because I don\'t like Fruit Punch.\",\"title\":\"Flavors mixed up\"},{\"name\":\"cyn███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Buyer beware!! I ordered this product and received 6 out of the 10 flavors. I have contacted them twice with no return contact. Great product - very bad customer service!!! I will not order again - this is too expensive for what you receive. I don\'t like wasting money and this is a waste.\",\"title\":\"Buyer Beware!!\"}]','Purified Water, Natural Flavor, Concentrated White Grape Juice, Vitamin C (ascorbic acid), Citric Acid, Fruit / Vegatable Juice (color), Natural Stevia Extract.',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Purified Water, Natural Flavor, Concentrated White Grape Juice, Vitamin C (ascorbic acid), Citric Acid, Fruit / Vegatable Juice (color), Natural Stevia Extract.\"}]','[\"Food\",\"Beverages\",\"Water Flavoring\",\"Water Flavoring\"]'),(163,'Women\'s Body Wash',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Soapbox-Body-Wash-Watermelon-Peony-Body-Wash-for-Women-Men_e95076b4-ad8e-4ada-a3d1-3ae9523de24e.2d7709ef48c1be7b611fe8ab85afd7b9.jpeg\"',5.00,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Massage this nourishing body wash on wet skin & rinse completely.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mrs L\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought Oat Milk Lavender body wash and so glad I did. Love the smoothness and fragrance.  I wish they would make Lotion in same fragrances .\",\"title\":\"Wonderful fragrance\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5}]','WATER, SODIUM COCO-SULFATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM CHLORIDE, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, GLYCERIN, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ALOE VERA JUICE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, CITRULLUS LANATUS (WATERMELON) FRUIT EXTRACT, PAEONIA ALBIFLORA (PEONY) FLOWER EXTRACT, SODIUM HYALURONATE (HYALURONIC ACID), NIACINAMIDE, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE (VITAMIN E), ACETYL HEXAPEPTIDE-8 (PEPTIDE), ACETIC ACID, FRAGRANCE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, BENZYL ALCOHOL, CITRIC ACID',29.99,'[{\"type\":\"Inactive Ingredients\",\"values\":\"WATER, SODIUM COCO-SULFATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM CHLORIDE, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, GLYCERIN, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ALOE VERA JUICE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, CITRULLUS LANATUS (WATERMELON) FRUIT EXTRACT, PAEONIA ALBIFLORA (PEONY) FLOWER EXTRACT, SODIUM HYALURONATE (HYALURONIC ACID), NIACINAMIDE, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE (VITAMIN E), ACETYL HEXAPEPTIDE-8 (PEPTIDE), ACETIC ACID, FRAGRANCE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, BENZYL ALCOHOL, CITRIC ACID\"},{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"WATER, SODIUM COCO-SULFATE, COCAMIDOPROPYL BETAINE, SODIUM CHLORIDE, GLYCOL DISTEARATE, GLYCERIN, GUAR HYDROXYPROPYLTRIMONIUM CHLORIDE, ALOE VERA JUICE, BUTYROSPERMUM PARKII (SHEA) BUTTER, CITRULLUS LANATUS (WATERMELON) FRUIT EXTRACT, PAEONIA ALBIFLORA (PEONY) FLOWER EXTRACT, SODIUM HYALURONATE (HYALURONIC ACID), NIACINAMIDE, TOCOPHERYL ACETATE (VITAMIN E), ACETYL HEXAPEPTIDE-8 (PEPTIDE), ACETIC ACID, FRAGRANCE, PHENOXYETHANOL, POTASSIUM SORBATE, DEHYDROACETIC ACID, BENZYL ALCOHOL, CITRIC ACID\"}]','[\"Personal Care\",\"Bath & Body\",\"Body Wash\",\"Women\'s Body Wash\"]'),(164,'Womens Plus Skirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Roaman-s-Women-s-Plus-Size-Tall-Invisible-Stretch-All-Day-Cargo-Skirt-34-T-Medium-Stonewash_9f91a1c2-90b1-4328-b51a-59e230714617.f7823d1b3ca5d8f7a02ae526e43fcb33.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"12 T\",\"14 T\",\"16 T\",\"18 T\",\"20 T\",\"22 T\",\"24 T\",\"26 T\",\"28 T\",\"30 T\",\"32 T\",\"34 T\",\"36 T\",\"38 T\",\"40 T\",\"42 T\",\"44 T\"]','[\"Black Denim\",\"Indigo Wash\",\"Light Stonewash\",\"Medium Stonewash\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Gra███G\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Had for awhile I like it\",\"title\":\"Old but still look new\"},{\"name\":\"Lee███ B\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the material and the color of the skirt. Pockets on the skirt are very convenient also ??\",\"title\":\"Cargo Skirt\"},{\"name\":\"JUD███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am short and the regular length on me is a maxi length. All the way to my feet. Have to wear with heels.\",\"title\":\"Great skirt. Very long.\"},{\"name\":\"PAT███IA ███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is my favorite skirt.  I have 4. They wear well. They are not easy to wrinkle. The first two did not have watch pockets. The latest ones do. I do not like the way the flaps on the cargo pockets turn up once to have washed them. Overall best skirts.\"},{\"name\":\"Den███ C\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s a nice skirt. I didn\'t realize it was flarey  I like the slim looking ones. I haven\'t worn it yet. But it is a nice looking skirt.\"},{\"name\":\"SAN███M\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This skirt is a great length (I am 5\'9\\\") and looks good. Love the pockets!!!! It is a little close fitting, so those with a large rear know it will accentuate that. the stretch makes it move great though so close fit is nice IMHO\",\"title\":\"Great stretch, love the pockets\"},{\"name\":\"Pam███ H\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The denim is heavy, not lightweight, and is perfect for fall and winter.  It may be a bit heavy for the summer, but I have lighter denim skirts for that season.  I am apple-shaped with heavy thighs and this skirt gives perfect coverage. This will last.  It washes well in cold water and dries with no shrinkage.  Remove it from the dryer and hang it up, perhaps you need to iron the hem which always curls? This is my go-to for casual occasions and day-to-day wear.\",\"title\":\"Heavy weight, sturdy and pretty\"},{\"name\":\"Sta███ne ███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The skirt was made well. Loved the length, very modest. Waist was great with elastic band . Very comfortable.\",\"title\":\"Cargo skirt\"},{\"name\":\"NAN███B\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Comfortable and good looking\",\"title\":\"Good looking\"},{\"name\":\"Dot███ S\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Not a bad looking skirt, but the patch pocket flaps are too thick don\'t lay well at all.   Once washed it might be better, if not I will probably just tack the flaps down.    Would be much better without the pockets and flaps.\",\"title\":\"Not a bad looking skirt, but the pocket flaps are poorly done.\"}]',NULL,55.74,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Womens Plus Skirts\"]'),(165,'Mens Cargo Shorts',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/X-RAY-Men-s-Belted-Cargo-Long-Shorts-18-Inseam-Below-Knee-Length-Multi-Pocket-3-4-Capri-Pants-Grey-Size-36_560a058c-2f7b-4136-9e3b-f45ebfb462f0.159ebaec977bcf7f87c9476d1968954b.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"28\",\"30\",\"32\",\"33\",\"34\",\"36\",\"38\",\"40\",\"42\",\"44\",\"46\",\"48\",\"50\",\"52\",\"54\",\"30 Waist\",\"32 Waist\",\"36 Waist\"]','[\"BLACK\",\"BLACK CAMO\",\"BROWN CAMO\",\"Black\",\"Burgundy\",\"CHARCOAL\",\"DESERT CAMO\",\"GREY\",\"Gray\",\"JESTER RED\",\"KHAKI\",\"Khaki Camo\",\"LEAF GREEN\",\"MAJOLICA BLUE\",\"NAVY\",\"NAVY CAMO\",\"NEW KHAKI\",\"Navy Camo\",\"OLIVE\",\"OLIVE CAMO\",\"ORANGE CAMO\",\"PASTEL GREEN\",\"PASTEL PINK\",\"PLAID BLACK\",\"PLAID BLUE/WHITE\",\"PLAID CHARCOAL\",\"PLAID WHITE\",\"ROYAL BLUE\",\"SAGE CAMO\",\"SLATE GREY\",\"STEEL\",\"STONE\",\"TEAL CAMO\",\"WHITE\",\"WHITE CAMO\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash Cold/Turn Garment Inside Out/Tumble Dry Low\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Den███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It was very  hard to find Men\'s White shorts in my size. So, when I saw these I thought I would give them a try. I actually got married in them (coastal theme) and they look great.\",\"title\":\"Great Pants at a Great Price\"},{\"name\":\"val███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Husband love them\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Seem to be good quality and heavy material (not flimsy).  The are 18\\\" long, so they fall farther below my knee than I would like - but otherwise - these long shorts are a good buy.\",\"title\":\"Well-made 18-inch capri pants\"},{\"name\":\"JOS███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great product, fast shipping, highest recommndations !\"},{\"name\":\"Debra\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I LOVE these capris! They\'re definitely going to be my \\\"go-to\\\" pants for summer. They\'re EXACTLY what I needed after wearing my beloved Mammut hiking capris until they were shredded and falling apart. These are as close as I\'ve come to replacing those pants. The design is similar to Mammut, and the fabric is almost identical in weight and weave. AND they cost LESS THAN HALF what I paid for the Mammut pants ten years ago!\\n\\nI\'d been buying Stone Touch Cargo Capris, but they stopped making the style I liked, and the ones that are still available were too large. Ah, well... these X-RAY pants are SO much better!\\n\\nThese are incredibly well designed and made. The seams are strong and the fabric is a perfect weight, heavy enough for working outside and light enough for hot weather. Fabric, seams, snaps, and zipper all seem to be very sturdy. They fit my waist well without the belt, and are roomy in the seat and thigh, allowing for lots of freedom of movement.\\n\\nI\'ve been wearing them daily, and like them so much that I ordered two more pair!\\n\\nI prefer some men\'s pants and shirts because they tend to be more well made, and designed for a wider range of movement than many of the women\'s, and the pockets are deeper... great for me since I hate carrying a purse. These pockets have snap closures rather than that annoying velcro that sticks to other garments in the laundry, so that\'s another big plus.\\n\\nIt\'s also one of the few men\'s cargo capris that come in a size small enough for me.\",\"title\":\"Great fit, quality and value!\"},{\"name\":\"BT\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My husband loves these Xray Jean capris. The extra room in the crotch from the gusset makes these pants very comfortable, especially when you sit!!\",\"title\":\"Xray pants with gusseted crotch!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Kim███ly\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"My son wears a 33\\\" waist in jeans so I ordered a 33\\\" waist. The fit around the waist was a little baggy. Otherwise, they are nice.\"},{\"name\":\"Tank\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This is the second pair I bought that ripped in the back. First pair ripped the first day, returned and purchased another pair. They ripped after wearing them a few times in the exact area.  Not sure what’s going on.\",\"title\":\"Rip easily, possibly defective???\"},{\"name\":\"Sup███t\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These are closer to almost pant than below the knee\\nThese are not just below the knee these are more like 3/4\",\"title\":\"These are 3/4 length\"},{\"name\":\"Don███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered 3 pair of cargo shorts from Walmart\\nThey came in as stated on my email.  I received 2 of 3 cargo shorts right that I  ordered. The navy camo cargo shorts that I ordered was just regular color navy cargo shorts.\",\"title\":\"Right size wrong product\"}]',NULL,29.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Shorts\",\"Mens Cargo Shorts\"]'),(166,'Shop Curtains','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-Blackout-Double-Pinch-Pleat-Curtain-Panel-Dark-Green-50-W-x-168-L-1Panel_b58be48f-a84a-489d-8dc2-0c49adf74b6f.b534a5ec133d5661427fae31c7b81ad0.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"50 W x 108 L\",\"50 W x 120 L\",\"50 W x 132 L\",\"50 W x 144 L\",\"50 W x 156 L\",\"50 W x 168 L\",\"50 W x 180 L\",\"50 W x 192 L\",\"50 W x 204 L\",\"50 W x 216 L\",\"50 W x 228 L\",\"50 W x 240 L\",\"50 W x 72 L\",\"50 W x 84 L\",\"50 W x 96 L\"]','[\"Baby Pink\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Blood Red\",\"Brick Red\",\"Burgundy\",\"Coffee\",\"Dark Chocolate\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Grayish White\",\"Ivory\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Green\",\"Mustard Yellow\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Olive Green\",\"Purple\",\"Rose Gold\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Seafoam Green\",\"Silver Gray\",\"Taupe\",\"Turquoise\",\"Violet\",\"White\",\"Wine\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m really happy I bought it!!! The Amay Blackout Double Pinch Pleat Curtain Panel in Ivory has completely transformed the ambiance of my living room. These curtains exude luxury and elegance while providing excellent light-blocking capabilities. The pinch pleat design adds a touch of sophistication to my home decor that I had been longing for. The fabric quality is exceptional, and the curtains drape beautifully, creating a cozy and inviting atmosphere. They make my space feel warm and welcoming, whether it\'s day or night. Love these!!\",\"title\":\"A Touch of Luxury!\"},{\"name\":\"Fyw███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m absolutely thrilled with the Amay Blackout Double Pinch Pleat Curtain Panel. The ivory color complements my home decor perfectly, and the pinch pleat design adds an elegant touch to my living space. But the real star here is the light control - these curtains effectively block out sunlight, creating a cozy and relaxing ambiance. The 108-inch length adds a touch of grandeur to my room. Superb quality and functionality!\",\"title\":\"Impressive Light Control and Elegance\"},{\"name\":\"Qiq███qy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently purchased the Amay Blackout Double Pinch Pleat Curtain Panel in Ivory, and I\'m extremely happy with my choice. The 50-inch width provides full coverage for my window, and the double pinch pleat design is simply stunning. The blackout feature is a game-changer, ensuring privacy and a darkened room whenever needed. These curtains have transformed the atmosphere of my bedroom, offering a perfect blend of style and function. Pleased with my order from this shop! I recommend it to everyone!!!\",\"title\":\"Perfect Blend of Style and Function\"},{\"name\":\"Btr███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently purchased the Amay Blackout Double Pinch Pleat Curtain Panel in Ivory, and I couldn\'t be happier with my purchase. The quality of the curtain panel is exceptional, and the fabric feels luxurious. The double pinch pleat design adds a touch of elegance to my living room. Moreover, the ivory color complements my decor perfectly. The blackout feature is fantastic as it blocks out the sunlight effectively, providing a cozy ambiance. I highly recommend these curtains to anyone looking for both style and functionality.\",\"title\":\"Excellent Quality and Elegant Look\"},{\"name\":\"Wlv███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have large windows in my bedroom, and finding curtains to fit them has always been a challenge until I found the Amay Blackout Double Pinch Pleat Curtain Panel. The 50-inch width and 108-inch length are a perfect fit, and the double pinch pleat style hangs beautifully. The ivory color adds a touch of sophistication to the room, and the blackout feature ensures a peaceful and dark environment for a good night\'s sleep. The quality is top-notch, and I am delighted with this purchase. Pleased with my order from this shop! I recommend it to everyone!!!\",\"title\":\"Perfect Fit for Large Windows\"}]',NULL,126.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(167,'Womens Plus Swimsuits','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Women-s-Plus-Size-Flower-Printing-Shaping-Body-One-Piece-Swim-Dresses-Tummy-Control-Swimsuit_284bfc8e-ebe1-4588-b799-66c17e7fbcef.0e1a1a771cad44f2b7eda5ecb0cc3ed4.jpeg\"',3.00,'[\"L,XL,XXL,3XL,4XL\",\"Size L (12-14)\",\"Size XL (16-18W)\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black-New\",\"Blue\",\"Green\",\"Green+New2\",\"Green-New\",\"Orange\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Handwash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Sun███wer███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very affordable price !!! Best swimsuit that good support for big bust 42DDD.   Best to have 2 pieces because of my age (bladder weak) make it easier to remove pant when go pee. THAN remove whole one piece suit.  I wear my daily breast support bra inside.  I am 195lb and 5\'3 and 57yrs old. Wear size 16-18w. Yesterday my husband and I went to pool party small group. Last photo below\",\"title\":\"Affordable price at best comfort support\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███en\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very nice Swimsuit, well made\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███a\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Bought this for my mom. Ended up keeping it for myself becuase it was way too small for her.\"},{\"name\":\"Hea███r\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This was not one piece swimsuit\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███n\",\"rating\":1}]',NULL,22.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Womens Plus Swimsuits\",\"Womens Plus Swimsuits\"]'),(168,'Wireless Printers',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Core-Innovations-Thermal-Printer-Paper-Sticker-Bundle-3-Adhesive-2-Paper-Rolls-for-Photos-Labels-Stickers-White-5-Rolls_8008ff9e-6c27-46d9-9389-f6d2ea6cc15d.6fae71e44b693f3d625bc9c30ceead5c.jpeg\"',4.80,'[]','[\"Multicolor\",\"White\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Cas███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is a great pack to buy for this printer! It was a life saver over the holidays that allowed me to customize present name tags, jazz up thank you cards, and label the decorations storage bins. I will now incorporate it into my business shipping routine to improve my aesthetic. I highly recommend getting this pack if you use this printer!\",\"title\":\"Product Review\"},{\"name\":\"Lee███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really love this little pocket printer. It was perfect for labing my homemade blackberry jam jars.\",\"title\":\"Thermal printer\"},{\"name\":\"Wal███tCu███mer███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I didn\'t like the shipping. I tried to put this paper in the order with the printer and it still cost me to ship the paper\"},{\"name\":\"kiya\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It didn\'t need paper because the original package of the mini thermal printer came with some but it helps to take advantage of the product with extra. Nice quality paper.\",\"title\":\"Business label printing\"},{\"name\":\"nic███as\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"3 adhesive rolls and 2 non adhesive rolls. the work perfect on small thermal printers. the adhesive rolls actually make pretty good stickers and labels. they hold up pretty well for the abuse i put em through. the non adhesive rolls work perfect for todo lists, receipts, and random notes.\",\"title\":\"perfect for personal and business use\"},{\"name\":\"Luke\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this thermal paper rolls it has sticky side.  I use my core innovation mini printer to print out my own design stickers.  I love that it come with different color rolls.\",\"title\":\"Awesome paper for making stickers!\"},{\"name\":\"BRE███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"it fit on my mini printer i buy at amazon and is sticker love it\",\"title\":\"love it\"},{\"name\":\"Cup███at\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Been using this paper with my thermal printer for a few months now. It\'s inexpensive and does the job. I read a lot of books and I use this paper to print the covers to remember which books I\'ve read and reviewed. Works perfect for my needs and is a fraction of the cost of the Zon for the same thing.\",\"title\":\"Love this thermal paper\"},{\"name\":\"Tara\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love that this printer uses adhesive paper rolls and non-adhesive paper rolls\\nI used the adhesive roles to label items in my pantry. The non-adhesive roles came in very handy to print out receipts to save for taxes. \\nLove that they offer colored paper rolls\",\"title\":\"Labels!❤️\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Works exactly as described/promised. Have already used it multiple times, only a minor hiccup trying to get it up and running, however the customer service team at Core Innovations really was great and walked me through loading the printer and getting up and running! Definitely recommend if you need a thermal printer and/or therm. printer paper\",\"title\":\"5* Product and Service All Around\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Electronics\",\"Computers, Laptops and Tablets\",\"Printers & Supplies\",\"Printers\",\"Wireless Printers\"]'),(169,'Toddler Girls Outfit Sets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/CARETOO-Toddler-Girl-Clothes-Outfits-12M-6T-Summer-Plaid-Shirt-Shorts-Headband-Cotton-Fabric-3pcs_b9ddc094-8b74-4177-b36f-941b00202d1a.548633d56b1de38b7f20a4988f74de6a.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"12-18 Months\",\"18-24 Months\",\"3T-4T\",\"2-3T\",\"4-5T\",\"5-6 Years\"]','[\"Daddy\'s Girl\",\"Floral\",\"Green\",\"Little Miss\",\"Pink\",\"Pink Print\",\"Purple\",\"Tie Dye\",\"White Blue\",\"White Green\",\"White+red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash and machine wash are OK.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Sue\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This outfit was cute and, most importantly, my granddaughter loved it!\",\"title\":\"Cute Outfit\"},{\"name\":\"Hay███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,24.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Toddler Clothing\",\"Toddler Girls (12M-5T) Clothing\",\"Toddler Girls Outfit Sets\"]'),(170,'All Area Rugs','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/iOhouze-Area-Rug-4-x6-Washable-Rugs-with-Rubber-Backing-Bedroom-Rugs-Natural-Cotton-Floor-Carpet-for-Dining-Room-Kitchen-Living-Room-Bedroom_347a8688-468e-449e-b39e-c7256080ec23.1f1a856ddd1fb9983e8e63d126affade.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"2\'x3\'(24\\\"x36\\\")\",\"2\'x4.3\'(24\\\"x51.6\\\")\",\"2\'x5\'(24\\\"x60\\\")\",\"2\'x6\'(24\\\"x72\\\")\",\"2\'x7\'(24\\\"x84\\\")\",\"2\'x8\'(24\\\"x96\\\")\",\"2.6\' x 14\' (31.2\\\"x168\\\")\",\"2.6\' x 16\' (31.2\\\"x192\\\")\",\"2.6\'x10\'(31.2\\\"x120\\\")\",\"2.6\'x12\'(31.2\\\"x144\\\")\",\"2.6\'x8\'(31.2\\\"x96\\\")\",\"3\'x5\'(36\\\"x60\\\")\",\"4\'x6\'(48\\\"x72\\\")\",\"5\'x7\'(60\\\"x84\\\")\",\"6\'x9\'(72\\\"x108\\\")\"]','[\"Black/Charcoal Grey\",\"Black/White\",\"Black/White-01\",\"Black/White-02\",\"Brown\",\"Charcoal Grey/Dark Grey\",\"Dark Grey/Light Grey\",\"Natural\",\"Solid Gray\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"MIc███le\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The rug has good style, pretty neutral. The rug stays put because it has nonskid on the back.\",\"title\":\"Great entry rug!\"},{\"name\":\"Terry\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"We have several cooks in the family, and the kitchen floor gets yucky.\\nThis horg washable rug fits the bill.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful Kitchen Rug\"},{\"name\":\"Rose\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The runner rug matches the play mat well. The rug is roborock friendly.\",\"title\":\"Runner Rug\"},{\"name\":\"Terri\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very nice and heavy duty rugs!\",\"title\":\"Highly recommend\"},{\"name\":\"Carol\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"If you\'re just looking for an inexpensive.  You\'ll like it. Corners curl up. could be tripping hazard.\",\"title\":\"It\'s ok\"},{\"name\":\"Kat\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I mistakingly thought this was an entryway door mat type rug, but it is not. It\'s okay to put in front of your kitchen sink or I got mine on the side of my bed, but it doesn\'t have the durations or thinkness to be called a \\\"door mat\\\". It\'s true that it\'s non-slip and I feel safe putting it beside my bed but not enough to put in a high traffic area like our kitchen or \\\"entry way\\\" which to me equates to \\\"door mat\\\". My mistake.\",\"title\":\"My mistake...\"},{\"name\":\"Mal\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Rug doesn\'t lay flat, too lightweight. Ends are turned under instead of bound, so they create a trip hazard. Not workable for my location.\",\"title\":\"Too Lightweight\"},{\"name\":\"Moo███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Not at all what I was expected.\\nI washed this run per instructions %26 it is now smaller than before.\\n\\nYes I expected it to get a little smaller, but WOW.!!\"},{\"name\":\"tpf███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I would never buy a product from this manufacturer again. The rug was folded up in a box upon arrival. Who would package a rug that way? I didnt even get to try it as I was not about to take it out of the box and try and get the fold marks out. It was easier just to take it back.\",\"title\":\"Folded up in a box\"},{\"name\":\"Max███amm███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Would not purchase again. These rugs are advertised as being non slip. I have hardwood floors and they slip all over the place. After 1 week I am already tired of repositioning them several times a day. They were folded when packaged and the fold marks have not come out even though I put them in the dryer with a damp towel. Not worth the money\",\"title\":\"Would not recommend.\"}]',NULL,109.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Rugs\",\"Area Rugs\",\"All Area Rugs\"]'),(171,'Tshirts for Women',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/JuneFish-Women-s-V-Neck-Tee-Summer-Tshirts-Casual-Short-Sleeve-Tops-Loose-Blouse-Fit-Tunic_da969b1a-0d24-4aa7-b08e-d4653720d310.0662f3c8e5df9e7e790f5a3e5666b3cd.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\"]','[\"Camouflage-pink\",\"Dark Green\",\"Fl Bw Grain\",\"Fl Gypsophila Black\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Peacock Blue\",\"Rose Navy\",\"Sunflower Black\",\"White Stripe\",\"A1-Leopard White\",\"A2-Light Blue Floral\",\"A3-Black Stripe\",\"A4-Black\",\"A5-Bean Red Stripe\",\"A6-Purple Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Please wash in cold water and dry clean. Recommended hand-wash or machine washable.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mel███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It fits great. Material is so soft. I love it!\",\"title\":\"Perfect top!\"},{\"name\":\"Bea███lon███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Have gotten so many complaints on this top, and it\'s so very comfortable.  I am definitely going to look for more like this from this seller. So happy with this find!\",\"title\":\"Really Nice Top for the Price\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really like the shirt, I\'m just Fat\",\"title\":\"Good shirt I\'m just fat\"},{\"name\":\"Betty\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"cool,comfy,fits nicely,the price was great,they\'re nice enough to be dressed up or casual around home.\",\"title\":\"love these\"},{\"name\":\"Mag███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Even though the suggested size is M, which I wear all the time, the sizing on this seems a bit small.  Order the next size up or it will cling to you.\",\"title\":\"Cute shirt, runs small\"},{\"name\":\"M\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I gave this top only three stars because this top is really pretty, and feels nice on but I had to return it because there was a defect in the sewing.\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I ordered ”purple red” which looked like a really bright color leaning towards dark purple. What arrived was a washed out mauve color with maybe a little beige undertones. So be wary of colors in pictures. It does appear well made and is very soft, but color is not what I was looking for and doesn\'t look good with my coloring.\",\"title\":\"Color is nothing like picture\"},{\"name\":\"Hac███gal███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"shirt is NOT long as pictured but rather short.  Nothing special about this item so keep looking for another purchase\",\"title\":\"save your money\"},{\"name\":\"Dina\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"this was not in the box , don\'t bother to sent it the quality of them is bad. please just refund card. i added a dress and sandals i ordered in blk still wrong, id like the dress refund, and the sandals exchanges for the black, thank you refund ALL exchange sandles w blk\",\"title\":\"not in order\"},{\"name\":\"julie\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Does NOT LOOK LIKE THE PCTURE! Material very cheap. Runs 2 sizes to big. I will keep and wear as a sleep shirt. NOT wearing it out of the house.\",\"title\":\"Made very cheaply.\"}]',NULL,19.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Tshirts for Women\",\"Tshirts for Women\"]'),(172,'Halloween Themed Clothing',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/TheLovely-Women-Plus-Sleeveless-Mock-TurtleNeck-Pleated-Top-with-Waistband_5bacad21-838f-4236-a4b5-13fa400e8974.4b75a5d2eb0dcc7b1a946f81793628d2.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\"]','[\"Americ