add a little salt to soak for 20 minutes to prevent the clothes from fading.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Tre███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great fit %26 keeps colors\",\"title\":\"Great gift\"},{\"name\":\"laura\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the different color of the pant cuff and top around the neck.  Super stretchy and cozy!\",\"title\":\"So happy I purchased these!\"},{\"name\":\"mary\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s a beautiful set of pj love the color\"},{\"name\":\"Bon███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought tgese for teen granddaughters. The style and colors are  just what they like, perfect. Very soft, quality fabric and packaged securely. Prompt delivery. Thank you!\",\"title\":\"ladie\'s pajamas\"},{\"name\":\"Ang███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love a great matching pj set, but these really surpassed my expectations. They give a Lake Pj vibe without the price tag. I am 5\'4” and 115lbs. The small is a little big, but it\'s the perfect fit for a cozy feel. They did not shrink when washed and dried.\",\"title\":\"Lake Pj Dupe\"},{\"name\":\"Deb\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I absolutely love these. The fit is perfect. The fabric is so smooth and soft next to my skin. The picture doesn\'t do them justice. The set is really pretty. I like them so much that I wear them all day if I\'m home.\"},{\"name\":\"Ash███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these pjs, I\'m going to use them to sublimate on and make into Halloween pjs for a party! They\'re super comfortable and flattering. My booty looks good!\",\"title\":\"Super soft and comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Lynda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"lovely colors and textures. I wanted long sleeves and comfortable materials and these provided both.  material is not too heavy for when temperatures are warmer.\"},{\"name\":\"Bon███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought a set each for twin granddaughters and they love them! So soft and comfortable, and the trim at the neck and ankles is very attractive and seemless. Definitely a win purchase.\",\"title\":\"ladie\'s pajama set\"},{\"name\":\"SLO███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The size and style were fine, but the fiber content is advertised as 95% Rayon, 5% Spandex.  However, the fabric is obviously polyester and is very uncomfortable to sleep in.  Who wants to sleep in plastic?  Why can\'t they just be honest and save me the bother of returning?\",\"title\":\"Deceptive product\"}]',NULL,33.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Pajamas & Loungewear\",\"Womens Pajama Sets\"]'),(241,'Lipstick','[\"Reviewers highlighted: shade, carry, for the morning\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Revlon-ColorStay-Overtime-Longwearing-Gloss-Lipstick-with-Vitamin-E-270-Relentless-Raisin-0-07-fl-oz_a6730305-c462-45ba-aba4-383162ba6f3c.99c45346f50c469d0eb884a786083ed9.jpeg\"',4.30,'[]','[\"All Night Fuchsia\",\"Bare Maximum\",\"Blush Hour\",\"Boundless Nude\",\"Cherry Time\",\"Constantly Coral\",\"Endless Spice\",\"Everlasting Rum\",\"Faithful Fawn\",\"For Keeps Pink\",\"Forever Pink\",\"Forever Scarlet\",\"Infinite Raspberry\",\"Keep Blushing\",\"Limitless Black Cherry\",\"Neverending Purple\",\"No Coffee Break\",\"Non-Stop Cherry\",\"Perennial Peach\",\"Purple\",\"Taupe Time\",\"Ultimate Wine\",\"Unending Red\",\"Unlimited Mulberry\",\"Unstoppable Nude\",\"24/7 Pink\",\"260 Perennial Plum\",\"270 Eternally Tan\",\"280 Stay Currant\",\"380 Always Sienna\"]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Working from the center of your lips outward, swipe on the lip color and take a moment for yourself as it dries. Color outside the lines? (Don\'t we all, sometimesÃ¢ÂÂ¦.) Just grab some makeup remover and a cotton swab and neaten up the job. Now add the gloss for major moisture! Brush on the lip gloss and reapply throughout the day when you feel like you need to really shine\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Vicki\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Perfect and stays on all day. I have used it for years. I always get asked what I wear. I love this product.\",\"title\":\"Perfect and stays on all day.\"},{\"name\":\"FRE███KI\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Got this for my cousin, and this was her comment\\\" A long lasting lip color is desired by every beautiful lady. When you need a perfect lip that stays moisturized, please look no further. Revlon Colorstay Overtime Lipcolor/ Rouge has given me the best lip color that I ever desired. The purple brand added a perfect blend with the clear lip gloss for use for a whole 24 hours. I love to add this to my special collection. I am also in the market to purchase other colors from Revlon. You can never get tired of acquiring many of these colors in your make up kit. It is also easy to package for traveling. Its pencil-like shape makes it a space saver\\\".\",\"title\":\"16 hour, it\'s!\"},{\"name\":\"Mouse\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Some mature women might have been hesitant to choose this vibrant color to test (Revlon Colorstay Overtime Lipcolor, 520 Neverending Purple, 0.07 oz), but I just LOVE purple and know older ladies can use bright, bright pinks and corals to great effect, so I thought, \\\"Why not purple, too?\\\" and I\'m glad I did!\\r\\n\\r\\nI don\'t care that I\'ve been wearing makeup for decades now. I never get tired of playing with it and I feel it gives me a pulled-together look and a look that says I care about my appearance. In fact, I was able to be a receptionist for a billion-dollar company even in my late fifties. The makeup helped me look \\\"polished.\\\"\\r\\n\\r\\nI think a mistake women make is to be scared to use bright colors if they are older, if their skin isn\'t \\\"perfect,\\\" and if they feel their features aren\'t \\\"perfect.\\\" Hogwash! Brights look GOOD on ANYONE, it turns out! Not only do the COLORS look good, the CONFIDENCE shown is appealing, too! I no longer ask myself, \\\"Oh, what will people think?\\\" when choosing makeup and clothes. I ask myself, \\\"Do YOU like this?\\\" instead! Life\'s too short, people!\\r\\n\\r\\nWell, I\'m talking a big talk, but I did apply the color lightly, just a dot on each side of the bow of the lip, then spread it out with my pinkie to corners for the top (put a dot, pull to side, put the other dot, pull to side), and a bigger dot on the bottom lip and pulled to each side with the pinkie. It gave a wonderful pop of color without emphasizing the lines around my lips. If you are young or don\'t have the lines yet, use the precise foam brush to fill in the lip with color, instead of spreading a small amount out with your pinkie. On my daughter-in-law, the solid, intense color looks fantastic. \\r\\n\\r\\nWhen applied lightly, this color is a vibrant pink with purple tone. When applied solidly, it looks more purple, but not a blue-based purple. It\'s a red-based, meaning it is more in the pink family.\\r\\n\\r\\nThe name is truthful: Color-STAY. Yes, it stays and stays. I don\'t even retouch during the day.\\r\\n\\r\\nHave you seen Lipsense\'s Violet Reign? This reminds me of it, color-wise. Lipsense is all the rage, but I don\'t like it. I like, frankly, the Revlon and the Maybelline long-lasting (and 24-hour) lip colors. The Revlon Colorstay I especially like: It doesn\'t dry my lips, it\'s reasonable in price, and it lasts longer on me. I can layer it and pull it with my pinkie and it covers beautifully. It isn\'t patchy when I do this. BIG positive.\\r\\n\\r\\nI don\'t use the gloss end of the lipstick (it comes with the foam tilted coloring-in brush on one end, and a pointed brush-like tip for the gloss on the other) because I like a matte lip with bright colors. For a pinky-brown lip, yes, I\'d use the gloss overlay. But for me, I like matte brights.\",\"title\":\"Purple for Mature Lips? YES!\"},{\"name\":\"Dia███dGo███ss\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Revlon is not kidding when it says Colorstay!!! This pretty medium purple orchid lipcolor with a glossy topcoat fixative stays on through eating and drinking, and I even tested it overnight on my hand. The shiny topcoat does wear off, but it takes awhile; and the color stays with minor wear closest to inside of lips where you eat and drink. Color is not very drying to lips, and glossy topcoat is SO shiny and plush feeling! This is a beautiful, tropical orchid purple; and the wand is a nice size for a small evening or cosmetic bag. I love not having to constantly retouch my lips all day. Put color evenly on dry lips first and let it dry, then slick on the yummy topcoat and you are ready to work all day or dance all night without worrying about your lipstick. No unsightly color transfer to wine glasses or clothing. This lipcolor really does work overtime!!!\",\"title\":\"Gorgeous Long Wear Purple Orchid Lipcolor!\"},{\"name\":\"Nie███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The shipping was super fast! the quality of the product was very good! I had to wait to buy my favorite shade for a long time. I ordered 2 of this kind of lipstick, but Walmart had only one for me. I will order again.\",\"title\":\"Mrs. Nien Ho is 78 years old.\"},{\"name\":\"nan███dre███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have always liked lip color applied with a brush; it seems to me that I have more control over how much I put on, how thick it is and if I get it exactly where I want it--lip sticks don\'t always go on just right so I blot off some of it. This is a lip color on one end of the wand, and a clear gloss at the other end--both applied with a brush. The color is applied to dry, bare lips, you wait while it dries, then the clear gloss goes over. I cannot guarantee that it lasts 16 hours because I haven\'t timed it, but it does last longer than a lot of lipsticks I\'ve used. It keeps my lips moist, slightly glossy looking, and I\'ve already decided to try some other colors. I have Neverending Purple at the moment; it looks a lot darker than it really is. I really like it, although purple/fuschia/lavender isn\'t always my first choice. It comes in a wide range of shades, pink, spice, coral, reds, tan, brown--dark and light shades. It may not last as long as a regular-sized tube of lipstick, but I honestly don\'t care. This is one product I\'ve tested that I definitely will continue to use and recommend.\",\"title\":\"I love this!\"},{\"name\":\"Mag███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Best lipstick out there! Stays on for hours!\",\"title\":\"Long lasting lipstick\"},{\"name\":\"NYMom\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I got the Neverending Purple color of the Revlon Colorstay Overtime lip gloss because I wanted to try a color I don\'t normally wear. It has little to no odor when I smell the wand straight out of the barrel. On my lips, it has no odor or taste. Based on the instructions you apply the lip color, wait until it dries, then apply the clear lip top coat. When it dries it seems to brighten in color and has a matte appearance. The gloss and moisture comes from the top coat. \\r\\nThe box says that it can last for 16 hours with no touch-ups needed. I applied mine early in the morning, and by 6pm after having eaten meals and snacks, drank water, talked, licked my lips here and there I found that it in fact DID stay on but not as strongly. It was a very bright purple upon first application. By the end of the day it was brought down to a slight dull purple. But, that was with no touch-ups. That is quite impressive. \\r\\nI suppose if I were at work and were to refresh it after lunch, it would continue being a vibrant lip color. By the way, by mid-day for me, it was still very bright and present so I didn\'t feel the need to refresh it. \\r\\nI could have re-applied the top coat to see if that would re-brighten the lip color that remained on my lips at the end of the day, but I was just still impressed that the color was still there and noticeable. Again, not as bright and rich, but still there. I am a dark-brown skinned woman, so if it was noticeable on me, I\'m sure it would be noticeable on someone of lighter skin and lip complexion.\",\"title\":\"It Actually Stays On All Day!\"},{\"name\":\"Lisa\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Funny thing about this, that shipped, so not from store: the packaging was from years ago, back when it was cardboard.  The product seems okay, so maybe? not sure why the packaging was ancient.\",\"title\":\"Love this, used it for years.\"},{\"name\":\"Cat███n\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"There is no lip product at all! the applicator is clean and dry\",\"title\":\"empty\"}]','Topcoat Ingredients: Hydrogenated Polydecene, Silica Silylate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower/Leaf Extract, Phytantriol, Squalane, Benzoic Acid. N00981  Basecoat Ingredients: Isododecane, Dimethicone, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Polyethylene, Disteardimonium Hectorite, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Methicone, Silica, Propylene Carbonate, BHT, Sorbic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, 1, 2-Hexanediol, MAY CONTAIN (+/-): [Mica, Bismuth Oxychloride (CI 77163), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Red 6 Lake (CI 15850), Red 27 Lake (CI 45410), Red 33 Lake (CI 17200), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140), Yellow 6 Lake (CI 15985), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, 77492, 77499), Carmine (CI 75470)] 22562',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Active Ingredient Name\",\"values\":\"Vitamin E\"},{\"type\":\"Active Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Vitamin E\"},{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Topcoat Ingredients: Hydrogenated Polydecene, Silica Silylate, Tocopheryl Acetate, Chamomilla Recutita (Matricaria) Flower/Leaf Extract, Phytantriol, Squalane, Benzoic Acid. N00981  Basecoat Ingredients: Isododecane, Dimethicone, Trimethylsiloxysilicate, Polyethylene, Disteardimonium Hectorite, C12-15 Alkyl Benzoate, Methicone, Silica, Propylene Carbonate, BHT, Sorbic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, 1, 2-Hexanediol, MAY CONTAIN (+/-): [Mica, Bismuth Oxychloride (CI 77163), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Red 7 Lake (CI 15850), Red 6 Lake (CI 15850), Red 27 Lake (CI 45410), Red 33 Lake (CI 17200), Yellow 5 Lake (CI 19140), Yellow 6 Lake (CI 15985), Blue 1 Lake (CI 42090), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, 77492, 77499), Carmine (CI 75470)] 22562\"}]','[\"Beauty\",\"Makeup\",\"Lip Makeup\",\"Lipstick\"]'),(242,'Plus Size Dresses','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Woman-Within-Women-s-Plus-Size-Thermal-Knit-A-Line-Dress-3X-Radiant-Purple_bbd9d949-525e-4387-a5b4-cea86fc642ab.1a2153168444b72b0c7a6378987c3931.jpeg\"',4.10,'[\"1X (22-24)\",\"2X (26-28)\",\"3X (30-32)\",\"4X (34-36)\",\"5X (38-40)\",\"M (14-16)\",\"L (18-20)\"]','[\"Black\",\"Deep Claret\",\"Emerald Green\",\"Medium Heather Grey\",\"Radiant Purple\",\"Raspberry\",\"Ultra Blue\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I LOVE these dresses,! I bought two. They are so easy to put on and wear! AND they have deep pockets! Yay! I get compliments on both but more compliments on the green. I love them! They do run large, so if I see them offered again, I will buy a couple more in a size smaller.\",\"title\":\"Deep pockets and so easy to wear!\"},{\"name\":\"Car███n S███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This was the third one of these dresses I purchased for my 95-y-o mother.  She likes them because they keep her warm and comfortable while still NOT looking like a lounger or robe.\",\"title\":\"Classy and comfortable.\"},{\"name\":\"mar███ S\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"the thermal knit a-line dress i ordered was great. it was purple in color which i love. the style is great and also the feel. it fits great and i love it.\",\"title\":\"thermal line a-line dress\"},{\"name\":\"Dor███K\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This thermal dress is perfect for the cold days and it can be dressed up for a night out or simply worn during the day not too hot inside and perfect when layered with a long sweater and cape or coat for outside. Comfortable!\",\"title\":\"My Perfect Winter Dressj\"},{\"name\":\"Dee███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fabric was nice not thin, but a nice weight.  It washed up great. The fit was perfect, not too tight, more toward the little loose side, I don\'t wear my clothes tight. I wore it to church on a cold Sunday morning and stayed nice and warm in it.\",\"title\":\"A very nice winter dress\"},{\"name\":\"Kar███S\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These dresses are a dream come true! Plus, so affordable for their quality. I hope you keep making dresses like these and for all seasons. I\'m going to spend the winter in the three that I bought.\",\"title\":\"Wonderful dresses!\"},{\"name\":\"Dia███ U\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I bought 2 of these dresses, one in green and one in purple. The green was sized and cut as expected. However, the purple one was over 2 inches shorter overall. The empire waist was 2 inches shorter and came way up on the bustline. The hemline was also 2+ inches shorter than the green. There are also numerous inside seam threads that are caught on the outside of the garments. I bought these for around the house wear, so I didn\'t send the purple one back. But because of lack of sizing consistency, and poor seam finishing I only gave these garments a 3 rating.\",\"title\":\"Dress has sizing and finishing issues\"},{\"name\":\"Lau███L\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I purchased this dress in green about a month ago and loved it.  The material was a good weight and held it\'s shape.  As soon as I took this dress out of the package I knew the material was thin and when I tried it on it was way big.  I compared it to my first dress and the neck line was not a crew neckline and droopy all over.  The waist was about 2\\\" bigger compared to the same dress I bought a month ago.  No quality control at all.  I was so disapointed.\",\"title\":\"Poor material and the size was way out of proportion to the exact same dress purchased a month ago.\"},{\"name\":\"Don███C\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Material was OK. length was good. the problem was the fit. It appeared to be an a line with a flowing type bottom in the picture. smaller around the waste. But it fit more mermaid style. it was too close to my body from my stomach down to my thighs, which made me appear larger.\",\"title\":\"Dress\"},{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This is awful.  It is supposed to be a flowy A-line dress.  Instead it is thermal clingy, lumpy pocket dress.  I\'m fat.  I bought this to flow over the problem areas it doesn\'t.  It manages to cling to everything and still be large?  I showed my husband since it was sooo bad and he was like what is it supposed to look like.  I showed him the picture and he laughed.   All around just an awful mess.\",\"title\":\"Magic dress but not in a postive way.\"}]',NULL,46.52,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Dresses\",\"Plus Size Dresses\"]'),(243,'Womens Swimsuit Tops','[\"Best seller\",\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Gubotare-Women-s-Bikini-Top-Bathing-Suit-V-Neck-Adjustable-Spaghetti-Straps-Twist-Front-Hot-Pink-M_b04af12e-8f53-40e0-9467-8c27184c78d8.bb30f1e633f6a77f1184695e829757cd.jpeg\"',3.30,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\"]','[\"AG\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Green\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Khaki\",\"Light Blue\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Donna\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Sam███ha\",\"rating\":4},{\"name\":\"pen███ent███\",\"rating\":1}]',NULL,9.27,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Swimsuits\",\"Womens Swimsuit Tops\",\"Womens Swimsuit Tops\"]'),(244,'Boys Sandals','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/HOBIBEAR-Boys-and-Girls-Classic-Graphic-Garden-Clogs-Slip-on-Water-Shoes-Toddler-Little-Kids-Big-Kids_b78428aa-475c-47f4-861d-e9c7ce87f8b7.7ecaf53a0b88aac06e7586768c260450.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"1.5 Little Kid\",\"2 Little Kid\",\"2.5 Little Kid\",\"4 Big  Kid\",\"4 Big Kid\",\"6 Toddler\",\"7 Toddler\",\"8 Toddler\",\"9 Toddler\",\"10-11 Little Kid\",\"11 Little Kid\",\"12 Little Kid\",\"13 Little Kid\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Gray\",\"Purple\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"dana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My son is very picky so spending $50 on name brand shoes was silly. I found these for $17 and I\'m so happy! He hasn\'t taken them off and loves the charms that came with the shoes. Overall, I\'m super happy with purchase. There\'s a definite difference in quality compared to name brand but for my messy, growing young son, these make perfect sense for us.\",\"title\":\"Affordable and cute!\"},{\"name\":\"Hey███ahH███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My toddler loves them. Seems pretty comparable to crocs in terms of feel and quality. Light weight, moderate grip, easy to put on and take off. We have Mario charms from crocs plus they came with their own charms. Would recommend for the value, esp at this age when they grow out of shoes so quickly\",\"title\":\"Pretty comparable to crocs\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ina███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These Crocs look good and my kids love them. got all three for just about the same price as one pair of regular crocs. also got the charms and they look very cute, good quality. very happy I found these instead of spending a bunch of money on the regular crocs brand which has become totally overpriced\",\"title\":\"great alternative to regular Crocs\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███le\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These clogs came nicely packaged so the shoes wouldn\'t get smashed during shipping. My son absolutely loves these shoes. He is 11 and we have a hard time finding inexpensive clogs that are not Crocs. These fit perfectly and he says they are more very comfortable. They came with a set of 4 cute charms to pop in the holes of your shoes. He wanted the dinosaur and dolphin and I put the rainbow and princess crown on my old clogs. I wish they made bigger sizes, but 4 is as large as they go. I would buy more in bigger sizes, if possible.\",\"title\":\"Comparable to Crocs, son loves them\"},{\"name\":\"KP\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My 3 yr old loves his “crocs” and they’re so easy and comfortable for him to put on himself. Love that they work well as water shoes\",\"title\":\"Great croc dupes\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ina███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"my kids like these they are on par with regular crocs but much more affordable\",\"title\":\"good quality good price\"},{\"name\":\"Olu███eun███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i love it and my son loves it too. beautiful and comfortable. Product material also looks durable\",\"title\":\"Worth it\"},{\"name\":\"Boy███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"If you’re looking for a good quality knock off of crocs, you’ve found them! This is my third pair I’ve bought for my boys and they are great! They seem to have a decent durability as far as wear and tear. Sizing is a little confusing, so I’d recommend sizing your child’s feet per instructions,\",\"title\":\"Perfect summer shoe for kids and toddlers\"},{\"name\":\"Gor███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The kids love them. I also bought a 100 count bag of pop-in decorations and they constantly swap them in and out.\",\"title\":\"Great Purchase!\"},{\"name\":\"Mad███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Only lasted one month before the back straps started to come off regularly. 2 months in they\'re completely gone. Still technically usable but do fall off occasionally.\",\"title\":\"Only lasted 2 months\"}]',NULL,49.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Kids Shoes\",\"Boys Shoes\",\"Boys Sandals\",\"Boys Sandals\"]'),(245,'Yellow Paint','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/ALL-IN-ONE-Paint-Naples-Sunny-Yellow-128-Fl-Oz-Gallon-Durable-cabinet-and-furniture-paint-Built-in-primer-and-top-coat-no-sanding-needed_79f7e41f-b5e2-44ee-8ed8-ec14cb0dbd23.5bbd32bf8705980ba0e618ae61e47981.png\"',4.50,'[\"1 Gallon (Pack of 1)\",\"8 Fl Oz (Pack of 1)\",\"32 Fl Oz (Pack of 1)\"]','[\"Abbey\",\"Almond\",\"Amalfi\",\"Bone\",\"Brick\",\"Capri\",\"Cashmere\",\"Cobblestone\",\"Colosseum\",\"Crete\",\"Envy\",\"French Toile\",\"Haven\",\"Heathered Gray\",\"Irish Garden\",\"Iron Gate\",\"Linen\",\"London\",\"Manor House\",\"Mediterranean\",\"Monarchy\",\"Naples\",\"Oxford\",\"Oyster\",\"Peony\",\"Polo\",\"Putty\",\"Saddle\",\"Saltwater\",\"Seadrift\",\"Simply Sage\",\"Spruce\",\"Stonehenge\",\"Stormy\",\"Sunrise\",\"Tapestry\",\"Thistle\",\"Trinity\",\"Truffle\",\"Warm Embers\",\"Weathervane\",\"Woodlands\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Ale███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Loved this product! It is so easy to use and honestly this one little can took me a long ways! I restored a bathroom vanity into a baby changing table.. no sanding or anything! It looks amazing.\\nI also had enough from this little can to paint my cabinets in the bathroom for extra storage and for it to match babies changing table. 100% will repurchase for future projects.\",\"title\":\"Love it!\"},{\"name\":\"pam███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Awesome paint\",\"title\":\"Excellent\"},{\"name\":\"love\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It did just what it stated it would , I love the out come. And will tell a friend I found a new paint product!\",\"title\":\"Just Beautiful\"},{\"name\":\"Susan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The finish you achieve is beautiful. It look like a professional sprayed my kitchen cabinets. If your cabinets are very dark it may need an extra coat.\",\"title\":\"Best paint ever!\"},{\"name\":\"fan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This paint works truly as advertised. No prep %26 the finish is beautiful!\",\"title\":\"great product!!\"},{\"name\":\"Susan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Goes on very easy and has a professional finish. Do take time to clean grease or grime of of kitchen cabinets before applying.  It\'s well worth the time.\",\"title\":\"Fabulous paint!\"},{\"name\":\"fan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This paint is amazing!!! No prep work required and the finish is beautiful!\",\"title\":\"great product\"},{\"name\":\"Tho███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Paint works well -- but they really skimped out on the packaging.  Thin cardboard with plastic paint can.  It was busted in shipping and seeped out onto my porch..  To do a return Wal-Mart requires you to mail back the product in its original packaging or return item to the store.. yeah.\",\"title\":\"Paints great - but busted open, left on porch\"},{\"name\":\"JRJR\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Not all that great for the price.  Doesn\'t live up to the hype.\",\"title\":\"Meh\"},{\"name\":\"WMT███5\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The color is very light and more blue than green.\",\"title\":\"Not green enough for me.\"}]',NULL,129.99,NULL,'[\"Home Improvement\",\"Paint\",\"Paint Colors\",\"Yellow Paint\"]'),(246,'Baby Boys Casual Outfit Sets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Wassery-Baby-Girls-Autumn-Clothes-3-6-9-12-18-24-Months-Infant-Plaid-Bear-Print-Long-Sleeve-Pullover-Sweatshirt-Elastic-Waist-Pants-Set-Newborn-Outfi_86704a7a-365d-4089-a660-cce5d057a0d2.4ce4cc423e907e3c15d00e7ee7906b5b.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"0-3 Months\",\"3-6 Months\",\"6-9 Months\",\"9-12 Months\",\"12-18 Months\",\"18-24 Months\"]','[\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Nev███ne\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,10.83,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Baby Clothes\",\"Baby Boys Clothing\",\"Baby Boys Outfit Sets\",\"Baby Boys Casual Outfit Sets\"]'),(247,'Shoelaces','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Dpityserensio-39-3In-Flat-Solid-Color-Shoe-Laces-10-Colours-Shoelaces-Football-Boots-Trainer-Shoes-Pink_0881d52a-b3b9-43bc-a931-c2d91f2eba9d.361ef150fe2a90e59c60e836a63b3c12.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"One Size\",\"39.3In/pair\"]','[\"Army Green\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Brown\",\"Coffee\",\"Deep Blue\",\"Gray\",\"Green\",\"Khaki\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Sky Blue\",\"White\",\"Yellow\",\"Orange\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jill\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"They were not dark purple they were burgundy.  was really disappointed , should have sent them back but its not worth it.\",\"title\":\"wrong color\"},{\"name\":\"Bill\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Believe it or not, I received only ONE shoelace. That did me no good whatsoever. I ordered this product again hoping to get the other shoelace. It also, took a long time to get it.\",\"title\":\"Don\'t order this\"},{\"name\":\"maria\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Ryan\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"mot███of2███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"dmp███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Mike\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"cat███ine███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Mic███le\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5}]',NULL,5.22,NULL,'[\"Household Essentials\",\"Shoe Care & Repair\",\"Shoelaces\"]'),(248,'Mens Cargo Pants','[\"Best seller\",\"Flash Deal\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/FEDTOSING-Relaxed-Work-Cargo-Pants-Outdoor-Mens-Pant-Gray-Size-38-36_1ca9e03d-50f4-4359-b9cc-157b1175ed19.eed628b7fc2b57b1bbb8f7f71029181b.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"28W*28L\",\"28W*30L\",\"30W*30L\",\"30W*32L\",\"32W*30L\",\"32W*32L\",\"34W*30L\",\"34W*32L\",\"34W*34L\",\"36W*30L\",\"36W*32L\",\"36W*34L\",\"36W*36L\",\"38W*30L\",\"38W*32L\",\"38W*34L\",\"38W*36L\",\"40W*30L\",\"40W*32L\",\"40W*34L\",\"42W*30L\",\"42W*32L\",\"44W*32L\"]','[\"Army Green\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Dark coffee\",\"Dark gray\",\"Gray\",\"Greyish green\",\"Khaki\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Navy blue\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"mark\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great pants!  Bought a pair, liked them so much bought another\"},{\"name\":\"KB\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Well fitting, true to size. Comfortable for a 12 hour shift. A nice deep dark Army green. Not olive drab, deeper green which is nice.\",\"title\":\"Nice deep dark Army green\"},{\"name\":\"KB\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nice fitting pants.  True to size. Comfortable for a 12 hour shift.\",\"title\":\"Nice fitting comfortable pants.\"},{\"name\":\"Leah\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am a laborer working in an environment that is very dirty. The climate is 10 degrees hotter than outside, in summer, and 10 degrees colder in winter. These pants are perfect for any season and extremely durable.\",\"title\":\"BEST workpants!\"},{\"name\":\"kathy\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"qbsolutely love these except for narrowed pant leg.  have ordered two of them  they fit my husband very well.\",\"title\":\"cool panrs\"},{\"name\":\"Janet\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Wait i didn\'t like was that they send the wrong size. The waist is 36 and the length is 34. So they changed the number. The waist is 34 and the length is 36. Although it doesn\'t work, I gave it to my nephew, maybe long but it can be fixed. Next time I\'ll buy 36 %26 36. It will be easier to fix.\",\"title\":\"You have great prices. And send it on time.\"},{\"name\":\"Molly\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"34 waist was very tight on his waist\",\"title\":\"Seemed to run small\"},{\"name\":\"Tex███vel███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I found the quality and manufacture of the pants to be excellent. But found that the pant seat is more suited for a person with \\\"more junk in the trunk\\\" for a proper fit. Even after a few washes it held up well. But was not suited for me with \\\"less padding\\\" in the rear. Gifted them to a friend.\",\"title\":\"Made for everyday action\"},{\"name\":\"Ver███ca\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Do not like how stiff the material was like canvas also it says to hang dry I did not realize that when I bought it it said not to use fabric softener I did anyway because the fabric was too stiff and scratchy and it came out fine slightly softer\",\"title\":\"Stiff like canvas,hang dry\"},{\"name\":\"Ryan\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Love the layout of the pockets fits fine, zippers are cheaply made, took it out of the package and the front zipper gets stuck already  and the teeth are bending\",\"title\":\"Poorly made\"}]',NULL,39.97,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Pants\",\"Mens Cargo Pants\"]'),(249,'Men\'s Styling Products',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Suavecito-Texturizing-Powder-for-All-Hair-Types-Strong-Hold-Men-1-75-oz_3a769066-5688-4f01-b307-1e54f286a5a8.a202a14b0b93424c818805a2be1a2a62.jpeg\"',4.50,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Sprinkle a small amount of Texturizing Powder into your hand or directly onto dry hair. Work into hair with fingers and shape hair into desired style. Add more product as needed or to touch up throughout the day. You may also use a comb or brush for a more defined finish.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jac███.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have never used, seen, or heard of a texturizing powder. I have always used the Grooming Spray and waited until it dried and then tried to give my hair that textured look by running my fingers through it. It worked, but may hair stayed pretty flat for the most part. I love this stuff. It only takes a very small amount to do the job. The hold is perfect. It helps me texture my hair and gives it WAY more lift than my old process. It has a matte finish too, so it doesn\';t look like your hair is covered in product. It works better than I expected and I will recommend it to everyone.\",\"title\":\"I love this stuff. Who knew anything like this even exhisted?\"},{\"name\":\"Zac███y C███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Was curious how good this stuff is so I gave it a try. It\';s not my favorite product to use. Great hold but doesn\';t leave your hair looking shiny. A super natural look.\",\"title\":\"Favorite product yet!\"},{\"name\":\"Luc███W.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Got the product which is a good value and works and smells great. My package got returned to sender and they promptly sent it back once it got to their facility.\",\"title\":\"Solid product, even better service\"},{\"name\":\"Wal███tCu███mer███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It was a little pricey for the size but it is a quality product.\"},{\"name\":\"jon\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"so ive been looking for a no shine high hold product for years that works for me. this product has no shine, add good volume, great hold, and adds good texture and makes the hair look fuller\",\"title\":\"what i been looking for\"},{\"name\":\"Sha███n S███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently purchased the texturizing powder and another product and my powder came with the seal to the container broken. I sent an email in regards to this with no response\",\"title\":\"Opened container\"},{\"name\":\"Mat███.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Brings my hair from a zero to a hero. Pretty amazing product but it will dry you out after continuous use. Pair with occasional hot oil treatment imo.\",\"title\":\"Great stuff\"},{\"name\":\"Eth███O.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This stuff is fantastic - I use it to give my hair some volume before locking it in with gel and it stays all day, no problem! It doesn\';t dry out or crisp up my hair either, it still feels perfectly natural\",\"title\":\"Works amazingly!\"},{\"name\":\"Eri███.\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Great stuff!! Another great product from Suavacito. Was excited when this came out, as I had just started recently using this for my new hairstyle. Only reason for 4 stars is the price. Pricing seems a little high for this. But, I\';m also comparing to another to only 1 other brand I\';ve purchased @ $10. Otherwise, I love this stuff and will definitely be an addition to my hair products.\",\"title\":\"Another Great Product @ $$$\"},{\"name\":\"Tim███y F███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I\'m only giving 3 stars because I love Suavacito so much. This product was not for me. I\'m mid 40s and felt this product made my hair look more grey than it is. Think of those powder wigs that the Fore fathers wore. Maybe it\'s just not for me? I love every other product I\'ve bought (pomade, cream, shampoo, shirts etc)\",\"title\":\"I\'m only giving 3 stars\"}]','Zea Mays (Corn) Starch, Bentonite/CI 77004, Silica Silylate, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, Tapioca Starch, Polysilicone-1 Crosspolymer, Silica, Pullulan, Fragrance (Parfum), Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Benzoate, Benzyl Salicylate, Citral, Limonene, Linalool',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Zea Mays (Corn) Starch, Bentonite/CI 77004, Silica Silylate, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, Tapioca Starch, Polysilicone-1 Crosspolymer, Silica, Pullulan, Fragrance (Parfum), Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Benzoate, Benzyl Salicylate, Citral, Limonene, Linalool\"}]','[\"Personal Care\",\"Men\'s Essentials\",\"Men\'s Styling Products\"]'),(250,'Womens Workwear Blouses',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Zenana-Women-Plus-Relaxed-Fit-Long-Sleeve-Round-Neck-Hem-Jersey-Tee-Shirt-Top_e8e29e55-0003-4598-bdb0-79e8041ba061.639cc0808a1d9fc0a609b27478039ba2.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\"]','[\"AMERICANO\",\"ARMY GREEN\",\"ASH BLUE\",\"ASH GREY\",\"ASH MINT\",\"ASH MOCHA\",\"ASH MUSTARD\",\"ASH ROSE\",\"Black\",\"BLUE GREY\",\"BLUE MINT\",\"BONE\",\"BRIGHT BLUE\",\"Brown\",\"CAMEL\",\"CEMENT\",\"CHARCOAL\",\"COFFEE\",\"COPPER\",\"COPPER RED\",\"CREAM\",\"DEEP CAMEL\",\"DEEP CORAL\",\"DESERT ROSE\",\"DK BURGUNDY\",\"DK OLIVE\",\"DK Olive\",\"DK PLUM\",\"DK PURPLE\",\"DK RED\",\"DK RUST\",\"DUSTY BLUSH\",\"DUSTY TEAL\",\"EGG SHELL\",\"EGGPLANT\",\"FUCHSIA\",\"GOLDEN MUSTARD\",\"GREY MIST\",\"HOT PINK\",\"HUNTER GREEN\",\"IVORY\",\"KHAKI\",\"LILAC GREY\",\"LT BROWN\",\"LT GREEN\",\"LT MUSTARD\",\"LT NAVY\",\"LT OLIVE\",\"LT ROSE\",\"MAGENTA\",\"MIDNIGHT NAVY\",\"MINT\",\"MOCHA\",\"NAVY\",\"Off-White\",\"ROSE\",\"RUBY\",\"SAND BEIGE\",\"SAPPHIRE\",\"TEAL\",\"TITANIUM\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"war███rze███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Zenana great comfy tops! I have many colorful tops made by them and love them. I\",\"title\":\"Comfy toos\"},{\"name\":\"Wal███tSh███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love it!!!  I wear it to work with an athletic wear shirt underneath, for work, with my jeans.   So awesome. Big and Flowy, it doesnt show my big fat belly.  Bought it for pregnancy.\",\"title\":\"Awesome Shirt to hide Belly Pudge\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Material is very nice.  Fits true to size. Not clingy.  I\'m 5\'2 with a fuller busy and I\'m wearing this over my leggings!\",\"title\":\"Love Love Love!\"},{\"name\":\"Ruby\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love this item.  I wear it over my leggings.  It is long enough to cover my hips.  Love the material.  It has pockets.\",\"title\":\"Comfortable exercise wear\"},{\"name\":\"Dim███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Good quality and great fit\",\"title\":\"Nice!\"},{\"name\":\"gwen\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I liked the style and all of the shirt.  However , if you check my order, you will see that I ordered size 1x. what I received was a size 3x. this I cannot wear. If you could, will you honor my order and send me the correct size without additional charges?   Thank-you.\",\"title\":\"Honest and hope for a response.\"},{\"name\":\"Siz███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Cute and comfortable!  Love the pockets!!\",\"title\":\"Cute\"},{\"name\":\"LACW\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Like the length.  Perfect for leggings.  Cheap material.  Does not wash well.\",\"title\":\"Cheap material.\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ine███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Chr███ine███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,18.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Workwear\",\"Womens Workwear Blouses\"]'),(251,'Womens Plus Skirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Roaman-s-Women-s-Plus-Size-Invisible-Stretch-All-Day-Cargo-Skirt-26-W-Medium-Stonewash_9f91a1c2-90b1-4328-b51a-59e230714617.f7823d1b3ca5d8f7a02ae526e43fcb33.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"14W\",\"16W\",\"18W\",\"20W\",\"22W\",\"24W\",\"26W\",\"28W\",\"30W\",\"32W\",\"34W\",\"12W\",\"36 W\",\"38 W\",\"40 W\",\"42 W\",\"44 W\"]','[\"Black Denim\",\"Indigo Wash\",\"Light Stonewash\",\"Medium Stonewash\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Gra███G\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Had for awhile I like it\",\"title\":\"Old but still look new\"},{\"name\":\"Lee███ B\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the material and the color of the skirt. Pockets on the skirt are very convenient also ??\",\"title\":\"Cargo Skirt\"},{\"name\":\"JUD███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am short and the regular length on me is a maxi length. All the way to my feet. Have to wear with heels.\",\"title\":\"Great skirt. Very long.\"},{\"name\":\"PAT███IA ███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is my favorite skirt.  I have 4. They wear well. They are not easy to wrinkle. The first two did not have watch pockets. The latest ones do. I do not like the way the flaps on the cargo pockets turn up once to have washed them. Overall best skirts.\"},{\"name\":\"Den███ C\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s a nice skirt. I didn\'t realize it was flarey  I like the slim looking ones. I haven\'t worn it yet. But it is a nice looking skirt.\"},{\"name\":\"SAN███M\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This skirt is a great length (I am 5\'9\\\") and looks good. Love the pockets!!!! It is a little close fitting, so those with a large rear know it will accentuate that. the stretch makes it move great though so close fit is nice IMHO\",\"title\":\"Great stretch, love the pockets\"},{\"name\":\"Pam███ H\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The denim is heavy, not lightweight, and is perfect for fall and winter.  It may be a bit heavy for the summer, but I have lighter denim skirts for that season.  I am apple-shaped with heavy thighs and this skirt gives perfect coverage. This will last.  It washes well in cold water and dries with no shrinkage.  Remove it from the dryer and hang it up, perhaps you need to iron the hem which always curls? This is my go-to for casual occasions and day-to-day wear.\",\"title\":\"Heavy weight, sturdy and pretty\"},{\"name\":\"Sta███ne ███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The skirt was made well. Loved the length, very modest. Waist was great with elastic band . Very comfortable.\",\"title\":\"Cargo skirt\"},{\"name\":\"NAN███B\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Comfortable and good looking\",\"title\":\"Good looking\"},{\"name\":\"Dot███ S\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Not a bad looking skirt, but the patch pocket flaps are too thick don\'t lay well at all.   Once washed it might be better, if not I will probably just tack the flaps down.    Would be much better without the pockets and flaps.\",\"title\":\"Not a bad looking skirt, but the pocket flaps are poorly done.\"}]',NULL,50.19,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Womens Plus Skirts\"]'),(252,'Mens Work Uniforms','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Chef-Code-Combo-Pack-Cool-Breeze-Cook-Shirt-and-Elastic-Waist-Chef-Pants-Red-Black-XS_7b3b059c-01a1-4303-a0bc-c9a19f661170_1.e1e73be8e55218afd32b86538458b5ff.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\"]','[\"Black/Black\",\"Khaki/Black\",\"Red/Black\",\"Royal/Black\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"val\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,32.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Work Clothing\",\"Mens Work Uniforms\"]'),(253,'Ice Cream Bars','[\"Rollback\",\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Little-Debbie-Nutty-Bars-Ice-Cream-Bars-12-fl-oz-4-Count_3df62825-d210-4361-af23-970a00157677.5ad18ab5e534b930e9f9b47f798bb943.png\"',3.70,'[]','[]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"lur███24\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This ice cream is going to be my go-to for summer. They are so good and the perfect size. My whole family loves them.  It\'s so hard not to eat the whole box at one time.\",\"title\":\"New favorite summer treat\"},{\"name\":\"Joan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these! They definitely don\'t deserve the negative reviews. The peanut butter taste isn\'t too overpowering, it\'s a great blend of ice creaminess and peanut butter.\",\"title\":\"Cheap and tasty!\"},{\"name\":\"Lia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Nutty Bar Taste Wit Vanilla Ice Cream Has Me Hooked! These Bars Are O Soooo Yummy!\",\"title\":\"Satisfied Customer!\"},{\"name\":\"chr███yd2███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I enjoyed these. I wish they had more of a peanut butter taste. But overall, it tasted great. It had great packaging to prevent breaking the cone. I like the individual wrappers.\",\"title\":\"Yummy\"},{\"name\":\"cri███t\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The only flavor I could find were these Little Debbie frozen bars. They taste just like peanuts in chocolate with vanilla inside. They are very good and the least expensive of the gourmet novelty ice cream bars. I\'d definitely get these again!\",\"title\":\"Inexpensive treat!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These nutty bar ice creams bars from Hudsonville are delicious. They take you back to those years when you were a little kid eating nutty bars. ￼ The portion size is just right for a quick and easy snack on the go.\",\"title\":\"Just like the snack cakes\"},{\"name\":\"kra███jac███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Ok so for this one the coupon gave me the nutty bars flavor which taste just like the nutty butty snack they did perfect ice cream bars cane with ,4 and it taste delicious the texture was good and the ingredients not natural but tasty they were cheap as well\",\"title\":\"Nutty bars\"},{\"name\":\"emi███345███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Loved these Nutty Bar ice creams, they were delicious!! They came with 4 in a box, which was perfect for my little family. Would definitely buy these again!!\",\"title\":\"These nutty bar ice creams were delicious!!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I\'m a peanut butter lover, so maybe I expected too much. There are other ice cream bars out there much like this one. My store only had this one to choose from, the Nutty Bar. I grabbed that one and tried one tonight. It was a nice treat for the night, but I really wanted more peanut butter. I won\'t be getting it again. I don\'t eat a lot of ice cream, I love it too much and would probably be huge if I constantly ate it. So when I do get some ice cream for myself, I get something I love. If I\'m going to splurge, it better be good. And unfortunately, this was just a bit boring.\",\"title\":\"Not bad, but nothing special\"},{\"name\":\"end███a\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This is an okay ice cream bar, I was excited for the peanut butter in it, but unfortunately it was pretty bland, tasted like plain vanilla. There was little peanut butter and the chocolate was thin.\",\"title\":\"Ok...but not great\"}]','MILK, SUGAR, CREAM, COCONUT OIL, ROASTED PEANUTS, CORN SYRUP, SKIM MILK, WATER, CRISP QUINOA, COCOA POWDER, PEANUT OIL, PALM OIL, ENRICHED FLOUR (WHEAT FLOUR, NIACIN, REDUCED IRON, THIAMIN MONONITRATE, RIBOFLAVIN, FOLIC ACID), CHOCOLATE, SOYBEAN OIL, RICE SYRUP, NATURAL FLAVOR, SOY LECITHIN, MONO & DIGLYCERIDES, SALT, GUAR GUM, CALCIUM SULFATE, CELLULOSE GUM, CORN STARCH, FRUIT JUICE (COLOR), FD&C YELLOW #5 LAKE, ANNATTO (COLOR), CARRAGEENAN.',4.48,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"MILK, SUGAR, CREAM, COCONUT OIL, ROASTED PEANUTS, CORN SYRUP, SKIM MILK, WATER, CRISP QUINOA, COCOA POWDER, PEANUT OIL, PALM OIL, ENRICHED FLOUR (WHEAT FLOUR, NIACIN, REDUCED IRON, THIAMIN MONONITRATE, RIBOFLAVIN, FOLIC ACID), CHOCOLATE, SOYBEAN OIL, RICE SYRUP, NATURAL FLAVOR, SOY LECITHIN, MONO & DIGLYCERIDES, SALT, GUAR GUM, CALCIUM SULFATE, CELLULOSE GUM, CORN STARCH, FRUIT JUICE (COLOR), FD&C YELLOW #5 LAKE, ANNATTO (COLOR), CARRAGEENAN.\"}]','[\"Food\",\"Frozen Foods\",\"Ice Cream & Novelties\",\"Ice Cream Bars\"]'),(254,'Womens Blouses',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Made-by-Johnny-Women-s-Short-Sleeve-All-Over-Tie-Dye-Tunic-Top-L-BROWN_339aaf67-16df-4949-b436-5442393d9acd.275413e9c2d0e844e0bd0be88703e622.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"XXXL\"]','[\"AQUA\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Brown\",\"Gray\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"WT638-AQUA\",\"WT638-BLACK\",\"WT638-BROWN\",\"WT638-DARK_PURPLE\",\"WT638-DENIM\",\"WT638-HDG\",\"WT638-HEATHER_GREY\",\"WT638-JADE\",\"WT638-LILAC\",\"WT638-MINT\",\"WT638-MUSTARD\",\"WT638-NAVY\",\"WT638-OLIVE\",\"WT638-PINK\",\"WT638-RED\",\"WT638-ROYAL_BRITE\",\"WT638-RUST\",\"WT638-TAUPE\",\"WT638-TEAL\",\"WT638-WHITE\",\"WT638-WINE\",\"WT1063-AQUA\",\"WT1063-BLACK\",\"WT1063-BROWN\",\"WT1063-CORAL\",\"WT1063-NAVY\",\"WT1063-OLIVE\",\"WT1063-PURPLE\",\"WT1063-TEAL\",\"WT1063-WHITE_BLACK\",\"WT1063-WHITE_NAVY\",\"WT1063-WINE\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash cold with like colors. Do not bleach. Hang dry or tumble dry low. Iron on low heat if needed. Do not dry clean.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mic███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It looks, feels and fits very good.  This dress looked just like the picture.  I got pants to match.\"},{\"name\":\"Katie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have about 10 of theses tie dyef tops, I love them with leggins, I always buy a size larger for a looser fit\",\"title\":\"tunic top\"},{\"name\":\"Mare\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I haven\'t worn the top yet. The fit was perfect. The only thing is the material\\nwas a little thin but with a camisole under it I think it will be fine.\\nI do love the color lilac.\",\"title\":\"Tunic Top\"},{\"name\":\"Sio███i\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"LOVE this cute top! Fits perfect and great quality. Has an easy wash, but recommend line dry to keep it from shrinking. Would definitely recommend. This is my 2nd purchase of different colors and will buy again soon.\",\"title\":\"Excellent quality top - ✰ 5 star!!\"},{\"name\":\"Sarah\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The material was different another shirt I have, same style different color.  Wasn\'t sure if I would like it. \\nTried it on and I really liked it. \\nVery pleased! 😊\"},{\"name\":\"Julia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love this tonic!\\nIm 5 foot 7 and it covers  everything so that I can wear it with leggings.\\nIm a size 1X, and the  XXL fits nicely.\\nVery light weight fabric, and very flattering.\",\"title\":\"Flattering\"},{\"name\":\"tanya\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i got this shirt in a 3xl, im 5\'2 and a bbw, so i like my shirts long, loose and soft and this shirt met all the requirements! And affordable too! Less than $20 for a nice shirt is always a great find!\",\"title\":\"comfortable plus size shirt\"},{\"name\":\"Katie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have many of these tie dye tops. True to size. perfect for leggings\",\"title\":\"Great top\"},{\"name\":\"tanya\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"affordable, cute, comfortable, great material, i cant say enough good things about this shirt! i have bought many from this manufacturer and never been disappointed! this jade blue color is definitely one of my favorite colors!\"},{\"name\":\"Taw███ha\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The shirt is nice but it\'s a bit see through so be mindful of the color of the bra you wear with it or wear an under shirt. But it\'s very comfortable and flowy.\",\"title\":\"Nice shirt\"}]',NULL,18.75,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Blouses\",\"Womens Blouses\"]'),(255,'Womens Pants','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Uvplove-Women-s-Pocket-Wide-Leg-Trousers-Lightweight-Pants-High-Waist-Button-Loose-Trouser-Work-Casual-Business-Pants-US-Size-XX-Large-in-Black_c0389ba2-8fb6-458c-9b09-a1b26d58b803.f8aa3e0eba4c0cbeb722ac71db9a4e3a.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\"]','[\"Apricot\",\"Black\",\"Coffee\",\"Dark Green\",\"Gray\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Wine Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Tonya\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Comfortable waistband, pants flow nicely and flattering.\",\"title\":\"Pleasent Surprise\"},{\"name\":\"Rok███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I ordered the small one which fitted me well. I am 61 inches tall and 50 kg in weight. The fabric is very soft to feel and comfortable to wear. The color on the web is pretty same as the website description. The lower part is wide and looks very stylish.\",\"title\":\"Very stylish and soft to wear\"},{\"name\":\"Ali███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these and will be ordering more colors.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful and comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Karen\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I like the light and flowing fabric.  These are well made and look very nice.  The length is great as well.  I\'m over 5.\'7\\\" and the length is perfect for me.\",\"title\":\"Great look.\"},{\"name\":\"Jen\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I saw these on an influencer\'s page and they were cute so I thought I would give them a try. The price was too good so I ordered 3 pairs. I am usually a Large but I sized up to an XL because I like my pants really flowy. They fit perfectly!! I\'m 5\'5\\\" and the length is perfectly for me. I have cankles so I don\'t like my pants cropped as it accentuates the thickness of my anklesm thes are long enough to be cute with heels but short enough to wear with sandals. I am so happy! I will be ordering more colors!\",\"title\":\"Fantastic buy!!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are lightweight and drape beautifully. If you are a little thick in the middle I recommend that you go up 1 size. They look expensive and feel comfortable. Perfect to dress up or down.\",\"title\":\"Comfortable and stylish\"},{\"name\":\"Shr███ha\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fabric is very soft and feels good to hands. Feels like I am wearing a very light pant. Needless to say that this is comfortable  for me.\",\"title\":\"Wonderful fabric\"},{\"name\":\"LL\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I loved the fabric and the fit! The color is a perfect match for the jacket I purchased but the pants are too short! I considered ordering another pair just to add length. However, that would also make them double the cost! Not sure what I will do!\",\"title\":\"Nice color and Fabric\"},{\"name\":\"Cin███ee\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Fabric nice for warmer days. Mostly bought for work, They are actually too short for me. I\'m 5\'5.  But still can wear.. Waist does go in good, for me but not good for tucking big shirts or if someone has larger waist.. I recommend if looking for this type of thinner pant! :)\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███n\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I am not quite where I want to be weight wise and I was hoping these would look flowy and hide my extra in the middle (belly and hips). They do not. The material is stretchy and flowy, so I didn\'t feel uncomfortable in them, but looks wise,  I felt I looked bigger. Maybe the black would be better? I dont know... but ill  be returning them.\",\"title\":\"No disguising extra pounds in this\"}]',NULL,35.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Pants\",\"Womens Pants\"]'),(256,'Womens Sweatshirts & Hoodies','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fantaslook-Fall-Sweatshirts-for-Women-Crewneck-Puff-Sleeve-Tops-Fashion-Shirts_4b1f95b8-46be-4f5c-8739-d9df955ea64f.85ecaa982d7eb9cf93629c2d750afdca.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Caramel\",\"Green\",\"Khaki\",\"Pink\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash or hand wash /Line Dry /Do Not Bleach\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this top so much I\'ve bought it in two colors. It\'s a great weight, not too light, but not too heavy, either. Perfect for fall. I can\'t wait to wear it with jeans and my knee high boots! It looks just like the pictures in the ad. It doesn\'t shrink %26 it runs true to size. For reference, I wear a 34C bra and I weigh 120 pounds. The small fits me perfectly. I will be tucking it in, at least to the front of my jeans, but it can be worn a little longer, although it does not cover your butt.\",\"title\":\"I love this top!\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really love this top. It is long enough to almost cover my butt %26 very soft. It literally looks just like the picture . I bought a size medium because the comments were recommending to size up one size. I could\'ve gotten away with a small, but I\'m OK with the medium. For reference, I am 5\',5” tall, 120 pounds %26 I wear a 34C in bra size. I hope this helps!\",\"title\":\"Beautiful fall time top. Love the sleeve detail!\"},{\"name\":\"Vista\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very comfortable. Fit perfectly, true to size. Recommend!\"},{\"name\":\"B\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fits right and is very nice!\",\"title\":\"Puff sleeve sweater\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Ordering from you was so easy.\",\"title\":\"Love it all.\"},{\"name\":\"Kay\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So pretty and great quality and so soft.\",\"title\":\"Kay\"},{\"name\":\"LKG\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Great top, not too tight, thick fabric. Unfortunately I ordered it as the weather turned very warm.\",\"title\":\"Great Top\"},{\"name\":\"Young\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Not very pretty like the photo\",\"title\":\"Too big\"},{\"name\":\"Den███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"1980\'s padded shoulder look. Didn\'t like it at all\"},{\"name\":\"Cher\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This sweater was true to size yet not flattering at all.  I did return it.\",\"title\":\"Very boxy, not at all flattering\"}]',NULL,69.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Sweatshirts & Hoodies\",\"Womens Sweatshirts & Hoodies\"]'),(257,'Mens Oxfords Shoes','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/New-York-Company-Men-s-Logan-Loafer_ee5d9e86-aafc-4258-8abb-fcd3f9124b9d.e40999aa928daaa928a8e715655abf04.jpeg\"',1.00,'[\"7.5\",\"8\",\"8.5\",\"9\",\"9.5\",\"10\",\"10.5\",\"11\",\"12\",\"13\"]','[\"Black\",\"Brown\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"New Spot Clean Only\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Sue\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These are not even the same shoes they sent us. Instead Walmart sent us these old looking penny loafers which were brown.\",\"title\":\"Meh\"}]',NULL,34.50,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Mens Shoes\",\"Mens Oxfords Shoes\"]'),(258,'Womens White Dresses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/GUESS-Womens-White-Lace-Zippered-Flounce-hem-Lined-Spaghetti-Strap-Sweetheart-Neckline-Knee-Length-Sheath-Dress-4_667cffbd-58e2-47a2-a3fc-d2e595201b38.f3479c61f25072feb7963c69f6f2c5f4.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"4\",\"6\",\"8\",\"10\",\"12\",\"14\"]','[\"Cobalt\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Pink\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"JM88\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful dress, fabric is detailed in person and feels expensive. I would recommend to size up because there is zero stretch. I\'m usually a size 4 and the 6 fit without any extra give.\",\"title\":\"Better than picture! Size up.\"}]',NULL,37.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"White Dresses\",\"Womens White Dresses\"]'),(259,'Boys Pajama Sets','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Wonder-Nation-Toddler-Short-Sleeve-Long-Pants-Snug-Fit-Cotton-Pajama-Set-2-Piece-Sizes-12M-5T_6e77510a-a0c1-44ef-8f56-0d1411b3b489.e66641c3492e047e879473ca7946424f.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"12 Months\",\"18 Months\",\"2T\",\"3T\",\"4T\",\"5T\"]','[\"Blue Cove\",\"Delicate Ivory Dinosaur\",\"Delicate Ivory Donut\",\"Lilac Bud\",\"Pink Sky\",\"Teal Sea\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ilo███otr███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is a two piece infant toddler pajama set size 12 months very pretty material colorful hearts everywhere the material is soft. It\'s 100% cotton and for the child safety, the garment Should fit snug. It is a very pretty pajama set.\",\"title\":\"Pretty pajamas\"},{\"name\":\"Art███75\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This sleep set for kids by Wonder Nation has two pieces: pants and a longsleeve top. This pajama is made of 100% cotton, unlike many others on the market, which are made of polyester. The material is soft, stretchy, and breathable. It is perfect for kids\' skin.\\nThe colorful heart pattern looks cute and nice.\\nThe pajama is true to size and fits perfectly to my 5 years old daughter. \\nI am satisfied with the quality of the sewing and would recommend this product for others.\",\"title\":\"Soft and breathable pajama\"},{\"name\":\"Hea███rB\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The cutest little jammies. The fabric is soft and cozy. I washed and dried these with no shrinkage they fit my 4 year old son perfect with room to grow (4T). The print is colorful and vibrant! The pants were easy for him to remove to use the bathroom at night and re dress himself.\",\"title\":\"A cozy pj set\"},{\"name\":\"Beh███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently picked up the Wonder Nation Baby and Toddler Girls\' pajama set in Pink Sky, size 4T, for my little one, and they\'re a hit! The 100% cotton material is so soft and breathable, perfect for her sensitive skin. I love that it\'s machine washable, making my life a lot easier when it comes to laundry day.\\n\\nThe design is adorable with its allover print, and the pink sky color is just so cute and vibrant, even after several washes. The top and pants fit her snugly, which is great for safety since these aren\'t flame retardant, as the label rightly notes. The elastic waistband on the pants ensures comfort, especially important for a restless sleeper like mine!\\n\\nOne slight downside is the snug fit means she might outgrow them a bit quicker than other pajamas. But given the quality and comfort, I think they\'re well worth it.\\n\\nOverall, I\'m really pleased with this set. These pajamas are comfortable, safe, and as charming as can be – a perfect bedtime ensemble for little ones. Solid 5 stars!\",\"title\":\"Snug and Soft\"},{\"name\":\"Ano███ous███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This little pajama set is extremely cute! It fits my little niece perfectly and she seems so comfortable in them. The fabric is soft and the little pink and colored hearts design is incredibly cute and attractive. The pajamas are sewn well, durable and will hold up to several washes. Would definitely recommend!\",\"title\":\"Cute little pajama set!\"},{\"name\":\"Lov███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Omg I love this. Perfect arrival timing. I ripped it out the pack. He was excited. He loves new clothes. Fit him perfectly fitted but not smothered. The design is cute . It is blue. It is easy to wash. You can even use it under his clothes as an extra layer\",\"title\":\"Perfect Fitted pj\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This 2-piece tight fit jammie set comes with pants and a short sleeve shirt. Very soft and comfy feeling material. My grandson loves sharks and this is so adorable on him. True to the size (5T) even after it was machine washed and dried, it didn\'t bleed, fade in color or shrink. Can be worn anytime of the year. Lots of styles, colors and patterns to choose from.\",\"title\":\"TRUE TO THE SIZE\"},{\"name\":\"Sho███r12███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Wonder Nation Baby and Toddler Girls Short Sleeve Cotton Tight Fit Top and Pants, 2-Piece, Sizes 12M-5T\\nis adorable. The material is cotton, which has a very soft feel. And so you don\'t have to worry about what materials your child is exposed to. This can be worn as a pajama set or long johns.\",\"title\":\"soft\"},{\"name\":\"Mom███win███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"My two-year-old looks absolutely adorable in this pajama set. He\'s now currently dressed and ready from head to toe for a bedtime. I like that it comes in the two-piece pajamas should come tops and bottom.\",\"title\":\"Pajamas\"},{\"name\":\"Dia███B\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"My only complaint about this product is the neck. I don\'t think my son has a large head for his age, but I could barely get the top on over his nose! I had to take it off and stretch the neck, but it was still a struggle to get it on. I own other Wonder Nation clothing, but they all have snaps around the neck to avoid this issue. The pants fit well, as did the rest of the top.\",\"title\":\"Fits good, neck could be wider\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Boys Clothing\",\"Boys Pajamas\",\"Boys Pajama Sets\"]'),(260,'Plus Size Tops','[\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SHOWMALL-Plus-Size-Tunic-for-Women-Cold-Shoulder-Top-Cream-Leopard-2X-Blouse-Short-Sleeve-Clothing-V-Neck-Shirts-Summer-Clothes_10ae3b05-7271-4d69-a122-8e5c355a04d8.72890e485fff3b596c9e25783012000b.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\",\"4X\",\"5X\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black Polka Dot\",\"Blue Gray\",\"Burgundy\",\"Cream Leopard\",\"Dark Green\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Olive\",\"Purple\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"To keep the well shape of this plus size top for women, machine wash with wash bag to retain the good shape of this plus size womens clothing, hang or line dry. DO NOT BLEACH.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Sou███egi███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have purchased these tops twice. They work for me. The one thing you might like to know is they tend to show wear in the midriff area on me that might be just my issue. Still I enjoy these tops. My first purchase was 3x I found that to be a bit roomy. My 2nd I went with 2x fits just right my weight is 264 lbs. if that helps.\",\"title\":\"Cute tops\"},{\"name\":\"Diana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this tunic it\'s soft and hangs well.  I am 5\'4 190lbs  and I got a 3x it\'s a little big but I like the way it fits   I could have gotten a 2x for a more fitted look. the reviews are what convinced me and I was sceptical because most clothes from China are small and cheap but this is not. I really love my tunic and will be ordering more colors\",\"title\":\"love it\"},{\"name\":\"AlbNM\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Looks nice and fits comfortably\",\"title\":\"I have several in all my favorite colors\"},{\"name\":\"Ang███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i really like the sleeves and the fabric of the shirt.\",\"title\":\"Cute Animal Print shirt\"},{\"name\":\"Str███err███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fabric super soft. It fit loosely but perfectly comfortable!\"},{\"name\":\"jes███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful short and very comfortable, light weight\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███l\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Runs very very large. Listen to the reviews. I didn\'t and I regret it. It\'s a different type of material but all together I guess it\'s worth the price. You get what you pay for. Wish it stayed slinky after washing.\",\"title\":\"Runs large peels when washed\"},{\"name\":\"Deb███h\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I think they run bigger so need to go down a size I got 2x. Need a 1x. Returns are a hassle for me so I\'m keeping it.\",\"title\":\"Bigger tops\"},{\"name\":\"Susan\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I always buy this showmall top. When you get a sale price they delay delivery and send a substitute. That\'s wrong. I then have to take it to the store to return two items I didn\'t even order!\",\"title\":\"don\'t buy on sale\"},{\"name\":\"kat\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Not true to size. Size up at least 2 sizes.\",\"title\":\"Runs small\"}]',NULL,29.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Tops\",\"Plus Size Tops\"]'),(261,'Underwire Bras',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Women-s-Vanity-Fair-75345-Beauty-Back-Full-Coverage-Underwire-Bra-Sheer-Quartz-Stripe-34D_9a981010-acbf-41c5-b596-0ee54efae8f7.f60fe5464bad01452ccf3a13a3737cc9.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"34D\",\"36B\",\"36C\",\"36DD\",\"38B\",\"38DD\",\"40C\"]','[\"Hinting Blue\",\"Honey Beige Lace\",\"Sheer Quartz Stripe\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"83% Nylon, 17% Spandex.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Alb███erq███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Finding a new bra is one of the most frustrating experiences!  I adore this bra and bought SEVERAL!\",\"title\":\"Finally!\"},{\"name\":\"Corky\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Provides full comfortable coverage. Love the side smoothing feature. Bought this model several years ago and kept it although I had put on some weight. Lost the extra size, found it in my drawer and was delighted to find that the same model number was still carried. It is a winner.\",\"title\":\"Best fitting bra I have owned\"},{\"name\":\"Ahnna\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I lost over 30 lbs. and had a lot of trouble finding a new bra that i liked.  This is it!!  Great fit, very comfortable, and keeps the girls right where I want them.  If the black ever comes back in stock I\'ll be getting that one too.  (I have the nude and the blue)\",\"title\":\"Great Fit!\"},{\"name\":\"Pic███mis███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the smoothness of this bra. No ridges, no lace with itchy edging. Lovely flat seams. I did snip off the little decorative metal buckle between the cups. The back minimizes bulges, even though it only has two hooks. So far I\'ve had no problems with the back riding up.  Very comfortable and it fits me perfectly.\",\"title\":\"Smooth and wonderful\"},{\"name\":\"Eho███ik\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This Bra is the Most Comfortable Bra, I love the wider band for Side Smoothing, Love the Fabric, Lightly Lined Cups, No Digging Under wire. Might be My New Favorite Bra!\",\"title\":\"Side Smoothing\"},{\"name\":\"Msd███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I received this to sample and post an honest review. I love this bra. I have always purchased cheap bras cause I assumed they were all the same. Oh how I was so wrong. I love this bra. My favorite now. And Vanity Fair will be my brand for bar\'s from now on.\",\"title\":\"Great Coverage\"},{\"name\":\"Jul███970███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These bras are so comfortable and smooth under your shirts. Love them!!!\",\"title\":\"Perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Kar███ich███e\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] If you do not have full round breasts this bra is not for you.  Felt like the wires were a bit low and could not adjust to fit my shape.  The fabric is 2 layered in cups and band and between the cups did not lay flat.  Would have to extra careful when washing to hold shape.  See photo of unwashed bra and note the cup puckering due to layers not being attached.\",\"title\":\"Generous cup size.\"},{\"name\":\"She███NDa███s\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This bra has almost everything I want...wide sides that help reduce \'fatty back\', easy front adjust shoulder straps that are elastic which prevents constant falling off my shoulders like other bras! The only addition I would wish for is a little heavier padding which would give me more of a \'girlie\' figure!!!\",\"title\":\"LUV this bra!\"},{\"name\":\"E M.\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have been wearing the same size, same style for years. Just received two new bras and they are at least 3 inches shorter. Do not even fit around me. I placed them side by side with ones I currently wear and even with “stretching,” there is no way the new ones are of the correct size. So disappointing as I have relied on VF for years.\",\"title\":\"So disappointing.\"}]',NULL,52.22,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Bras\",\"Underwire Bras\"]'),(262,'Womens Blouses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Asklazy-Women-s-Summer-Cold-Shoulder-Mesh-Panel-3-4-Bell-Sleeve-Adjustable-Spaghetti-Straps-Casual-Blouses-Tops-US-Size-Royal-Blue-XL_f7cd2bb5-b4b7-46da-9555-2ad20afbb6e9.7db07270c54a44ba1b48fc9a09c9a811.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black Dot\",\"Dark Green\",\"Floral White\",\"Flower Navy Blue\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Wine Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Both Machine Wash and Hand washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mar███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m 5\' 5” 119 lbs and small fit just perfect. The material is quality and well sewn. I purchased the black. The 3/4 sleeve totally makes the top and looks very dressy with light jeans.\",\"title\":\"Elegant %26 comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Kel███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love this print. Material is nice and light. I prefer to wear a tank top underneath it as it is a little sheer. Looks way cute with jeans or black pants.\",\"title\":\"Love this print. Material is nice a...\"},{\"name\":\"hea███r\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I probably should have gotten one size up because there\'s zero stretch capability with this shirt. I\'m usually a large but I couldn\'t get it to fit at the bottom because it doesn\'t slow and the stitching at the bottom doesn\'t stretch. I love the design though. I got a light color and it\'s not see through.\",\"title\":\"Nice shirt but get your correct size\"},{\"name\":\"Jer███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased this as a gift, and they absolutely love the shirt. It fits perfectly and is extremely comfortable. It seems to be of great quality and they would absolutely recommend this product. It has a really nice design as well.\",\"title\":\"I purchased this as a gift, and the...\"},{\"name\":\"Terri\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"It\'s not bad for the price. The white is more of an ecru/ivory than a white. The material is soft and hangs well. If you are in between sizes than go up. It seems to run slightly small.\",\"title\":\"It\'s not bad for the price. The whi...\"},{\"name\":\"Katie\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This shirt is very cute. It\'s great for us spring transition shirt. It is kind of see-through so you would need a undershirt with it. It fits true to size.\",\"title\":\"This shirt is very cute. It\'s great...\"},{\"name\":\"Kim\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This shirt is super cute and very flowy, making it the perfect choice for a summer day. This would be great on a beach vacation. I love the design of the sleeves. I would plan on wearing a bralette underneath as it is fairly see through. If wavering between sizes, I would go up a size.\",\"title\":\"This shirt is super cute and very f...\"},{\"name\":\"Sweta\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Style and color is wonderful would recommend\",\"title\":\"Would recommend Love the color\"},{\"name\":\"Jes███a\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"This is a cute floral top that adds a touch of flair with the netted sleeves. I think it would look better if it came in pastel colors with less printed flowers. The price point is reasonable though and would be great for summer attire.\",\"title\":\"This is a cute floral top that adds...\"},{\"name\":\"Bharu\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The design looks good.But quality of the product is not good.Material is rough not soft .whrn i open the pack then i got to know this producy from China.\",\"title\":\"The design looks good.But quality o...\"}]',NULL,45.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Blouses\",\"Womens Blouses\"]'),(263,'Cooling Sheets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-800TC-Organic-Cotton-Twin-Size-Fitted-Sheet-39X75-Fits-Mattress-Upto-10-12-inches-Turquoise-Stripe_b91831ac-93f6-42ca-aa5c-c944414e38ca.db1fbdc938dfb5731d2ed93141979a45.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"King Pillowcases(20x40)\",\"Standard Pillowcases(20x30 )\",\"Split King (39x80)\",\"Twin (39x75)\",\"Twin XL (39x80)\",\"Full (54x75)\",\"Queen ( 60x80)\",\"Short Queen ( 60x75)\",\"Olympic Queen ( 66x80)\",\"California king (72x84)\",\"RV King (72x75)\",\"King (76x80)\",\"Grand King (80x98)\",\"Emperor (84x84)\",\"Alaska King (108x108)\"]','[\"Aqua Blue\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Dark Grey\",\"Gold\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Ivory\",\"Lavender\",\"Light Blue\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Orange\",\"Parrot Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Sage\",\"Silver Gray\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"Teal\",\"Turquoise\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Recommended first wash is Dry cleaning for longest color retention. From next wash, machine / hand wash is suggested. Do not bleach / soak. Wash dark colors separately and dry in shade. Recommended water temperature upto 40 degrees Celsius. Medium-Heavy ironing required after wash.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Judy\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,56.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Cooling Sheets\"]'),(264,'Girls Uniform Bottoms','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Beverly-Hills-Polo-Club-Girls-School-Uniform-Skirt-2-Pack-Performance-Scooter-Skort-for-Girls-4-16_3743a9ec-8c3b-4e6a-a40e-a59c034dcfa4.05ff5ea9c6a7660a9431804d011709c9.jpeg\"',4.30,'[\"4\",\"5\",\"6\",\"6X\",\"7\",\"8\",\"10\",\"12\",\"14\",\"16\"]','[\"Khaki Pleated\",\"Khaki Pockets\",\"Navy Pleated\",\"Navy Pockets\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"kri███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My daughter wears them to school and loves them and the comfort of the material and stretch\"},{\"name\":\"car███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My daughter loves the material and how comfortable\",\"title\":\"Skirt\"},{\"name\":\"Yes███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I loved the style the color it\'s perfect fit has shorts under as well\",\"title\":\"Great purchase\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My girls LOVED these! They were especially excited about the pockets. These run big! My girls usually wear 7/8 or 8. So I got these in an 8. They fit like a 10. No big deal, I\'m going to order a size down for them to wear now, and hold onto these for later! I got them nautica ones last year on sale on Amazon and they LOVE them. They wanted me to get some more, but when I went to reorder them, triple the price! Yikes! The girls were bummed until they saw these! I haven\'t gotten the ones without pockets, but the material is nice, it\'s like an athletic material.\",\"title\":\"Sporty with POCKETS!\"},{\"name\":\"jac███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Ang███\",\"rating\":4},{\"name\":\"Heidi\",\"rating\":1}]',NULL,22.98,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"School Uniform Store\",\"Girls School Uniform Store\",\"Girls Uniform Bottoms\"]'),(265,'Womens Hoodies','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Women-Short-Sleeve-Crossed-Surplice-Button-Tops_b92c1cfd-f9ba-4f64-a907-2e1c0227909d.ff9a3148be794bcaccf47a90a804ba09.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Army Green\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Brick Red\",\"Green\",\"Gray\",\"L-Black\",\"L-Blue\",\"L-Dark Blue\",\"L-Purple\",\"Navy\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"S-Dark Green\",\"S-Grayish Purple\",\"S-Khaki\",\"S-Light Grey\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash Do Not Bleach Non-High-Temperature Ironing Avoid over Exposure\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Trish\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The shirt has a very flattering cut to it. I get compliments every time I wear it. Nice fabric and it washes well. I bought three more in different colors , two short sleeve and two long sleeve. The fabric is nice It\'s not too heavy, but not too thin either. The one thing I am not the fondest of are the button color. If they really bother you, I\'m sure they could be easily replaced.\",\"title\":\"Very cute shirt and dress it up or dress it down\"},{\"name\":\"Kel███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Soft and comfortable. I wish I had bought more!\",\"title\":\"Comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Gina\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I wear a size 12-14 and bought a large in green for Christmas. I was impressed at how flattering it was.\",\"title\":\"Really cute shirt, flattering and fits great.\"},{\"name\":\"Jacey\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This is a thick shirt, well made.  Did not shrink when washed %26 dried in the dryer. A little on the larger side of large, prob should\'ve gotten a med but rather a little roomy than tighter. Overall good.\",\"title\":\"Thicker than expected.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Remove the big white buttons (which are not necessary and outdated) and the design is very current and flattering. The price is right also!!\",\"title\":\"Great design\"},{\"name\":\"Jac███n\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I like the style of the shirt. Didn\'t like the material. The color of the shirt was fine.  Would have liked a choice of colors.\",\"title\":\"Poor quality\"},{\"name\":\"Beate\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I bought 3 of these shirts. One bought beginning of march, two others mid march, because I liked the way the first one looked. However they are of poor quality, I only had these shirts a couple of months and they are developing these fuzz balls on the front of the shirts. They look like I already had them for like a year\"},{\"name\":\"TR\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Did not like the look and material of this top. It ran small and it reminded me of something a nurse would wear on the job\",\"title\":\"Tee\"},{\"name\":\"Karla\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This blouse is well made and feels gorgeous on. However, I ordered purple and they shipped black. I do not wear black! I am very disappointed as I was looking forward to wearing it!\",\"title\":\"Color blind\"},{\"name\":\"Jac███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"never received order of 3 blouses. That sucks!\"}]',NULL,17.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Sweatshirts & Hoodies\",\"Womens Hoodies\",\"Womens Hoodies\"]'),(266,'browse subscription pantry',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Organic-Maqui-Berry-Powder-2-Pounds-Non-GMO-Raw-Vegan-by-Food-to-Live_3a42ff25-6455-40d7-a885-fa0fa476d89d.9ad1064836ff36d025edd2edf6670cec.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"0.25 lbs\",\"0.5 lbs\",\"1 lbs\",\"2 lbs\",\"4 lbs\",\"8 lbs\",\"22 lbs\"]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Safe Handling Instructions\",\"value\":\"STORE IN: Cool, Dry Place\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mic███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"good taste and demonstrably effective. Never heard of this , but I sure do like it and this seller\",\"title\":\"Hard to conceive of\"},{\"name\":\"Hazel\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful consistency, love the taste.\",\"title\":\"This is the good stuff!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Eil███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Just got it this order; wanted to give it a try. I have put it in its’ own glass jar & am awaiting courageous inspiration. That’s what is so positive about FTL. New & exciting uses for foods that are good for us & are good to boot!!\",\"title\":\"Organics Maqui berry powder\"},{\"name\":\"Rob███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Maqui is great.  A pleasant surprise.\\r\\n\\r\\nFairly sweet, so it\'s something you look forward to eating.   Maybe it has something your body needs -- give it a try, I suggest.  I am glad I did.  It is not inexpensive, but you just take a little bit daily.\",\"title\":\"Maqui is great.  A pleasant surprise\"},{\"name\":\"James\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this product.  Mixes easily in my protein shake and the berry flavor is excellent.  It really gives a great flavor to a protein shake.  Highly recommended.\"},{\"name\":\"che███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Since this purchase I am more and more drawn to this product. Food to Live provided quick delivery of this quality organic product at a fair price, as usual. Thank you Food to Live.\",\"title\":\"New to my life, Organic Maqui\"},{\"name\":\"Gimpy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i have severe dry eyes , and 1 tea, a day helps treat this condition.\",\"title\":\"good\"},{\"name\":\"Daw███se\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Did not like the flavor but mixed in a smoothie you do not notice it and you can still get all the benefits and that makes me smile\",\"title\":\"so good for you\"},{\"name\":\"Jea███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Maria is so nice and provided wonderful service!!!\\r\\nMy order was in separate zip closure bags. I know they\'ll be much fresher than being in the big bag.\",\"title\":\"Great service & thoughtful packaging\"},{\"name\":\"Kevin\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Nice dark Rich color. Product is slightly moist. That\'s why I did not give it five stars.  Freeze dried means dry. Not slightly moist.  I will order again and hopefully next bag will be totally dry powder.\",\"title\":\"Product seems good but?\"}]','ORGANIC FREEZE DRIED MAQUI BERRY POWDER',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"ORGANIC FREEZE DRIED MAQUI BERRY POWDER\"}]','[\"Subscriptions\",\"Subscription Grocery\",\"browse pantry staples\",\"browse subscription pantry\"]'),(267,'Shop Curtains','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-Grommet-Blackout-Curtain-Panel-True-Red-84-Inch-Wide-by-108-Inch-Long-1Panel_7d04edcb-3f6b-4349-91bc-1d56740a2fea.91d865d9424a143646cfc0273644fe1d.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"84 W x 108 L\",\"84 W x 120 L\",\"84 W x 132 L\",\"84 W x 72 L\",\"84 W x 84 L\",\"84 W x 96 L\",\"100 W x 108 L\",\"100 W x 120 L\",\"100 W x 132 L\",\"100 W x 72 L\",\"100 W x 84 L\",\"100 W x 96 L\"]','[\"Baby Pink\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Burgundy\",\"Gold\",\"Green\",\"Gray\",\"Greyish White\",\"Ivory\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Red\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"sos███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought the same curtains for 2 different bedrooms but in different colors. I can\'t believe how well they block out the daylight. Not completely black out but really close. I\'m very happy with them. The colors are really nice. I found sheets that are exact color matches for both rooms.\",\"title\":\"Love these curtains\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was looking for curtains that would elevate my room\'s aesthetics while also serving a functional purpose. These curtains do just that. The white color adds a touch of elegance, and the 84-inch size covers my window beautifully. Fantastic! Exactly as advertised! Great product! Very happy!!!\",\"title\":\"Elegant and Functional!\"},{\"name\":\"Cal███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased these curtains for my teenage daughter. Her previous curtains claimed to be blackout but definitely were not. Her room tends to be very bright and she is out of school but can\'t sleep in like a teenager should lol. We\'re revamping her room and these curtains are real and true. Close them and it\'s dark! Bonus- wrinkle-free!\",\"title\":\"Mid-day naps are on the way!\"},{\"name\":\"Ric███d\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These blackout curtains are a sleep saver! The 84-inch width and length provide full coverage, and the grommet design makes them easy to slide open or close. I\'m amazed at how effectively they block out light, creating the perfect sleep environment. Highly recommended!\",\"title\":\"Sleep Saver!\"},{\"name\":\"Aaron\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'ve ordered these several times for every room. They\'re soft silky material, not stiff at all. Definitely are black out curtains, keeps it cool in summers here in texas and keeps it warm during the cold weather days. I was very pleased with the quality of these drapes. Beautiful color and very well made. Blocks the sun as described. Will order again.\",\"title\":\"Great quality, looks high end\"},{\"name\":\"fok███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These curtains are amazing!!! The quality is exceptional - super soft and really beautiful. They are way nicer than I expected. And they do a fantastic job at blocking out the sun. Came a little wrinkled but it easily came out using a steamer.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful high-quality Curtains!\"},{\"name\":\"Rob███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So I originally purchased 6 curtains but as I was putting them up I realized I would only need 2. They work surprisingly well considering they are white “black out” curtains. Honestly they work super well.I have a front facing bedroom that always gets blasted with sunlight all day. The first picture I took at 7:30am and the second picture at 12pm and it truly keeps the light and heat out.\",\"title\":\"They are just what I hoped for\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███en\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The curtains are dark, which is good. The fabric is shinier than I expected.\",\"title\":\"Does the job\"},{\"name\":\"Mary\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The color is lovely, as is the fabric.  BUT it is not blackout or room darkening!  In addition, it appears that in order to supply the width I ordered, another panel was added...but not one of an equal size.  End result is a curtain with a seam off center.\",\"title\":\"Not blackout!\"},{\"name\":\"Mary\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The color and fabric are very nice.  BUT, these curtains are not room darkening!  Plus, to get them to the width I ordered, the manufacturer simply added a panel...not in center, not same size. Not a good look.  I will keep them and add a darkening panel on the reverse and hope the seams                                 are not so noticable.,\",\"title\":\"So so\"}]',NULL,134.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(268,'Look Good While Working Out','[\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Cueply-Women-s-Running-Shorts-High-Waisted-Athletic-Gym-Workout-Shorts-with-Liner-Zipper-Pockets_41a3d7f8-4ad0-4d39-9f70-c3e28c8691e1.5a53c95b6387d44a43e34fc6673e4bea.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"01 Black\",\"02 Red\",\"03 Purple Red\",\"04 White\",\"05 Light Gray\",\"06 Khaki\",\"07 Navy Blue\",\"08 Hot Pink\",\"09 Neon Green\",\"10 Golden Yellow\",\"11 Orange\",\"12 Royal Blue\",\"13 Purple\",\"14 Purple Gray\",\"15 Maroon\",\"16 Brown\",\"17 Camo Green Pink\",\"18 Dark Blue Palm Leaf\",\"19 LD Khaki\",\"20 TD Blue\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Gentle Machine Wash Cold / Do Not Dry Clean.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jen███le\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They are the perfect length for me! I was nervous they would be too long and look silly based on the way they look on the models. My waist is about 32” and my hips are about 40”. The inside of the shorts go down about maybe 6 or 7 inches so it covers well but it doesn\'t look bad.\",\"title\":\"Perfect\"},{\"name\":\"KJ\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Perfect summer active short!!\\nI ordered up 2 sizes (I don\'t like super short or tight shorts.\\nI did cut the liner out. Too big. \\nShorts at the perfect length, and not tight around my waist. Bought multiple colors.  Neon yellow and red!!\",\"title\":\"Great looking shorts\"},{\"name\":\"Bri███t\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these shorts and ordered them in 4 colors! They run slightly small, I like my shorts a little looser and am usually a medium but sized up to a large\",\"title\":\"Perfect shorts\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"these are great shorts. fits true to size. norally i am an xs but the small fits perfect. there is only one pocket with a zipper but the pocket is so small my hand wont fit inside it.\",\"title\":\"great shorts\"},{\"name\":\"Andie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It’s not warm enough yet here in Michigan to go running outside in shorts but I’ve tried these on and I think they will work very well for a very hot day. There is one zippered pocket that will be great for my car key.\",\"title\":\"Can’t wait to try these on a run\"},{\"name\":\"Patty\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The material feels nice and good quality. My problem was that runs two sizes smaller than regular fit. I wear Large and bought Xlarge and still tight, so this is the reason of my 4 stars and i am returning it. You need to buy 2 sizes larger than your regular size.\",\"title\":\"Good quality and value\"},{\"name\":\"Mer███es\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"They are super comfy and fit great but are completely see through. The underlining looks like underwear and is very visible through the shorts. Not even a big T shirt will do the trick to cover.\",\"title\":\"See through\"},{\"name\":\"Amber\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This is similar in quality to other Chinese purchases I made. Wasn\'t thinking I was purchasing from temu but that\'s the quality I got. They are fine but the tag said for big women and then labeled it a small. The lining is too big and the shorts are too big for a tts small. Ide say fits more similar to a mediums they were cheap so you get what you pay for\",\"title\":\"An honest take\"},{\"name\":\"Mel███a\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I really wanted to like these a lot and so so excited to get them. I am typically a true size small and the size small runs way too small. they look like they would fit a five year-old they still fit but not I would want them to fit. Plus the pocket is too small to fit my phone and it\'s completely built backwards. I am definitely returning this.\",\"title\":\"Runs small\"},{\"name\":\"Bet███y\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Returned two pair and never received a refund after MULTIPLE TIMES of reaching to customer service they told me i needed to call my bank and dispute it.\"}]',NULL,29.99,NULL,'[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Sports Medicine & Injury Recovery Solution\",\"Optimize Performance\",\"Look Good, Feel Good\",\"Look Good While Working Out\"]'),(269,'Maternity T-Shirts',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Smallshow-Long-Sleeve-Pregnancy-Shirts-Tops-Maternity-Clothes-for-Women-3-Pack_bebdef3e-4fbf-4ee3-8d2c-8bb9a3b35097.9ac14c73d8d88f4271fb80d5f8fdc62e.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black/Army Green/White Stripe\",\"Black/Deep Green/Teal\",\"Black/Deep Grey/Ligth Grey Stripe\",\"Black/Deep Grey/Wine\",\"Black/Light Grey/Army Green\",\"Black/Light Grey/Deep Green\",\"Black/Light Grey/Deep Grey\",\"Black/Light Grey/Navy\",\"Black/Light Grey/White Stripe\",\"Black/Navy/Wine\",\"Deep Grey/Deep Green/Navy\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash Cold/ Do Not Bleach/ Wash with Similar Colors/ Tumble Dry with Low Heat/ Iron on Low Heat/ Recommend to wash with laundry bag\"}]','[{\"name\":\"step\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fact that they are long sleeves but overall super lightweight is phenomenal. Being pregnant makes even upper Midwest USA feel like the middle of summer sometimes. The sleeves are a little long but I\'m also short\",\"title\":\"Wonderful!\"},{\"name\":\"Rae\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very comfortable and cute\",\"title\":\"Great but for soon to be moms\"},{\"name\":\"linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I like the way the item fits\",\"title\":\"Good\"},{\"name\":\"Jade\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these! Super soft and fit great!\"},{\"name\":\"Jamie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very comfortable and fit as expected.\"},{\"name\":\"cou███ee\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fit so amazingly and they are so soft!\",\"title\":\"So comfortable!\"},{\"name\":\"Sar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These shirts are really nice  nice material and so comfortable , get your regular size before pregnancy\",\"title\":\"Love these shirts\"},{\"name\":\"Cri███ne\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are great for layering or wearing under a cardigan. They are thin but not see through.\",\"title\":\"Great shirts\"},{\"name\":\"Sha███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I purchased these as a gift and they arrived on time.\\nThe colors are nice selection and easy to mix and match.\",\"title\":\"Nice shirts\"},{\"name\":\"Gina\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Soft and cozy but I found that any little bit of heat that makes me perspire shows right through. Especially above the belly and under the breasts when sitting. This is made for maternity so those vulnerable spots for sweating are not very cute or appealing.\",\"title\":\"Soft and comfy but….\"}]',NULL,39.49,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Maternity Clothing\",\"Maternity Tops & T-Shirts\",\"Maternity T-Shirts\"]'),(270,'Plus Size Jeans','[\"Reviewers highlighted: comfort, fit, quality\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Levi-s-Women-s-Plus-Size-94-Baggy-Jeans_a49fcd45-4ed3-4766-95cb-e8fd3ef305be.a049e9b75b2bc280ee501c81bd896fd9.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"16W\",\"18W\",\"20W\",\"22W\",\"24W\"]','[\"Black\",\"Light Indigo Worn In\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash cold - normal cycle. Wash inside out with like colors, do not bleach, tumble dry medium, hot iron, dry clean possible\"}]','[{\"name\":\"reb███9\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I am a huge fan of everything Levi\'s makes!  I got these Levi\'s Women\'s \'94 Baggy Jeans in Plus Size 18 for my mom.  My mom especially needs baggy jeans not only because she likes to wear comfortable clothing, but also because she had both of her knees replaced in the past year.  These jeans are awesome for her!  The thing I love most about them is that she doesn\'t look like she has a “mom jeans\'” rear in them.  They are a muted, almost distressed black color.  These are my mom\'s first pair of Levi\'s and she actually looks good in denim for the first time in her 74 years!  She\'s worn jeans in other brands, but I\'ve never liked denim on her until these from Levi\'s!\\r\\n\\r\\nThough these are \'94 Baggy, they don\'t look sloppy.  My mom is always put-together, and these work for her.  They are straight-cut, so there is no awkward tapering at her ankles or extra length on the back.  The rise is in the middle, so these are perfect to make my mom happy, as they don\'t press into her stomach at the waist or look too low like lowriders.  These are loose through the thigh and allow her hips room so they are not overly tight in inappropriate areas.  \\r\\n\\r\\nMy mom loves the feel of the fabric and the fact that these are slightly stretchy.  She even appreciates that these are made using five percent recycled material.  She\'s really getting into planet-saving actions, and now even her jeans are doing it with her!  I recommend these for their comfort, the look is not sloppy, and the feel is stretchy and comfortable.\",\"title\":\"Baggy but not sloppy!\"},{\"name\":\"Bun███26\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I love these Jean I just got , they\'re made by Levi\'s. These jeans are baggy, so they\'re great for doing hip hop dancing in. They move just the right way and they\'re so comfortable and light. If you love great jeans, you have to try these.\",\"title\":\"Very roomy\"},{\"name\":\"Smetz\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have the 94 baggy jeans made by Levi. You can never go wrong with Levi\'s. These jeans are great for everyday wear, but I will be using these for those cold winter days when I need to wear thermals underneath.  I was very impressed by the quality of these jeans. Being made in a plus size is amazing.  I would highly recommend trying the Levi\'s 94 baggy jeans for everyday wear they are very comfortable, and will last a lifetime.\",\"title\":\"Remarkable Jeans!\"},{\"name\":\"Bab███18\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] First off it came very well packaged the Levi\'s 94 baggy as a mid rise loose through the hip in the legs in straight leg and it has an awesome look it\'s very well put together the stitching is very well they look really great you can use it as occasion or you can use it use them as a dress down for a worker for school which ever one you would like they look very good quality as well as value it makes great gifts for birthdays holidays in Christmases it\'s really awesome They fit very well they look really nice on you they\'re very comfortable and they look amazing I recommend this to our family and friends they really comfortable jeans and their Levi\'s which is really awesome this makes you look really nice on you they feel good on you as well Levi as  been around along time and they are really great and last for along time they don\'t fall apart\",\"title\":\"Great fit\"},{\"name\":\"Mis███2\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I got these Levi\'s plus size baggy jeans for my daughter. She couldn\'t wait to try these on when they arrived. She said these are the most comfortable jeans she has ever worn. They fit her perfectly in the waist. She is 5\\\"2 and these were just right in length for her. She was so pleased she didn\'t have to roll the bottoms up. The light denim color looks so good on her. I would highly recommend these jeans to anyone. These are super cute!!\",\"title\":\"So comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Acole\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I have been wearing Levi\'s for many years and these jeans didn\'t disappoint! The first thing I liked is the color of the jeans it is a nice lighter blue and look very nice. I love the feel of the jeans ,alot softer than a new pair of regular jeans are. These fit very relaxed and very comfortable to wear all day no matter what you have to get done. These fit true to size. I like the way the jeans fit the legs and is loose and feels great! I think I just found my new favorite pair of jeans and I am going to have to get more!\",\"title\":\"Comfortable!\"},{\"name\":\"Amy███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] So these jeans fit great in the waist. Easy to button and zip. The pockets are deep enough to hold my phone, keys and change. The legs are absolutely huge. Like much more than baggy, they are extremely oversized. I could easily fit 2 of my legs in 1 pant leg. While I do appreciate and adore the retro feel from my childhood I really think the legs are to big. At least for me. However, there are plenty of women that will love this feature for multiple reasons. The pants are excellent quality and the stitching is perfect!!\",\"title\":\"Takes me back!!\"},{\"name\":\"Nin███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I just got these Levi\'s baggy Jeans, and they are so comfortable to wear anytime anywhere! They are well made, easy to wash & wear, and a great fit for us full figured girls. Add accessories and you\'ll be good to go!\",\"title\":\"Comfy Fit!\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███nn\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I was 19 years old in 1994. Levi\'s jeans were all the rage. I was excited when I saw these jeans and just had to get a pair. The quality of Levi\'s jeans has remained consistent from back in the day to now. These jeans are well constructed with no flaws.\\r\\n\\r\\nHowever, the size ran a little big for me. I understand that the style of these jeans are ‘94 Baggy, but they are too baggy for me. I would recommend getting at least one size smaller than you usually wear.\",\"title\":\"Great quality! Size runs big though.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Levi\'s recently dropped a Brand New, really cool, ‘94 Baggy Jeans Collection for Women. This Collection offers a variety of styles, colors and sizes (including plus sizes). \\r\\n\\r\\nThe Levi Strauss, Mid Rise, Light Indigo, ‘94 baggy plus size jeans in size 22W M, are oversized, denim construction, baggy type jeans that are designed to sit high on the waist, with the traditional 5 pocket, zipper fly, design. I really like how Levi Strauss brought the 90\'s trend back with the Baggy Jeans Collection, it brings back so many memories. \\r\\n\\r\\nI find it fascinating how trends from the 90\'s are coming around again. I\'ve been wearing Levi Strauss Jeans throughout My life and I must say they hold up really well. \\r\\n\\r\\nWhen selecting the Levi\'s ‘94 Baggy Jeans, I would highly recommend trying them on in store because they are made oversized. If You are ordering the jeans online, consider sizing down 2-3 sizes. For reference, I wear size 20-22 in plus size jeans. The ‘94 baggy jeans are nice, high quality jeans that will hold up for a long time. The only down side to the jeans is that they are way oversized, I ordered my usual size and they are like 3 sizes too big for Me.\",\"title\":\"‘94 Baggy Jeans\"}]',NULL,61.24,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Jeans\",\"Plus Size Jeans\"]'),(271,'Boy Shorts','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/No-Boundaries-Cotton-Boyshort-Panty-Sizes-XS-XXXL_5a5a8af7-1dad-4fc7-9206-a7f79d94b5ce.e04d35121ffdc7bf3fa712c283915d82.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"XXXL\"]','[\"BLACK SOOT\",\"BLUE THRILL\",\"BRIGHT APRICOT\",\"BRIGHT APRICOT FLORAL\",\"BURGUNDY NIGHT\",\"CLAY BRICK\",\"FRESHWATER BLUE\",\"LEMOND CHAMBRAY\",\"LEMOND CHAMBRAY STAR PRINT\",\"MED HEATHER GREY\",\"NAVY BLUE\",\"ORCHID ROSE PLAID\",\"SOFT OMBRE PRINT\",\"TOASTED ALMOND\",\"WILD SAGE\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash cold; Gentle cycle; Non-Chlorine Bleach when needed; Tumble Dry Low; Do not iron\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ren███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"True to color brick. Soft cotton feel at first. I actually thought they would fit my adult butt because of how wide they appear, but that was not the case. They did fit my tiny 11 year old girl as expected. She didn\'t like the texture and did not want to keep them.\",\"title\":\"Undies\"},{\"name\":\"rou███imo███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My daughter prefers boyshort style undies over other cuts. She like the way this brand fits true to size and she finds them comfortable. The seam, or lack of, isn\'t seen under thinner garments. The color works well under lighter dresses so she doesn\'t have the show through problem.\",\"title\":\"comfy and breathable\"},{\"name\":\"Cat███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am pleasantly surprised on the feel and fit of these boy short style panties.They fit true to size and are not tight or restricting around the leg. I like the thin band around the waist and the material is soft and comfortable. Lightweight material feel and a very comfortable wear.\",\"title\":\"Great fit and feel\"},{\"name\":\"Twi███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is my first experience with Boy Shorts and I must say that they are the most comfortable pair  of underwear I have ever owned at my age that says a lot. I love the color  the softness, texture,  support and control that these have. I will be purchasing more in different colors\",\"title\":\"very comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Nikki\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These underwear are stretchy and have a nice\\nDurable material. Despite being durable they are soft , smooth and have plenty of stretch. The band is medium width band that has a satin look to it. The band is just as stretchy as the rest of the material so it does not dig in. I also like that these are tagless!\",\"title\":\"Soft and stretchy\"},{\"name\":\"Aja███27\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These underwear fit great. They are true to size in the elastic does not dig into your skin. The material is very soft on your skin and comfortable and moves well with you. The underwear did not ride up or slide. They stayed in place and are very comfortable to wear. I like the dark colors especially for certain times of the month. The underwear washed really easily and they\'re holding up very well. I would definitely recommend these.\",\"title\":\"Great fit true to size\"},{\"name\":\"Har███Gir███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I absolutely love these No Boundaries boy shorts! They are so comfortable and fit so well. They look really nice and cute too! They are made really well and are a very good quality. I got them in a pretty greenish grayish color. I love them! I will definitely be buying more and I highly recommend these!\",\"title\":\"Very nice!\"},{\"name\":\"bar███buy███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"No Boundaries boyshort underwear are super soft. They are also super comfortable. The waistband is just the right size and isn\'t too tight fitting leaving behind an elastic band mark. Overall size wise they are spot on for your usual size and they are a good fit. Also doesn\'t loose it\'s shape after a few washes like some do. Good quality between softness and durability.\",\"title\":\"super soft\"},{\"name\":\"blu███gel███s5\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"If you are looking for a comfy fit, this No Boundaries style is perfect. What I love is that the seams are soft and flexible. They don\'t dig into your skin or feel like they are so loose that they won\'t stay in place. The fabric is just as soft and has the flexibility you need for a comfortable fit all day. So far, they have held up nicely in the wash. I did wash them on a delicate cycle like I do with all my garments of that nature. Definitely a good comfy, pair.\",\"title\":\"Comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Dar███e32███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I got these no boundaries junior cotton boyshort in the color brick red these are a size large they are cotton and are very comfortable the fit is overall good the elastic around the top is thin which i like compared to those wide bands you find on a lot of panties which gets stretched out and i prefer these kind myself they are just more comfortable. They arent the prettiest and not the fancy kind but these are comfortable and the fit is really good and they are a good value. So if you are looking for some comfortable fitting boyshort panties that are a good fit and a good value but not the fancy frill ones these are for you i am going to get several more in different colors.\",\"title\":\"Good comfortable fit at a good value\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Panties\",\"Boy Shorts\"]'),(272,'Casual Dresses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Aiyino-Women-s-V-Neck-Floral-Spaghetti-Strap-Summer-Casual-Swing-Dress-with-Pocket_a0c46f04-cb6a-46f4-8626-b8224108c127.df701ae6875ee214df5e2edf1ccc7513.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Cashew Cyan-Blue\",\"Green Leaf Black\",\"Maple Leaf Grey\",\"Navy lily\",\"Spots\",\"White Lily\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Gra███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This dress was a birthday gift for my niece. She loved it.\",\"title\":\"Niece\'s B-day gift\"},{\"name\":\"HOW███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Rose\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Rose\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Rose\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,18.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"Casual Dresses\"]'),(273,'Womens Dresses','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Allegra-K-Women-s-Floral-V-Neck-Ruffled-Flutter-Sleeve-Belt-Wrap-Midi-Dress_63da855a-6fa8-4d7c-aa51-d20bf56cd6fe.a9d3afe52d39c6194291b15cc6b99000.jpeg\"',3.80,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]','[\"Beige-Apricot Floral\",\"Beige-Purple Floral\",\"Blue\",\"Burgundy\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash Cold with Like Colors\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Julia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love this dress! I needed a light weight dress that was work appropriate because I walk to work in the summer heat. The material is nice and light, very comfortable without being see-through. Perfect length to be work appropriate. Will probably buy in more colors. 130 lbs, 5\'5”. Bought the Small.\",\"title\":\"Summer Professional\"},{\"name\":\"Con███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"True to size I\'m a 4-6 and small fits very well.\",\"title\":\"Nice dress\"},{\"name\":\"Les███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this dress , i have 8 Allegra K dresses so far and i have just ordered one more . These dresses are so silky and so well made . I will purchase more . Allegra K dresses are so well made , i love them .\",\"title\":\"Positive\"},{\"name\":\"Les███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is one of the prettiest dresses i own . i have two Allegra K Wrap dresses now and can\'t quit wearing them . The material is so silky and soft and these dresses are so very well made . Love em . I will purchase more , i have another one on order now . Delivery is so fast and well packed . The seller does well .\",\"title\":\"A positive review\"},{\"name\":\"Del███Div███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"the fabric is a bright yellow which is overwhelming.  the fabric is scratchy.  i returned it\",\"title\":\"fabric not as expected\"},{\"name\":\"JWi███ams███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I love the print and design of this dress.  I am 5\'7” and I like my dresses to be a least knee length, however this one was a little bit above the knee.\",\"title\":\"Great fit for above the knee length\"},{\"name\":\"Big███t\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"the fabric is rough. reminds me of a burlap bag.  color is more mustard than yellow. i am 5\'7\' dress is shorter thani like, mid knee.\"},{\"name\":\"lola\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"the material placed under the arm pit made the sleeve too tight\",\"title\":\"wrap around dress\"},{\"name\":\"Mom███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Very cute print. Dress is 100% polyester so it felt like I was wearing a dress made of plastic. Definitely was not comfortable. It kept shifting, and I had to readjust frequently. Not worth the money you pay for.\",\"title\":\"Plastic Dress\"},{\"name\":\"Mom███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"100% Polyester. Felt like I was wearing a plastic dress. Kept shifting around, had to readjust frequently. Cute print, but not worth it. Horrible quality.\",\"title\":\"Plastic dress\"}]',NULL,34.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"Womens Dresses\"]'),(274,'Colored Sheets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-100-Cotton-600-Thread-Count-4-PCs-Sheet-Set-Easily-Fit-upto-24-Inch-Deep-Pockets-Stripe-Pattern-Queen-Chocolate_2f3f7aea-e512-475b-9147-b2be365ddb6a.e6ced8f53ac965cd63ce349fdaa62f71.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"Alaska King\",\"California King\",\"Emperor\",\"Grand King\",\"King { 6-PCs Set }\",\"Queen { 6-PCs Set }\",\"RV King\",\"Short Queen\"]','[\"Black Solid\",\"Black Stripe\",\"Black {Solid}\",\"Black {Stripe}\",\"Burgundy Stripe\",\"Burgundy {Solid}\",\"Burgundy {Stripe}\",\"Chocolate Solid\",\"Chocolate Stripe\",\"Chocolate {Solid}\",\"Chocolate {Stripe}\",\"Dark Grey Solid\",\"Dark Grey Stripe\",\"Dark Grey {Solid}\",\"Dark Grey {Stripe}\",\"Ivory Solid\",\"Ivory Stripe\",\"Ivory {Solid}\",\"Ivory {Stripe}\",\"Light Blue Solid\",\"Light Blue Stripe\",\"Light Blue {Solid}\",\"Light Blue {Stripe}\",\"Navy Blue Stripe\",\"Navy Blue {Solid}\",\"Navy Blue {Stripe}\",\"Purple Solid\",\"Purple {Solid}\",\"Purple {Stripe}\",\"Sage Green Solid\",\"Sage Green Stripe\",\"Sage Green {Solid}\",\"Sage Green {Stripe}\",\"Silver Grey {Solid\",\"Silver Grey {Stripe\",\"Taupe Solid\",\"Taupe Stripe\",\"Taupe {Solid}\",\"Taupe {Stripe}\",\"Turquoise Solid\",\"Turquoise Stripe\",\"Turquoise {Solid}\",\"Turquoise {Stripe}\",\"White Solid\",\"White Stripe\",\"White {Solid}\",\"White {Stripe}\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Recommended first wash is Dry cleaning for longest color retention. From next wash, machine / hand wash is suggested. Do not bleach / soak. Wash dark colors separately and dry in shade. Recommended water temperature upto 40 degrees Celsius. Medium-Heavy ironing required after wash.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Fub███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I could be happier with my Amay 600-thread count sheet set. The fabric is so soft against the skin, and the deep pockets ensure that the sheets stay put even on my thick mattress. The turquoise color is vibrant and hasn\'t faded after multiple washes. These sheets have elevated my sleep experience to a whole new level of comfort!\",\"title\":\"Best Sleep Ever!\"},{\"name\":\"Piduv\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am absolutely thrilled with the Amay 100% Cotton 600-Thread Count 6-PCs Sheet Set in Turquoise. The fabric feels incredibly soft and smooth against my skin, providing the perfect level of comfort for a good night\'s sleep. The deep pockets are a game-changer, easily accommodating my thick mattress (up to 24 inches), and ensuring a snug fit without any slipping or bunching. The solid turquoise color adds a touch of elegance to my bedroom decor, and the sheets have maintained their color and quality after several washes. I couldn\'t be happier with this purchase!\",\"title\":\"Luxuriously Soft and Deep-Pocketed Sheets!\"},{\"name\":\"Zaz███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased the Amay 100% Cotton 600-Thread Count 6-PCs Sheet Set for my king-sized bed, and I must say, these sheets have exceeded my expectations. The 600-thread count makes them feel exceptionally luxurious and durable. Even after multiple washes, they have retained their softness and have shown no signs of pilling or wear. The deep pockets easily fit over my thick mattress, and the elasticized edges keep the sheets securely in place. The rich turquoise color adds a pop of vibrancy to my bedroom, and I love how they instantly elevate the overall look. I highly recommend these sheets for their quality and longevity. Looking forward to ordering more items in the future!!!\",\"title\":\"Incredible Quality and Durability!\"},{\"name\":\"Del███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fitted sheet\'s deep pockets effortlessly accommodate my extra-thick mattress, and the sheets stay perfectly in place throughout the night. Not to mention, the stunning turquoise color adds a refreshing pop to my bedroom. If you\'re after a restful night\'s sleep with a touch of elegance, these sheets are a must-have.\",\"title\":\"A Dreamy Night\'s Sleep\"},{\"name\":\"SFC███tin███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"the Sheets have stripes thaare horizontal and not vertical as advertised,  they fit like a garbage bag, and not soft at all.\",\"title\":\"bad sheet sets\"}]',NULL,99.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Colored Sheets\"]'),(275,'Bed Skirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SGI-Bedding-16-Inch-Wrap-Around-Bed-Skirt-Microfiber-Fade-Resistant-Wrinkle-Free-Anti-static-Decorative-Extra-Storage-Space-Clutter-Free-Olympic-Quee_2fb67500-4a77-4c65-a910-2a56765ce0b1.1d5c965077c3c616ad938ff92211e20a.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"California King- 14\\\"\",\"Full- 14\\\"\",\"King- 14\\\"\",\"Olympic Queen- 14\\\"\",\"Queen- 14\\\"\",\"Twin- 14\\\"\",\"California King- 16\\\"\",\"Full- 16\\\"\",\"King-16\\\"\",\"Olympic Queen- 16\\\"\",\"Queen- 16\\\"\",\"Twin- 16\\\"\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blood Red\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Egyptian Blue\",\"Golden\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Ivory\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Gray\",\"Lilac\",\"Mediterranean Blue\",\"Moss\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Parrot Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink\",\"Plum\",\"Purple\",\"Rust\",\"Sage\",\"Taupe\",\"Teal\",\"Turquoise Blue\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\",\"Zebra Print\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash Cold. Do Not Bleach. Tumble Dry Low. Remove Promptly.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Bev███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very pretty color, easy to put on box springs by myself. Works better than last bed skirt I ordered.\",\"title\":\"Would order this again.\"},{\"name\":\"Mad███ine███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"What just what I was looking for.\",\"title\":\"Perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Ami███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought this in maroon color and it is very nice. There is no need to iron because it is not crumpled after washing.\",\"title\":\"Good buy\"},{\"name\":\"Rita\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I liked my new bedskirt. Perfect color. Fit great.\"},{\"name\":\"Snow\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"very pleased, loved the color and it was a perfect fit\",\"title\":\"perfect fit\"},{\"name\":\"MM\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"looks amazing but it\'s weird to put on the bed\"},{\"name\":\"Evita\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The bedskirt was fine except it wasn\'t the pale lilac color as shown in the picture, so I had to return it. I\'ve already returned it, so I cannot tae a picture.\",\"title\":\"Bedskirt\"},{\"name\":\"DebNS\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Requested lavender but it was \\npurple-ish pink. By the time I opened the pkg after putting my lavender sheets on, that was when I noticed the color. The invoice stated lavender. It was a couple months after the seasonal weather changes %26 opened the white brand name bag that I noticed the color was definitely purple-ish pink.\\nMuch to late to return. I hope to gift it when I find that person! \\nThank you.\",\"title\":\"My bad not opening sooner\"},{\"name\":\"yel███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Don\'t buy!  YELLOW, not ivory. Perfect for trash bin only.  AWFUL!  Hate it!\",\"title\":\"Don\'t buy!  This bed skirt is YELLOW, not ivory\"},{\"name\":\"Z\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,25.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Skirts\"]'),(276,'Colored Sheets','[\"Reviewers highlighted: softness, price, comfort\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Mellanni-Sheet-Set-Iconic-Luxury-Brushed-Microfiber-Deep-Pocket-Sheet-4-Piece-King-Paisley-Gray_8e3929dd-f1ed-462a-9b3a-486d275ada26.22a355ab7191a924a794eab9c684926e.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Short Queen\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"Split King\",\"California King\"]','[\"Light Blue\",\"1102 White\",\"1126 Ivory\",\"1128 Golden Ivory\",\"1172 Blush Pink\",\"1182 Yellow\",\"1241 Pistachio\",\"1284 Spa Mint\",\"1335 Lavender\",\"1356 Violet\",\"1357 Hazy Lilac\",\"1364 Light Gray\",\"1394 Gray\",\"1436 Sage\",\"1448 Emerald Green\",\"1455 Teal\",\"1524 Aqua\",\"1535 Light Blue\",\"1561 Sky Blue\",\"1573 Blue Hydrangea\",\"1583 Spa Blue\",\"1593 Blue Nova\",\"1597 Royal Blue\",\"1621 Coral\",\"1652 Persimmon\",\"1667 Poppy Orange\",\"1678 Terracotta\",\"1752 Brick Red\",\"1785 Burgundy\",\"1812 Sand\",\"1823 Beige\",\"1862 Gold\",\"1872 Tan\",\"1875 Taupe\",\"1877 Dark Taupe\",\"1887 Brown\",\"1952 Purple\",\"1959 Navy Blue\",\"1990 Black\",\"2102 Striped White\",\"2364 Striped Gray / Silver\",\"2535 Striped Light Blue\",\"2823 Striped Beige\",\"3394 Pin Stripe Gray\",\"4394 Windowpane Gray\",\"5364 Chevron Gray\",\"6959 Polka Dot Navy\",\"7394 Paisley Gray\",\"7535 Paisley Blue\",\"8561 Laced Sky Blue\",\"8573 Madison Blue\",\"8952 Madison Purple\",\"8953 Check Burgundy\",\"9423 Quatrefoil Silver - Gray\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash cold on permanent press or gentle cycle with like colors. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Do not bleach, iron or dry-clean.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Dawn\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The color is clear and icy, without a gray tinge, as so many of this color have. The fabric itself is not stiff or rough, but is extremely comfortable.\",\"title\":\"Delightfully soft and cooling to the touch\"},{\"name\":\"Lau███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Only had these sheets for about a week, but we love them so far! They are soft, cool, and the fitted sheet fits over and more importantly STAYS ON our fat pillowtop mattress without sliding off the corners after a few nights of restlessness! Washed before first use and they held up just fine, but I believe we wouldn\'t of had to do that, as they were so soft out of the package! Don\'t know how long they last, or how soft they remain after multiple washes, but so far so good!\",\"title\":\"So far so good\"},{\"name\":\"Erin\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The sheets were a great value and good quality. Everything was as expected.\",\"title\":\"Worth the money.\"},{\"name\":\"Grace\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I\'m not sure why SOOO many 5 stars. The color is yellow and a very pretty mum flower yellow. The material is silky satin feeling. The only problem I have so far is the material is VERY thin; I can see my pillow pattern through the pillowcases. I have not washed them yet and will before deciding if I will return them.\",\"title\":\"Hmmm!\"},{\"name\":\"Grace\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I\'m not sure why SOOO many 5 stars. The color is orange and a very pretty mum flower orange. The material is silky satin feeling. The only problem I have so far is the material is VERY thin; I can see my pillow pattern through the pillowcases. I have not washed them yet and will before deciding if I will return them.\",\"title\":\"Hmmm!\"},{\"name\":\"Kay\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Just got these in the mail, so far they\'re pretty sofa like I wanted... however they\'re are not the same color I thought I was getting so they dont match my other bedding like I wanted. I ordered baby blue but these look like a pale teal or seaglass color to me\",\"title\":\"Color is off\"},{\"name\":\"Emi███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"These sheets are the exact color as in the picture, which I love.  Matches my tye-die  bedding really well.  They are very soft and comfortable as well, and I enjoy them keeping me cool at night so I rest well.  They are pretty baggy or oversized for my queen size bed, but I think it is because my mattress isn\'t as deep as some.  If you have a deep mattress, these would be great for you.  That is the only reason I went with 4 stars instead of 5 because they are so big that I have huge wrinkles even with the corner snap style holders.  Otherwise, 5 stars all the way.  Would highly rccommend for those with deep mattresses!\",\"title\":\"Soft sheets\"},{\"name\":\"Matt\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Had a flaw in them ,they look like they may have been torn, they were sewn. I contacted Walmart, told I would hear from the company, haven\'t heard anything from them!\",\"title\":\"Dissapointed\"},{\"name\":\"DORIS\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I requested Aqua color for sheets and was sent Baby Blue instead. Didn\'t think to check before washing the sheets. Now I\'m stuck with these sheets.  I needed the color Aqua. And to add to the disappointment,  Baby Blue was not one of the colors listed on their website. Instead of just saying not available, someone made the decision to sent what ever they though would pass.\",\"title\":\"Sent wrong color\"},{\"name\":\"Lea\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Pillowcase ripped right down the seam in the first wash\",\"title\":\"Disappointed\"}]',NULL,53.97,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Colored Sheets\"]'),(277,'Couch Covers','[\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Sanmadrola-100-Waterproof-Couch-Covers-Non-Slip-Sofa-Cover-Elastic-Straps-Silicone-Backing-Pocket-Washable-Furniture-Protector-Slipcovers-Kids-Pets-D_285a92d6-8e41-4e0f-ab51-2d88893b1363.e2b08105f7c8a50990fe8a574414ad83.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"Chair (One-couch Sofa)\",\"Loveseat (Two-couch Sofa)\",\"Oversized Sofa (Four-couch Sofa)\",\"Sofa (Three-couch Sofa)\"]','[\"Aegean Blue\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Dark Brown\",\"Gray\",\"Khaki\",\"Light Gray\",\"Sand\",\"Taupe\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mor███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i bough x large for my sofe and large for my loveseat fits perfectly, considering the odd shape of my furniture, it stays in place pretty well and i like the color\",\"title\":\"sofa covers\"},{\"name\":\"Glo███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"perfect fit on my sofa.👍\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have an overstuffed faux suede 3seat reclining sofa and a high strung lab mix. I had been using throw blankets to protect the seat, but though the were thick enough to protect, they could not withstand her practicing her flying trapeze routine. I was constantly fixing them. This cover fits the bill. I got the largest size in the Aegian Blue. The size is large enough for me to tuck in where it needs it without being too tight. The color is true to screen.\",\"title\":\"Dog tested\"},{\"name\":\"Gary\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"fantastic quality, great material, and nonslip work\'s well.\"},{\"name\":\"Iris\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Samaria water proof coash cover love this going to order another color\",\"title\":\"So comfortable my dog and mom fell asleep\"},{\"name\":\"Pam\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"it came fast when they said it would \\ni really like it fits well\"},{\"name\":\"Che███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Using to protect new couch from grandkids. Spilled liquids don\'t sink in. Cover stays in place and is comfortable to sit on.\",\"title\":\"Performs as promised\"},{\"name\":\"Has███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"very good product. can use it even without straps. great for protecting couches and increasing their life.\",\"title\":\"Protect your couches for their longer life.\"},{\"name\":\"Cav███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The product is exactly the way they advertised it. It was just what I wanted.  I don\'t use the straps. There\'s no need.\",\"title\":\"Great Chair %26 Couch Cover\"},{\"name\":\"Ang███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"not worth the purchase.  very thin and didn\'t come close to fitting either the love seat or the couch... plus it was missing the elastic band to hold it on. use caution better yet... dont waste your time or money\"}]',NULL,29.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Slipcovers\",\"Couch Covers\"]'),(278,'Cologne for Men',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Kenneth-Cole-Copper-Black-by-Kenneth-Cole-Eau-De-Toilette-Spray-3-4-oz-for-Men_546c78f7-6e43-4212-8d53-1083f75ed2ca.94d37d817f2d6916c6e6b6c6d86dffc7.jpeg\"',4.90,'[\"3.4 oz\"]','[]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"wil███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i love this cologne\",\"title\":\"great product\"},{\"name\":\"Marie\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Bob\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Mimi\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Chr███oph███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Yisel\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"gil███to\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Ann███782███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"ejj███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"craig\",\"rating\":5}]','Benzyl Benzoate, Citral, Limonene, Linalool, Water (Aqua), Fragrance, Alcoh