 a few screws that bolt from the foot base into the legs were not long enough. They were all the same screws but for some reason a few weren�t holding the foot in place.\"},{\"name\":\"Est███e\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Great set! The chairs are a little smaller than I thought though.\"},{\"name\":\"Wyatt\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Solid and durable set! It will weather the elements well. Seat back is a tad uncomfortable.\"}]',NULL,2429.99,NULL,'[\"Patio & Garden\",\"Patio Furniture\",\"Patio Sets\",\"Shop All Patio Sets\"]'),(374,'Womens Panties',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Women-s-Bali-DFSTHP-Soft-Touch-Hipster-Panty-Almond-6_95884fdc-4e29-40b0-9e73-5f8652ee3201.d3aafe188f539c7430d154e2fea91310.jpeg\"',4.30,'[\"5\",\"6\",\"7\",\"8\",\"9\"]','[\"Almond\",\"Black\",\"Blue Sky Ahead\",\"Crystal Grey Heather\",\"Evening Blush\",\"Gentle Peach\",\"Regal Navy\",\"Rose Bloom Pink\",\"Tinted Lavender\",\"Warm Brown Animal\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"75% Nylon, 25% Spandex Crotch Lining: 100% Cotton\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Wif███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This is a perfect fitting panty for my wife. No show type of panty that makes her feel fantastic when wearing it. She enjoys the cool fabric soft feel and fit that accentuates her curves in all the correct spots.\",\"title\":\"Fantastic panty for the wife\"},{\"name\":\"Nan P\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I really enjoyed the feel and fit of these underwear.  I thought may not fit well but they stayed where they were supposed to be. I would definitely buy these as no problems all day long and not too hot,\",\"title\":\"Comfortable all day\"},{\"name\":\"jes███a37███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These are so comfortable!  They are lightweight and breathable.  Great for wearing with anything, especially dress pants.  I don\'t have to worry about panty lines!  I would definitely recommend these to anyone.\",\"title\":\"Comfy and no panty lines\"},{\"name\":\"Lau███C\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Surprisingly nice fit and don\'t ride up. For now, I\'m ONLY hang drying them. I feel like over time the heat would mess up the hems and material. And? NO panty lines, even with leggings/fitness pants!\",\"title\":\"Comfortable, Stay in Place, No Panty Lines!\"},{\"name\":\"KMP50\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I got my pair and I\'m amazed at how soft the panties are! The seams are smoot and there\'s no label to irritate the skin. They are low enough that they don\'t ride up. No wedgies! I am old enough that I appreciate smooth seams\",\"title\":\"A beautiful product\"},{\"name\":\"Blu███82\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The fabric is soft and makes it feel like you are not wearing anything. They stay in place so you do not have to do any adjusting. I have been bending and moving a lot and they have stayed in place and not rolled down either. I received this pair free but I would definitely purchase them.\",\"title\":\"Nice soft pair of underwear\"},{\"name\":\"Meg███ P\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These hipsters are made of the softest material. They slide on smoothly and are very comfortable to wear. There are no visible panty lines which is a plus. They look nice on too. They did fall down below my stomach at the end of the day.  I do have a bit of an apron belly from a c-section,  so this might not affect everyone. A nice pair of underwear.\",\"title\":\"Super soft!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Nice smooth fabric, but tends to slip down in back.  Haven\'t had that issue with any other Bali panties....maybe these run large?\",\"title\":\"Slippery, thin fabric\"},{\"name\":\"Netta\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I haven\'t checked all 10 pair, but on at least 3 the top of the gusset isn\'t stitched.  Too much of a hassle to return.\",\"title\":\"Quality Control?\"},{\"name\":\"anny\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Not a good fit.  Gave to my daughter.\",\"title\":\"Nice but!\"}]',NULL,13.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Panties\",\"Womens Panties\"]'),(375,'Cooling Sheets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-Egyptian-Cotton-600-Thread-Count-4-PCs-Sheet-Set-Fits-Easily-Fit-upto-15-Inch-Deep-Pockets-Stripe-RV-Short-Queen-Burgundy_966f2120-06e2-4ddb-877c-717ded3bd5ec.832bfb1cc6429b735749a9b1e1c2bbcc.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Short Queen\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\",\"Alaska King\",\"Emperor\",\"Grand King\",\"RV King\"]','[\"Black Solid\",\"Black Stripe\",\"Burgundy Solid\",\"Burgundy Stripe\",\"Chocolate Solid\",\"Chocolate Stripe\",\"Chocolate {Stripe}\",\"Dark Grey Solid\",\"Dark Grey Stripe\",\"Ivory Solid\",\"Ivory Stripe\",\"Light Blue Solid\",\"Light Blue Stripe\",\"Navy Blue Solid\",\"Navy Blue Stripe\",\"Purple Solid\",\"Purple Stripe\",\"Sage Green Solid\",\"Sage Green Stripe\",\"Silver Grey Solid\",\"Silver Grey Stripe\",\"Taupe Solid\",\"Taupe Stripe\",\"Turquoise Solid\",\"Turquoise Stripe\",\"White Solid\",\"White Stripe\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Recommended first wash is Dry cleaning for longest color retention. From next wash, machine / hand wash is suggested. Do not bleach / soak. Wash dark colors separately and dry in shade. Recommended water temperature upto 40 degrees Celsius. Medium-Heavy ironing required after wash.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Pat███k\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m thoroughly impressed with the \\\"Amay Egyptian Cotton 600-Thread Count 4-PCs Sheet Set\\\" in a rich shade of purple. These sheets exude quality, and the 600-thread count is immediately noticeable in their softness and durability. The deep pockets are a lifesaver for my thick mattress, ensuring a secure fit. These sheets not only feel fantastic but also look elegant, elevating the overall aesthetic of my bedroom. They\'re a testament to both comfort and style, making my sleep time even more enjoyable. This set is a must-have for anyone seeking a quality sheet upgrade.\",\"title\":\"Great quality\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fitted sheet easily accommodates mattresses up to 15 inches deep, ensuring a secure and snug fit. No more struggling to keep the corners in place throughout the night – these sheets stay put! We\'ll be purchasing again from this seller!!!\",\"title\":\"Perfect Fit and Deep Pockets\"},{\"name\":\"Navy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay Egyptian Cotton sheet set is an absolute game-changer for a good night\'s sleep. The 600-thread count ensures an incredibly soft and smooth texture against the skin, making it a delight to slip into bed each night. Totally satisfied with this purchase!!!\",\"title\":\"Unmatched Comfort and Softness\"},{\"name\":\"Judy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently purchased the Amay Egyptian Cotton 600-Thread Count 4-PCs Sheet Set in Queen size, and I couldn\'t be happier with my purchase. These sheets are not only visually stunning in their beautiful purple stripe design but also incredibly comfortable. The 600-thread count ensures a silky smooth feel against your skin, making bedtime a luxurious experience. What impressed me the most was the deep pockets that easily fit my 15-inch mattress without slipping off. No more waking up to tangled sheets! The elasticized corners keep everything in place throughout the night.\",\"title\":\"Luxurious Comfort and Quality\"},{\"name\":\"Geo███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay Egyptian Cotton 600-Thread Count 4-PCs Sheet Set in Purple is an absolute dream! The luxurious feel of the Egyptian cotton against my skin is unparalleled, providing a truly indulgent bedding experience. The 600-thread count ensures a smooth and soft texture, making it a delight to slip into bed each night. I love that the set includes everything I need - a fitted sheet, a flat sheet, and two pillowcases - all perfectly coordinated with a stylish stripe pattern. The deep pockets easily fit mattresses up to 15 inches, ensuring a secure and snug fit. Amay has created a fantastic sheet set that combines comfort, style, and practicality, making it a must-have for anyone looking to elevate their sleep sanctuary!\",\"title\":\"A Dreamy Bedding Experience\"},{\"name\":\"sof███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay Egyptian Cotton sheet set is an absolute game-changer for a good night\'s sleep. The 600-thread count ensures an incredibly soft and smooth texture against the skin, making it a delight to slip into bed each night. Totally satisfied with this purchase!!!\",\"title\":\"Unmatched Comfort and Softness\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These sheets are the epitome of comfort and quality. The Egyptian cotton feels heavenly against my skin, and the 600-thread count is evident in the smoothness and durability of the fabric. They have quickly become my go-to choice for a restful night\'s sleep.\",\"title\":\"Great for me!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Thread Count Sheet Set is pure luxury. The deep purple color adds a touch of opulence to my bedroom, and the sheets themselves are incredibly soft and comfortable. They fit my queen-sized bed with ease, and the 15-inch deep pockets ensure they stay in place perfectly.\",\"title\":\"Quality product\"},{\"name\":\"Fel███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently upgraded my bedding to the Amay Egyptian Cotton 600-Thread Count 4-PCs Sheet Set in Queen size, and it has been a game-changer for my sleep quality. These sheets offer a perfect blend of luxury and functionality. The purple stripe design adds an elegant touch to my bedroom decor, and the 600-thread count Egyptian cotton fabric feels incredibly soft against my skin. What sets this sheet set apart is its deep pockets, which effortlessly accommodate my 15-inch deep mattress. No more struggling to tuck the corners in!\",\"title\":\"Sleeping in Elegance\"}]',NULL,89.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Cooling Sheets\"]'),(376,'Shop Curtains','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-Rod-Pocket-Curtain-Panel-Yellow-Gold-120-Inch-Wide-by-84-Inch-Long-1-Panel_4ff97459-aeea-4f41-9740-b7a27c461ba6.e3375ebd0b2be858a53e055c35735a7c.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"120 W x 108 L\",\"120 W x 120 L\",\"120 W x 132 L\",\"120 W x 72 L\",\"120 W x 84 L\",\"120 W x 96 L\",\"150 W x 108 L\",\"150 W x 120 L\",\"150 W x 132 L\",\"150 W x 72 L\",\"150 W x 84 L\",\"150 W x 96 L\"]','[\"Baby Pink\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Burgundy\",\"Fresh Green\",\"Gray\",\"Greyish White\",\"Ivory\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"True Red\",\"White\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These curtains are the epitome of elegance. The rich black color adds a touch of luxury to my space, and the 150-inch width provides full coverage that\'s hard to come by. The rod pocket design makes installation a breeze. I\'m in love with the sophisticated look they bring to my home.\",\"title\":\"Elegance Redefined!\"},{\"name\":\"fipaj\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love this beautiful color! The length was great. It blocks out enough sunlight but it does not block 100% of sunlight. I think it\'s perfect for spring, summer, and even our mild winters. Will definitely buy it again in other colors.\",\"title\":\"The color is on point\"}]',NULL,146.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(377,'Mens Work Uniforms','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/2-PACK-Chef-Code-Basic-Short-Sleeve-Chef-Coat-with-Pearl-Buttons-Chef-Jacket-Red-4XL_b5193447-8f6d-4dbc-80f4-c95d817209dd.b6139d66cbbf017e3f78e2db9999