 is stretchy and sewn well. It hugs me in the right places and is swingy and long where I want it to be. I got it in black and few like it would be perfect for a semi dressy or casual event.\",\"title\":\"The shirt gets a thumb\'s up!\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ina███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The shirt is comfortable and cute!\",\"title\":\"Cut top\"},{\"name\":\"She███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love how soft and colorful\"},{\"name\":\"Renee\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Figure flattering. Comfortable\",\"title\":\"Figure flattering. Comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"She███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the way they fit and how soft and colorful\"},{\"name\":\"Terri\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"this blouse is not true to size I ordered two wax and wish I would have ordered extra large for 1X I did have to return it\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"One of those online purchases your proud you made. Fit, drape, comfort, price. Excellent\",\"title\":\"No regrets\"}]',NULL,33.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Blouses\",\"Womens Blouses\"]'),(379,'Mens Briefs','[\"Best seller\",\"Flash Deal\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/INNERSY-Men-s-Underwear-Briefs-Soft-Comfy-Classic-Underwear-Pack-of-4-M-Black_5eddf991-1e04-4b32-a07a-b30d1c3b231c.a84349b277b5ca8ba41daeabbbfd6b3e.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black/Blue/Barely White/Dark Indigo\",\"Black/Burgundy/Dark Indigo\",\"Black/Red/Gray/Blue\",\"Blue Floral\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash cold with like colors; Tumble dry low; Cool iron if needed (low steam iron)\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Angy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These briefs for men are made of cotton, soft viscose and stretchy spandex. The briefs are made with stretch fabric ensure the breathability and durability, cotton viscose gives ultra-cool comfort and silky feel that my husband likes. Covered stretch waistband is comfortable you don’t have the elastic on the sink throughout the day. They ride high on the legs making them more constrict your thighs and prevent rubbing or irritating. Great for everyday wearing. He said nice and hope I will get him more of them. They also come in 4 diff colors.\",\"title\":\"Briefs Soft Comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Gab\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Awesome fit\",\"title\":\"Awesome underwear\"},{\"name\":\"Tony\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"perfect underwear for summer season!  Open air fiber keep private parts cool and offers great support for large testicles!\",\"title\":\"men\'s underwear\"},{\"name\":\"HHBR\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These look so cute on my boyfriend. He resisted at first but tried them and loves how they feel. I love how they look on him. Much better than his shorts he was using. The material is nice and they picked great colors.\",\"title\":\"Perfect for men\"},{\"name\":\"Alb███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I think I found one of the most comfortable briefs in along time. They are well made and the pouch is very comfortable and large to support your gear.\",\"title\":\"Great Briefs\"},{\"name\":\"Harry\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"A VERY GOOD VALUE FOR YOUR MONEY AND THE DELIVERY WAS AHEAD OF SCHEDULE BY SEVERAL DAYS I HAD AN ISSUE WITH SOMETHING AN IT WAS \\nHANDLE PERFECTLY\"},{\"name\":\"Amie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My husband absolutely loves them. They make his butt look nice. Hubby says they\'re very, very comfortable and they don\'t squish the parts that aren\'t supposed to be squished.\",\"title\":\"liked\"},{\"name\":\"Mom███een███ns\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is a really fun and cool set of boxers. The colors are loud for this set of four boxers. My hubby really likes the comfort that the boxers provide him throughout the entire day. It does not pinch and gather in areas that would make the wear uncomfortable. It has ample room in the crotch, and it does not ride up. The fit is perfect, size 38 waist and large fits him perfectly.\",\"title\":\"Cool Colors\"},{\"name\":\"Bay███inn███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got these for my husband and he actually loves them. We bought a large and he wears a 36 inch waist. They fit him perfectly. They are very good quality and the colors are very nice. These are on my list to buy again!\",\"title\":\"Great look and feel!!\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███hn\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Pros\\r\\nStretchy in most areas\\r\\nSoft fabric \\r\\nWashes well, no shrinking\\r\\nBand is comfortable around the waist\\r\\n\\r\\nCons\\r\\nNot a lot of support wor work outs and such. \\r\\n\\r\\nMy husband said they are comfortable but won\'t be his \\\"go to\\\" underwear.\",\"title\":\"Mens underwear\"}]',NULL,22.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Underwear\",\"Mens Briefs\"]'),(380,'Red Hair Dye','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Garnier-Nutrisse-Nourishing-Hair-Color-Creme-RZ4-Intense-Bronze-Red_31e6ed3d-f2ab-4fd3-924f-5f4976f2ec83.18a753f6561ebc56e13b56bb9c8fa44c.jpeg\"',4.00,'[]','[\"Blue Curacao\",\"Dark Intense Indigo\",\"Deepest Intense Purple\",\"Med Copper Red\",\"BR1 Deepest Intense Burgundy\",\"BY1 Bleach Icing Swirl\",\"DN1 Light Cool Denim\",\"IN1 Dark Intense Indigo\",\"L1 Deep Intense Lilac\",\"P1 Deepest Intense Purple\",\"RA1 Red Autumn\",\"RC1 Medium Copper Red\",\"RP1 Cherry Flamingo\",\"TL1 Teal Forest\",\"BR2 Dark Intense Burgundy\",\"Br2 Dark Intense Burgundy\",\"H2 Golden Blonde\",\"IN2 Blue Curacao\",\"M2 Sweet Grenadine\",\"P2 Intense Purple\",\"R2 Medium Intense Auburn\",\"V2 Dark Intense Violet\",\"B3 Golden Brown\",\"BR3 Intense Burgundy\",\"R3 Light Intense Auburn\",\"B4 Caramel Chocolate\",\"RZ4 Intense Bronze Red\",\"BL11 Jet Blue Black\",\"BL21 Blue Black\"]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Always read the hair color instructions insert in the box. Store between 50° and 80° F. Questions? Garnier Nutrisse has expert color consultants to help you. Call: 1-800-4GARNIER (1-800-442-7643).\"}]','[{\"name\":\"San███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"ultra bold red is the color..and is true to its name\\nlong lasting easy application \\nleaves your hair in great condition\",\"title\":\"super color !have been using for 3 years with lots\"},{\"name\":\"Can███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"At first I was like this makes no sense .. when I received it and read instructions but did as it said.. %26 it turned out so good! I got the icing swirl color!\",\"title\":\"Icing swirl color!\"},{\"name\":\"kathy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love it!!! I haven’t tried a lightening hair color before and this one did not disappoint. I bought it again because the first time I used a very small amount because I was scared and I loved it so I tried again. As with most product with bleach tho my hair does feel drier I feel like that should be said\",\"title\":\"Awesome!\"},{\"name\":\"Jes███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is my go-to haircolor product for the past 20  years. It lightens my roots with ease and never disappoints. The color saturation is unbeatable! Highly recommend.\",\"title\":\"My life-line\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love it and it gave me a good color\"},{\"name\":\"Emily\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Great color, not harsh and nice scent. Definitely will buy again, BUT……. DO NOT ADD THE FRUIT OIL INTO THE  DEVELOPER BOTTLE!!!!! Do Not use the fruit oil as instructed because it will turn your dye into the consistency of WATER!!!!!! \\nWhat a Disaster!!!!!! The fruit oil, “C” completely ruined my dye. Luckily I had ordered 2 boxes, so I was able to fix my dye.\\nThe fruit oil, “C” causes the dye to drip like water. Therefore making it Impossible to put dye on your hair and have it stay on your hair.\\nDO NOT USE THE FRUIT OIL !!!!!\",\"title\":\"DO NOT ADD THE FRUIT OIL !!!!!!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Jes███0\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I have medium brown hair, used as directed, only lifted 4 levels. Not even close to platinum let alone light blonde. Although, it left my hair with no breakage or dry ends. Still satisfied as it did lift evenly and my hair looks great and it\'s healthy.\",\"title\":\"Barely lightens\"},{\"name\":\"Cai███nn\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"It clearly shows two boxes of hair dye and states two pack but yet I only got one box. I paid $9.76 for a two pack, instead of $7.62 for one box. This is a rip off and would not recommend. I get it its only a $2 dollar difference money wise but I paid for two and I darn well want two.\",\"title\":\"Two pack lie\"},{\"name\":\"Mimi\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"When this color was mixed according to the directions the color was GREEN.   I have been using this brand and color for years and now will not buy again.\",\"title\":\"Do you want Green hair!!  No, then do not buy.\"},{\"name\":\"Lydia\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Green is my favorite color and have been wanting to dye my  hair dark green for some time. So when I saw this dark green hair dye....and it was Nutrisse? I had to order it online. Well I finally got around to using it.....but to my disappointment the color wasn\'t even a green color as shown on the box. It was more of a light green! I\'ve used your product to dye my hair for too many years to count. And this is the first time I have not been satisfied with the results.\",\"title\":\"Very Disappointed....\"}]','Colorant: 1212441 Aqua/Water/Eau, Cetearyl Alcohol, Propylene Glycol, Deceth-3, Laureth-12, Ammonium Hydroxide, Oleth-30, Lauric Acid, Hexadimethrine Chloride, Glycol Distearate, Polyquaternium-22, Ethanolamine, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Ci 77891/Titanium Dioxide, 2,3-Diaminodihydropyrazolo Pyrazolone Dimethosulfonate, 5-Amino-6-Chloro-O-Cresol, 4-Amino-2-Hydroxytoluene, P-Aminophenol, Ascorbic Acid, Tocopherol, Sodium Metabisulfite, 1-Hydroxyethyl 4,5-Diamino Pyrazole Sulfate, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil/Sunflower Seed Oil, 2-Methylresorcinol, 2-Methyl-5-Hydroxyethylaminophenol, Dimethicone, P-Phenylenediamine, Parfum/Fragrance, Carbomer, Resorcinol, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Extract, Edta, Vitis Vinifera Seed Oil/Grape Seed Oil. F.I.L.# D212126/2 Fruit Oil Concentrate: 1028840 Paraffinum Liquidum/Mineral Oil/Huile Minerale, Vitis Vinifera Seed Oil/Grape Seed Oil, Parfum/Fragrance, Tocopherol, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Extract. F.I.L.# D25829/5 Rinse-Out Conditioner: 1100858 Aqua/Water/Eau, Cetearyl Alcohol, Elaeis Guineensis Oil/Palm Oil, Behentrimonium Chloride, Pyrus Malus Fruit Extract/Apple Fruit Extract, Glycerin, Parfum/Fragrance, Isopropyl Alcohol, Stearamidopropyl Dimethylamine, Niacinamide, Pyridoxine Hcl, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter/Shea Butter, Citric Acid, Olea Europaea Oil/Olive Fruit Oil, Saccharum Officinarum Extract/Sugar Cane Extract/Extrait De Canne A Sucre, Benzyl Alcohol, Chlorhexidine Dihydrochloride, Persea Gratissima Oil/Avocado Oil, Ribes Nigrum Seed Oil/Black Currant Seed Oil, Linalool, Phenoxyethanol, Citrus Limon Peel Extract/Lemon Peel Extract, Ci 19140/Yellow 5, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Ci 15985/Yellow 6, Tocopherol, Glycine Soja Oil/Soybean Oil. F.I.L.# D174455/5 Developer: 1152439 Aqua/Water/Eau, Hydrogen Peroxide, Ce Te Aryl Alcohol, Trideceth-2 Carboxamide Mea, Ceteareth-25, Glycerin, Tetrasodium Etidronate, Tetrasodium Pyrophosphate, Sodium Salicylate, Phosphoric Acid. F.I.L.# D209745/1',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Colorant: 1212441 Aqua/Water/Eau, Cetearyl Alcohol, Propylene Glycol, Deceth-3, Laureth-12, Ammonium Hydroxide, Oleth-30, Lauric Acid, Hexadimethrine Chloride, Glycol Distearate, Polyquaternium-22, Ethanolamine, Silica Dimethyl Silylate, Ci 77891/Titanium Dioxide, 2,3-Diaminodihydropyrazolo Pyrazolone Dimethosulfonate, 5-Amino-6-Chloro-O-Cresol, 4-Amino-2-Hydroxytoluene, P-Aminophenol, Ascorbic Acid, Tocopherol, Sodium Metabisulfite, 1-Hydroxyethyl 4,5-Diamino Pyrazole Sulfate, Helianthus Annuus Seed Oil/Sunflower Seed Oil, 2-Methylresorcinol, 2-Methyl-5-Hydroxyethylaminophenol, Dimethicone, P-Phenylenediamine, Parfum/Fragrance, Carbomer, Resorcinol, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Extract, Edta, Vitis Vinifera Seed Oil/Grape Seed Oil. F.I.L.# D212126/2 Fruit Oil Concentrate: 1028840 Paraffinum Liquidum/Mineral Oil/Huile Minerale, Vitis Vinifera Seed Oil/Grape Seed Oil, Parfum/Fragrance, Tocopherol, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Extract. F.I.L.# D25829/5 Rinse-Out Conditioner: 1100858 Aqua/Water/Eau, Cetearyl Alcohol, Elaeis Guineensis Oil/Palm Oil, Behentrimonium Chloride, Pyrus Malus Fruit Extract/Apple Fruit Extract, Glycerin, Parfum/Fragrance, Isopropyl Alcohol, Stearamidopropyl Dimethylamine, Niacinamide, Pyridoxine Hcl, Butyrospermum Parkii Butter/Shea Butter, Citric Acid, Olea Europaea Oil/Olive Fruit Oil, Saccharum Officinarum Extract/Sugar Cane Extract/Extrait De Canne A Sucre, Benzyl Alcohol, Chlorhexidine Dihydrochloride, Persea Gratissima Oil/Avocado Oil, Ribes Nigrum Seed Oil/Black Currant Seed Oil, Linalool, Phenoxyethanol, Citrus Limon Peel Extract/Lemon Peel Extract, Ci 19140/Yellow 5, Camellia Sinensis Leaf Extract, Ci 15985/Yellow 6, Tocopherol, Glycine Soja Oil/Soybean Oil. F.I.L.# D174455/5 Developer: 1152439 Aqua/Water/Eau, Hydrogen Peroxide, Ce Te Aryl Alcohol, Trideceth-2 Carboxamide Mea, Ceteareth-25, Glycerin, Tetrasodium Etidronate, Tetrasodium Pyrophosphate, Sodium Salicylate, Phosphoric Acid. F.I.L.# D209745/1\"}]','[\"Beauty\",\"Hair Care\",\"Hair Color\",\"Red Hair Dye\"]'),(381,'Boxed christmas chocolate',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/merci-Holiday-Finest-8-8oz_0a528f61-a16e-4104-9d9c-cb58a1223c7b.e6601e2d380fa681efec830320d846f6.jpeg\"',4.60,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Keep in a cool and dry place.\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Merci Holiday Gift Box Chocolates offer a great assortment of delicious chocolates. Even the box is so beautifully decorated you don\'t need to wrap it for gift giving. The back of the box has a description of each flavor that is included. Very good quality chocolates.\",\"title\":\"High quality chocolates that make a great gift!\"},{\"name\":\"Sab███a20███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These merci Finest Selection Chocolates taste so good. The chocolates are smooth and come in eight different flavors. Although I don\'t like all the flavors, most of them are yummy. My favorite one is the coffee and cream, which has a strong coffee aroma and is so sweet that it has no bitter taste at all. The least favorite is marzipan, which has a white filling and I personally dislike the texture of it. Some have filling and some have solid insides. One flavor a day keeps the sadness away.\",\"title\":\"Yummy\"},{\"name\":\"She███gir███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I enjoy this product for the holidays with my family. I love all the cool flavor and it\'s the perfect size. Its unique box opens up to reveal a wonderful array of elegantly thin chocolate bars in a variety of indulgent flavors such as Crème Truffle, Hazelnut-Almond, Cafe au Lait and Praline-Crème. It is high quality, but also very reasonably priced, so it\'s easy to give all the time.\",\"title\":\"The perfect gift !!!\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███e5\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Merci Chocolate European chocolates are by far the best I like to give these as gifts because who doesn\'t love great chocolate!! The box has eight different types of chocolate each one better then the other also it seems like every time I buy a box I have to get one for myself!!\",\"title\":\"Great chocolate\"},{\"name\":\"Kay███n11███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This will be my go to candy for gift giving this year for sure! The variety of chocolate in this pack is great it definitely has something for everyone. The chocolate was very smooth and same as the ones that had fillings. I am not a fan of dark chocolate at all but these have made me change my mind they taste very rich and smooth. I will be going get a few more boxes to see which flavor was my favorite cause they were were so good!\",\"title\":\"High Quality Chocolate\"},{\"name\":\"Pip███ee\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These chocolates are a huge hit with my family!  These fine chocolates are of excellent quality and are packaged nicely so they would make a great  gift. They also taste so delicious - the marzipan is my favorite!\",\"title\":\"Delicious!\"},{\"name\":\"Cjm███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I LOVE this product!  Not only does the name say it all (what better way to say ‘thank you\' than with chocolate!), but the product is so tasty!  The first time I purchased this was as an end of year thank you gift for my daughters preschool teachers.  Then I would give it to dance instructors or assistants for Christmas.  The latest purchase is my favorite because the label is now  festive for the holidays ;it used to be plain red)!  I bought enough  for all of her teachers, as well as her guidance counselor for the holiday season.  The chocolate is so creamy and delicious!    My favorite is the hazelnut!!  I love that each piece us individually wrapped.  My daughter\'s French teacher appreciates this gift the most since she has received it numerous times!\",\"title\":\"Delicious!\"},{\"name\":\"Kry███e\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Love, love, love these! Even hubby and the kiddos liked them, and they\'re much pickier about chocolate than I am. Great variety of flavors that were fun to try out. I don\'t think I disliked any of them! Give them a try!\",\"title\":\"Delicious!\"},{\"name\":\"glo███rl2███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I really like how creamy and tasty this chocolate is an