Navy/Red\",\"2Pk: Navy/White\",\"2Pk: Neon Lime/Neon Coral\",\"2Pk: Spring Blue/Mid Navy\",\"2Pk: Yellow/White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Pep███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They are great quality, I wear them often. If you buy a bigger size they are a bit long until washed.\",\"title\":\"Great leggings.\"},{\"name\":\"MrsT\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very comfortable cotton capri\",\"title\":\"Capri\"},{\"name\":\"Megan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"if i could give it a 10 stars i would. these are durable and comfy. \\nmy daughter loves them so do i. \\nthey are very stretchy but not see through so adults can wear them outside not worry.\",\"title\":\"the best bike shorts\"},{\"name\":\"jean\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m  all about comfort and these shorts deliver!\",\"title\":\"Great comfy shorts\"},{\"name\":\"Laura\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I looked extensively for red biker shorts that would match a black Minnie Mouse shirt to wear to Disney. So color was key, but also something comfortable and flattering. These shorts check all the boxes, and bonus that I have a navy blue pair too! Based on reviews I sized up (normally am a L but got XL). The XL fits but are a bit loose, so I definitely could have gone with L and been good. The L is sold out and I really like them, so I\'ll make the XL work. Definitely recommend these shorts! They\'re soft cotton, so probably best for everyday clothing versus workout apparel.\",\"title\":\"Great shorts!\"},{\"name\":\"Scc\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These shorts are perfect for everyday summer do everything wear.  I have several colors that I mix and match with tees for summer living.\",\"title\":\"Great summertime gear!\"},{\"name\":\"KAT███INE███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Though I was ok with fabric feeling and pricing, item sizing runs small. Will return and order a bigger size.\"},{\"name\":\"Nic███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"These look nothing like the picture! They do not have a wide waist band-they also do not fit well-baggy in the legs and do not a control anywhere.\",\"title\":\"Do not like them at all-waste of money\"},{\"name\":\"Tracy\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"There is only one pair in the bag. I only received the black pair\",\"title\":\"Missing item\"},{\"name\":\"Shari\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Yuck! The material is cotton but not wash and wear but a throwback to stay home and wash clothes.  Best if washed by hand and air dry.\\nWhat kind of cotton is this?\",\"title\":\"Poor Cotton Fabric\"}]',NULL,21.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Activewear\",\"Womens Workout Bottoms\",\"Workout Leggings\"]'),(386,'All Vitamins & Supplements',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Nature-s-Truth-Rapid-Release-Turmeric-Curcumin-1600-mg-Per-Serving-Softgels-60-ct_1ae8d199-2a6e-4f86-9b82-25a17728cd83.a80a252734fb1622b683c028e7b04231.jpeg\"',4.60,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"For adults, take two (2) rapid release liquid softgels daily, preferably with a meal.\"},{\"name\":\"Dosage\",\"value\":\"For adults, take two (2) rapid release liquid softgels daily, preferably with a meal.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Brian\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Noticed a difference in my gut health within a week of taking recommend if you have those issues\"},{\"name\":\"edd███oy6███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I am in my early 50s, with age comes health problems as well as inflamation and bone issues. I have been a big fan of tumeric for a while now. I have been trying this particular one for a couple weeks now and it works real well for my inflammation, and I can see some improvement in my skin tone as well. I definitely recommend the use of this.\",\"title\":\"works good\"},{\"name\":\"Nat███eS\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I started incorporating the rapid release Turmeric Curcumin soft 