 but definitely worth every it.\"},{\"name\":\"Jar███11\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I like the benefits of this vitamin in my routine. The pills are pretty small so easy to swallow. There\'s no distinct smell or taste either. I feel like I\'ve gotten a bit more energy and my skins improving also with the tumeric.\",\"title\":\"Not bad!\"}]','Turmeric Curcumin Complex (Turmeric 10:1 Extract, Turmeric 95% Extract), Astragalus, Ginger, Black Pepper Extract. Other Ingredients: Gelatin, Vegetable Glycerin, Sunflower Oil, Sunflower Lecithin, Yellow Beeswax,<br>Titanium Dioxide Color.',15.28,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Turmeric Curcumin Complex (Turmeric 10:1 Extract, Turmeric 95% Extract), Astragalus, Ginger, Black Pepper Extract. Other Ingredients: Gelatin, Vegetable Glycerin, Sunflower Oil, Sunflower Lecithin, Yellow Beeswax,<br>Titanium Dioxide Color.\"}]','[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Vitamins and Supplements\",\"All Vitamins & Supplements\"]'),(387,'Plus Size Dresses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Dresses-for-Women-Summer-Sleeveless-Plus-Size-Daily-Vintage-Sunflower-Bohemian-V-Neck-Maxi-Dress_3c275359-b66d-4984-97ef-a1a10393af51.8dc6e14c922f6c8ea6a37e2808ceb1f5.jpeg\"',1.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Navy\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"washing by hand or machine with cold water, do not bleach. hang or line dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Vir███ia\",\"rating\":1}]',NULL,9.19,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Dresses\",\"Plus Size Dresses\"]'),(388,'Womens Pajama Sets',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/cheibear-Women-s-Satin-2pcs-Lounge-Sleepwear-T-Shirt-and-Shorts-Polka-Dots-Pajama-Sets_767ed194-1689-4d21-8186-3714254b51fa.a2f35db5cc26ad2be67427cde5495b59.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black Dots\",\"Blue\",\"Blue Dots\",\"Champagne\",\"Champagne Pink\",\"Dark Green\",