tyle. My husband is 6\' and muscular and the medium fit really well. Pants also sit a little high on the waist, but still fit well. \\nGET THIS SET.\",\"title\":\"AMAZING\"},{\"name\":\"Brian\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The item is nice I look good in it so thank you😊\",\"title\":\"Nice\"},{\"name\":\"Andy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Brooklyn 99. Tigers and Toucs!\",\"title\":\"PB\"},{\"name\":\"Dar███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought for. My husband and he can\'t stop wearing it\"},{\"name\":\"Bar███a\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"this is pricey for what it is but, we needed a fun outfit for the holidays and this works so, we splurged\"},{\"name\":\"Jer███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"It said it was going to run big and I got my exact size and it was too small.\"},{\"name\":\"der███k\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,54.95,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Workout Clothing\",\"Mens Workout Clothing\"]'),(410,'Mens Pajama Sets','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Vulcanodon-Mens-Pajama-Set-100-Cotton-Long-Sleeve-Button-Down-PJ-Set-for-Men-Plaid-Men-s-Sleepwear-Red-Blue-Plaid-Small_19f5ab18-9477-4d70-be8a-7b8298dcce0d.2571a25fbe8b6ebe7abafd2c59231fc6.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Aqua Blue-Plaid\",\"Dark Blue-Plaid\",\"Navy-Plaid\",\"Red Blue-Plaid\",\"Royal Blue-Plaid\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Patty\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"He is tall, but the pants are not short on him.\",\"title\":\"Good weight and fit.\"},{\"name\":\"Hazel\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I found it difficult to find a pajama set like this for my husband. It\'s true that they run big and the pants long. However, I washed the set before use and put it in the dryer and they shrunk enough to fit fine. My husband wears a large and weighs about 145. After washing and drying, the pant leg length was good. I would purchase again.\",\"title\":\"Light weight pajama set\"},{\"name\":\"Kry███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s difficult to locate a good pajama set for men, but I came across these and bought them for my husband. He adores them! He claims they are really comfortable. They are little thin, which my husband enjoys.\",\"title\":\"Incredible set.\"},{\"name\":\"Adr███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They are good .\"},{\"name\":\"Har███B.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These Hanes pajamas are comfortable. The material is a blend of polyester and cotton, and the sizes run a touch large; I generally wear size XL but opted to take the advice of other reviews and get the next smaller size (L), and the fit is excellent and comfortable. The pants have an elastic waist and buttons with lots of give. I will order again.\",\"title\":\"Incredible pijamas light and agreeable.\"},{\"name\":\"Carol\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"MY HUSBAND REALLY LIKES THESE!  THANKS FOR THESE CHOICES!\",\"title\":\"GREAT PJ\'S\"},{\"name\":\"Bri███L.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The top fits, but I\'m not sure I\'ll ever utilize the breast pocket. I\'m not a lover of buttons, but I discovered I can slip the top over my head without having to deal with them. The bottom has buttons that I found a little snug (the button barely fits through the buttonhole), but the elastic waistband insures a decent fit. It\'s properly sized, comfy, and well made.\",\"title\":\"Incredible PJ\'s fit well.\"},{\"name\":\"Lana\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"My husband is 5\'10\\\" tall and the PJs were about 3 inches too long.  Chest circumference was way too large.  We will reorder in a medium. Nice fabric.\",\"title\":\"Nice but too large\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The long lower pajama is a little snug, and the sleeves are thin. I\'m an 88kg, 5\'9\' male with a normal structure. Also, the lower pajama buttons are too small. The major downside is that the red colour comes off when you wash your hands. It was done as a precaution, and you cannot put it in the washing machine.\",\"title\":\"Pyjamas.\"},{\"name\":\"Ste███ie ███th\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Fits fine, but the arms are a little short, but they work.\",\"title\":\"great light weight.\"}]',NULL,37.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Pajamas and Robes\",\"Mens Pajama Sets\"]'),(411,'Colored Sheets',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Bare-Home-Fitted-Sheet-22-Extra-Deep-Pocket-Premium-1800-Collection-King-22-Pocket-Red_cc4917af-1ed3-420d-9489-6762ddb17d62.692c2725e39337e8c38c861717613868.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"Twin-XL\",\"Full-XL\",\"22\\\" - Cal King\",\"22\\\" - Full\",\"22\\\" - Full XL\",\"22\\\" - King\",\"22\\\" - Queen\",\"22\\\" - Split Queen\",\"22\\\" - Twin\",\"22\\\" - Twin XL\",\"24\\\" - Full\",\"24\\\" - King\",\"24\\\" - Queen\",\"24\\\" - Twin\",\"24\\\" - Twin XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Cloud Gray\",\"Cypress\",\"Dark Blue\",\"Forest Green\",\"Gray\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Gray\",\"Plum\",\"Red\",\"Sand\",\"Taupe\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash in cold water with similar colors. Tumble dry on low. Do not bleach\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jade\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have a very thick mattress. I was forever buying sheets and nothing seems to fit correctly and stay on. This sheet has a 360 elastic that actually encompasses the entire thing! Best purchase I could have made. Price wasn\'t bad either.\",\"title\":\"A sheet that fits\"},{\"name\":\"traci\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"it\'s been hit and miss finding a fitted sheet that doesn\'t come off in the middle of the night.  this fits my pillow top mattress and the quilted bamboo mattress pad.\"},{\"name\":\"JB17\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"We have these on three of our four beds in our home! They are great and fit deep mattresses or a mattress with a pillow topper. They have elastic all the way around for a great fit. I had previously tried those suspender type clips with a standard size fitted sheet and the sheet was still coming off, and they were a pain. You won\'t regret this purchase!\",\"title\":\"DEEP fitted sheet that actually stays on!\"},{\"name\":\"Jamie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"it has never popped off the corners of the bed. there\'s actually a little room, and it\'s a little loose. every single sheet I have bought, even expensive ones with so-called deep pockets, still come off with my 6-ft 3, 300 lb son rolling around in there at night. this one works great!\",\"title\":\"love it\"},{\"name\":\"carey\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have a king size bed with a large mattress topper 4 in added to my large mattress. I\'ve never been able to find deep pocket sheets that actually fit and stay on. These sheets are amazing and they stay on because of the special way they are sewn. They are true deep pocket and soft and I love them and bought six sets!\",\"title\":\"Best Fitting Sheets I\'ve Ever Found\"},{\"name\":\"Carol\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fabric is soft, the color is beautiful.\\nThe surprise is there is only a fitted sheet and a pillowcase and if you buy 20 inch air mattress you really need this deep pocket she I\'m not sure when they started selling A Sheet instead of a set of sheets. So maybe you have a flat sheet that will make  a pretty , coordinated guest bed.\",\"title\":\"1 fitted sheet, 1 pillowcase\"},{\"name\":\"Harry\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Unfortunately for me, I did not read the full ad. I was looking for California King deep pocket sheet SET. I read the ad and the sheet was what I was looking for. Dummy me did not notice it was NOT a set. MY MISTAKE. The sheet is great, now I have to try to find the matching top sheet and pillow cases. The sheet is great.\",\"title\":\"Read the listing\"},{\"name\":\"KJ\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Good sheets but not exactly deep pockets. These were for an in home  hospital bed and they barely fit.\",\"title\":\"Not so deep.\"},{\"name\":\"Shari\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"If zero stars was an option that\'s what I would give the sheets. They are way too big for an XL twin mattress, gaping at every corner and not staying in place when you sleep. Cheap construction, very thin material. Skip these and keep looking.\",\"title\":\"Skip these and keep looking\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███oph███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I love this product but I had to sew a corner together when I got it due to the manufacturer not sewing up a corner from the factory. I would have returned it for another one but then I would have been left without a sheet for my bed as no other sheet is deep enough for my mattress with the mattress topper and protector. Once I sewed it up it has been a great sheet and is very comfortable and durable. My 110 lb German Sheperd likes to get on the bed and it holds up to him which other sheets dont.\",\"title\":\"Unfortunate\"}]',NULL,32.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Colored Sheets\"]'),(412,'Low Support','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/The-Serena-Cotton-Wirefree-Sports-Bra_d8e38aa1-fa4f-4c42-a46f-fc76a077dc5b.d50694057c1bb68becfed51e2f6110d4.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"36BCD\",\"36DDFG\",\"38BCD\",\"38DDFG\",\"40BCD\",\"40DDFG\",\"42BCD\",\"42DDFG\",\"44BCD\",\"44DDFG\",\"46BCD\",\"46DDFG\",\"48BCD\",\"48DDFG\",\"50BCD\",\"50DDFG\",\"52BCD\",\"52DDFG\",\"54BCD\",\"54DDFG\",\"56BCD\",\"56DDFG\"]','[\"Amethyst Plum\",\"Black\",\"Blue Feathered Print\",\"Gray Shadow\",\"Heather Grey\",\"Lavender\",\"Light Coral Geo Print\",\"Mocha\",\"Mocha Leo Dot\",\"Navy\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash. Do not bleach. Line dry. Iron as needed using low temperature.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Tam███San███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They are very well made, not flimsy at all. Very comfortable and soft. I wish Leading Lady would stock all of the colors in my size but they haven\'t yet.\",\"title\":\"Nice products\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███lin███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My daughter loves this bra! Shes a younger bigger girl and this is perfect for her as a young tween.\",\"title\":\"Great for my tween\"},{\"name\":\"Tra███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Susan\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,29.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Bras\",\"Womens Sports Bras\",\"Low Support\"]'),(413,'Cooling Sheets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-800TC-Organic-Cotton-California-King-Size-Fitted-Sheet-72X84-Fits-Mattress-Upto-12-15-inches-Parrot-Green-Stripe_c14d3184-50ee-46b6-accc-be208cf034c3.63eda26f153403f6437564213ce8769f.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"King Pillowcases(20x40)\",\"Standard Pillowcases(20x30 )\",\"Split King (39x80)\",\"Twin (39x75)\",\"Twin XL (39x80)\",\"Full (54x75)\",\"Queen ( 60x80)\",\"Short Queen ( 60x75)\",\"Olympic Queen ( 66x80)\",\"California king (72x84)\",\"RV King (72x75)\",\"King (76x80)\",\"Grand King (80x98)\",\"Emperor (84x84)\",\"Alaska King (108x108)\"]','[\"Aqua Blue\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Dark Grey\",\"Gold\",\"Gray\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Ivory\",\"Lavender\",\"Light Blue\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Orange\",\"Parrot Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Sage\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"Teal\",\"Turquoise\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Recommended first wash is Dry cleaning for longest color retention. From next wash, machine / hand wash is suggested. Do not bleach / soak. Wash dark colors separately and dry in shade. Recommended water temperature upto 40 degrees Celsius. Medium-Heavy ironing required after wash.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Rob███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Additionally, the organic cotton material is exceptionally soft and breathable, ensuring a comfortable night\'s rest. What\'s even better is that it\'s easy to maintain; it doesn\'t wrinkle much and stays in great condition after several washes. I\'m thrilled with my purchase!\",\"title\":\"Perfect Fit and Easy Maintenance!\"}]',NULL,58.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Cooling Sheets\"]'),(414,'Wireless Bras','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Pntutb-Womens-Clearance-Sexy-Women-s-Plus-Size-Vest-Crop-Wire-Free-Bra-Lace-Lingerie-Sexy-V-Neck-Underwear-Rollback_a7f7dba3-5c8b-4fa4-96f2-600570386266.76be6025cffb03c992cde45adcc4e677.jpeg\"',3.10,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Gray\",\"Green\",\"Pink\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash in cold water or gentle machine wash/do not bleach/air dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Just make sure you try and buy the same brand that fits best as it\'s not the same across the board\",\"title\":\"Frequently shop\"},{\"name\":\"Dawn\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"i irdered a 3xl. according to size and fit, it should have fit no smaller than a 36D. it did not. It did however fit my sister, who is a 34B or C. the size description is not accurate.\",\"title\":\"Size is not accurate\"},{\"name\":\"Noel\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered a small and it was more for a size C or D\",\"title\":\"Don\'t buy\"},{\"name\":\"John\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"John\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Tammy\",\"rating\":2},{\"name\":\"Tammy\",\"rating\":2}]',NULL,4.69,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Bras\",\"Wireless Bras\"]'),(415,'Premium Hair Styling Products',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Mizani-Edge-Taming-Hair-Gel-Size-1-7-Oz_72f355b8-f261-4021-b2a5-1336357680c2.056b3793ba4d69bda25a7b53fec5c14b.jpeg\"',4.30,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Use as directed on package\"}]','[{\"name\":\"sim███jei███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Firm, moisturizing, glossy hold. My go to with the gel from this line. Sleek and moisturized natural finish without the hard or stiffness associated with edge controls.\",\"title\":\"Finally!! NO matte, flaky residue 🙌🏽\"},{\"name\":\"dun███8rm███c\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review w