 stars instead of 5 is that the top will look better on a taller gal.  I\'m 5\'4.5 and its a bit saggy on me.  If i place the band where it belongs you can\'t see it; the top comes down over the top of the band. (saggy look)  If I want to see the band I have to pull it down pretty much over my butt.  It\'s hard to find the happy the medium if you\'re shorter.\",\"title\":\"Better on a taller Gal\"},{\"name\":\"Ana███sia███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Im 5â5, 117. Lovely color and fabric feels good but it way too big. Ordered small and it fit well at the top but extremely bagy towards the bottom. The fabric overlaps and covers the band completely, not to mention the shirt is so long it almost covers my butt entirely.\"},{\"name\":\"RHO███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"this shirt starts beating up from the first time you put it on this sure is not worth a dollar much less 19 do not buy this product it\'s the worst quality I have ever purchased in clothing!!\",\"title\":\"first time I wore this shirt this is what it did!!\"}]',NULL,16.99,NULL,'[\"Party & Occasions\",\"Halloween\",\"Halloween Themed Clothing\"]'),(418,'Bedding Sets','[\"Best seller\",\"Flash Deal\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SORMAG-3-Pieces-Duvet-Cover-Set-Soft-Washed-Microfiber-Duvet-Cover-Full-with-2-Pillow-Shams-Black_b35bac1a-a0b7-49cc-83b3-fbe862e95400.26efa2fab4d60feab6b3855e1983dd53.jpeg\"',4.30,'[\"Twin\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\"]','[\"Black\",\"Dark Grey\",\"Light Grey\",\"Navy Blue\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Karen\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These microfiber duvet covers with zippered closure are fantastic in every way. My latest purchase was the white one. I\'ll need to return it as I\'m looking for bright white and this a soft white to match his soft it actually is. If I was only concerned with quality, functionality, and comfort, I\'d be keeping this for sure!\",\"title\":\"It\'s a soft white, not a bright white\"},{\"name\":\"EM\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This duvet is the exact size of the comforter I bought. I love it because it\'s zippered so it\'s easy to open and close. Also the inside has strings to attach the comforter. This will be my go to for duvets.\",\"title\":\"Quality zippered duvet\"},{\"name\":\"Wendy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought a similar duvet from bed bath and beyond three years ago on sale for $98. This duvet is softer and has the ties to hold it in place at 1/3 of the price.  Very happy with this duvet\",\"title\":\"BB%26B quality for 1/3 the price\"},{\"name\":\"Hap███ust███r\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s soft and arrived quickly\",\"title\":\"Happy customer\"},{\"name\":\"C\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"LOVE. It is pretty heavy which I love! It\'s very soft and it washed very well. I\'m so excited to go to bed tonight!\",\"title\":\"Perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Tony\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The overall quality is good. The paper cardboard inside it smells bad.\",\"title\":\"The overall quality is good\"},{\"name\":\"Sha███m\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Bought this to use over a duvet we had for my son\'s college apartment.  Ordered based on reviews. so I hope they are right!\",\"title\":\"college dorm\"},{\"name\":\"Omar\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"When I ordered it I thought I was getting a good deal because it looked like a nice comforter and it came with 2 shams. Turns out it was only the covering of the comforter and none of the fluffy inside stuffing actually came with it.\",\"title\":\"Unexpected\"},{\"name\":\"Sanni\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"it definitely did not show the color, or should i say i ordered DARK grey and I received a light smoke grey. I based my bedroom colors and theme based on the grey depicted in pic. Ot took forever to be delivered and eas told 3 differnet dated, so i don\'t want to deal with returning it and being stalled even more!!!\",\"title\":\"Not what shown\"},{\"name\":\"Mary\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It was a microfiber fabric. I thought it was a full set comforter wasn\'t happy with the color did not use just returned.\"}]',NULL,129.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bedding Sets\",\"Bedding Sets\"]'),(419,'Wedding Tablecloths','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Efavormart-90-x132-Wine-Seamless-Polyester-Rectangular-Tablecloth_b37859ad-a576-47dd-8828-0bb187d62bd5.bb77ab26136af9cc2fc565455c566fa0.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"50\\\" x 120\\\"\",\"54\\\" x 96\\\"\",\"60\\\" x 102\\\"\",\"60\\\" x 126\\\"\",\"72\\\" x 120\\\"\",\"90\\\" x 132\\\"\",\"90\\\" x 156\\\"\"]','[\"Amethyst\",\"Apple Green\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Blush\",\"Brown\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Cinnamon Rose/Gold\",\"Denim\",\"Dusty Blue\",\"Dusty Rose\",\"Dusty Sage\",\"Eucalyptus Dusty Sage\",\"Floral Dusty Sage Green\",\"Fushia\",\"Gold\",\"Ivory\",\"Lavender\",\"Lime Green\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Nude Beige\",\"Orange\",\"Peacock Teal Green\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Silver\",\"Taupe\",\"Terracotta\",\"White\",\"Willow\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Deb███h\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s a steal at this price and a beautiful tablecloth that\'s very large and going to cover any table  you have. If it\'s too big, cut it to size because it\'s a great value. You can always add a ruffle where you had to cut it.\",\"title\":\"IT\'S AMAZING!\"},{\"name\":\"Eli███eth███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I like the material and easy to manage.Price is good.\",\"title\":\"Good.\"},{\"name\":\"Les███dra███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought three of these in different colors. I have a few utility tables in my kitchen and studio and it\'s fun to change the decor by putting on a different color tablecloth!\"},{\"name\":\"Rena\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fit my table perfectly.\",\"title\":\"Nice\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███r\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"We are using this to cover tables for displaying items at markets - and they are perfect! The fabric is a great weight - for a nice drape over the tables.\",\"title\":\"very satisfied with this product for the price.\"},{\"name\":\"Bon███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Very thin but inexpensive for a holiday table.\",\"title\":\"Perfect for Christmas table with leaf.  Very thin\"},{\"name\":\"Sarah\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Simple design. Good for daily use. I purchased it because the color in the picture looks more on the cinnamon side. But it is more on the rose side. It doesn\'t match my stuff. I wanted to return it but I cannot return it to Walmart. I don\'t have a printer to print the label. So I\'m gonna have to go to the copy center. It\'s a hassle to return. After I paid the shipping price of $3.99, I\'m stuck with it. The lighting makes a difference when taking a product picture so I don\'t think it\'s the seller\'s fault that the color looks a bit different. I\'m giving it three stars for not being able to return it to Walmart. I should\'ve purchased Mainstays Yale brick tablecloth.\",\"title\":\"Cannot return it to Walmart\"},{\"name\":\"DD\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"They arrived all stained as if they were used. They came individually packed nicely but once I opened them to lay them on the tables, there were brown stains on each of them. At that point it was too late to return.\",\"title\":\"Do not buy\"},{\"name\":\"Lucy\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The actual color of the received items do not match the color description on the website.  The company response was that colors do not actually represent the real color.  \\nA mustard color is not a gold color\",\"title\":\"Company wants me to pay for items to be returned\"},{\"name\":\"Deb███h\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Never received the order. I got a message saying it was delivered today @1:20 pm. Nothing was delivered to my house.\",\"title\":\"Missing package!\"}]',NULL,16.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Kitchen & Dining\",\"Kitchen & Table Linens\",\"Table Linens\",\"Wedding Tablecloths\"]'),(420,'Plus Size Tops','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Pntutb-Womens-Clearance-Plus-Size-Women-s-Print-V-Neck-Short-Sleeve-Long-T-Shirt-Blouse-Rollback_bb39a419-2725-493d-9381-e625b2f7271e.bef8afa4f1bb0cc6a7b6635a6b793040.jpeg\"',3.60,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\",\"Plus Size\"]','[\"#7-Black\",\"#7-Gray\",\"#7-Green\",\"#7-Khaki\",\"#7-Maroon\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Lea███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I can\'t eait for the weather to warm up so I can wear it!\",\"title\":\"so cute\"},{\"name\":\"Car███n\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Nice color, good fit, it\'s a cute shirt.\"},{\"name\":\"Glo███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Sizing is in no way accurate!\",\"title\":\"Too small\"},{\"name\":\"she███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Took over a month to get %26 it was the wrong size.\",\"title\":\"Grrrr!\"},{\"name\":\"Glo███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Runs VERY SMALL! Was supposed to be a 5x..could have been more than a xxl by normal standards. ABSOLUTELY NOT worth the money!!!!\",\"title\":\"If you get it, SIZE WAYYYY UP, but don\'t recommend\"},{\"name\":\"Glo███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Sizing is in no way accurate!\",\"title\":\"Too small\"},{\"name\":\"Jac███lin███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"misty\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Che███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Che███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,7.09,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Tops\",\"Plus Size Tops\"]'),(421,'Whipped Toppings','[\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Cool-Whip-Extra-Creamy-Whipped-Cream-Topping-8-oz-Tub_2bfbd0d1-bc15-4400-9ae5-e07451cec671.ba6e666b9d13d6885daa885ba64ebc83.jpeg\"',4.70,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"To thaw: Place unopened tub in refrigerator for 4 hours. Do not stir.Storage: Keeps fresh in refrigerator 2 weeks. May be refrozen for longer storage. For best results: Do not thaw Cool Whip on countertop or in microwave. Excessive stirring or heat will cause product to soften and become watery.Package yield: About 3 cups.\"},{\"name\":\"Safe Handling Instructions\",\"value\":\"Refer to product label if applicable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"car███j19███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the extra creamy. It tastes so much better than the regular Cool Whip. It also has a texture closer to actual whipped cream. I like it. It has actual cream in it instead of oil. I love to use this in a no bake cheesecake recipe. It always turns out so much better when I use the extra creamy.\",\"title\":\"The extra creamy is so much better than the regular Cool Whip!\"},{\"name\":\"sun███cf0███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I freeze this, cut it into 4ths, put 1/4 into a bowl with 1/2 cup of blueberries on top. This is a healthy and delicious LOW calorie dessert. So I always have a freezer full of these. I highly recommend it!\",\"title\":\"Rich and Creamy\"},{\"name\":\"Bev███y\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I keep discovering things I missing. First my Marie Collender coconut cream pie, then my breakfast sandwiches and I am missing my cool whip!  Boy this order was a mess!!!  Glad we are not having our dinner until Fri.  I even went out to my car and looked to make sure I didn\'t miss anything….. but I did end up with a kids towel that\'s not mine?????\",\"title\":\"I keep realizing I am missing things.\"},{\"name\":\"Ang███ust███r\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"DID NOT RECEIVE MY ORDER BUT ORDER CONFIRMED DELIVERED!\",\"title\":\"Delivery Driver JAZZMIN\"},{\"name\":\"Nic███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered 2 tubs of cool whip on my grocery order. I get home and putting everything away and I notice a mess in the cool whip bag. The 2 tubs are stacked together, I pick the top one up to see cool whip all over the bottom container. Upon inspection, it had no plastic seal and no plastic lid - only the card board insert for the lid. Mistakes happen,  but I\'m completely baffled that this was not obvious to the grocery picker.  I\'m not out a lot of money by any means, but definitely think it needs to be noted!\",\"title\":\"Disgusted!\"},{\"name\":\"Cry███l\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It was not the extra creamy\"},{\"name\":\"laura\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"your brand is qdollsr an something c e nts i paid 3.21 for extra creamy an no one in my family eats it cuz its gross.would l ike my m o ney back .....\",\"title\":\"too much for whip cream\"},{\"name\":\"Cus███er\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Bought online. Arrived with package ripped and half full. The worker that shopped for this is clearly unqualified\",\"title\":\"Walmart needs to choose better staff to shop\"},{\"name\":\"Carol\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This was the only item that was missing out of my order.\",\"title\":\"Item missing\"},{\"name\":\"pen███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The Cool Whip look like cottage cheese and was all on one side and I\'m not eating this mess…both bowls looked this way!!\",\"title\":\"cool whip was inedible!!\"}]','SKIM MILK, HYDROGENATED VEGETABLE OIL (COCONUT AND PALM KERNEL OILS), HIGH FRUCTOSE CORN SYRUP, WATER, CORN SYRUP, LIGHT CREAM, CONTAINS LESS THAN 2% OF SODIUM CASEINATE (FROM MILK), NATURAL AND ARTIFICIAL FLAVOR, XANTHAN AND GUAR GUMS, POLYSORBATE 60, SORBITAN MONOSTEARATE, SODIUM POLYPHOSPHATE, BETA CAROTENE (COLOR).',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"SKIM MILK, HYDROGENATED VEGETABLE OIL (COCONUT AND PALM KERNEL OILS), HIGH FRUCTOSE CORN SYRUP, WATER, CORN SYRUP, LIGHT CREAM, CONTAINS LESS THAN 2% OF SODIUM CASEINATE (FROM MILK), NATURAL AND ARTIFICIAL FLAVOR, XANTHAN AND GUAR GUMS, POLYSORBATE 60, SORBITAN MONOSTEARATE, SODIUM POLYPHOSPHATE, BETA CAROTENE (COLOR).\"}]','[\"Food\",\"Frozen Foods\",\"Frozen Desserts\",\"Whipped Toppings\"]'),(422,'Mens Graphic Tees','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Men-s-Batman-Logo-Vintage-Graphic-Tee-Athletic-Heather-X-Large_5e0a57b5-cef6-49ec-963c-5e22ac4865c4.5825ce1817b0d3e7146cc049887f869c.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"Big & Tall\",\"Men\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"Athletic Heather\",\"Charcoal\",\"Charcoal Heather\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Royal Blue Heather\",\"Silver\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash & Tumble dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Enr███e\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Happy\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,18.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Shirts\",\"Mens Graphic Tees\"]'),(423,'Arthritis pain relief',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/New-Easy-Open-Cap-Voltaren-Arthritis-Pain-Gel-for-Powerful-Topical-Arthritis-Pain-Relief-Two-150-G-Tubes-and-One-50-G-Tube_aefa2dd3-5908-4fd0-b07b-d8eb14ebcd3d.ec5b8d7ce2083672912cf89e46439429.jpeg\"',4.40,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Dosage\",\"value\":\"2-4 Grams\"},{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Use up to 21 days unless directed by doctor. Not for strains, sprains, bruises or sports injuries. This product has not been shown to work for these types of injuries. For your arthritis pain: Use 4 times per day every day. Do not use on more than 2 body areas at the same time. Use ENCLOSED DOSING CARD to measure a dose. For each upper body area (hand, wrist, or elbow) - Squeeze out 2.25 inches (2 grams). For each lower body area (food, ankle or knee) - Squeeze out 4.5 inches (4 grams). Read the enclosed User Guide for complete instructions: Use only as directed. Do not use more than directed or for longer than directed. Apply only to clean, dry skin that does not have any cuts, open wounds, infections or rashes. Do not apply in the same area as any other product. Do not apply with external heat such as heating pad. Do not apply a bandage over the treated area. Store ENCLOSED DOSING CARD with your Voltaren Arthritis Pain. The doing card is re-usable.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"asm███9\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] It\'s perfect to get rid of pain fast with Voltaren topical gel and keep it away with Voltaren Joint Comfort & Movement dietary supplement. The gel is quick absorbing into skin and The supplement is one capsule per day made with natural ingredients proven for their anti inflammatory properties. This proven combination will help you feel better and move better. I especially love that it is a drug free supplement\",\"title\":\"Voltaren\"},{\"name\":\"dee███t12███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Flip top easy to use! Make sure you follow directions and use it for the right areas. Great option for anyone with arthritis. I\'ve been using it on my feet, especially being a server. It\'s a life saver.\",\"title\":\"Helps with the pain\"},{\"name\":\"coo███c5d███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I was happy to be gifted the Voltaren Arthritis Pain gel from Influenster. I have bad knees and wrists from years of sports and years of an office position. The gel goes a long way into helping my comfort. The included dosing guide is very helpful to measure the amount of cream you need. It doesn\'t have a strong overpowering scent like other topical gels do.\",\"title\":\"Love the dosing chart\"},{\"name\":\"ash███s75███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Love this! I usually use biofreeze and this is my new favorite. The packaging is normal cardboard, texture is smooth and ribs into skin easily, works great, and the scent isn\'t too overpowering.\",\"title\":\"Great\"},{\"name\":\"Sus███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Excellent to relief pain. This was given to my daughter in the hospital to help with pain when she had leukemia. I highly recommend the product. Altho the pain eventually comes back as always with everyone, that\'s when you apply more, it really worked for me & my precious daughter it\'s now an over the counter med & can be purchased without a prescription. There is no odor, rub it on and go. No one will know your wearing it.\",\"title\":\"Have pain rub on,no smell Voltaren it really works\"},{\"name\":\"che███pop███t71███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The voltaren arthritis pain gel is a great product to keep on hand for when arthritis pain strikes. I love that you can apply it to directly where the pain is for relief. I would purchase this again in the future.@voltarengel #voltaren #thejoyofmovement @Influenster #Complimentary\",\"title\":\"Great product\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Really helped with arthritis pain. Comes with a little ruler that gives you dosage amount for upper and lower body. You do need a good amount of t. Packaging is good, but you get a lot of pain you can go through a tube very quickly. No scent but it helps\",\"title\":\"Effective\"},{\"name\":\"mar███64b███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I received the Voltaren Arthritis Pain Gel free from Influenster to try and give my honest review. It is a noteworthy product that provides targeted relief for individuals suffering from arthritis type pains. It worked well and absorbed nicely with a non-greasy feel. I would recommend this product.\",\"title\":\"Works well.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This was not any better than bengay or tiger balm. The instructions say to use it multiple times a day for maximum effectiveness, but unfortunately with our busy lifestyle that\'s extremely inconvenient. I need something more fast acting and potent.\",\"title\":\"I prefer something else.\"},{\"name\":\"car███nas███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I\'ve heard a lot about Voltaren however I did not experience the relief it indicates happens with usage. I will continue to try it again and see if it makes a difference. I will not purchase it as I don\'t see the benefit from it.\",\"title\":\"Unsatisfied\"}]','Active Ingredients: Diclofenac Sodium (Nsaid) (Equivalent To 0.93% Diclofenac) (1 %)/Arthritis Pain Reliever/Inactive Ingredients: Carbomer Homopolymer Type C/Cocoyl Caprylocaprate/Fragrance/Isopropyl Alcohol/Mineral Oil/Polyoxyl 20 Cetostearyl Ether/Propylene Glycol/Purified Water/Strong Ammonia Solution. Nonsteroidal Anti-Inflammatory Drug',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Active Ingredient Name\",\"values\":\"Diclofenac Sodium\"},{\"type\":\"Active Ingredients\",\"values\":\"NA\"},{\"type\":\"Inactive Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Carbomer homopolymer Type C cocoyl caprylocaprate fragrance isopropyl alcohol mineral oil polyoxyl 20 cetostearyl ether propylene glycol purified water strong ammonia solution\"},{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Active Ingredients: Diclofenac Sodium (Nsaid) (Equivalent To 0.93% Diclofenac) (1 %)/Arthritis Pain Reliever/Inactive Ingredients: Carbomer Homopolymer Type C/Cocoyl Caprylocaprate/Fragrance/Isopropyl Alcohol/Mineral Oil/Polyoxyl 20 Cetostearyl Ether/Propylene Glycol/Purified Water/Strong Ammonia Solution. Nonsteroidal Anti-Inflammatory Drug\"}]','[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Pain management\",\"Arthritis pain relief\"]'),(424,'Low Support','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/The-Serena-Cotton-Wirefree-Sports-Bra_52f1317a-f9c3-49aa-a846-2651ce079ae7.aa3228b61928f4ec7325e20109a9632d.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"36BCD\",\"36DDFG\",\"38BCD\",\"38DDFG\",\"40BCD\",\"40DDFG\",\"42BCD\",\"42DDFG\",\"44BCD\",\"44DDFG\",\"46BCD\",\"46DDFG\",\"48BCD\",\"48DDFG\",\"50BCD\",\"50DDFG\",\"52BCD\",\"52DDFG\",\"54BCD\",\"54DDFG\",\"56BCD\",\"56DDFG\"]','[\"Amethyst Plum\",\"Black\",\"Blue Feathered Print\",\"Gray Shadow\",\"Heather Grey\",\"Lavender\",\"Light Coral Geo Print\",\"Mocha\",\"Mocha Leo Dot\",\"Navy\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash. Do not bleach. Line dry. Iron as needed using low temperature.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Tam███San███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They are very well made, not flimsy at all. Very comfortable and soft. I wish Leading Lady would stock all of the colors in my size but they haven\'t yet.\",\"title\":\"Nice products\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███lin███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My daughter loves this bra! Shes a younger bigger girl and this is perfect for her as a young tween.\",\"title\":\"Great for my tween\"},{\"name\":\"Tra███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Susan\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,29.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Bras\",\"Womens Sports Bras\",\"Low Support\"]'),(425,'Mens Casual Button Down Shirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Wespornow-Mens-Hawaiian-Shirts-Short-Sleeve-Floral-Tropical-Beach-Casual-Button-Down-Shirts-Black-M_20d0d300-5644-4e3d-b554-31bcb014adfe.bdaaf255877d13daa16e5029c58c0e63.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"XXXL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Dark Blue\",\"Grey Leaves\",\"Navy\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m very happy with it. The shirt was exactly as described looks great fits great and I received many compliments on the shirt. To be honest the quality of the shirt was better than I had anticipated as well.\",\"title\":\"Great Fit\"},{\"name\":\"jimmy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Soft fabric, true fit, nice pattern\",\"title\":\"Awesome Hawaiian Look!\"},{\"name\":\"Bre███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Husband loves it, usually particular. So I ordered two more!\",\"title\":\"Husband loves it\"},{\"name\":\"MJM\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought this as a gift for a friend who loves Hawaiian shirts.  The colors were as they seemed in the picture.  The fabric is very soft and my friend really likes the shirt.  It seems to be true to size.  The downside was it took over a week to arrive.\",\"title\":\"Highly recommend  - great shirt!\"},{\"name\":\"Gal\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Pleasantly surprised with the good quality of the product at its price point. Love the fabric and print. perfect fit.\",\"title\":\"Great design and good fit.\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Nice shirt but runs small.  Suggest order a size larger.\"},{\"name\":\"sar███er\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Vendor has items listed for sale on Walmart.com that are not available.  I have to tie up my money just to find out I\'m not getting the item and get a refund.  I will not be buying anything from this vendor again and I may avoid Walmart.com.  Buyer beware!\",\"title\":\"Not available\"},{\"name\":\"Manu\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"not at all matching with pictures. very poor quality\",\"title\":\"this is poor quality and dull\"},{\"name\":\"Cis███aul███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"A\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,26.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Shirts\",\"Mens Casual Button Down Shirts\"]'),(426,'Womens Pants','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Summer-Savings-Wycnly-Sale-Capri-Pants-Women-Womens-Drawstring-Elastic-Waist-Capris-Casual-Plus-Size-Button-Straight-Leg-3-4-Trousers-Comfy-Cotton-Li_7a79f16d-7e47-416d-9de5-1a8b4dbf7fb8.2f048755094d25f4ee01c3781aa6b92f.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"XXXL\",\"XXXXL\",\"XXXXXL\"]','[\"Army Green\",\"Army Green pants for women\",\"Brown\",\"Coffee\",\"Coffee-1\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Gray\",\"Green\",\"Green pants for women\",\"Green-1\",\"Khaki pants for women\",\"Light Blue\",\"Pink\",\"Pink pants for women\",\"Purple\",\"Purple pants for women\",\"Rose Gold\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\",\"Yellow-1\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ath███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love, have had no issues with it so far. Material is cool and comfy.\",\"title\":\"Super Comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Abr███m\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought these capris for a beach vacation, and they were perfect! The cotton linen blend kept me comfortable even in the heat, and I love that they\'re solidcolored, so easy to mix and match with different tops. Highly recommend!\",\"title\":\"Highly recommend!\"},{\"name\":\"Bro███ick███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These capris are so versatile! I can dress them up with a nice blouse or keep it casual with a tshirt. The drawstring waist adds a bit of interest to the design, and the cotton linen fabric is just what I need for summer. Great find at Walmart!\",\"title\":\"Great find\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":4}]',NULL,7.77,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Pants\",\"Womens Pants\"]'),(427,'Tshirts for Women','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amoretu-Women-Hoodies-Tunic-T-shirt-Button-Swing-Pullover-Loose-Fit-Green-S_d4187e75-d69d-4476-bff9-d77bc02f0f33.2bf01b6ac3b9dcf5248f75060c57375f.jpeg\"',4.10,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"A:Apricot\",\"A:Black\",\"A:Navy\",\"A:Wine Red\",\"B: Black\",\"B:Green\",\"B:Purple\",\"B:Wine Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ros███nda███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Perfect for Chilly Days \\nThis hoodie is perfect for those chilly days. The long sleeves and hood keep me warm while the button detail adds a touch of sophistication.\"},{\"name\":\"sKi███ght███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Flattering Fit \\nThe swing silhouette of this hoodie is not only sophisticated but also offers a flattering fit. It\'s a unique take on the traditional hoodie design.\"},{\"name\":\"Deana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very soft, fits as expected.\",\"title\":\"Good purchase\"},{\"name\":\"mar███et ███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This top perfectly blends utility and fashion. The kangaroo pocket is roomy, and the adjustable drawstring hood is a nice touch. However, the fabric, although durable, isn\'t as soft as I expected. All in all, I still find it perfect for everyday wear.\"},{\"name\":\"bin███hil███g\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Light and Quality Sweatshirt \\nI adore this sweatshirt more than I thought I would! It\'s light yet cozy. Though shipping took longer than I\'d like, it was worth the wait. I plan on buying more in different colors!\"},{\"name\":\"Xef███h\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Warm and Soft Hoodie\\nI love this hoodie! It\'s warm, soft, and the buttons add a fashionable touch. It\'s versatile enough to layer a cute cami under or button it up to stay warm.\"},{\"name\":\"Gre███y D███an\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Superb Quality and Fit\\nThough this hoodie ran a bit large, I still appreciate the excellent quality of the material. The colors are beautiful, vibrant, and go well with just about any outfit. Plus, the enclosed braided bracelet adds a cute personal touch!\"},{\"name\":\"rud███rre███do\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I love this sweatshirt, but I wish it was a bit more snug. I ordered a smaller size in a different color, so I hope there isn\'t much variation between sizes.\"},{\"name\":\"Tara\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The snap was not even attached for the bottom button. Not sweatshirt material either.\"},{\"name\":\"Diane\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"didn\'t even look like the picture cheap cheap\",\"title\":\"poor quality really bad material\"}]',NULL,13.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Tshirts for Women\",\"Tshirts for Women\"]'),(428,'Womens Casual Shoes','[\"Reviewers highlighted: comfort, color\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SOUL-NATURALIZER-Womens-Black-1-2-Platform-Stretch-Gore-Arch-Support-Perforated-Tia-Round-Toe-Wedge-Slip-On-Athletic-Sneakers-10-W_f17c333d-54cd-4d94-919f-a964048be838.e844ef0070d609a5b33be4e2e06a785a.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"5\",\"6\",\"6.5\",\"7\",\"7.5\",\"8\",\"8.5\",\"9\",\"9.5\",\"10\",\"11\"]','[\"Black\",\"Mushroom Grey\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Spot or Wipe Clean\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Amali\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Light, comfortable, and good value for money. I have three pairs of Soul, blue. black and white, they are my favorite shoes!\",\"title\":\"Always fashionable.\"},{\"name\":\"Sandy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got these boots for my son.   He absolutely loves them.  They fit well and he is on his feet a lot with his job and he claimed they were so comfortable he forgot he had them on.\",\"title\":\"The boots by Sketcher are a terrific find.\"},{\"name\":\"Mil███mis███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"No break in. I ordered 10w to be comfortable, because of bunions...no problem! Would definitely recommend!\",\"title\":\"Comfort!\"},{\"name\":\"Tj ███LA\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These shoes were comfortable right out of the box. I could wear them all day long because they feel like soft hugs for my feet.\",\"title\":\"Soft Hugs for my Feet\"},{\"name\":\"Urb███arm███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are the most comfortable shoes I own. This is my second pair of Soul Tia shoes, because they feel so good on my feet and look good too. I\'m short so a little bit of a wedge is great. All shoes bother or hurt my feet, especially after a bad foot surgery a few years ago. (even sneakers) These slipons are the only ones I can walk in all day without any pain. I love the mauve color too.\",\"title\":\"Perfect shoes for me\"},{\"name\":\"Jenka\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'ve been looking for a comfortable shoe that isn\'t a sneaker for when I want to look more pulled together. Well this shoe checks all the boxes! It\'s gorgeous, comfortable and easy to get on. I\'m going to be buying in every color.\",\"title\":\"Great sporty but elevated shoe!\"},{\"name\":\"JudR\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I walk about 4 miles a day with 2 large dogs in a very hilly area of southern California.  These are one of the most comfortable shoes I\'ve ever purchased for everyday and walking longer distances.  I highly recommend. I purchased a wide width as they were more comfortable than the reg. width.\",\"title\":\"Happyfeet\"},{\"name\":\"Jole\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great fit and so comfy!!! I purchased a 9.5 wide! I wish they were wider so I could wear socks with them....., my sweet sweat a bit with the interior suede material. Can\'t wait until it\'s get cold so that I can wear them more often.\",\"title\":\"So comfy!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Qui███eto███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was looking for a comfortable casual shoe for a slightly dressier look than an athletic sneaker. I have a wide toe box and narrow heel, so lots of slip-ons don\'t work for me. The Soul Tia Slip On Sneaker is great. It\'s wide enough in the toe, and my heel stays put without rubbing. I wouldn\'t attempt a full day of tourist walking in this shoe, but it\'s perfect for a day with an average level of activity when a running shoe is too sporty. The dove/taupe color is a nice neutral.\",\"title\":\"Sleek and Comfortable\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I bought wide width but they are not a true wide. Feels like a regular width. Otherwise love these shoes!\",\"title\":\"Great sneaker\"}]',NULL,74.94,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Womens Shoes\",\"Womens Casual Shoes\"]'),(429,'Girls Dresses','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/IBTOM-CASTLE-Little-Big-Girls-Flower-Tulle-Dress-Princess-Pageant-Birthday-Party-Wedding-Formal-Floor-Length-Long-Dance-Evening-Maxi-Gown-6-7-Years-L_52d8bb57-85f1-4d9a-805b-b031a0212232.8da11f3d0dbd613dc7cd36bcf70e940e.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"5-6 Years\",\"6-7 Years\",\"8-9 Years\",\"9-10 Years\",\"11-12 Years\",\"13-14 Years\"]','[\"Green\",\"Light Green\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Rainbow Purple\",\"Red\",\"Royal Blue\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash in cold water, line dry, do not bleach and iron\"}]','[{\"name\":\"MAR███A\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really loved this dress on my goddaughter she looked so beautiful. the fabric was great and looks just like the picture. Will buy again.\",\"title\":\"just beautiful\"},{\"name\":\"Chloe\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i love it now my daughter is looking beautiful for her ball\"},{\"name\":\"Jes███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"we love the dress my baby girl loves it\",\"title\":\"10 out of 10\"},{\"name\":\"DeeR\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Well made and fast shipping. Thank you!\",\"title\":\"Beautiful for teen girl\"},{\"name\":\"Tam\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought it for my grand daughter she loves it.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful\"},{\"name\":\"Mo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Got the dress for my Granddaughter for a family black tie event !! The dress was beautiful and my Granddaughter was beautiful in it !\"},{\"name\":\"dee███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"bought it for my 8 year old daughter it was so 3 dimentional the floweres on it. when she twirled it was beautiful. she loved the dress. fit well. still has growing room.\",\"title\":\"gorgouse dress\"},{\"name\":\"Mindy\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The dress sizes are way bigger my daughter a 8 year old order her this dress my 12 yeah that big and wear it plus\'s the flowers on the front was hanging on some was miss can see where they was not in the box had to pay to have this fix up would not order from them\",\"title\":\"Flower girl Royal\\nBlue dress\"},{\"name\":\"gwen\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Candy\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,47.95,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Girls Clothing\",\"Girls Dresses\",\"Girls Dresses\"]'),(430,'Shop all kids','[\"Best seller\",\"Rollback\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Russell-Athletic-Boys-Active-Woven-Basketball-Short-Sizes-4-18-Husky_9a3fc26f-5832-4546-b25e-e8ac26cecc07.a37256e7d166ea39041120fe7eae847a.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"4-5\",\"6-7\",\"8\",\"10-12\",\"14-16\",\"18\",\"8 Husky\",\"14/16 Husky\",\"18 Husky\",\"10-12 Husky\"]','[\"Black\",\"Green\",\"Khaki\",\"Orange\",\"Turquoise\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"MACHINE WASH COLD, DELICATE CYCLE WITH LIKE COLORS, ONLY NON-CHLORINE BLEACH WHEN NEEDED, TUMBLE DRY LOW, REMOVE PROMPTLY, COOL IRON IF NEEDED. DO NOT IRON.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"soz███ess███29\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Boys two green Russell athletic basketball shorts. These shorts are comfortable and roomy. My son is wearing a size extra large which is also a size fourteen to sixteen. These shorts run true to size and fit him perfectly. For size reference he is 5 foot tall and approximately eighty five pounds. These basketball athletic shorts were a great price. The quality and style is also amazing.\",\"title\":\"Russell athletic basketball shorts\"},{\"name\":\"soz███asp███ter███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This Russell Athletic Woven Basketball\\nshort is a size 8. This fits my son perfectly. He is a standard size 8. The color is a nice blue and the material is comfortable and high quality. The elastic waistband is comfortable as well and stays up with activity. The price is very affordable. Overall, this is a great pair of active shorts and is a great purchase for any active kid.\",\"title\":\"Size 8 Russell Athletic Boys Woven Short\"},{\"name\":\"soz███wil███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"We love the color of these shorts. They remind me of an ocean. The black-and-white striped down the side is a great detail and across the bottom. They do say comfort fit, four way stretch however, my son did not feel that they were very stretchy. They do have a bit of an awkward fit for him. They are long in the front. We have ordered his typical size, which is a size 18 and they fit yet just are not the most flattering.\",\"title\":\"Boys ocean blue striped shorts\"},{\"name\":\"soz███tra███w\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these kind of Shorts. These Russell Athletic Boys Woven Basketball shorts are stretchy, easy to put on, good material, and comfortable. My 3 year old is wearing a size 4 to 5 and they fit true to size. I love that he can just slip them on himself and take them off himself, also. They are perfect for summer and it\'s nice that they are stretchy so hopefully he can wear them next year too.\",\"title\":\"Easy to put on and comfortable\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"These are super cute. The quality is nice. However they fit a little bigger for the size. My daughter is a true size 6 and these are a little too large on her. She can grow into them. If I were, you would size down one size, but the quality is great and the fit is great and the color is great. Everything about them is great other than the fit is little off I love the thick elastic waist band \\n\\n.\",\"title\":\"Shorts perfect athletic wear\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":4}]',NULL,9.98,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Savings\",\"Kids & Baby Savings\",\"Shop all kids\"]'),(431,'Womens Tops','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/JWD-Womens-Shirts-Casual-V-Neck-Tshirts-Puff-Short-Sleeve-Summer-Tops-Tunic-Blouses-Pink-L_4ada50e9-12a7-441f-be6d-736d9891e957.c2710f5daf1ccecdd8909aedd2ef40c8.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"01-Black\",\"02-White\",\"03-Dark Pink\",\"04-Light Yellow\",\"05-Light Blue\",\"06-Purple\",\"07-Dark Green\",\"08-Pink\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"CAS███LLA███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This JWD V Neck is really a great shirt.  It\'s light weight, sleeves to the elbow and runs true to size.  The quality of the material is fantastic, in that it appears far more expensive than it is and holds its shape.  I bought one to begin with and now I will be buying more of this line.  Looks great on.  Can be worn as casual or dress-up.  Love it!\",\"title\":\"JWD V Neck Top Is My New Number One Favorite\"},{\"name\":\"Ash███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Wears so well, washes nice and I can style up or down!\",\"title\":\"Easy to wear\"},{\"name\":\"Arl███ton███gai███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"A nice shirt at a good price!\",\"title\":\"A Good Buy\"},{\"name\":\"Jody\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The color is not as bright as the picture, but it is a sage color and looked like an olive color picture. None the less, it is a very nice shirt.\",\"title\":\"Very nice fit\"},{\"name\":\"EB\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Perfect for casual and work outfit\",\"title\":\"Great top\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful color and fabric. Fits well!\",\"title\":\"Pale yellow top\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This shirt is nice a lightweight and true to size. The patter is really cute and has a great texture. Seems like it would be perfect for work or even after work activities. Definitely  a great buy and it came with a really cute necklace as an extra bonus.\",\"title\":\"lightweight and great pattern\"},{\"name\":\"Pic███3\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Love this shirt! Fits to size.\",\"title\":\"Love this shirt\"},{\"name\":\"S\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Fits  tight. Material is interesting not my favorite\"},{\"name\":\"Mary\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Soft material but very thin - color very  dull and muted.\",\"title\":\"Fair\"}]',NULL,38.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Tops\"]'),(432,'Hand Soaps','[\"Reviewers highlighted: ease of use, refill, container\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Softsoap-Hand-Soap-Tablets-Sparkling-Lavender-Refill-Tablets-3-Count_4fdbf5ae-fc7b-4dc7-b5b4-68620a6b3e65.2d88f3c839048e7641a2901709d23ae0.jpeg\"',3.70,'[\"8\",\"16\"]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"drop in Fill a foaming hand soap bottle with 8 fl oz of warm water and drop in your tablet. Do not replace pump. fizz up Wait for your tablet to fizz up and transform into foaming hand soap clean hands When your tablet stops fizzing, replace your pump and wash your hands DO NOT SHAKE BOTTLE\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Bre███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I saw this on my Ibotta app, so I gave it a try. I clearly put too much water into the bottle BUT I couldn\'t find the fill line. Smells nice and foamed up nicely as well. It did feel watered down BUT I\'m to blame for that. I would definitely purchase again. My hands feel soft and smell nice even though I overdid the water. The pump worked well, unlike the many reviews that I have read. I really like that I\'m not using so much packaging when I need to refill my soap.\",\"title\":\"Foams up nice!\"},{\"name\":\"Sus███ac\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This really works and saves me money. Give it a try!!!\",\"title\":\"Economical\"},{\"name\":\"Louis\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the foaming hand soap. It covers your hands quickly and washes off completely. I will continue to buy this product.\",\"title\":\"Economical hand soap.\"},{\"name\":\"Bro███y\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Softsoap, if you are reading this, please improve it because I want to buy it. What others are saying is true, it foams good out of the pump, but as you rub hands together it disappears, which is okay but confusing for children who might think they don\'t need to rinse. The coconut has a wonderful smell, but strong. The largest problem I have is with the sun exposure warning and the burning! If you have a small cut on your hand, it burns like fire. And unfortunately my cuts don\'t heal instantly, so it\'s burning everytime I go to the bathroom! \\n\\nI desperately want a low-waste solution from Walmart for hand soap, I don\'t have to use another vendor, it\'s easier to get it from Walmart. The big plastic jugs are wasteful, but my three year old is telling me her hands are burning and it\'s discouraging hand washing.\\n\\nPut the regular soap refills in wax paper! \\n\\nAnd the cost of three of these tablets is outrageous anyways, so there\'s too many cons to continuing to buy these even though it needs to be workshopped.\\n\\nFix it and will buy more. Looking for New and Improved on the box.\",\"title\":\"Needs work but I want to buy it\"},{\"name\":\"Bri███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Mechanically, it functioned fine. No problems with the pump. The tablet thing worked out too. The problem is the soap. It is foamy but has no texture to it at all. Feels like plain water and hands don\'t feel fully clean after using. Lavender scent is fairly synthetic smelling. \\nNot great.\",\"title\":\"Needs Improvement\"},{\"name\":\"Len███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"FYI: this does not foam or clean your hands. The scent is awesome though. I followed directions etc....but the bottle empties fast and just doesn\'t lather on your hands. I love this concept and the bottle looks great in any bathroom/kitchen but they need to work on the formula\",\"title\":\"Doesn\'t foam, but nice scent\"},{\"name\":\"Mlc\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Pump gets stuck after a while. You have to manually lift the pump instead of it popping up on its own.  Refill line is on the outside so hard to tell how much water to put. Foaming of the soap is useless as it just disappears on your hand instantly. You rub your hands together and it feels like there\'s nothing so you have to pump 2-3 times to make it feel like you actually have enough soap to wash your hands enough.\",\"title\":\"Good try… but would never recommend\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The liquid does not seem to work as a foaming soap.  I have attempted to pour it in to other pumps thinking that I just had a bad bottle/pump and it was not the case.  The other reviews on this site seem to be from a script too.  I reached out to softsoap but never got a response.\"},{\"name\":\"MA\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I added less water than directed and foam was not thick, soap was watery. The scent was not great, more like a chemical lemon smell. The tablet idea is great but needs a lot of improvement.\",\"title\":\"Not great\"},{\"name\":\"Hopey\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"So I loved the concept since I had a foaming dispenser already. Seemed like a great idea to cut down on clutter with the small package as opposed to having the bug bottle of liquid refill. Problems are: no lather whatsoever my hands don\'t even feel clean; the smell is so strong it makes my throat hurt; incredibly drying to my skin. I have only been using this 3 days and my knuckles are cracking. I don\'t have sensitive skin so I really feel as though this product needs some work.\",\"title\":\"Worst soap I have ever used!\"}]','Citric Acid, Sodium Carbonate, Gluconolactone, Sodium Lauryl Sulfate, Sodium Benzoate, Fragrance/Parfum, Sodium Acetate, Ext. Violet 2.',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Active Ingredients\",\"values\":\"N/A\"},{\"type\":\"Inactive Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Citric Acid Sodium Carbonate Gluconolactone Sodium Lauryl Sulfate Sodium Benzoate Fragrance Sodium Acetate Ext. Violet 2\"},{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Citric Acid, Sodium Carbonate, Gluconolactone, Sodium Lauryl Sulfate, Sodium Benzoate, Fragrance/Parfum, Sodium Acetate, Ext. Violet 2.\"}]','[\"Personal Care\",\"Bath & Body\",\"Hand Soaps\"]'),(433,'Stickers','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Clear-Glass-Sheet-Flat-Photography-Kid-Stickers-Variety-Pack-Dessert-Candy-Card-DIY-Refrigerator-Sticker-Frosted-Selfvadhesive-Donut-Sports_b99998e9-c490-41ec-9451-646d61aeed78.91f28354477b4a5a34ef7be04bcdba51.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"One Size\"]','[\"Multicolor\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Diana\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,11.23,NULL,'[\"Arts Crafts & Sewing\",\"Scrapbooking\",\"Stickers\"]'),(434,'All Area Rugs','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Hauteloom-Casablanca-Collection-Living-Room-Bedroom-Area-Rug-Cozy-Moroccan-Farmhouse-Carpet-Black-Brown-Beige-3-11-x-5-7_5eba8ced-70d4-4348-a7a0-1d4bb6bc5d6f.cc9ea6a4c32d7f613264451761bf1864.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"2\'7\\\" x 7\'3\\\"\",\"2\'7\\\" x 7\'3\\\" - Brown, Dark Beige, White\",\"3\'11\\\" x 5\'7\\\"\",\"5\'3\\\" x 7\'\",\"6\'7\\\" x 9\'\",\"7\'10\\\" x 10\'\",\"7\'10\\\" x 10\' - Brown, Ivory, Beige, Cream\",\"9\'2\\\" x 12\'\"]','[\"Ivory, Beige / Lexi\",\"Ivory, Beige / Nalu\",\"Ivory, Beige / Nate\",\"Ivory, Medium Brown / Kami\",\"Light Brown, Charcoal, Gray / Maonon\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Lor███a R███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This rug is true in color with subtle striations of black, cream, & ivory with modern black linear zig zag design. Super soft underfoot. Placed under my 42”x52” dining table in 5x7 size. Very stylish.\",\"title\":\"Soft & modern\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This rig is the perfect neutral color. Amazing balancing of cream and white. The black abstract lines are a true black, non of that grayish yuck mixed in. It has little to no pile but still manages to be incredibly soft and comfortable to walk in. After returning 2 other boutique rugs I was almost ready to give up. Found this one and hit the jackpot. Perfect for my office!\",\"title\":\"Obsessed!\"},{\"name\":\"Jess\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I set up our new rug today and I am impressed!! The quality, feel, comfort and the look is top notch. I was a bit worried it would be too dark but it’s a gorgeous color. It looks great in our living room.\",\"title\":\"Impressed!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Joey\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was a little hesitant to buy this rug without any reviews, but this one\'s a stunner! The creams and whites are very vibrant in person, and it\'s incredibly soft which I wasn\'t even expecting. Highly recommend.\",\"title\":\"Love.\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This rig is the perfect neutral color. Amazing balancing of cream and white. The black abstract lines are a true black, non of that grayish yuck mixed in. It has little to no pile but still manages to be incredibly soft and comfortable to walk in. After returning 2 other boutique rugs I was almost ready to give up. Found this one and hit the jackpot. Perfect for my office!\",\"title\":\"Obsessed!\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This rig is the perfect neutral color. Amazing balancing of cream and white. The black abstract lines are a true black, non of that grayish yuck mixed in. It has little to no pile but still manages to be incredibly soft and comfortable to walk in. After returning 2 other boutique rugs I was almost ready to give up. Found this one and hit the jackpot. Perfect for my office!\",\"title\":\"Obsessed!\"},{\"name\":\"Tan███R.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This rug is so soft, I didn’t expect that but so happy with it. It’s lower pile so not super heavy and will need a rug pad so it doesn’t slide if laying on wood or tile. Colors match picture a cream and black rug. Would love this in a runner.\",\"title\":\"Great Value\"},{\"name\":\"Joey\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was a little hesitant to buy this rug without any reviews, but this one\'s a stunner! The creams and whites are very vibrant in person, and it\'s incredibly soft which I wasn\'t even expecting. Highly recommend.\",\"title\":\"Love.\"},{\"name\":\"Kelly\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My husband doesn’t like a lot of decor, specifically my taste. But when I bought this rug the first thing out of his mouth was “my whole body gets happy when my feet touch this rug!” So I’ll rate this a 10/10. It’s so soft! Looks awesome against a leather couch.\",\"title\":\"Perfect rug\"},{\"name\":\"Ele███O.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is the best rug I’ve ever purchased. It is thin but also soft. Lays flat immediately and great quality. So glad I found this\",\"title\":\"Best rug\"}]',NULL,67.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Rugs\",\"Area Rugs\",\"All Area Rugs\"]'),(435,'Mens Thermal Underwear','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Thermajohn-Long-Johns-Thermal-Underwear-for-Men-Crewneck-Set-XS-4XL_f050df26-9452-4fd1-b208-b5da6828bd13.2634915db11c9d04d04f1f322a4d8134.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"2X\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Charcoal\",\"Christmas Print\",\"Desert Camo\",\"Gray\",\"Hunter Green\",\"Navy\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable Tumble Dry Medium Cool Iron if Needed\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Swf███m\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These long johns are literally the softest ones I have ever felt. They are extremely comfortable. I got these for my husband to wear during the winter months because he works outdoors all day long. These definitely help keep him nice and warm. They aren\'t too thick or bulky and other layers of clothing go on smoothly right on top. These do fit very snug. My husband wears a 3 XL in his regular clothing but these I need to size up for him. Just pay attention to the size chart.\",\"title\":\"Very soft and comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"pet███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The thermajohn two piece mens thermal set. This ultra soft thermal set is micro fiber and is a size large in black. Large is 42\\\"- 44\\\" chest and 34\\\"-36\\\" in waist and they are cut a bit small. They are 92% soft polyester and 8% spandex. There are no annoying tags, have a plain neck, sleeves and legs. They are soft and stretchy and are static free. The fly hole is very generous. The innerside is a soft brushed fleece. This is a very nice set especially during this cold upstate NY spring. This set is made in China and available at Wal-Mart.\",\"title\":\"Thermajohn Mens longjohns\"},{\"name\":\"bob███0\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Or mine for that matter. Both are grey, (these do come in blue also), but the similarity ends there. They provide the same warmth, but with a soft, lightweight feel. Even on a cold morning dog walk, my cotton longjohns would feel damp, but ThermalJohns are moisture wicking and it works. \\r\\nSize XL looked too small, but when you pull them on they stretch into place and stay there. The bottoms were perfect, and can be worn under anything without that bulky, baggy feel. Also available as separate pieces, I may have gone 2XL for the top, but I was ok with the XL fit also. I would recommend at least 1 size over what you normally wear though.\\r\\nContaining no cotton, they are 92% Ultra-Soft polyester, and 8% Spandex, with a brushed fleece lining. So, the ThermalJohn set was soft, warm, form fitting and moisture wicking, and definitely replacing my old johns for most activities. \\r\\nA great product for sure, I wish I had these during my many years of outdoor fieldwork.\",\"title\":\"Not your Fathers Longjohns...\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███sa7███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My husband is very pleased with his Thermajohn Ultra Soft Thermal Underwear Long Johns! They are thick, stretchy and extremely soft! The fact that they are fleece lined is a huge plus, especially for the value! With the onset of cold weather, he is very happy to wear these and stay cozy throughout the workday.\",\"title\":\"Amazing quality!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Mom███ree███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My dad loves this thermal underwear set; he said they are comfortable and quality made. They outside is smooth, almost athletic material. They are thick but thin enough to wear under clothes.\",\"title\":\"Dad loves them...\"},{\"name\":\"DrJim\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have had Long Johns before. They kept me warm and dull. I put them on when I had to and took them off as soon as I could. They bunched up and never fit right. You have too, right?\\r\\n\\r\\nI got these Thermajohn Ultra Soft Long Johns with almost no expectations at all. Wow! Did they perform. They are lightweight and warm. They stay put on my skin, and they are very comfortable. I even lounge around the house in them. \\r\\n\\r\\nMy sweetie wanted to take a picture of me in them to post, but I am not that kind of guy. Here is a picture after they came out of the wash.\\r\\n\\r\\nYou will love these long johns!\",\"title\":\"Too Cool but Warm\"},{\"name\":\"Dal███960███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I have to say up front it is very hard to write a review for a product like this when the review is supposed to be done in such a short period of time after receiving the product, literally days. Any piece of clothing should likely be worn, washed dried, at least once or twice before I think you could really provide an objective analysis. That said, here goes.\\r\\nAt first glance and feel these remind me of a set of silk pajamas. They are very silky smooth on the outside but do have a nice fleece texture on the inside. Probably would be very comfortable to sleep in during colder weather.\\r\\nThese are made in China. 92% polyester and 8% spandex. They fit really tight. I\'m sure that the snug fit is intentional and helps the performance of the product and its stated purpose, to keep you warm, but I must say in my opinion the sizing chart is off.\\r\\nI am 5\'10, 195 lbs. I wear a 17 1/2 shirt and 34-36 waist slacks. I ordered the XL, which according to the sizing chart should fit 38-40 waist and 46-48 chest. Right out of the bag, before washing/drying they are very snug. Maybe they will stretch, although I imagine it will probably go the other way?\\r\\nThey are comfortable and probably would work well for light outdoor activities. Call me a skeptic, but this is not what I would be wearing under my hunting clothes in cold weather.\\r\\nTime will tell. I plan on revisiting this review after some real-life use.\",\"title\":\"The Jury is Still Out\"},{\"name\":\"Rev███er9███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The THERMAJOHN thermal underwear is first and foremost, very warm. It feels like a definite step up from the standard “waffle weave” thermal underwear that I have had before. The outer surface has a sheen to it that allowed a second layer of clothes to slip right over. The inner surface is fleece and was quite cozy. It is advertised as “Thick Fabric-Lightweight Feel” but I found it to feel heavy against my skin. It was almost as though my skin could not breathe. That said, I am sure that it will retain my body heat in even the coldest of temperatures. The bottoms fit snug around my legs, but it was too baggy thru the seat in my opinion. Likewise, the arms were a tighter fit than was the torso. That being said, the cuffs were loose around my wrists. I find this odd for a product that is trying to keep the heat in. And for that matter, the neckline is like a boat. I much prefer a tighter fitting collar to my neck especially in the case of thermals. I do not want to feel cold air drifting down the back of my neck. I do like that the hems were smooth and did not irritate my skin. All in all, I am okay with the thermal underwear. I will use it, but I would not recommend them to friends or family.\",\"title\":\"THERMAJOHN\"},{\"name\":\"Qua███yFo███eap█████████\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The Thermajohn Men\'s Ultra Soft Thermal Underwear Long Johns Set is a soft, comfortable Poly/Spandex Mix that feels like Fleece on the inside and smooth on the outside. It keeps nice and warm and is great to layer under clothing, however, the Pants are way to short for someone 5\'7\\\" or taller. We prefer to have Thermal Pants cover the ankle, so they can be tucked into the Socks and Boots in Winter, these here are more like Capris. Overall, the Thermajohn Men\'s Ultra Soft Thermal Underwear Long Johns Set is recommendable, but I would buy the Shirt and Pants separate to make sure the Thermal Pants I buy will be long enough.\",\"title\":\"Soft, warm, but the Pants are too short\"},{\"name\":\"Tom\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"They sent wrong size.  \\nDelivered Fri, Dec 18 (Package 3 of 3)\\nReturn or replacement eligible until Sun, Jan 17\\nDelivered\\nTrack package\\nThermajohn Thermajohn Men\'s Ultra Soft Thermal Underwear Long Johns Sets with Fleece Lined (White, 2XL)\\nThermajohn Thermajohn Men\'s Ultra Soft Thermal Underwear Long Johns Sets with Fleece Lined (White, 2XL)\\nSold by Thermal J Brands\\n$24.99 $24.99\\n\\nObviously they don\'t check there outgoing orders.  \\nIt\'s a fabric printed label, not a sewed in label, and you need a magnifier to see the care instructions and size.\",\"title\":\"Disappointed and Uncomfortable\"}]',NULL,39.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Underwear\",\"Mens Thermal Underwear\"]'),(436,'Belts','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/WHIPPY-Women-Leather-Belt-with-Double-Ring-Buckle-Coffee-Waist-Belt-for-Jeans-Dress_7d8ba8ff-c26c-4e07-b14e-7e59312cf918.62ec3195c6db783465a0bedddd69fc1c.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"For waist 24\\\"-28\\\"\",\"For waist 29\\\"-34\\\"\",\"For waist 35\\\"-40\\\"\",\"For waist 41\\\"-46\\\"\",\"For waist 47\\\"-50\\\"\",\"For waist 51\\\"-55\\\"\"]','[\"A-Black+Beige\",\"A-Black+Brown\",\"A-Black+Coffee\",\"A-Black+Leopard\",\"A-Black+White\",\"B-Beige\",\"B-Black\",\"B-Black A\",\"B-Brown\",\"B-Coffee\",\"B-Leopard\",\"B-White\",\"C-Black+Brown+Beige\",\"C-Black+Brown+Coffee\",\"C-Black+Brown+Leopard\",\"C-Black+Brown+White\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"KWH\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Looks great!  Nice quality and great price.\",\"title\":\"Nice\"},{\"name\":\"Ano███ous███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Got this for an event but the belt is super cute, and the shipping was actually super fast, came in 2 days early.\",\"title\":\"Great for the price!\"},{\"name\":\"Big███ma5███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Cute belts!  Love both colors.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"WHIPPY Women\'s Leather Belt is a beautiful accessory to any outfit. Well made, true to color, and the double ring buckle adds an upscale look. Great with jeans, slacks, or dress.  This is the second belt I\'ve purchased so now have both the brown and the black. Both arrived in perfect condition, well packaged for shipping. Order was processed quickly.\",\"title\":\"Perfect accessory for your wardrobe!\"},{\"name\":\"Lisa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great belts %26 so comfortable and easy to wear. Sturdy material and love the buckle. Just wish you could get all three colors in a set, more expensive to buy them the way they are sold. I had to have all three colors!\",\"title\":\"Belts\"},{\"name\":\"Susie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I just purchased these in the tan and black. They do run a little bit small but still fit. Took my outfit to a different level. Really looked nice. Higher end without the price.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful belt\"},{\"name\":\"Lisa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Just what I was looking for to bring my smarten up a notch. Love the clasp detail, very stylish. Love it!\",\"title\":\"Leopard belt\"},{\"name\":\"jan███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very good quality,  better than what I expected. I like how the buckle works. I  would highly recommend these belts.\",\"title\":\"Very nice\"},{\"name\":\"Cam███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Cute, functional, and affordable. Keeping!\",\"title\":\"Love these\"},{\"name\":\"Deb███h\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The buckle can be difficult to engage due to the design of the belt. Overall, worth the effort.\",\"title\":\"Decent value\"}]',NULL,11.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Bags & Accessories\",\"Accessories\",\"Belts\"]'),(437,'All Cat Food','[\"500+ bought since yesterday\",\"In 200+ people\'s carts\",\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SHEBA-Perfect-Portions-Wet-Cat-Food-Variety-Pack-for-Kittens-1-32-oz-Trays-24-Pack_ae893824-2bf6-4aca-acbf-26bce66fd931.fd22a33ed0f461e252a5ed65bc14ae5c.jpeg\"',4.80,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Feed a kitten 4-7 servings daily. Adjust to maintain ideal body condition.\"},{\"name\":\"Feeding Instructions\",\"value\":\"Feed a kitten 4-7 servings daily. Adjust to maintain ideal body condition.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"cri███t\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently got two kittens they love it\",\"title\":\"My kitten love it\"},{\"name\":\"Eve\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Our 17yr old cat began having difficulty eating soft dry food %26 even canned adult cat food. Was losing weight %26 no longer very active. Began feeding her Sheba kitten food %26 it made all the difference. She began eating again, even asking for second helpings. Loves all the flavors %26 is starting to put some of her weight back on. Looking better %26 has more energy now. She\'s an old gal, but we believe she\'ll be around a bit longer now %26 in better shape due to this new diet. She\'s so affectionate once again %26 feeling better. Thanks Sheba!\",\"title\":\"Great choice for an aging cat who quit eating!\"},{\"name\":\"Lissa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have 3 kittens and the runt just seems to need an extra boost. This is perfect for him!!♥️\",\"title\":\"Kitten loved it\"},{\"name\":\"Nan███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My Senior kitty Samantha no longer has her teeth ):  Sheba Kitten Paté has the perfect consistency for her. She enjoys it very much! I\'m so glad I found a food that she can delight in.\",\"title\":\"Great for Senior cats with teeth problems\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███ne\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"he really doesn\'t want any other foods I knew I was starting to give him too many options  damm...but I still will cuz I love him\",\"title\":\"love\"},{\"name\":\"Sha███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great food my cats love it\",\"title\":\"Great buy\"},{\"name\":\"Sly\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Very smooth pate, small portion size, opening the packet though seems to be a mess just have to find your best way with the leadt amount of mess.\",\"title\":\"Soso\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"There are empty containers packaged inside the multi pack\",\"title\":\"RIP OFF\"},{\"name\":\"bee███oon███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I BROUGHT THIS YESTERDAY. IT\'S NOT EXPIRED HOWEVER IT\'S MOLDED. I FOUND IT ALONG THE INSIDE OF THE TUB AND ON THE BOTTOM. AT FIRST GLANCE IT LOOKS LIKE A INSECT OF SOME SORT. PLEASE INSPECT YOUR FURBABY\'S FOOD BEFORE GIVING IT TO THEM. I DIDN\'T EXPECT THIS COMING FROM YHE SHEBA BRAND. I WILL NEVER BUY SHEBA AGAIN.\",\"title\":\"DISGUSTED!!!\"},{\"name\":\"diane\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"package was opened and is missing a twin pack\"}]','CHICKEN: Chicken, Water, Poultry By-Product, Pork Broth, Dried Egg Product, Potassium Chloride, Guar Gum, Sodium Tripolyphosphate, Fish Oil, Calcium Carbonate, Choline Chloride, Ma