dress .My grand daughter looks real pretty on Easter Sunday thank you\"}]',NULL,33.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Toddler Clothing\",\"Toddler Girls (12M-5T) Clothing\",\"Toddler Girls Outfit Sets\"]'),(456,'Premium Cologne for Men','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Hermes-Terre-D-Hermes-Eau-de-Toilette-Vaporisateur-Natural-Spray-for-Men-3-3-oz_065b47a8-7e5a-4845-9f7b-ac88351ffd8d.9c6996e4cd04fccceb35fd0ae3c10451.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"3.3 oz\",\"6.7 oz\"]','[]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Sha███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fantastic! Just 3-4 spray\'s and it last\'s full day\",\"title\":\"Great deal\"},{\"name\":\"1963\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought from Walmart because there are lots of cheap imitations being sold; and I was fairly certain Walmart would only sell the real thing, which is what I received. Note this is not the perfume cologne which is much stronger.\",\"title\":\"great price on genuine product\"},{\"name\":\"Li\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Really like the perfume! [This review was collected as part of a promotion.]\",\"title\":\"Smells so nice. Really like it!\"},{\"name\":\"Isaac\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great scent. Citrus and Vetiver.\",\"title\":\"Love it\"},{\"name\":\"Hui███g N███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Good! [This review was collected as part of a promotion.]\",\"title\":\"That\'s wonderful!It is the present for my husband.\"},{\"name\":\"slo███an0███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very classy and original scent, hard to find an \'alike\'.  This in principle holds for all Hermes\'s fragrances.  The price on Walmart.com (~ 43$) was superior to all other sellers.  Smooth delivery.\",\"title\":\"Excellent\"},{\"name\":\"Mat███w\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great scent not overwhelming.\"},{\"name\":\"Ye Y\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"its fresh and masculine without being too powerful. [This review was collected as part of a promotion.]\",\"title\":\"i will buy it again\"},{\"name\":\"Chief\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Very casual scent\\nNot a show stopper but will grab attention when worn in small settings\"},{\"name\":\"hum███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"FAKE PRODUCT VERY BAD I Wasted my money.My husband\'s Favorite Parfume but not anymore because this one is actually FAKE\"}]','Alcohol, Parfum (Fragrance), Aqua (Water), Limonene, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Diethylamino, Hydroxybenzoyl Hexylbenzoate, Citral, Cinnamal, Linlool, Bht',81.16,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Alcohol, Parfum (Fragrance), Aqua (Water), Limonene, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Diethylamino, Hydroxybenzoyl Hexylbenzoate, Citral, Cinnamal, Linlool, Bht\"}]','[\"Premium Beauty\",\"Premium Fragrance\",\"Premium Cologne for Men\"]'),(457,'Womens Plus Shorts','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Pntutb-Womens-Shorts-Clearance-Women-s-Plus-Size-Summer-Print-Five-Points-Cotton-Linen-Pants-Casual-Shorts-Rollback_d8735dc0-96f5-439a-beba-5560fbe9b2bd.202e7ddcd69281a46186ffa79d33a2f0.jpeg\"',2.50,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\"]','[\"Blue\",\"#7-Army Green\",\"#7-Black\",\"#7-Green\",\"#7-Khaki\",\"#7-Light Blue\",\"#7-Navy\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"tab███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"🤔...\\nthe blue shorts 🩳 fit is incredible!\\nstill.. Where are my green 🍏 shorts?\",\"title\":\"where is the 2 pair..\"},{\"name\":\"its███byt███g\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Tight in the legs, short waisted not true to size.\",\"title\":\"just Breathe\"},{\"name\":\"Mel███a\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I thought the shorts were a five pack and I got one pair also there see threw\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The shorts weren\'t a normal 2x and very cheap material AND can\'t be returned !!!   Very disappointed in Walmart !!!\",\"title\":\"3 or of shorts and 4 bras\"},{\"name\":\"RITA\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"NOT MY SIZE  SMALL. I ORDER XXL\"},{\"name\":\"Rho███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Rho███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Chr███ine███\",\"rating\":4},{\"name\":\"Adela\",\"rating\":3},{\"name\":\"Mad███ne\",\"rating\":3}]',NULL,7.19,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Shorts\",\"Womens Plus Shorts\"]'),(458,'White Sheets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-100-Cotton-600-Thread-Count-4-PCs-Sheet-Set-Easily-Fit-upto-21-Inch-Deep-Pockets-Solid-Grand-King-White_4f167707-8335-4b0b-8788-33d7138be1fb.e2fea14195e1435e2d146df8161b46e0.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"Alaska King\",\"California King\",\"Emperor\",\"Grand King\",\"King { 6-PCs Set }\",\"Queen { 6-PCs Set }\",\"RV King\",\"Short Queen\"]','[\"Black {Solid}\",\"Black {Stripe}\",\"Burgundy Solid\",\"Burgundy Stripe\",\"Burgundy {Solid}\",\"Burgundy {Stripe}\",\"Chocolate Solid\",\"Chocolate Stripe\",\"Chocolate {Solid}\",\"Chocolate {Stripe}\",\"Dark Grey {Solid}\",\"Dark Grey {Stripe}\",\"Ivory Stripe\",\"Ivory {Solid}\",\"Ivory {Stripe}\",\"Light Blue {Solid}\",\"Light Blue {Stripe}\",\"Navy Blue {Solid}\",\"Navy Blue {Stripe}\",\"Purple Solid\",\"Purple Stripe\",\"Purple {Solid}\",\"Purple {Stripe}\",\"Sage Green {Solid}\",\"Sage Green {Stripe}\",\"Silver Grey {Solid\",\"Silver Grey {Stripe\",\"Taupe Solid\",\"Taupe Stripe\",\"Taupe {Solid}\",\"Taupe {Stripe}\",\"Turquoise Solid\",\"Turquoise Stripe\",\"Turquoise {Solid}\",\"Turquoise {Stripe}\",\"White Stripe\",\"White {Solid}\",\"White {Stripe}\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Recommended first wash is Dry cleaning for longest color retention. From next wash, machine / hand wash is suggested. Do not bleach / soak. Wash dark colors separately and dry in shade. Recommended water temperature upto 40 degrees Celsius. Medium-Heavy ironing required after wash.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Xaw███po\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'ve had the Amay 100% Cotton 600-Thread Count Sheet Set for several months now, and they still look and feel brand new. The durability of these sheets is remarkable. The fabric has held up exceptionally well to multiple washes, and there is no pilling or fading. Even with the deep pockets, they remain securely in place on my California King mattress. I couldn\'t be happier with their long-lasting quality.\",\"title\":\"Built to Last!\"},{\"name\":\"Yis███ekn███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these sheets. My bed feels so much more comfortable and I slept very well. No complaints whatsoever ever. Would order again in the future!\",\"title\":\"Very cozy!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Brian\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay 100% Cotton 600-Thread Count 4-PCs Sheet Set in Turquoise has been a game-changer for my sleep experience. From the moment I laid down, I felt like I was sleeping on a cloud. The 600-thread count provides a level of softness and smoothness that is unmatched, making these sheets a true indulgence. The California King size fits my bed perfectly, and the deep pockets are an absolute lifesaver. I have a thicker mattress, but these sheets easily accommodate it, with no slipping or bunching up. The convenience of not having to readjust the sheets every night is a major plus.\",\"title\":\"Sleeping on Cloud Nine!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m in love with the Amay 600-Thread Count Sheet Set in Turquoise. The color is a dream, and the 100% cotton fabric is both comfortable and breathable. The deep pockets are a fantastic feature, ensuring a snug fit on my mattress. It\'s clear that quality is a priority with Amay. This sheet set has exceeded my expectations in every way!\",\"title\":\"Perfect\"}]',NULL,117.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"White Sheets\"]'),(459,'Cooling Sheets','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-800TC-Organic-Cotton-Emperor-Size-Fitted-Sheet-84X84-Fits-Mattress-Upto-18-inches-Royal-Blue-Solid_d0d3d703-f846-407f-9e84-9292ac621bc9.2112144cecf9d71278e14935722152af.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"King Pillowcases(20x40)\",\"Standard Pillowcases(20x30 )\",\"Split King (39x80)\",\"Twin (39x75)\",\"Twin XL (39x80)\",\"Full (54x75)\",\"Queen ( 60x80)\",\"RV Short Queen ( 60x75)\",\"Olympic Queen ( 66x80)\",\"California king (72x84)\",\"RV King (72x75)\",\"King (76x80)\",\"Grand King (80x98)\",\"Emperor (84x84)\",\"Alaska King (108x108)\"]','[\"Aqua Blue\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Dark Grey\",\"Gold\",\"Gray\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Ivory\",\"Lavender\",\"Light Blue\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Orange\",\"Parrot Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Sage\",\"Silver Gray\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"Teal\",\"Turquoise\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Recommended first wash is Dry cleaning for longest color retention. From next wash, machine / hand wash is suggested. Do not bleach / soak. Wash dark colors separately and dry in shade. Recommended water temperature upto 40 degrees Celsius. Medium-Heavy ironing required after wash.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Cha███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s not easy to find organic bedding for our RV, but this fitted sheet ticks all the boxes. The 800TC cotton is smooth and luxurious, and the orange hue adds warmth to the space. The fact that it can handle an 18-inch mattress is a huge plus. We\'re enjoying comfort and style on our travels!\",\"title\":\"Organic Luxury on the Road\"}]',NULL,69.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Cooling Sheets\"]'),(460,'Casual Dresses','[\"Reviewers highlighted: comfort, fit\",\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Mengpipi-Women-s-Maxi-Dresses-Short-Sleeve-Long-Casual-Dresses-Loose-with-Pockets-Colorful-leaves-M-US-8-10_05637275-e083-410c-953a-f12578ba83a4.fbea4e38722a852092133edade292004.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"S(US 4-6)\",\"M(US 8-10)\",\"L(US 12-14)\",\"XL(US 16-18)\",\"XXL(US 20-22)\",\"XXXL(US 24-26)\",\"XXXXL(US 28-30)\"]','[\"Army Green\",\"Black\",\"Colorful leaves\",\"Leopard\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Purple\",\"Royal Blue\",\"White\",\"Wine\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash and hang dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Lal███ve8███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I looked everywhere for a long dress and I wasn\'t expecting this level of perfect in a dress! It\'s the perfect length, perfect amount of stretch and pockets! I\'m due to have back surgery and this dress is perfect to wear while recovering when pants aren\'t an option. Love so much I immediately ordered another with long sleeves! Even came nicely packaged.\",\"title\":\"A must have!\"},{\"name\":\"Rae\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It was comfortable enjoyed the pockets for my phone.\",\"title\":\"Plus size\"},{\"name\":\"EsA███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Wore this dress to my son\'s graduation, and it was comfortable and true to size.\",\"title\":\"Nice Dress\"},{\"name\":\"Lac███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"was perfect for my sons wedding.\",\"title\":\"loved the dress\"},{\"name\":\"Tif███2\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fits perfect. Sinched just right under the boobs. Fabric feels so good and comfy. I love it.\",\"title\":\"Very satisfied\"},{\"name\":\"hon███lug███000██████\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"this dress is very comfortable and has pockets.\\nthe dress is very stretchy and thin, good fro summer time. you can use this dress for any occasion and you will look fabulous.\",\"title\":\"comfortable drees with pockets\"},{\"name\":\"Mam███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have this dress with the colorful vine print in size medium. I\'m about 5\'4-5\'5 155lbs. I wear sandals with it. I will say in the pictures advertised, you don\'t see the models feet I believe which kind of looks odd. It does kind of create this allusion that it\'s longer or that it\'ll make you look skinny… but I\'m sure it varies for each person. It hit the bottom for me but it\'s not like it completely hid my feet. It\'s very comfortable and there are pockets that I like. It\'s not too thin. The dress arrived on time. It looks like the picture. Like it wasn\'t too bright in person, it has a nice muted yet colorful look to it. I definitely recommend. (See pictures)\",\"title\":\"Recommend\"},{\"name\":\"ima███sma███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"fits true to size,  is so soft!  casual but can be dressed up with accessories.   would buy again\",\"title\":\"Love this dress!\"},{\"name\":\"KAT███A\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The dress I thought I ordered, based on the seller’s picture, is not what I received. The material is thin, not as long, and the color of the dress I was sent is different from what was pictured. Disappointed in this purchase. Not a good value for the price paid.\",\"title\":\"Disappointed\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███dri███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Nice dress but not the color it was in the photos.\"}]',NULL,32.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"Casual Dresses\"]'),(461,'Baby Girls Casual Dresses',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/2-Pack-Infant-Toddler-Girls-Blue-Floral-Knit-Dresses_b6e23d7a-02a3-4182-ac5d-4d85024dfa17.60bcaa75aeb682067e70fe79a769eb65.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"12 Months\",\"18 Months\",\"2T\",\"4T\"]','[\"Blue Floral\",\"Pink Floral\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable, Tumble Dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Bar███a B███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The material is fine, easy to care for, and the quality is awesome. My great/granddaughter will enjoy these dresses for a while until she moves into the next size. Service is wonderful and you can depend on it.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful Rose snug outfit for little girls.\"},{\"name\":\"Gen███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Me gustan muy bonitas excelente calidad\"},{\"name\":\"Diane\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So cute can’t wait to summer\"},{\"name\":\"ALI███A F███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"so cute can\'t wait to get these on her\",\"title\":\"so cute can\'t wait to\"},{\"name\":\"Joy███B.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\":u1F970::u1F970:\",\"title\":\":u1F970::u1F970:\"},{\"name\":\"ALI███A F███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"so soft and cute can\'t wait to get them on her\",\"title\":\"so soft and cute can\'t\"},{\"name\":\"Loida\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Soft material\"},{\"name\":\"Sha███Dee███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Shipping was quick, the dresses look exactly like the photo and the quality is 100%\",\"title\":\"Shipping was quick, the dresses\"},{\"name\":\"Vio███ K.███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Good material beautiful colors\",\"title\":\"Good material beautiful colors\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███.\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Very cute dresses, Just pretty short. Good quality fabric.\",\"title\":\"Very cute dresses, Just pretty\"}]',NULL,35.60,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Baby Clothes\",\"Baby Girls Clothing\",\"Baby Girls Dresses\",\"Baby Girls Casual Dresses\"]'),(462,'Womens Cropped Jeans',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Gloria-Vanderbilt-Women-s-High-Rise-Slender-Series-Tummy-Sculpt-Culottes-Jeans-23-Inseam_76348ad8-8696-40d7-8412-40493211b05e.6e5ba053d1042f29c8d7d608163ab17f.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"4\",\"6\",\"8\",\"10\",\"12\",\"14\",\"16\",\"18\"]','[\"Merrick\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"hea███rb2███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These are so comfortable. They are a stretch denim. They have tummy control so they are flattering. I like the color of the denim too, it will match all colors. I  received lots of compliments when I wore these. I am glad to see capris are making a comeback.\",\"title\":\"These are so comfy and cute\"},{\"name\":\"tin███9\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These culotte\'s are well made and have the proper thickness. Not too thick or thin-cane see through them and perfect for cooler or warmer temperatures. The tummy shaping effect is an added plus. They fit TTS.\",\"title\":\"White HOT\"},{\"name\":\"iri███48\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I received these jeans for an honest review. Sizing: jeans size 16, 210 lbs, 5,7 tall, apple shape (postpartum belly). They feel light, stretchy, very comfortable, however, i\'m not sure about the tummy control part. Maybe if I sized down it would be more of a tummy controlling effect. With that being said, I do have a big postpartum tummy, probably bigger than the average person my size. They don\'t feel too snug. Just for a comparison- have a pair of Lee jeans size 16 and they are a bit smaller. So if you have a smaller tummy, you definitely might want to size down. Overall very pleased with these. I have other pants from this brand and I love it, It holds for many years.\",\"title\":\"First white jeans i own, positively surprised\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I really like these pants! They are versatile and go well with various looks. Additionally, they are super comfortable and provide enough support in the stomach area. The color is perfect. The size is a bit large, but I like it because it gives me extra comfort . I highly recommend them!\",\"title\":\"Perfect pants\"},{\"name\":\"jen███ern███9\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] One thing about Gloria Vanderbilt jeans are they are constructed beautifully.  They are quality and comfort and style.  They are true to size.  I really like the culottes, I find them to be very flattering.  They have a nice stretch to them. Yoi can\'t go wrong with these!\",\"title\":\"Modern classic\"},{\"name\":\"lyl8\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] The denim has a great quality feel & good stretch without being too heavy. I love the color. The length comes right to my ankle, so not really crop jeans for shorter women, but fits fine and looks good with heels.\",\"title\":\"Great jean!\"},{\"name\":\"who███ell███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I love these pants, but they are thin and see through. Otherwise, they\'d be 5-star! Just the right amount of fashion and functionality, it tucks in on the tummy where it\'s needed most. Good sized pockets and great stretch! These will be great this summer!!!\",\"title\":\"Tighty Whitey\"},{\"name\":\"car███rae███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I couldn\'t share a picture of me wearing them because they were not very flattering on me at all.  While I managed to put them on, they ran a little small in comparison to other brands I\'ve worn, so a size up would\'ve been more comfortable.  I don\'t think a size up would\'ve made the fit more flattering however.  The concept of tummy control is great but not well executed as there was no support offered to help control the midsection. The fabric and color are nice and soft, and the length is great for a springtime look and feel.  I was just disappointed by the lack of tummy support for a garment that seemed targeted to help with that problem area.\",\"title\":\"Nice concept but no actual tummy support/control\"},{\"name\":\"nan███113███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These crop pants are very comfortable and made of a soft material . I should have gone down a size but wasn\'t sure how much stretch they would have. I ordered a 14 but am normally a 12 if there is some spandex/stretch to the material. They were not all that flattering on me because I am short and the sizing was off. The  bottom legs are flared. I could feel the tummy control material but it really didn\'t hold me in since they fit me loose. I like the beige color and the material, they are extremely comfortable for the summer though and can be dressed up or down.\",\"title\":\"Nice flare crop pant with tummy control\"},{\"name\":\"bab███uto███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I got this item for free in return for my honest review. I\'m not sure if it\'s because I got the wrong size (they had nothing smaller when I chose them),  but they were super loose on me and didn\'t give me that tummy sculpt look. I love Gloria Vanderbilt, but I don\'t like this style for culottes. If you choose the right size for yourself (go down a size) I think you will get that full tummy sculpting effect. I can\'t say I would highly recommend these, but they are worth giving a shot to try!\",\"title\":\"They are okay, but not my style\"}]',NULL,24.98,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Jeans\",\"Womens Cropped Jeans\"]'),(463,'Plus Size Tops','[\"Flash Deal\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/JuneFish-Women-s-Tops-Summer-Sleeve-Shirts-Eyelet-T-Shirt-Hollow-Casual-Blouse_d08118a1-096a-44cb-b83e-4ba2d9c04eee.6f97f0c6cce0bd94898f01544ad1279e.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Dark Blue\",\"Grayish Green\",\"Light Green\",\"Orange\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Rust Red\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Do not bleach, Machine wash or Hand wash separately in cold water, Dry clean.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Susan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very pleasantly surprised! The blouse is comfortable and the colors are beautiful. I bought it in 3 colors, white, light blue and sage green.\",\"title\":\"Great blouse!\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The color is even better in person. The material is soft and the style flatters the body. Great price for a good product!\",\"title\":\"Great Value\"},{\"name\":\"Tri███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The material is very soft and seems like good quality. I have not washed yet but feels like it will hold up well. Love the color and design. Very comfortable and cool for humid southern days.\",\"title\":\"Very nice\"},{\"name\":\"Car███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is my new favorite top! It\'s fitted around my shoulders and chest and hides my kangaroo pouch from pregnancy. Perfect for that in between stage while I work on getting back into shape. My bust is 39” and a medium is a perfect fit.\",\"title\":\"Perfect Top\"},{\"name\":\"Hei███oNe███bor███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Yes, this shirt includes all 3 aspects! It\'s such a lovely blouse, and I\'m looking forward to pairing it with a summery skirt. However, I can totally see this pairing nicely with shorts and pants as well. The eyelets in the fabric probably require a cami worn underneath, but I\'m fairly certain the holes are tiny enough not to be see-thru.\\nI would LOVE to see this available in more colors, and at the 11.00 price!\",\"title\":\"Feminine, Stylish, %26 Comfortable?\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Likes:  Quality, Design, Fit, Material And All the Compliments I get- I own 4 different colors. This is my Go To Top=I wear them with Tennis shoes and boots-Very Versatile!   You will not be disappointed!!!!!\",\"title\":\"Amazing Tunic-Hides all your Flaws!!\"},{\"name\":\"Leona\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Great fit, comfortable too. Color was supposed to be dark blue, but it\'s more of a corn flower blue.\",\"title\":\"great fit, inaccurate color\"},{\"name\":\"Mom███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I love this shirt! But, I\'m a DD and this shirt would look better if I were a smaller (breasted) woman (or if i wear a sports bra). It fit nice in the shoulders. Good material. Comfortable. Good stitching. True to size. It just lays funny in front if your boobs are bigger. Also, thicker material than expected. Nice!\",\"title\":\"Great for smaller top ladies\"},{\"name\":\"Kelly\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"There is no lining to the shirt so you can see through the eyelet on the entire shirt. Also if you\'re large busted, you might want to pass on this one as it has extreme darting at the bust area and it draws all eyes to the bust. The fabric is stiff too it doesn\'t hang but instead sits on the body.\",\"title\":\"Not flattering for large busts and see-through\"},{\"name\":\"Debra\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These tops looked so cute I bought 3.  What a disappointment! They wear like maternity tops, they are snug across the top of the breast\'s and then fall like a maternity top.  Not what I was looking for at all\",\"title\":\"Not as Pictured\"}]',NULL,14.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Tops\",\"Plus Size Tops\"]'),(464,'Shop Curtains','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-Rod-Pocket-Curtain-Panel-Draperies-Silver-Grey-60-Inch-Wide-by-120-Inch-Long-1-Panel_33b99fdc-7f36-477d-84c1-e82d972c218c.9a3212860a5acaa95d8d9e14a5b7a0da.jpeg\"',3.00,'[\"60 W x 108 L\",\"60 W x 120 L\",\"60 W x 132 L\",\"60 W x 72 L\",\"60 W x 84 L\",\"60 W x 95 L\",\"72 W x 108 L\",\"72 W x 120 L\",\"72 W x 132 L\",\"72 W x 72 L\",\"72 W x 84 L\",\"72 W x 96 L\"]','[\"Baby Pink\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Burgundy\",\"Fresh Green\",\"Gray\",\"Greyish White\",\"Ivory\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"True Red\",\"White\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Cij███ho\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently purchased the Amay Rod Pocket Curtain Panel Draperies in Beige, and I couldn\'t be happier with my purchase. These curtains are not only beautiful but also highly functional. The 60-inch width is perfect for my windows, and the 95-inch length adds a touch of elegance to my room. The beige color complements my decor beautifully. The quality is exceptional, and they block out light effectively. Installation was a breeze with the rod pocket design. I highly recommend these curtains to anyone looking to enhance their space. We\'ll be purchasing again from this seller!!!\",\"title\":\"Excellent Curtain Panel\"},{\"name\":\"Janis\",\"rating\":1}]',NULL,116.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(465,'Plus Size Tshirts','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Pntutb-Womens-Clearance-Women-s-Plus-Size-Solid-O-Neck-Loose-Short-Sleeve-T-Shirt-Pullover-Tops-Rollback-Clothes_835fb67a-0919-47ac-9fed-834d334888bc.ac63b020da94ed5d7955b470526af676.jpeg\"',2.80,'[\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"XXXL\",\"XXXXL\",\"#7-Black\",\"L(1)\",\"XL(1)\"]','[\"XXXXL\",\"#7-Black\",\"#7-Blue\",\"#7-Green\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Lisa\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"ordered a xxl got a child sized shirt.\",\"title\":\"not true to size so it didnt fit.\"},{\"name\":\"Angie\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This material is like a sports shirt and way smaller than it says especially in the arms. Very disappointed.\"},{\"name\":\"Mir███a\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"DA\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"DA\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":3},{\"name\":\"Paula\",\"rating\":3},{\"name\":\"Donna\",\"rating\":3},{\"name\":\"Tammy\",\"rating\":1},{\"name\":\"LISA\",\"rating\":1}]',NULL,5.79,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Tshirts for Women\",\"Plus Size Tshirts\"]'),(466,'All Runner Rugs',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Unique-Loom-Rounded-Trellis-Frieze-Rug-Ivory-Gray-2-x-10-Runner-Trellis-Traditional-Perfect-For-Bathroom-Hallway-Mud-Room-Laundry-Room_6eaa44e6-61f7-4f57-9cb9-3a1821bb378e.c0857d3aa3863f7f755a48d020257ebe.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"2\' 0\\\" x 10\' 0\\\"\",\"2\' 0\\\" x 13\' 0\\\"\",\"2\' 0\\\" x 13\' 1\\\"\",\"2\' 0\\\" x 3\' 0\\\"\",\"2\' 0\\\" x 3\' 1\\\"\",\"2\' 0\\\" x 6\' 0\\\"\",\"2\' 0\\\" x 6\' 1\\\"\",\"2\' 0\\\" x 8\' 8\\\"\",\"3\' 0\\\" x 3\' 0\\\"\",\"3\' 0\\\" x 5\' 0\\\"\",\"3\' 0\\\" x 5\' 1\\\"\",\"3\' 1\\\" x 3\' 1\\\"\",\"3\' 3\\\" x 5\' 3\\\"\",\"4\' 0\\\" x 4\' 0\\\"\",\"4\' 0\\\" x 6\' 0\\\"\",\"4\' 1\\\" x 4\' 1\\\"\",\"4\' 1\\\" x 6\' 1\\\"\",\"5\' 0\\\" x 5\' 0\\\"\",\"5\' 0\\\" x 8\' 0\\\"\",\"5\' 1\\\" x 5\' 1\\\"\",\"5\' 1\\\" x 8\' 0\\\"\",\"5\' 3\\\" x 5\' 3\\\"\",\"5\' 3\\\" x 8\' 0\\\"\",\"6\' 0\\\" x 6\' 0\\\"\",\"6\' 0\\\" x 9\' 0\\\"\",\"6\' 1\\\" x 6\' 1\\\"\",\"6\' 1\\\" x 9\' 0\\\"\",\"7\' 0\\\" x 10\' 0\\\"\",\"7\' 0\\\" x 7\' 0\\\"\",\"7\' 1\\\" x 10\' 0\\\"\",\"7\' 1\\\" x 7\' 1\\\"\",\"7\' 10\\\" x 10\' 0\\\"\",\"7\' 10\\\" x 11\' 0\\\"\",\"7\' 10\\\" x 7\' 10\\\"\",\"8\' 0\\\" x 10\' 0\\\"\",\"8\' 0\\\" x 11\' 0\\\"\",\"8\' 0\\\" x 8\' 0\\\"\",\"9\' 0\\\" x 12\' 0\\\"\",\"9\' 0\\\" x 12\' 2\\\"\",\"10\' 0\\\" x 13\' 0\\\"\",\"10\' 0\\\" x 13\' 1\\\"\",\"10\' 0\\\" x 14\' 0\\\"\",\"10\' 0\\\" x 14\' 1\\\"\",\"10\' 0\\\" x 16\' 2\\\"\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue Multi\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Ivory\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Gray\",\"Light Pink\",\"Multi\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Orange\",\"Pink\",\"Red\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"spot-clean\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Kai███n\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this rug and it\'s exactly what I had pictured in my mind for the space!! I have multiple rugs from Rugs.com so I know it will be durable and easy to clean!!\",\"title\":\"Perfect!!\"},{\"name\":\"Megan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I know it\'s not the ideal thing to say with the review, but I got this rug to cut up to replace my RV carpet in the living room and kitchen area. The quality was absolutely perfect and it is an amazing improvement to our RV. The colors are beautiful and it was exactly what I wanted. It was very good quality before cutting it up and would be a great piece for any home.  The price also can not be matched. Will buy from again for rugs to use for real in my home.\",\"title\":\"RV Carpet Replacement\"},{\"name\":\"pho███irl███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought two of these rugs for my outdoor deck to match my yellow Sunbrella sectional. It\'s a nice yellow gold color with white detail. Makes a cheery outdoor room!\",\"title\":\"Beautiful color\"},{\"name\":\"Alice\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I waited to review my Lattice Frieze Rug until several weeks & different weather conditions had passed.  I love it!  The rich blue color hasn\'t yet shown any evidence of fading, although hot summer hasn\'t yet struck us here in central Ohio  (my experiences with rich blue indoor carpets do, however, include fading). Rain hasn\'t appeared to affect it either.  I refer to it now as the \\\"star of my front porch.\\\"\",\"title\":\"Star of my front porch!\"},{\"name\":\"Vma███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought this for our family room. We have two little kids and two pets, so I needed something soft, durable, and easy to clean. So far it has stood up to the test. We\'ve only had it a week, but it\'s already been peed on, spat up on, and scratched by the cat, and you can\'t tell at all! Very easy to clean, hides stains well, and doesn\'t pull easily when scratched. Also feels soft underfoot. Great value!\\r\\nLiterally as I was writing this review, the dog threw up on the rug— no big deal, cleaned right up!\",\"title\":\"Great rug, great price\"},{\"name\":\"Hav███sed███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So far really like this rug and the look it gave the room!  It isn\'t the thickest pile but it under my bed so it\'s not a big deal.  The grey is very nice color and the pattern is great!  So happy w my new rug.  I bought 3 rugs from rugs.com the last month!  Great experience\",\"title\":\"A good change to room!\"},{\"name\":\"pho███irl███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought this to brighten up the TV room. It\'s absolutely gorgeous! Looks beautiful during the day with the sun on it and at night with soft light. Also purchased the rug pad for underneath. Not a super thick plush rug, but it\'s not what I was looking for. Excellent customer service!\",\"title\":\"Beautiful colors!\"},{\"name\":\"Ray███tas███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"After tirelessly cleaning up cat vomit and other accidents for 2 years on my similarly designed wool rug, I realized how worn it looked. The stains never came out all the way and it was snagged every where from cat claws. It pained me since I spent so much money on it. THIS rug is so much less expensive, provides me the same look, and cleans up beautifully. Within 24 hours of laying it down, I had a cat vomit on it and wipe his bottom on it. No stains here! It cleaned up like it never happened. Yes, it is very thin...just get a thick quality rug pad underneath. Yes, it comes folded and has terrible creases at first. After 2 weeks they are just about gone, just be patient. All in all, this is an excellent value for a 10x14 rug, and I\'m happy with the look and livability.!\",\"title\":\"Got rid of wool rug for this one\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███k P███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This rug is perfect for my stairs. I like the thinness of it, and the size is perfect for the wash. I gave it 4 stars because with this cut, the pattern is slightly off on each side.\",\"title\":\"Nice Rug\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I love this rug, but I could not get the rolls out it and it wouldn\'t lay flat after I put heavy items on each corner I didn\'t want to fall because rug was bunched up\",\"title\":\"Beautiful pattern\"}]',NULL,49.52,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Rugs\",\"Runner Rugs\",\"All Runner Rugs\"]'),(467,'Toddler Boys Swim Trunks','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Bagilaanoe-Toddler-Baby-Boy-One-Piece-Swimsuit-Print-Long-Sleeve-Zipper-Rashguard-Swimwear-3M-6M-12M-2T-3T-4T-5T-Kids-Beach-Pool-Shorts-Bathing-Suit_302ed03b-541b-48a2-ba62-a53026917c40.79d02dac1a5c7a2b9031092e621c4d13.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"3-6 Months\",\"1-2 Years\",\"2-3 Years\",\"3-4 Years\",\"4-5 Years\",\"6-12 Months\"]','[\"Blue Black Shark\",\"Blue Shark\",\"Coconut Tree\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"ber███ce\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Taffy\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Kelly\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Eli\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Eli\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,11.04,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Toddler Clothing\",\"Toddler Boys (12M-5T) Clothing\",\"Toddler Boys Swimsuits\",\"Toddler Boys Swim Trunks\"]'),(468,'Couch Covers',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/CHUN-YI-Stretch-2-Piece-Checks-Sofa-Cover-with-Cushion-Cover-Slipcover-XL-Sofa-Teal_dec80e7e-54ec-4a08-b2bd-9968419481e5.fa90147342a2191c168c52d77d2a69a7.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"Chair\",\"Loveseat\",\"Sofa\",\"XL-Chair\",\"XL-Sofa\"]','[\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Brick\",\"Camel\",\"Chocolate\",\"Coffee\",\"Coral Pink\",\"Dark Blue\",\"Dark Cyan\",\"Dark Green\",\"Dark Magenta\",\"Denim Blue\",\"Dove Gray\",\"French Blue\",\"Gray\",\"Ivory White\",\"Light Gray\",\"Light Green\",\"Orange\",\"Sand\",\"Smoky Blue\",\"Teal\",\"White\",\"Wine\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ela███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great fit, nice fabric, very attractive. Exactly what I was looking for.\",\"title\":\"Perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Cat███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"We just inherited a couch from a relative to go in our basement. We are going to steam clean it and this slipcover will look great on it. It has a lot of stretch, which is awesome. The fabric is softer than I thought it would be. Love the pattern too.\",\"title\":\"Super soft and fits great\"},{\"name\":\"seedy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Amazing couch cover. It is durable and stretchy, you can wash it too. Just know the size of your couch or sofa before you buy it. You will love it.\",\"title\":\"Couch covers\"},{\"name\":\"Jus███ssJ███ae\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Renovating my home and I can\'t afford new furniture so I decided to try these covers. Boy, I love it and it looks really nice.\",\"title\":\"Different look\"},{\"name\":\"seedy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is an amazing couch covers it\'s very durable and stretchy. So if you want something to cover your messed up couch or sofa this is the one for you.\",\"title\":\"Couch covers\"},{\"name\":\"Mid███tGi███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This cover is great from protecting your sofa from pets, children, and in my case husbands. Chips and salsa on the couch - no worries! It\'s very stretchy and conforms well to our sofa. If you add a few throw pillows you can hardly notice it\'s a slipcover. The color is a blue-gray.\",\"title\":\"Fits well and looks nice\"},{\"name\":\"Reb███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nicer than I expected.  A label on the back, or the front would have been helpful--it took me a while to figure out how to get it onto my odd shaped chair properly.  But it is good quality and seems to be wearing well.  Very pleased\",\"title\":\"Very pleased\"},{\"name\":\"Gba███i\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I have two young granddaughters and their dog visit every other week, so my entertainment room sofa was starting to show some wear and tear from spills and food drops, not to forget dog hair! So, this two-piece sofa coverup seemed to be the answer to the above challenges. It arrived in perfect condition, all wrapped up in a heavy-duty clear carry bag. The directions are in the carry case and very easy to follow; it is in two pieces: the base and the cushions cover. The challenge of putting it on the sofa, is all the stretching to make it fit correctly on the three-cushion sofa. The outer cloth material was surprisingly very soft and has a light corduroy ridge pattern design. The granddaughters and dog gave their thumbs and paws up for snuggling on it. I really like the soft Dove Gray color, as it blended well with the other room furniture; almost a neutral color. While in use, the cover does move around a bit, but was fairly easy to pull back into a sharper and neater appearance. The material is a bit thin, so time will tell on how long it will keep looking as great as it is. I requested the “Sofa” size and it fit a normal three-cushion size sofa, with a little to spare. It is made in China. I believe the material mix is 85% polyester and 15% spandex. I machine washed it twice in cold water and on delicate load; then dried it on low and took it out at the end of the drying cycle, so as to not create wrinkles – do not iron. I gave it a four star, as it did not come with any type of clip and stretch type of adjustments. Overall, a nice, inexpensive quick fix for sofa coverup!\",\"title\":\"Nice soft material, a quick sofa coverup!\"},{\"name\":\"Pam\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"It took me a little bit to figure out how to get it on my chairs.  It was quite comical, I had to laugh at myself.  I\'d get the arm on and then realize I had to turn it around.  After a little bit I got it on.  If my chair had been a little larger in the arms and back, it would have been a breeze.  Color was as pictured. I love it.\",\"title\":\"Just what I needed.\"},{\"name\":\"Amber\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The material is actually pretty comfortable, but the one I ordered was actually a size smaller than it was supposed to be. Kind of a bummer, since it doesn\'t properly fit the sofa I bought it for, even though I measured first. It *does* fit the loveseat I have, though, so it\'s not a total waste. It\'s also shaped to fit a specific kind of sofa, so be ready for it to look a little weird if yours doesn\'t match.\",\"title\":\"Runs small or wrong item in package?\"}]',NULL,69.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Slipcovers\",\"Couch Covers\"]'),(469,'All Area Rugs','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Festival-Contemporary-6-7-x-9-6-Multi-Color-Polypropylene-Indoor-Area-Rug_4d4df9e4-cf40-43c0-8fb2-d35cf9a9173b.498f01fe5963318829db529de0ca2bc6.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"2\' x 3\'\",\"2\'7\'\' x 7\'3\'\'\",\"2\'7\'\' x 9\'10\'\'\",\"3\'11\'\' x 5\'3\'\'\",\"5\'3\'\' Round\",\"5\'3\'\' x 7\'3\'\'\",\"6\'7\'\' x 9\'6\'\'\",\"7\'10\'\' Round\",\"7\'10\'\' x 10\'3\'\'\",\"8\'9\'\' x 12\'3\'\'\"]','[\"Multicolor\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Vacuum on high pile setting to remove debris. Spot clean with mild detergent and water when necessary.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jaxs\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The rug even more beautiful then the picture. The color are are on the darker tones and very rich.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful\"},{\"name\":\"Kbeau\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love this rug! Deep, rich colors, well made, very comfortable. It goes very well with gray, dark brown, and black furniture.\",\"title\":\"Very versatile and high quality tug\"},{\"name\":\"Amy███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought this for my son. Love the colors, really livened up his living room\",\"title\":\"Great colors!\"},{\"name\":\"Reg███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"We absolutely love this rug! It is everything we were hoping for and more.\",\"title\":\"Quality\"},{\"name\":\"Shi███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Luv the rug!! Got a lot of compliments on it!\",\"title\":\"New family room rug!\"},{\"name\":\"Bah███mam███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This rug is absolutely beautiful and it feels so soft when laying or walking on it! you can\'t go wrong with this purchase. After unrolling it and placing it on the mat I taped the ends that were rolled up to my floor for a couple of days. It lays perfectly flat now. i love this rug!\"},{\"name\":\"Mad███ine███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought a beautiful rugs this month & I like it\",\"title\":\"Great\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am enjoying this purchase.\",\"title\":\"Good colors.\"},{\"name\":\"Tri███7\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Bought this a month ago and while there was a small defect decided to keep it as I could hide the area in question. Good quality rig for the price and comfortable — our 20 year old cat really enjoys relaxing on it throughout the day, without it showing the cat hairs. Cleans up easily. The only drawback is our roomba a finds the colors too dark to manage and thinks it is sensing a “cliff” and errors out when trying to vacuum the rug. Other than that, we are happy with the product.\",\"title\":\"Good quality and price for our needs\"},{\"name\":\"Geo███a\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Beautiful rug goes really well with our decor. Only draw back is strong petroleum smell that permeated the house . The smell is gradually going away, but a month later it still has an odor. Delivery was prompt, we received it four or five days before estimated delivery date.\",\"title\":\"Festive landscape area rug\"}]',NULL,268.89,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Rugs\",\"Area Rugs\",\"All Area Rugs\"]'),(470,'Microfiber Sheets',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Ntbay-Premium-1800-Series-Microfiber-Queen-Fitted-Sheet-with-Deep-Pocket-Ultra-Soft-and-Breathable-Fitted-Bed-Sheet-60x80-inches-Mint_f2363e69-c9dd-4a67-89ca-33b0cc15a425.1b2a378ac68f10f7a986dafb9d62c213.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\"]','[\"Aqua\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Brown\",\"Dark Brown\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Ivory\",\"Khaki\",\"Light Gray\",\"Mint\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Orange\",\"Pale Orange\",\"Pink\",\"Pinstriped\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Sage Green\",\"Sky Blue\",\"Smoke Gray\",\"Striped\",\"White\",\"Wine Red\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"kelly\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"fit my bed pefect and it stays in place\",\"title\":\"fits perfect\"},{\"name\":\"buy███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Exactly what I thought and wanted\"},{\"name\":\"Lynn\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I created a hang out room for my middle school age grandchildren. I bought these for the mattresses, obviously. These have a very deep pocket, just so you know. I got mattress toppers to put on existing mattresses to fill in the space. The color aqua is just beautiful. The sheets are nice and soft. I did not want microfiber, however, I could not find the aqua color I wanted in a price point I was willing to pay. I am happy with them. It\'s the color I love. If you don\'t mind microfiber, then I would recommend.\",\"title\":\"Happy with them\"},{\"name\":\"patty\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very soft %26 warm almost like swade  nice feel !\\nFit well ! I\'m very satisfied !!\",\"title\":\"Nice quality !!!!!  Great color !\"},{\"name\":\"Riley\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"very soft and comfortable.\",\"title\":\"perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Pho███x\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This sheet is incredibly well-made, soft, and definitely worth the price.\"},{\"name\":\"Mara\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Wonderfully made, fits perfect\",\"title\":\"Worth the price\"},{\"name\":\"Dawn\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"just a normal sheet like thick cotten blend. okay, but not the softness and brushed texture i was looking for.\",\"title\":\"NTBAY fitteddouble brushed fitted sheet\"},{\"name\":\"Ann\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Dislike sheets they ripped the first time using them\",\"title\":\"Poor\"},{\"name\":\"wanda\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The sheet started ripping at the corner in one of the seams after one wash and a month of use. No wonder the price was so low. You get what you pay for.\",\"title\":\"poor quality\"}]',NULL,27.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets & Pillowcases\",\"Microfiber Sheets\"]'),(471,'Chocolate Bars','[\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Tony-s-Chocolonely-Dark-Chocolate-Bar-with-Almond-and-Sea-Salt-Vegan-6-35-Oz_3c6bd2b4-cefb-492f-ba15-7093ffd26a48.09452fb2522d2b9cd19199839fec97ba.jpeg\"',4.80,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Keep cool, dry and dark, but not in the fridge! Best Before: see side.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"mik███e1\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Delicious! My toddler thinks it\'s for him ….But he is going to be disappointed when he sees me eat the whole thing! lol. It\'s very tasty, way better than I thought it would be. The chocolate was fresh and had a nice crisp break to it. Very good!\",\"title\":\"Delicious\"},{\"name\":\"dan███l24███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This is the creamiest and best tasting chocolate bar I have ever had.  Hands down way better than Hersheys. I got the almonds and sea salt and it was the perfect blend of flavors.  This seriously made my week. So tasty for a treat and I definitely recommend it.  I wound up eating the whole thing in 1 day.\",\"title\":\"Delicious!! Best chocolate bar!!\"},{\"name\":\"ken███joy███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] WOWOW is this chocolate delicious. I\'m usually a milk chocolate gal, but this dark chocolate has the perfect balance of smooth, lightly bitter, and sweet. The salty almonds add a great crunchy texture!\",\"title\":\"On the Tony\'s Train!\"},{\"name\":\"han███r28███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I really liked this candy bar. From the moment you open the package the beautiful scents waft through the air making its way to your olfactory center. The salt is a perfect touch to complement the bar. I will buy this as gifts and for myself in the future.\",\"title\":\"So yummy!\"},{\"name\":\"tri███kay███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This by far was one of the best tasting chocolate. It was so smooth and creamy. After trying this, I had to buy the variety pack to try out some other flavors and they were just as delicious! Definitely recommend trying!!\",\"title\":\"Tasty!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] When I first received this chocolate bar I was surprised with size. It\'s a pretty big bar. The taste is incredible. You really can enjoy Rich taste of dark chocolate, and the sea salt pieces blend in to perfection with the almonds. The whole family enjoyed it. My youngest says he gives it 10 out of 10.\",\"title\":\"Best chocolate bar I ever had\"},{\"name\":\"jen███n82███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This was a little melted because it arrived in my mail box on a warm day, so I refrigerated it before eating any to solidify it a bit. I thought the overall taste was decent. I definitely like the small number of ingredients compared to some other popular chocolate brands. I would probably try this again, or other versions of Tony\'s, in the future!\",\"title\":\"Decent!\"},{\"name\":\"ltg███my\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This candy bar is amazing! I had never heard of it before and was pleasantly surprised at the flavor (was thinking it would be chalky or not pleasing to eat) I love a good dark chocolate bar and the added sea salt made it even better.It was bigger than I thought it would be too. I will definitely be on the lookout for these at my local store.\",\"title\":\"Very tasty bar!\"},{\"name\":\"tee███ye\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] My kids really liked this chocolate!! It does taste like a richer more premium chocolate bar. But even though it says milk chocolate it tasted like dark chocolate. It had that try bitter taste to it which isn\'t my fave 😔 bit overall it was ok.\",\"title\":\"Premium\"},{\"name\":\"its███kh\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] This dark chocolate bar wasn\'t bad 👌. It is not as dark as I like my dark chocolate, but it was ok for the quality and value. I kind of wish the almond chunks were a little bigger than they were, but still a good amount of it in it. The chocolate itself wasn\'t the smoothest, but that might have been my fault since the weather had been on the warmer side 😅.\\n\\nTwo things that I didn\'t really like as much about this chocolate bar would be the sea salt chunks and the splitting of the chocolate bar... First off, the sea salt chunks were quite big... 😅 there were bites where I\'m just hit with the salt, or the salt bit would be on the slightly larger and harder side where it feels like I chewed a piece of sand 🙈. I wasn\'t a big fan of that... Second off, it would have been nice if the chocolate bar broke off into more even pieces... the chocolate bar was molded with the Tony\'s chocolate name... so the pieces weren\'t even 😅 (just me and my OCD). \\n\\nOverall, it still wasn\'t that bad. It\'s a decent bar of chocolate comparable to others (like Hersheys  🤔).\",\"title\":\"Decent large chocolate bar 👍🍫\"}]','Cocoa Mass, Sugar, ALMONDS, Cocoa Butter, Sea Salt, SOY Lecithin, Cocoa Solids: 51% minimum',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Cocoa Mass, Sugar, ALMONDS, Cocoa Butter, Sea Salt, SOY Lecithin, Cocoa Solids: 51% minimum\"}]','[\"Food\",\"Candy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Chocolate Bars\"]'),(472,'Womens Tops','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Cueply-Womens-Summer-Tops-Short-Sleeve-V-Neck-Dressy-Casual-Chiffon-Blouses-T-Shirts-Tops_a0089250-7f7e-4363-8ee1-5f54bdee35e5.16172ccc2fd79de1b53915bd9363393d.jpeg\"',4.90,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"01 White\",\"02 Black\",\"03 Royal Blue\",\"04 FP-Floral Red\",\"05 FP-Floral Dark Blue\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand or machine washable, iron at low temperature.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Chr███ina███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am always a bit skeptical when I buy clothes online, but I have to say, I am Very pleased. The material is very good quality and the size is perfect and the fit is very flattering.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful and good quality\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I like everything about it.  The color and material is excellent.\",\"title\":\"Excellent.\"},{\"name\":\"Tammy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very nice affordable blouse.  Arrived on time just as promised.\",\"title\":\"Chiffon Blouse\"},{\"name\":\"Ama███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the print options on this shirt. Super light and flowey material, great for a hot day.\",\"title\":\"Light and flowey\"},{\"name\":\"Chris\",\"rati