e future!\",\"title\":\"I enjoyed this product\"},{\"name\":\"Gio\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I use carhartt work shirts for my jobs …. They are comfortable and thick material that I like very much\",\"title\":\"I can wear these type shirts for the rest of my life\"},{\"name\":\"kc\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have never bought clothes online and I decided to give it a chance. I am very satisfied with this purchase and I am going to make purchases like this in the future!\",\"title\":\"I enjoyed this product\"},{\"name\":\"kc\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have never bought clothes online and I decided to give it a chance. I am very satisfied with this purchase and I am going to make purchases like this in the future!\",\"title\":\"I enjoyed this product\"},{\"name\":\"Ken\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This shirt is not a flimsy cotton t-shirt...it is thick and durable, and the pocket is great for my glasses and pen.\\nWould recommend to anyone needing a good work shirt.  Can go from warehouse to a meeting and look professional at either.  Washes and dries with no wrinkling.\",\"title\":\"Great Work Shirt\"},{\"name\":\"kc\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have never bought clothes online and I decided to give it a chance. I am very satisfied with this purchase and I am going to make purchases like this in the future!\",\"title\":\"I enjoyed this product\"},{\"name\":\"kc\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have never bought clothes online and I decided to give it a chance. I am very satisfied with this purchase and I am going to make purchases like this in the future!\",\"title\":\"I enjoyed this product\"},{\"name\":\"kc\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have never bought clothes online and I decided to give it a chance. I am very satisfied with this purchase and I am going to make purchases like this in the future!\",\"title\":\"I enjoyed this product\"},{\"name\":\"Jamie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My husband owns five of these T-Shirts in different colors.  It\'s a durable t-shirt that washes easily and doesn\'t lose its shape.  He loves Wearing them on his days off, but they are also nice enough to wear out for a quick lunch or doing family activities.  They also keep him cool even though it\'s a little bit of a thicker tee.\",\"title\":\"Most Definitely\"},{\"name\":\"Kno███ead███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This tshirt is an amazing look especially for a. Giver guy. Great material and holds it shape nicely. DXL is my go to for my guys.\",\"title\":\"Definitely a great buy!\"}]',NULL,11.80,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Shirts\",\"Mens T-Shirts\"]'),(474,'Mens Pants','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Keevoom-Mens-Slim-Fit-Dress-Pants-Casual-Stretch-Flat-Front-Plaid-Chinos-Pants_3f58a30f-60e9-4278-9e62-01f347ed1196.512e854f7dc927dd7b81d8e95788672f.jpeg\"',4.00,'[\"28\",\"30\",\"32\",\"34\",\"36\",\"38\",\"40\",\"42\"]','[\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Dark Green\",\"Green\",\"Light Khaki\",\"Off-White\",\"Red\",\"Wine Red\",\"Blue T1\",\"Gray-X1\",\"Red G1\",\"Dark Gray G2\",\"Red T2\",\"Black T3\",\"Light Brown G3\",\"Gray T4\",\"Light Gray G4\",\"Gray G5\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash cold separately and do not bleach. Tumble dry low.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jason\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I can wear this pant for various occasions,and matches many clothes,good price.\",\"title\":\"I like it!!\"},{\"name\":\"Ann███z\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I absolutely LOVED these pants, and have plans to buy them in a different color. The fit was perfect!\",\"title\":\"Great pants for the price!\"},{\"name\":\"Scott\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great for the price. Stylish, very stretchy, and comfortable. The bolder designs definitely draw attention, but that is fun. Also versatile from casual to a little bit dressed up.\",\"title\":\"Stylish, Stretchy, Comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"her███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"they sent me the wrong size  ! very disappointed.\"},{\"name\":\