,'[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Dark Blue\",\"Dark Green\",\"Gray\",\"Green\",\"Light Blue\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Orange\",\"Peacock Blue\",\"Peacock Blue Shorts\",\"Red\",\"Red Shorts\",\"Rose Red\",\"Sky Blue\",\"White\",\"Wine Red\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"wil███m\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fiit was perfect very durable and comfortable\\nNice having 3 pockets as i ride bike as well as swim.\",\"title\":\"Very positive\"},{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"nice comfortable fit  quick dry excellent purchase\",\"title\":\"great swim suit!\"},{\"name\":\"Piz███oe\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great fit, very large selection of colors and sizes.\",\"title\":\"Super comfortable.\"},{\"name\":\"Jol███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nice fit. Great pattern. Dual zipper pockets!!!\",\"title\":\"Great fit\"},{\"name\":\"Joe\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought 3 pair......Perfect length and fit!! I will buy more\"},{\"name\":\"Abo███ott███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The short were short and did not reach my knees\",\"title\":\"Real short\"},{\"name\":\"Rasha\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"True to fit but a little short for me\"},{\"name\":\"Upi███yni███ame███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Stiff fabric. Hopefully it will relax as its washed and worn.\",\"title\":\"I dont lick the fabric\"},{\"name\":\"Tiny\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Make sure you order up by 3 sizes. These things are tiny and clearly not American sizes\",\"title\":\"Order up 3/4 sizes\"},{\"name\":\"cor███ia\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"We were very disappointed when we ordered mens swim shorts and received a lavender women\'s top.  WOW!  buyer beware....  At least Walmart  refunded my money today.\",\"title\":\"Mens swim shorts got women\'s top\"}]',NULL,18.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Swimwear\",\"Mens Swimwear\"]'),(477,'All Cat Treats','[\"100+ bought since yesterday\",\"In 50+ people\'s carts\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Temptations-Classic-Blissful-Catnip-Flavor-Crunchy-And-Soft-Treats-For-Cats-16-Oz-Tub_5f0241ab-a679-480d-adcb-eea3856cbd82.a900c924bbda921dfad458d2b95a287f.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"6.3 oz\",\"16 OZ\"]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"For an adult cat, feed 10-12 treats per 10 pounds of body weight daily. If fed as a main meal, feed 1/2 - 2/3 cup per 10 pounds of body weight daily. Provide fresh drinking water at all times.\"},{\"name\":\"Feeding Instructions\",\"value\":\"For an adult cat, feed 11-13 treats per 10 pounds of body weight daily. If fed as a main meal, feed 1/2 - 2/3 cup per 10 pounds of body weight daily. Provide fresh drinking water at all times.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Carla\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Amazing l love it my cat loves it and l will buy again.\",\"title\":\"Temptations love it ❤️\"},{\"name\":\"San███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Kitty\'s favorite nighttime snack, she loves it.\"},{\"name\":\"Aub███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was thrilled when my big canister of catnip treats was delivered. They are just purrfect!\",\"title\":\"Cheaper in bulk\"},{\"name\":\"Debra\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My cat loves them\",\"title\":\"Love 💖\"},{\"name\":\"Kim\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My cat goes crazy for these. she\'s learned exactly what the bag sounds like when i pick it up.\",\"title\":\"My cat loves these\"},{\"name\":\"Sil███OrS███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got down to a half of a little bag of these and I woke up at 3:30am with both of my cats sitting on my chest.. The bigger cat had his nail to my throat and in his other paw was the empty cat treat bag.. I told his “Ok, ok I got the point....” and the next morning I subscribed to the giant tub of the catnip ones. It would be in the best interest of your heath to just do the same.\",\"title\":\"Prey to your god you never run out of these..\"},{\"name\":\"aye███ppe███lic███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"my cat goes crazy for em!\",\"title\":\"addicted\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███l\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"It came in a box, I took it out and there isn\'t a lid. Not sure if I should return or what. You\'d think it\'s at least be discounted or something. Weird\",\"title\":\"It is missing the lid\"},{\"name\":\"Kek███nia███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"My order was Shipped in two packages, each one had one  item broken with the product all over the box. Not very happy that the order was delayed but to have this mess that I had to clean up after receiving it made me more upset! No bubble wrap on one of them....NOT WHAT I HAD EXPECTED AT ALL! CAN YOU TELL THAT I\'M MAD?????\",\"title\":\"Poorly packaged and shipped!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Kai███n\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Originally bought these in the catnip flavor, gave to my healthy cat, less than 30 minutes later she was puking and dry heaving all over the house. Thought it might be because of the flavor and the amount I gave…. Bought a different flavor and only gave her 1 treat, again less than 30 minutes later, and she was throwing up non stop. Please do not buy these for your cat, I\'m sure there are a lot more options for treats with better, real ingredients. No hate, but I know I\'m not the only person who had this issue from reading the reviews on here.\",\"title\":\"Made my cat throw up all over the house\"}]','Chicken By-Product Meal, Ground Corn, Animal Fat (preserved with Mixed Tocopherols), Wheat Flour, Brewers Rice, Dried Meat By-Products, Natural Flavors, Brewers Dried Yeast, Potassium Chloride, Choline Chloride, Yellow #5, Blue #2, Salt, DL-Methionine, Taurine, Calcium Carbonate, Dried Catnip, Vitamin E Supplement, Zinc Sulfate, Ferrous Sulfate, Natural Salmon Flavor, Dried Cheese, Mixed Tocopherols (preservative), Copper Sulfate, Vitamin A Supplement, Citric Acid (preservative), Niacin Supplement, Vitamin B12 Supplement, Riboflavin Supplement, Manganese Sulfate, Thiamine Mononitrate, D-Calcium Pantothenate, Pyridoxine Hydrochloride (Vitamin B6), Vitamin D3 Supplement, Biotin, Potassium Iodide, Folic Acid, Rosemary Extract',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Chicken By-Product Meal, Ground Corn, Animal Fat (preserved with Mixed Tocopherols), Wheat Flour, Brewers Rice, Dried Meat By-Products, Natural Flavors, Brewers Dried Yeast, Potassium Chloride, Choline Chloride, Yellow #5, Blue #2, Salt, DL-Methionine, Taurine, Calcium Carbonate, Dried Catnip, Vitamin E Supplement, Zinc Sulfate, Ferrous Sulfate, Natural Salmon Flavor, Dried Cheese, Mixed Tocopherols (preservative), Copper Sulfate, Vitamin A Supplement, Citric Acid (preservative), Niacin Supplement, Vitamin B12 Supplement, Riboflavin Supplement, Manganese Sulfate, Thiamine Mononitrate, D-Calcium Pantothenate, Pyridoxine Hydrochloride (Vitamin B6), Vitamin D3 Supplement, Biotin, Potassium Iodide, Folic Acid, Rosemary Extract\"}]','[\"Pets\",\"Cats\",\"Cat Treats\",\"All Cat Treats\"]'),(478,'Extracts & Flavoring',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Organic-Acerola-Cherry-Powder-0-5-Pounds-Non-GMO-Raw-Vegan-Kosher-by-Food-to-Live_63516bd0-d2f1-44f0-a216-e249a013bc60.a783769d3c4f74c5b07206a3c00a2030.jpeg\"',4.90,'[\"0.5 lbs\",\"1 lbs\",\"2 lbs\",\"4 lbs\",\"8 lbs\",\"12 lbs\",\"22 lbs\"]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Safe Handling Instructions\",\"value\":\"STORE IN: Cool, Dry Place\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mig███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Happy to get my vitamin c from acerola liking it so far\",\"title\":\"Vitamin c acerola\"},{\"name\":\"Jos███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It was seamless and unobtrusive\",\"title\":\"Flawless\"},{\"name\":\"Cyn███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Though I haven’t used the Acerola Cherry powder yet (I’m waiting until I use up what I have), I really like the fact that this has no anti clump substance added to it.  Just pure dried and powdered organic Acerola Cherry.\",\"title\":\"Looks good.\"},{\"name\":\"Joe\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really like the high content of vitamin c of 6000mg per once. that\'s about 225 mg per gram of natural vitamin c thank you so much for having the best product.\",\"title\":\"great product\"},{\"name\":\"Leah\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased this as the normal company I buy acerola powder from was out, and I\'m so glad! This acerola has a much better flavor and seems much more fresh. Highly recommend!\",\"title\":\"Great product!\"},{\"name\":\"She███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great organic product without additives at a great price.\",\"title\":\"Very Happy with Product and Service\"},{\"name\":\"Angel\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"For my dried mango smoothie I discovered that the Acerola Powder makes the perfect companion.  Not too sweet, just perfect.  Try it.\",\"title\":\"Looking for a balance?\"},{\"name\":\"Kyle\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is a wonderful vitamin C supplement.\",\"title\":\"Great product\"},{\"name\":\"Sam\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have to offer a review--what a fantastic powder, it\'s freeze-dried, so the potency is increased and the flavor is sweet and delicate, very pleasant to take.  I have searched and searched for acerola cherry powders, and this is the best one I\'ve tried yet, I\'ll always purchase it now from FoodtoLive,  Thank you, your product is perfect!\",\"title\":\"Exceptional\"},{\"name\":\"Phi███p\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This taste really good and dissolves easier than any other natural Vitamin C I have tried. I prefer drinking and taking supplements in spring water chilled to 38 degrees and stirred to increase the amount of exclusion zone water (H3O2) which I think likely improves uptake of any nutrients as well.\",\"title\":\"Acerola Powder\"}]','ORGANIC ACEROLA CHERRY POWDER',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"ORGANIC ACEROLA CHERRY POWDER\"}]','[\"Food\",\"Baking\",\"Baking Ingredients\",\"Vanilla Extract, Food Coloring & Spices\",\"Extracts & Flavoring\"]'),(479,'Womens Workwear Blouses','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Uvplove-Women-s-Sleeveless-Chiffon-Tank-Top-Double-Layers-Casual-Blouse-Tunic_be5967ed-5897-4fe4-bed2-6e1a86571408.9b586b675b7f2c67a5126204ee9b82c3.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"Amy Green\",\"Beige White\",\"Black Leaves\",\"Blue\",\"D Red\",\"Dark Green\",\"Flower Light Blue\",\"Light Green\",\"Light Pink\",\"M Red\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Navy Blue Leaves\",\"Pink\",\"01-White\",\"02-Black\",\"03-Grey\",\"04-Light Blue\",\"05-Royal Blue\",\"06-Wine Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash and Hand washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Geri\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"VERY COMFORTABLE, the fabric feels wonderful against your skin.  I plan to wear it with white jeans and black jeans.  Very versatile.  Lots of compliments.  Wash on gentle cycle, cold water in a lingerie bag, dried on low for five minutes.  Plan on purchasing another color.  Well worth the money.  Definitely a classic to my wardrobe.\",\"title\":\"Classic top %26 well worth the money\"},{\"name\":\"Memoe\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love this blouse.  It is comfortable and hangs well.  I am short 5\'  ,  and it fits true to size.  Very light and airy.  Cant wait for warmer weather to wear to work or out with friends or hanging out on weekends.\",\"title\":\"Great comfortable summer blouse\"},{\"name\":\"Susan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I found a blouse like this several years ago. (I love that it\'s long enough to cover the butt and fitted enough not to add pounds).  I have been looking for another one ever since,  so you can believe that I bought one in each color.!!!\",\"title\":\"Romantically simple\"},{\"name\":\"Sali\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s a simple yet beautiful top. I bought the light green. (Which is more like turquoise). Goes great with white jeans. It\'s more of a tunic length and covers the back which is another plus.\",\"title\":\"Love it.\"},{\"name\":\"Wal███tsh███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Just love this top, I get more compliments about this top whether it\'s paired with jeans, dressy slacks or capris, yes it\'s that versatile..\"},{\"name\":\"Jing\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"love it. The size S is perfect for me ( 5\'5 and 130 pounds). It is comfy and stylish.\",\"title\":\"love it\"},{\"name\":\"lynn\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"this top was inexpensive but it was what I needed. well, i was very pleasantly surprised.  The color was perfect, the fit was perfect, it was made really well and it arrived days early.  I will be ordering more in different colors!\\nI\'m told i need to tell you I\'m a walmart employee. Okay,  I am. Trust me, I wouldnt say anything if it weren\'t great.\",\"title\":\"very happy\"},{\"name\":\"Dee\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It is very long and I am 5\'2\\\". There are similar tops that are shorter on the Walmart page and I went ahead and purchased 3 of them since they are better suited for my height. However, I will keep this top. It is a good quality and beautiful color.\",\"title\":\"Love it but...\"},{\"name\":\"Deno\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The blouse is of good quality. The material is nice and resistant. The color is vivid and it is nice taylored.\",\"title\":\"Good quality\"},{\"name\":\"Sad███ma\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered a large for my daughter because she likes things to be roomy to accommodate her assets, they sent a small :(   The material has no give (we knew this) so the size was really important.\",\"title\":\"The company sent the wrong size\"}]',NULL,29.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Workwear\",\"Womens Workwear Blouses\"]'),(480,'NFL Flags',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Summer-Sunflowers-Tricolor-Sheltie-Flag-Garden-Size_7fee37d8-1364-48e8-bc69-136f2d72717a.17a11ec90e265f00d4915eaaac998cd9.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"11 1/2 x 15.25\",\"11.25 x 15.5 in.\",\"28 x 40\"]','[\"Airedale Terrier - Black and Tan\",\"Airedale Terrier - Grizzle and Tan\",\"Basset Hound - Black Tricolor\",\"Basset Hound - Lemon and White\",\"Basset Hound - Red and White\",\"Bernese Mountain Dog\"