nal Sports Team Flags\",\"NFL Flags\"]'),(481,'Womens Booties','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Dr-Scholl-s-Womens-Brianna-Ankle-Bootie-Medium-Wide-Width_8f4b865f-fecd-41ce-ac16-1005e8fe9334.2a639807cde5efdb945e9be65823518d.jpeg\"',4.30,'[\"6\",\"6.5\",\"7\",\"7.5\",\"8\",\"8.5\",\"9\",\"9.5\",\"10\",\"11\"]','[\"Black Microfiber\",\"Black Suede\",\"Dark Shadow\",\"Dark Shadow Grey Microfiber\",\"Gray\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Please See Label For Fabric Care Instructions.\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love, love, love this boot!  Super stylish and oh my goodness, so comfortable!  Will be getting this in other colors.\",\"title\":\"LOVE this bootie!\"},{\"name\":\"Sar███V\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Cute and comfortable. You can wear them all day with ease!\",\"title\":\"Comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Mam███thr███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very comfortable boots, wore them all day and didn\'t have any problems. I ended buying 2 more pairs in different colors. Worth the purchase.\",\"title\":\"Very comfortable boots\"},{\"name\":\"Les███ S\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these booties!!! They make every outfit look good -I bought one in every color!!\",\"title\":\"Awesome boots!\"},{\"name\":\"Deb███ V\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have a hard time finding boots that are comfortable. I don\'t like a high heel. I\'m a plus size girl and I\'m afraid of tripping and falling. These booties are absolutely the most comfortable boot I own. They are true to size and I can wear them all day without any problems. They go with any kind of outfit to. I have them in black and grey. I get lots of compliments especially on the grey ones. I\'m going to buy them in brown when they are available.\",\"title\":\"So comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"She███hll███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Cute but hits just at the height that it cuts into my ankle something terrible\",\"title\":\"Cute but uncomfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Meg███uli███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"\\\"The size of these items was too small for my needs, so I had to return them.\\\"\",\"title\":\"Runs Small\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"These are very cute shoes but seemed to be too narrow for me and I have a narrow foot. I bought these because I had a brown pair that were the same size but they just didn\'t fit like them.\",\"title\":\"Cute but narrow\"},{\"name\":\"Jo ███CT\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Beautiful shoes but run waaay too small. I\'ve worn true to size women\'s 7 shoes for 25 years and these hurt and punches my toes and feet all over too much to even stand in. Very stiff and narrow. Too bad, because they\'re adorable shoes. Will be sending back.\",\"title\":\"Very small and painful to wear\"},{\"name\":\"Meg███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These shoes are so cute but I\'m disappointed with the fit and insert. The front top of the shoe rubs terribly against the front part of my leg when I walk and bruised my leg after teaching in them for 7 hours. I thought that by ordering this style of shoe from Dr. Scholl\'s there would be a memory foam insert like the slip on sneakers I\'ve bought from them. I was wrong. The inserts are not comfortable and very thin. I\'m hoping that I can break these in because returning shoes is always a gamble.\",\"title\":\"Disappointed\"}]',NULL,69.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Womens Shoes\",\"Womens Booties\"]'),(482,'Womens Tank Tops','[\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Anygrew-Womens-Summer-Casual-T-Shirt-V-Neck-Sleeveless-Tunic-Tops-for-Leggings-Loose-Blouse-Shirt_ad4967e5-0e2a-454d-933b-161c05e00899.65bb94096dd33b6f4529252217bd2cde.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"01 Flower Mint Green\",\"02 Black\",\"03 White\",\"04 Flower Blue Lily\",\"05 Variegated Blue\",\"06 Royal Blue\",\"07 Flower Bean Red Stripe\",\"08 Flower Black stripe\",\"09 Purple Red\",\"10 Floral Light Blue\",\"12 Wine Red\",\"13 Variegated Rose Red\",\"14 Grey\",\"15 Navy Blue\",\"16 Pink\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Lori\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these tops, I have purchased three times in multiple colors. Highly recommend. Wash and dry wonderfully, just make sure to remove from the dryer promptly or hang to finish drying.\",\"title\":\"Anygrew v neck tunic\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this top. It is soft and moves with you even on hot and humid days. And it goes with shorts, pants and leggings. I would have liked it to be a little longer but I love it so much I don\'t even care.\",\"title\":\"soft and comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Z\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fabric is a very interesting synthetic and stretchy.  What I really like about this blouse is the perfect fit around the arms. I just washed it and it looks good.  What is even better that, when I wore I felt elegant.\",\"title\":\"It has a beautiful fit.\"},{\"name\":\"Sandy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love them they are both stylish and comfortable to wear with either a pair of shorts, leggings or jeans.\"},{\"name\":\"Gra███aB\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Roomy %26 comfortable.  Hangs nicely!\",\"title\":\"Hides everything!\"},{\"name\":\"Diana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really love these shirts. The material is like Jersey knit and are of great quality. I bought two of them. They fit me perfectly (size XL). I highly recommend them . Also the colors are vibrant. They are ad advertised and I got for a great price. Thanks Walmart!!\",\"title\":\"V neck t shirts\"},{\"name\":\"Viv███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This tunic top is great for summer. The armholes are cut just right so there\'s no worry about exposing too much when raising your arms. I bought two,will get more sleeveless ones for summer. I already have several short sleeve ones. All are comfortable.\",\"title\":\"Just right for summertime\"},{\"name\":\"WLJ\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I received my order today. I got the black one and a white one. They both fit great and true to size. I will be order a couple more in different colors. Fantastic price for a high quality product. I would definitely recommend these for updating your summer wardrobe.\",\"title\":\"Great summer blouse!\"},{\"name\":\"Da\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Solid colors have a nice fit true to size. The prints  look like they come from a different factory and they\'re smaller than the solids- order up a size.\"},{\"name\":\"Kgee\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The material is awful. I wore it once and the material is so cheap it balled up where my seat belt was and ruined the shirt.\",\"title\":\"Cheap material\"}]',NULL,39.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Tank Tops\",\"Womens Tank Tops\"]'),(483,'Shop Curtains','[\"100+ bought since yesterday\",\"In 200+ people\'s carts\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Mainstays-Blackout-Curtain-Panels-Set-of-2-Black-30-W-x-84-L_c2d63eea-27d0-4ef1-b108-f41be3f08bca.5da54edf8ab1cedccf6bd17956b380f1.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"30\\\"W x 63\\\"L\",\"30\\\"W x 84\\\"L\",\"30\\\"W x 95\\\"L\"]','[\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Blue Cove\",\"Blue Moonlight\",\"Blue Quartz\",\"Botanical Blue\",\"Botanical Gray\",\"Brick Red\",\"Burgundy\",\"Dark Teal Blue\",\"Golden Sunshine\",\"Gray\",\"Grey Dawn\",\"Ikat Blue\",\"Medallion Black\",\"Medallion Brick Red\",\"Medallion Burgundy\",\"Medallion Dark Teal Blue\",\"Medallion Gray\",\"Red Sedona\",\"Taupe\",\"Teal Blue\",\"Terracotta\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash cold; Line Dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Aeris\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really like these curtains! First of all, the design is really beautiful. I like the dark color of it that helps block out light. I also really like the texture of the fabric. It\'s much more...slippery? They\'re not super thick, but they do a pretty good job blocking light and are comfortable and look nice.\",\"title\":\"Nice looking (and feeling) curtains!\"},{\"name\":\"Nie███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really like these blackout gray curtains from Mainstays. The decor is very cute. They are  energy efficient. The pocket rods holds small to large size rods. It comes with two panels and not just 1. There 84 inches, big enough for my living room window. And it\'s made from 50% recycled polyester. I would definitely recommend these.\",\"title\":\"Curtains\"},{\"name\":\"Tina\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"they are amazing curtains and during the summer keep the place cool during the winter keep it warmer. plus if a person suffers from migraines the curtains keep your room dark so you can rest and get over your migraine. best curtains I give them as gifts and have some they help me with my migraines.\",\"title\":\"Great Deal!!!!!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Dag███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Ordered these blackout curtains before, like them a lot and ordered another set. Arrived but didn\'t have the black lining as the first set. Thinking it was a glitch exchanged for a new set. Set arrived and again no black lining, clueless as to why. Other than that everything else went great.\",\"title\":\"Not the same as the first set\"},{\"name\":\"Jisp\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I purchased 3 sets, all to be hung side by side, unfortunately even thou the same item 2 have a grey back and 1  a proper black. this effectively shows when the sun hits, as they filter or \\\"blackout\\\" the light so differently.\",\"title\":\"Not all made the same\"},{\"name\":\"Jason\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I ordered these because the title said blackout curtains, but these are not true blackout curtains you can still see sunlight through them, the photo i include is in a dark room and as you can see the sinlight is coming through pretty good, so no not true blackout curtains.\",\"title\":\"Not true Blackout curtains\"},{\"name\":\"Tay███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Definitely NOT BLACKOUT . Decent price but was not even close to being blackout curtains . Still can see through them a good bit so keep that in mind . I needed these in a pinch so it works for now but next summer I\'ll definitely have to get better ones\",\"title\":\"Not blackout\"},{\"name\":\"LT\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"They\'re not even close to being black out curtains. The picture is with the lights off and the sun shining towards the window. The only reason the picture looks slightly better is bc I ended up layering one curtain over the other.\",\"title\":\"Not black out curtains\"},{\"name\":\"Darla\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Totally misled by this item as title states Mainstays Blackout Curtain Panel Pair, Set of 2, Burgundy, 30\\\"W x 63\\\"L curtains came are room darkening NOT blackout.  I shouldn\'t have to scroll thru everything in ad I should be able to go by title.  but noooo in pics and other place they state room darkening but title says blackout. \\npic is of exactly what the title states.  misleading.\",\"title\":\"NOT BLACKOUT CURTAINS\"},{\"name\":\"Sam\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These are not blackout curtains. They are one thin piece of black fabric folded on the edges and sewed. You can see sun through them. If there is bright light on one side and dark on the other you can make out shapes, ie don\'t trust that you have privacy with these curtains. The pictures attached were not in direct sunlight.\",\"title\":\"Not blackout\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(484,'Plus Size Lingerie',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/3-Packs-Womens-Plus-Sizes-Basic-Solid-Long-Length-Adjustable-Spaghetti-Strap-Tank-Tops_cc2f3f40-6a8c-43de-9d83-128bd7a221b5_1.3abe9ec8c83fa24f7c6b84dfdacf6819.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"1X\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\",\"1XL\"]','[\"3PK - BLACK/CHARCOAL/WHITE\",\"3PK - BLACK/DEEP JUNGLE/WHITE\",\"3PK - BLACK/H GREY/WHITE\",\"3PK - BLACK/NAVY/WHITE\",\"3PK - BLACK/OATMEAL/WHITE\",\"3PK - BLACK/RED/WHITE\",\"3PK - BLACK/TAUPE/WHITE\",\"3PK - CHARCOAL/H GREY/OATMEAL\",\"3PK - DEEP JUNGLE/NAVY/RED\",\"3PK - NAVY/TAUPE/RED\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mic███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Comfort, adjustable straps, length👍\"},{\"name\":\"Rosa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"True to size. Very comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Susan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Loved these! I\'m tall (5\'10\\\") with a longer torso, and it can be difficult to find tank tops that are long enough, but these were great! The quality is good,  as was the color selection. Would recommend them!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are perfect for my needs. I\'ve worn the Costco brand for years. These camisoles are much better. The quality can\'t be beat and the three pack is a bargain, since I wear them every day and night. They are very soft and comfortable. I will be ordering more in the future. I am extremely happy with my purchase and will highly recommend these camisoles to my family and friends. They would make a great gift to any woman you know.\",\"title\":\"LOVE THESE CAMISOLES\"},{\"name\":\"Cha███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The bot works great but they want to charge you  to use the program with it .  That there would be a continual charge to access all the features was not made clear up front.\",\"title\":\"ion bot\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"My wife says they\'re excellent quality %26 they stretch, yet true to size. but as with cotton, mostly gotten they\'re going to stretch and eventually not hold their shape. But you have to expect that with cotton. The material itself and the straps could be a little bit more reinforced and thicker.\",\"title\":\"My wife would say...\"},{\"name\":\"Jus███oth███ust█████████\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"These are made a of a very thin, cheap feeling fabric. The cloth has a dry feel to it. It\'s not soft like other under slips. For this quality I would expect it to just be a few dollars. Clearly quality is slipping, big time.\",\"title\":\"Cheap and flimsy material, barely anything to it\"},{\"name\":\"Julee\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"25 dollars for 3 tank tops that roll up and i could have paid 12 or less for better quality. ridiculous i wantvmy money back but since ive tried them its not possible. total rip off\"},{\"name\":\"Mir\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These are super small, no stretch in them, plain cotton and are huge\",\"title\":\"Not the best\"},{\"name\":\"Diane\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I I thought it was going to have a built-in bra or at least a flat shelf to Support and it didn\'t have anything!!\",\"title\":\"Horrible product\"}]',NULL,24.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Plus Size Bras, Panties, & Lingerie\",\"Plus Size Lingerie\",\"Plus Size Lingerie\"]'),(485,'Womens Shoes','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Dearfoams-Women-s-Darcy-Quilted-Cuff-Velour-Clog-House-Slipper_cbddda18-0fa3-48c8-9422-382229bceed8.1b0d4495b05cb975c89f9d3c6b3e82a3.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"SW\",\"S (5-6)\",\"M (7-8)\",\"L (9-10)\",\"XL (11-12)\",\"XXL (13-14)\"]','[\"Aubergine\",\"Black\",\"Eventide\",\"Pale Mauve\",\"Peacoat\",\"Potting Soil\",\"Sleet\",\"Smokey Purple\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Spot Clean and Lay Flat to Dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Bar███47\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I like the roomy toes in the wide size , too many  others are too narrow ! The shoes are soft and luxurious!\",\"title\":\"Blue soft and comfortable house shoes\"},{\"name\":\"Abi███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These slippers are very comfortable. They have held up after washing and regular every day use for about two months since I\'ve had them. Would recommend they are very soft!\",\"title\":\"Very comfy slippers\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███omP███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These slippers are very soft and comfortable on your feet.Im glad  these came in wide width because most slippers do not come in wide width.If you want a very comfortable slipper, order these , you will love them like I do.\",\"title\":\"Women\'s Darcy Microfiber Velour Clog\"},{\"name\":\"Sio███ie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"After purchasing 3 other separate pair, I bought my Dearfoam\'s and after two weeks they have still retained their spring to provide the much-needed cushioning for all the moving I\'m doing about my house.\",\"title\":\"Retain their spring\"},{\"name\":\"Prue\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the warmth and the texture but as suggested I went up to a 9 since I wear an 8-1/2 and really wish I had gone down to the 8 instead.  They are a little large unless I have socks on with them so it\'s hard to keep them on when I walk, other than that, I really like them a lot!\",\"title\":\"VERY comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Mare\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"comfort - size perfect - this  is the onle slipper I ever buy.  been wearing dearfoam over 15 years.   they also keep their shape while so many others do not..\",\"title\":\"awesome!!\"},{\"name\":\"Kor███3\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I would give a 5 star as these are the only slippers I buy but this pair has a defect in on the sole. I didn\'t contact the company because I didn\'t want to send them back and wait another 3 weeks.\",\"title\":\"So comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Mam███iz\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This is the 3rd pair of Dearfoam slippers I have purchased.  I loved my first ones so I bought a second pair.  I had them about 6 mos and needed to wash them so I  put them in my washer on delicate, cold wash, slow spin and the sole fell apart!!  They were pretty new and I  followed laundry instruction so I figured it was a fluke.  I ordered another pair (I have short wide feet, hard to fit).  They are so comfortable from the very start but enjoy them while you can.  I spilled on them and decided, with much hesitation, to launder them.  I started to put them in the washer and noticed they were falling apart and they were about 2-3 months old!!  I did try to launder them on delicate, cold no spin cycle.  You can see the result in the picture.  That\'s two almost new pairs of Darcy style, there won\'t be a third!!  I didn\'t save the recipe so I am out the price of both pairs.\",\"title\":\"Disappointed a second time!\"},{\"name\":\"Lis███10\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I\'ve had these for a couple of years. Only worn indoors, when I actually wore them. The bottoms of the slippers are breaking apart. I could barely feel any cushion inside . No support at all. I\'ve bought cheaper slippers than this, that lasted a lot longer.\",\"title\":\"Not very comfortable\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I bought two pairs two weeks ago. I have been buying this product for a long time and have always been pleased. This time the tan suppliers became soiled. I washed them according to the instructions and they fell apart . See picture.\",\"title\":\"Fell apart in washer\"}]',NULL,36.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Womens Shoes\",\"Womens Shoes\"]'),(486,'All Area Rugs','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Luxe-Weavers-Shag-Plush-Geometric-Red-8x10-Area-Rug-Indoor-Carpet_6cd0e3ba-14b5-485e-8270-21d1ccaf7c1a.8106ac7a9aae3c59b00ba7172bbfd00d.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"5\' x 7\'\",\"8\' x 10\'\"]','[\"Brown\",\"Gray\",\"Pink\",\"Red\",\"Turquoise\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Vacuum without a beater bar; Spot-clean with a mild carpet cleaner solution\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Sha███ua\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love it, my vision is complete!\",\"title\":\"But it!\"},{\"name\":\"Bon███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,199.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Rugs\",\"Area Rugs\",\"All Area Rugs\"]'),(487,'Plus Size Pants','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Roaman-s-Women-s-Plus-Size-Petite-Invisible-Stretch-Contour-Capri-Jean-42-W-Ocean_ecd36142-404d-4c07-a5c2-3d9dc6ee2884.9b4b08991757fbdf165e342c7be515b0.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"14W\",\"16W\",\"18W\",\"20W\",\"22W\",\"24W\",\"26W\",\"28W\",\"30W\",\"32W\",\"34W\",\"12W\",\"36 W\",\"38 W\",\"40 W\",\"42 W\",\"44 W\"]','[\"Banana\",\"Black Denim\",\"Chocolate Flowy Animal\",\"Dark Wash\",\"Medium Wash\",\"Ocean\",\"White Denim\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"CIN███E\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the fit and comfort of these capris! They wash up well and retain their fit and they have pockets, which I like.\",\"title\":\"Great fit and comfort!\"},{\"name\":\"Lau███D\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Is a really nice capri pants, the color I choose was black and i really like it, is really comfy and fit good overall.\",\"title\":\"Good fit\"},{\"name\":\"BEC███H\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These capris are the perfect fit!  I wear a size 22, and had wondered if they would be too tight in the thighs and around the knees, but they are so comfortable and flattering.  I first ordered Women\'s Petite for the shorter inseam, but they are also shorter in the rise, so the waist always pulled down in back.  So I switched to the regular Women\'s size, they are perfect.  The stretch allows for a more slender look to the legs and butt, but they don\'t bind anywhere.  I LOVE them!\",\"title\":\"Perfect Capri!\"},{\"name\":\"Rob███B\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love your 27/7 jeans and capri\'s. Great fit, true to size.\",\"title\":\"Capris\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia ███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"NICE!! They are perfect. Nice and comfy..\",\"title\":\"great purchase\"},{\"name\":\"Jim R\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"These did not fit as snugly as I was hoping but they are a comfy pair of capris.\",\"title\":\"Not quite as snug as I had hoped.\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The material of the pants wasn\'t a good quality stretch material. The crouch of the pants was very uncomfortable. The color of the pants was beautiful!\",\"title\":\"These pants wasn\'t for me!\"},{\"name\":\"GAI███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I like the brand, but the legs are too wide and certainly do not look like the picture. Otherwise, It\'s okay. For me it ran a little big. I figured it would shrink a little and be fine but it didn\'t. I kept it and will wear it.\",\"title\":\"Stretch Denim Capris Review\"},{\"name\":\"War███P\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Legs are a big big and way too roomy. Didn\'t fit me the way I\'d like.  Great for thicker thighs\",\"title\":\"Don\'t know\"},{\"name\":\"Jo V\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Very disappointed ordered  size 12  received a size 42 and my other item is on back order.\",\"title\":\"not reliable\"}]',NULL,46.69,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Pants\",\"Plus Size Pants\"]'),(488,'Womens Workwear Pants','[\"Reviewers highlighted: comfort, fit, material\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Made-by-Johnny-Women-s-Chic-Tie-Dye-Palazzo-Pants-M-AQUA_471fb063-26d4-4a7d-a1cb-4ae07bd245d6_1.310baf6ceb1b881f15388e7674644ffa.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"XXXL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Purple\",\"WB1060-AQUA\",\"WB1060-BLACK\",\"WB1060-BROWN\",\"WB1060-CORAL\",\"WB1060-NAVY\",\"WB1060-OLIVE\",\"WB1060-PURPLE\",\"WB1060-TEAL\",\"WB1060-WHITE_BLACK\",\"WB1060-WHITE_NAVY\",\"WB1060-WINE\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash cold with like colors. Do not bleach. Hang dry or tumble dry low. Iron on low heat if needed. Do not dry clean.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Tinka\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These pants feel very nice, so soft. They are a little longer than I\'d like but at least they aren\'t too short.  I love the design and I just might buy another pair.\",\"title\":\"Good buy!\"},{\"name\":\"mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nice pattern and color. Fit me great and i got compliments on them. The length was perfect\"},{\"name\":\"non███152███245███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Ordered these pants one size big because of recommendations and they fit.  They look and feel good.  They are a little long on me and I am average height but I can still wear them.  I got a dress to match.\"},{\"name\":\"Kim███ly\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These pants are FANTASTIC!!!!! All of the reviews are accurate! So so comfortable!!!. I bought the Teal size 18-20. (xxl)I normally wear a 2x in jeans or pants. The material description states knit. I have bought  bell bottoms that were knit from Wal Mart and they were thin sweat pant material.  Cute, but too hot for the summer( Georgia ). These, my friend are thin and soft and stretchy.But NOT cheap thin. Good thin! Almost like stretchy polyester. I\'m going to the beach in Sept and these are going with! Im 5\'6\\\"\\\" and the length is fine. The waist part can be turned down if you need to pull them up and turn the waist down to shorten them. I\'m about to order another pair! These are fantastic.  Sitting, standing, they look dressy but feel like pajamas. Flip flops or wedges could dress up or down. Get them!!!\",\"title\":\"The Best Pants Ever!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Cindy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought these because I broke my ankle and will be in a boot for 6  weeks. Needed something comfy that would go over the boot. Bought a size up so they aren\'t tight. because it\'s stretchy material they fit fine. Seem a bit long.\",\"title\":\"Great fit and soft\"},{\"name\":\"Ali███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Most comfortable pants I think I\'ve ever worn. They are a soft and stretchy material. They aren\'t too hot for summer wear and I believe would also be comfy in cooler weather. They fit true to size.\",\"title\":\"Comfy!\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███en\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these pants! So comfortable and lightweight.  They are very long for someone 5\'3\\\" but I cut about 3 inches off and hemmed them and they\'re perfect for me now\",\"title\":\"soft and comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Gina\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"this is what i ask for in my size and love the color\",\"title\":\"love them\"},{\"name\":\"Nona\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"These are really comfortable with lots of stretch. The only thing I would change , is the length. There are very few women that are tall enough, well over 6\', that would be able to wear these, without shortening them.  I don\'t think even 5\\\" heels would make them the right length. Love the material and colors.\",\"title\":\"Lovely, but too leggy.\"},{\"name\":\"Hope\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"loved the pants but they sent the wrong size\",\"title\":\"wrong size\"}]',NULL,22.95,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Workwear\",\"Womens Workwear Pants\"]'),(489,'Pate Wet Cat Food','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Special-Kitty-Turkey-Flavor-Pate-Wet-Cat-Food-for-Adult-Kitten-22oz-Can_05f0ffbe-4ce2-4ae8-bb7f-52e2e2c81720.e53f26028952e69967ce137355047720.jpeg\"',4.40,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Feeding Instructions\",\"value\":\"Follow the feeding instructions to serve up the proper amount of food to your cat and let them chow down as they enjoy the delicious turkey flavor.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Gin███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I usually buy this to mix a table spoonful in with the cats hard food. He really likes it.\",\"title\":\"Wet cat food\"},{\"name\":\"Les███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I feed a colony of Feral Furbabies and they love this canned food,I love the larger can and the price tag. They are all very happy and healthy. It would be awesome to buy in cases, hint hint, 22oz cans by the case would help rescues, sanctuaries and feral TNR feeding.\",\"title\":\"Great value, cats love!\"},{\"name\":\"Nanta\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My kitties eat every bite of this wet food I mix it with special kitties dry and they love it eat every bite\",\"title\":\"My kitties love this wet cat food\"},{\"name\":\"BRE███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My cat loves this food %26 I love the price! So sick of throwing away money💸on the overpriced(which has nearly DOUBLED!)\\\"name\\\" brands! This was a winner for my Calico cat who is always on the move!\",\"title\":\"Calico loves💗 it!\"},{\"name\":\"Cat\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Large can is easier to feed several cats at once.  Taste appeals to my cats.  Price is competitive.\",\"title\":\"Feline Favorite\"},{\"name\":\"bla███aji███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I\'m buying this to feed TNR cats in Kaufman and it work well.\",\"title\":\"bargain\"},{\"name\":\"Jac███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I was reading the other reviews n I feed over 20   feral cats n I can’t afford to do it but they deserve to eat! I don’t get any help financially because I’m not a shelter! Started Trap n Release but the vet retired now I’m worried! This is all I can afford but they are constantly out of it!\",\"title\":\"Only Large can Made\"},{\"name\":\"Dwa███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"did a pickup order today got what I wanted but five cans of my cat food are really dented would not have gotten dented cans\",\"title\":\"dented cat food cans\"},{\"name\":\"elson\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Not 22oz by far. \\n\\n50% of the cans are full of water and juice.  It\'s the same amount of food as the smaller cans. Opening up a can is a lottery. You don\'t know how much food you\'re going to get.\",\"title\":\"25% JUICE. Cat food lottery.\"},{\"name\":\"Jea███e\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Opened my bag to find dented and bent cans. Pull top lid was open and food exposed on one can. Three other cans had to be thrown away as well. Due to the severity of the dents. Waste of my money. Second time this has happened. Walmart shoppers giving customers Walmarts trash. Photos were taken.\",\"title\":\"Received bad food\"}]','MEAT BY-PRODUCTS, WATER SUFFICIENT FOR PROCESSING, POULTRY BY-PRODUCTS,  TURKEY, FISH, RICE, CHICKEN LIVER, CHICKEN HEART, ADDED COLOR, NATURAL FLAVOR, GUAR GUM, SALT, CARRAGEENAN, POTASSIUM CHLORIDE, CHOLINE CHLORIDE, VITAMINS (THIAMINE MONONITRATE, VITAMIN E SUPPLEMENT, NIACIN SUPPLEMENT, d-CALCIUM PANTOTHENATE, PYRI