me\":\"she███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I really thought this was coming with a fitted sheet and pillowcases and it came with just a freaking sheet for my bed I have no fitted sheet no pillowcases to go with it this is ridiculous for $20 like I really thought it was more it was a fitting sheet with it at least and I just got a  sheet.. I\'m really not satisfied cuz I have no vision in my right eye and low vision in my left eye so it\'s very hard for me to see very well and it looked it show the pictures showing a bed with sheets on it and a fitted sheet and a pillowcases so I thought I was getting the whole the fitted sheet pack with the sheet not just a sheet I\'m very upset\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I am disabled, and shopping on line is  the only way I can get what I need. Also on a fixed income. I haven\'t got a lot of things I ordered. I don\'t have a lot of money and need what I \\n order!!!!!\",\"title\":\"Didn\'t get my sheet.\"},{\"name\":\"Lor███s\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Would like a refund not what it says it was\",\"title\":\"Refund\"}]',NULL,23.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Sheets\"]'),(491,'Mens Polo Shirts','[\"Best seller\",\"Flash Deal\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Iceglad-Polo-Shirts-for-Men-Short-Sleeve-Soft-Cotton-Collared-Shirt_e2d2ece6-e90c-44fa-b10d-453b332aeded.572dd0aeb153ff3cd57c7279548a1deb.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"01-Vg-Blue\",\"02-Black\",\"03-Vg-Navy Blue\",\"04-Dark Gray\",\"05-Vg-Green\",\"06-White\",\"07-Gray\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine-wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ing███ana███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Color as same the picture, my husband likes it and he will wear very soon.\",\"title\":\"nice shirt and my husband loves it.\"},{\"name\":\"Rob███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Perfect fit and feel.  My husband wants to wear nothing but these shirts to work.\",\"title\":\"Yes!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Nara\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nice smooth comfortable cotton shirt\",\"title\":\"Looks and feels nice\"},{\"name\":\"Rob███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I ordered more after receiving my first order.  Husband loves the fit and comfort.  I love the wash and dry ease.  Now he has one for every day of the week.\",\"title\":\"Quality is Great\"},{\"name\":\"Nova\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Nice polo. Shirt is comfy\",\"title\":\"Great\"},{\"name\":\"BW\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The shirt material is cotton and it feels great. The craftsmanship seems good. I bought a medium but it was way too tight and seemed more like a small size.\",\"title\":\"Material feels great but shirt is way too small\"},{\"name\":\"BClaw\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"sleeves to short. material not as expected\",\"title\":\"shirt\"},{\"name\":\"robin\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This short runs small. I bought these for my husband and bought his normal size.\",\"title\":\"Size up\"},{\"name\":\"Kathy\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered a man\'s polo shirt.  What I received was a cheap child\'s heart necklace.   Unfortunately, before I realized the mistake, my granddaughter say it and thought her grandfater had got it for her.  She was so excited, I just dont have the heart to return it.   Dont buy from this seller, who knows what you will receive!\",\"title\":\"i ordered a shirt and they sent a cheap necklace\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"95% cotton; hang dry only.  Did that, still didn\'t fit; too tight.  So, for the price, not worth it for me.\",\"title\":\"Not what I wanted for the price\"}]',NULL,36.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Shirts\",\"Mens Polo Shirts\"]'),(492,'Meal Replacements',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Barney-Butter-Almond-Meal-13-Oz_cf8dd637-9877-402c-b718-56788fb8d1d8.5029866a407230bd0a7fc3b2afa55729.jpeg\"',4.90,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Store airtight in refrigerator after opening.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I use this to make cakes. The quality is good and I like it that the skin of the almond was left there so there\'s more fibre. A healthier alternative to normal almond meal!\\n\\nI use it to make my healthy sweet potato brownies - sweet potato mash, with this almond meal, honey and eggs. A very healthy chocolate indulgent treat! lots of recipes online. Enjoy!\",\"title\":\"grounded almond with the skin\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Truly delicious with the genuine taste & crushiness. Highly recommend it.\",\"title\":\"Excellent!\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Perfect product, texture is fine, great for baking, can also be roasted to add flavor. All around useful almond meal for sweet and savory dishes.\",\"title\":\"Wonderful almond flour \"},{\"name\":\"iHe███ust███r\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have made good pancakes using mostly this flour/meal, just added some other flour such as chickpea/potato to extend the nutritional profile and just in case so they wouldn\'t fall apart. Looks like its milled with the skins on, which I think is good.\",\"title\":\"Excellent!\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"We used to buy great Almond Meal from Trader Joe\'s, which is no longer available at their stores.  We have tried several brands of other almond meal that didn\'t even come close to the great flavor we were used to.  Finally, we found the Barney Almond Meal.  We brush melted coconut oil on skinless boneless chicken breasts and sprinkle almond meal to coat the chicken and then bake.  We call it our Kentucky Fried Chicken.  It\'s pretty great!  Thanks to iHerb for carrying this great product and to the Barney corp for making such a fresh and tasty product, with no additives.  \",\"title\":\"Excellent Almond Meal\"},{\"name\":\"Dia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love this almond flour - very good quality, pure, aromatic, clear vegetable protein that is certified paleo, KETO, vegan and beehive, a universal substitute for wheat flour - ideal for meat and vegetables, protein pancakes, desserts and French pasta\\nExpensive, but worth it if you need a low carb - just try it!\",\"title\":\"Excellent!\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I loved this product. It is perfect for low carb baking and adding to dishes when wanting to add a bit more protein. I have used it to make Gluten free low carb crusts and bases for cake and it comes out perfectly. The quality of the packaging is also great!\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Excellent!\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great product. I use this to bake keto baked goods. \",\"title\":\"Excellent!\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Barney Butter Natural Almond Flour is a standout product in the realm of gluten-free and grain-free baking. Here\'s why I  recommend it:\\nSize of the Package\\n\\nThe package contains 368 grams (13 ounces) of almond flour, which is ample for various baking recipes and dietary needs. It\'s a versatile size that ensures you have enough on hand for multiple culinary adventures.\\nQuality of Ingredients\\n\\nThe almonds are finely ground into a smooth and consistent flour, making it ideal for baking and cooking. The flour is gluten-free, grain-free, and paleo-friendly, appealing to a wide range of dietary preferences.\\nMethods of Use\\n\\nThis almond flour can be used in numerous ways in the kitchen. It serves as an excellent alternative to traditional wheat flour in baking recipes, providing a rich nutty flavor and moist texture to baked goods. It can also be used as a coating for meats and vegetables or as a thickener in sauces and soups.\\nColor\\n\\nThe almond flour has a pale, creamy color, typical of finely ground almonds. It blends seamlessly into recipes and adds a subtle almond flavor that enhances the overall taste of dishes.\\nTaste\\n\\nThe taste of Barney Butter Natural Almond Flour is rich and nutty, with a mild sweetness that comes naturally from almonds. It adds a delightful depth of flavor to baked goods, making them more flavorful and satisfying.\\nRecommendations\\n\\nI highly recommend Barney Butter Natural Almond Flour to anyone looking for a high-quality, gluten-free alternative to traditional flour. Whether you follow a gluten-free diet or simply enjoy experimenting with new ingredients in the kitchen, this almond flour delivers excellent results. It\'s perfect for baking delicious treats like cookies, muffins, and cakes, while also providing nutritional benefits from almonds.\\n\\nOverall, Barney Butter has crafted a superior almond flour that meets the highest standards of taste and quality. Incorporate it into your baking repertoire and elevate your culinary creations with its exceptional flavor and versatility.\\n\",\"title\":\"Natural Almond Flour\"},{\"name\":\"sc0███er\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Perfect for low carb baking and cooking mix. With skin on, i find the taste more distinct. \",\"title\":\"Good\"}]','Unblanched Ground California Almonds.',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Unblanched Ground California Almonds.\"}]','[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Weight Loss\",\"Meal Replacements\"]'),(493,'Womens Tops','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/asdoklhq-Juniors-Plus-Blouses-Shirts-Women-Printed-Halter-O-Neck-Tank-Sleeveless-Casual-Tee-Tops-Blouse_e9c7017c-4f00-4a61-85a9-fb8a2f822a05.d66df2fef4cea965feb21349f460d5ed.jpeg\"',3.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"XXXL\",\"XXXXXL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black-TopNewA\",\"Black-TopNewC\",\"Blue\",\"Light blue-TopNewA\",\"Pink-TopNewA\",\"White\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"She███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This shirt is very cute I just love butterflies It fit\'s really good i\"},{\"name\":\"MIC███LE\",\"rating\":1}]',NULL,13.98,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Tops\"]'),(494,'Kids\' Quilts','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Whale-Flotilla-3-Piece-King-Quilt-Set-Soft-Embossed-Bedding-Lightweight-Bedspread-Coverlet-Damask-Vintage-Pattern-Reversible-Bed-Cover-All-Seasons-Bo_eb222b61-1b30-41a4-a204-ef22592a38bc.b67dff5428880941bb63b3875cc379a7.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"Twin\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\"]','[\"BlushPink\",\"Brich Beige\",\"Burnt Orange\",\"Dusty Lavender\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Red\",\"Sage Green\",\"Vintage Blue\",\"Vintage Bone\",\"Vintage Light Grey\",\"Vintage Red\",\"Vintage White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Dog███x2\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Just the weight needed for summer and anytime really. I live in the south. This is my third one. You can\'t beat the price for this quality anywhere. The colors are rich and you can add your own decor to dress it up. Size was spot on for my king size bed with thick mattress. Don\'t hesitate to purchase.\",\"title\":\"Great king size comforter.\"},{\"name\":\"Geo███na\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The color was exactly as in the picture. The quilt stitching is attractive and has an appearance similar to that of someone doing a personal quilt. I got a king size for a queen size bed and it\'s a good size and better coverage. Light enough for summer use but warm enough for those occasional cool nights. Excellent price for the quality.\",\"title\":\"Well made, great value\"},{\"name\":\"DA\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I needed something light and thin, something for hot summer nights that\'s not too thick. I immediately unwrapped and washed before use. It washed and dried well. The fabric is soft and cool for hot sleepers! This works for me. Let me go buy another color…Lol\",\"title\":\"Perfect!\"},{\"name\":\"Jane\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is a beautiful lightweight embossed spread. The color is gorgeous. I bought it as a gift for someone and was so impressed with it I went back and bought two more. Would definitely recommend.\",\"title\":\"Flotilla embossed bed set.\"},{\"name\":\"Chris\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought it to stage my house and the house sold in a week.\",\"title\":\"Bedspread\"},{\"name\":\"Sally\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Lightweight and lovely. Top stitching done in a beautiful pattern. Bright white-veru clean and stylish.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful Quilt\"},{\"name\":\"terri\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very nice, soft material.  Came with two king shams also.\",\"title\":\"Bedding\"},{\"name\":\"Agnes\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the  color, great material  %26 fantastic  size   I ordered 2 quilts different  color  %26 design.  Kept  both of them because  they are so lovely %26 terrific price.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful  quilt\"},{\"name\":\"Sum███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"its cute wanted something bright for Spring time. the quilt is light weight/thin. overall l do like it..\",\"title\":\"It\'s cute\"},{\"name\":\"Har███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I didn\'t expect too much when buying a blanket this cheap, but I was on a budget and loved the color. I was disappointed when I removed it from the dryer after the first wash to find that the heat from the dryer had made the blanket \\\"crunch\\\" up. I figured I\'d just dry it on lower heat next time because while it didn\'t look great all crunchy and wrinkled, it wasn\'t damaged. Of course, when I washed it a second time it came out of the dryer completely melted in two spots. Waste of money, spend a little more for a blanket you can use for more than a few washes.\",\"title\":\"Cheap material\"}]',NULL,65.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Kids\' Rooms\",\"Kids\' Bedding\",\"Kids\' Quilts\"]'),(495,'9 Drawer Dressers','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fabric-Storage-Dresser-9-Drawers-Steel-Frame-Wooden-Top-Bedroom-Entryway-Nursery-Tall-Chest-Drawers-Organizing-Clothes-Shoes-Toys-More-Black_503f8e53-d404-4e5c-b16d-01872e2b1a56.c53994c2b2e8344eb2a39910dbdc7e8a.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"One Size\",\"2 Fabric Drawers\",\"H2 Fabric Drawers\",\"4 Fabric Drawers\",\"5 Fabric Drawers\",\"5 Fabric Drawers + Shelf\",\"6 Fabric Drawers\",\"7 Fabric Drawers\",\"8 Fabric Drawers\",\"9 Fabric Drawers\",\"10 Fabric Drawers\"]','[\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Gray\",\"Rust Brown\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Wipe clean with wet cloth\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Lis███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is a tv stand but I put it in my kitchen it\'s perfect I live in a studio. Very well constructed! Strong pieces!\",\"title\":\"This is well worth it\"},{\"name\":\"Rac███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I put it together in about 45 minutes. The drawers made with a strong thick cloth and do not feel flimsy. They\'re large enough to fit 2 kids clothes with room to spare. It\'s not as wide as a regular size dresser but it can fit a 32\\\" tv and a dvd player easily.\",\"title\":\"Great quality %26 looks cute in my kids room\"},{\"name\":\"Fre███Smi███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"You are able to put together the dresser by simply reading step by step instructions . So, I\'m saying it is easily done and we are happy with our new dresser. It fits nicely in our home, plus I personally like how pretty it looks. It is sturdy enough for clothes, it can easily be lifted to the area you need it to be in, and it does have a lot of room inside each drawer.\\nFYI-make sure you have a proper screwdriver, the one that came with the kit was slightly smaller for the fitting.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful and light dresser.\"},{\"name\":\"Tyr███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love it was super easy to put together only thing is I just wish the drawers were a little bigger but I guess since it\'s 10 of them I should have plenty of room for clothes\",\"title\":\"Dresser review\"},{\"name\":\"Fel███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This unit is much better than the photo shows - it\'s very sturdy, it looks more expensive that what it is and adds a nice decorative touch to the room! Although the drawer handles are black, I spray painted them gold and it looks fabulous! The drawers hold a lot so, I do recommend this purchase.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful Drawer Storage Unit!\"},{\"name\":\"MsJay\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This item functions more as a storage unit than a traditional dresser. It\'s ideal for storing sheets, towels, or other items in a guest bedroom, or even for a small child. However, it is quite short in height. On the positive side, the drawers are made of thick, high-quality fabric. Considering the price, I\'m satisfied with it.  i may put longer legs on it and paint and seal the top.\",\"title\":\"\\\"Good Quality Storage Unit, But Smaller Than Expec\"},{\"name\":\"Nat███e\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I love this the only issue I saw was the material in the front looked like it was already unthreading when I unboxed it only disappointment but beside that great storage space and looks beautiful in my room\",\"title\":\"7 out 10\"},{\"name\":\"Sarah\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"So, keep in mind this product is only $50. And you get what you pay for. During assembly, the wood piece on top cracked pretty easily, one of the bolts broke through the top, I followed the directions exactly as directed and used the proper bolts that the instructions told me to. Only one of the bolts broke through the top so I\'m assuming it was a manufacturing issue, maybe they accidentally put a longer bolt with the smaller step 1 bolts. I was not aware that the top was cracked initially and when I ran my hand across the wood, it cut the palm of my hand. :( Either way, I\'m sad that this problem occurred. I did read the reviews before purchasing this item and many customers have complained of the same issue. \\nAgain, you get what you pay for lol.\",\"title\":\"Not worth it.\"},{\"name\":\"Me\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"They are nothing fancy but will serve their purpose. If it weren\'t missing all four handles (I ordered two of these) I would have given a higher rating. I reached out to the seller but there has been no response.\",\"title\":\"missing handles\"},{\"name\":\"Blair\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This product came damaged!  Not real bad but enough to put a sour note in a way you paid for this!  Plus one of the screws for the feet of the dresser was bent so it didn\'t screw in very far!\",\"title\":\"If you think your getting a deal think again!\"}]',NULL,199.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Furniture\",\"Bedroom Furniture\",\"Dressers\",\"9 Drawer Dressers\"]'),(496,'Frozen Sandwiches','[\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Golden-Krust-Chicken-Patty-5oz-Jamaican-Style-Jerk_8055d2c1-e9ad-4cbb-a2b7-507e08d3b70c.de10999e47f8a7b0154dced5ab045351.jpeg\"',4.20,'[]','[]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Bac███ode███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was excited to see that Walmart added the Jerk Chicken variety of Golden Krust\'s patties!  The chicken is flavorful with just the right amount of spice.  Like all of Golden Krust\'s patties, the crust is flaky.  The chicken and crust combo creates a delicious snack or meal.  Since school is out for the summer, I look for foods that are easy for my kids to make for their lunches.  I suggest stocking up on these kid-friendly patties as they are an inexpensive item to have on hand and can be conveniently heated up in the microwave.\",\"title\":\"Keep your freezer stocked with these!\"},{\"name\":\"Jay\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is a great meal replacement or snack and is super convenient.  I love to microwave this and then put it in air fryer for a couple of minutes to bring out that crispy, delicious outer crust.  I love this and the beef patties as well.\",\"title\":\"Convenient snack or meal replacement\"},{\"name\":\"Gab███lle███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"As someone who enjoys chicken empanadas and beef patties, this was a perfect snack for me. I find the crust to be delicious and super flaky, and the filling is chunks of jerk chicken combined in a flavorful sauce. I love to have these as a mid-day snack in opposed to lunch. Super filling and delicious. I find they taste best in the oven or crisping it up in an air fryer after microwaving. A must try with your favorite sauce, and a super affordable option as well. I always keep these stocked in my freezer!\",\"title\":\"My favorite easy snack\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these patties. I put them in the oven opposed to the microwave, and the crust is perfect. The filling is like a paste, but I don\'t care. These are flavorful and cheap.\",\"title\":\"Super flaky crust, mushy filling.\"},{\"name\":\"Les███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Loved the flavor and texture.\",\"title\":\"Great taste\"},{\"name\":\"Jeff\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The crust was warm and had a great texture! The spice level on the chicken inside was just enough to not be overpowering. Would definitely recommend for fans of Jamaican Patties that want to try something new outside of Beef.\",\"title\":\"Perfect snack at a good price\"},{\"name\":\"And███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I have been sick for three days since I ate one of these. I am going to hospital to get some testing done tomorrow.\",\"title\":\"Bad Batch\"},{\"name\":\"Jer███neD███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Soggy in microwave meat tasted gross.  Will not purchase again.\",\"title\":\"Nasty\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Sal███e\",\"rating\":5}]','Chicken, Water, Breadcrumbs (Wheat Flour [Niacin, Reduced Iron, Thiamine Mononitrate, Riboflavin, Folic Acid], Sugar, Yeast, Salt), Modified Corn Starch, Seasoning (Monosodium Glutamate, Salt, Dehydrated Garlic, Brown Sugar, Dextrose, Spices (Celery Seed), Corn Starch, Sugar, Dehydrated Onion, Paprika, Paprika Oleoresin (For Color), Turmeric, Natural Flavors, Extractives Of Turmeric), Onion, Thyme, Textured Vegetable Protein (Soy Flour And/Or Soy Protein Concentrate), Curry Powder (Turmeric, Coriander, Fenugreek, Cumin, Black Pepper, Ginger, Mustard, Fennel, Allspice, Red Pepper), Modified Food Starch, Hot Pepper, Soy Sauce (Water, Soybeans, Wheat Flour, Salt, Sugar, Mushroom, Preservative).  Crust:  Wheat Flour (Wheat Flour [Niacin, Reduced Iron, Thiamine Mononitrate, Riboflavin, Folic Acid], Malted Barley Flour), Water, Shortening (Palm Oil And/Or Soybean Oil), Beef Suet, Sugar, Yellow Egg Shade (FD&C Yellow #5, Yellow Lake#6, Salt) Annatto And Turmeric Liquid (Extractives Of Annatto And Turmeric, Propylene Glycol, Polysorbate 80), Salt.',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Chicken, Water, Breadcrumbs (Wheat Flour [Niacin, Reduced Iron, Thiamine Mononitrate, Riboflavin, Folic Acid], Sugar, Yeast, Salt), Modified Corn Starch, Seasoning (Monosodium Glutamate, Salt, Dehydrated Garlic, Brown Sugar, Dextrose, Spices (Celery Seed), Corn Starch, Sugar, Dehydrated Onion, Paprika, Paprika Oleoresin (For Color), Turmeric, Natural Flavors, Extractives Of Turmeric), Onion, Thyme, Textured Vegetable Protein (Soy Flour And/Or Soy Protein Concentrate), Curry Powder (Turmeric, Coriander, Fenugreek, Cumin, Black Pepper, Ginger, Mustard, Fennel, Allspice, Red Pepper), Modified Food Starch, Hot Pepper, Soy Sauce (Water, Soybeans, Wheat Flour, Salt, Sugar, Mushroom, Preservative).  Crust:  Wheat Flour (Wheat Flour [Niacin, Reduced Iron, Thiamine Mononitrate, Riboflavin, Folic Acid], Malted Barley Flour), Water, Shortening (Palm Oil And/Or Soybean Oil), Beef Suet, Sugar, Yellow Egg Shade (FD&C Yellow #5, Yellow Lake#6, Salt) Annatto And Turmeric Liquid (Extractives Of Annatto And Turmeric, Propylene Glycol, Polysorbate 80), Salt.\"}]','[\"Food\",\"Frozen Foods\",\"Frozen Appetizers & Snacks\",\"Frozen Sandwiches\"]'),(497,'Kites',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Mint-s-Colorful-Life-Butterfly-Kite-for-Kids-Adults-Polyester-Material-Easy-to-Fly_de434a65-21d3-40f1-a296-3984514ee685.5fa815762c396a55f1e7cb61129e2c15.jpeg\"',4.50,'[]','[\"Blue\",\"Multicolor\",\"Pink\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Can\'t be soaked in water for long time\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Frank\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I gave this to my 5-yr old niece. She, and her grandparents, played with it on the beach, when windy. A storm was thought to be coming, so it was unusually windy. Im told the kite was easy to assemble, flew for 15 minutes, and the string wrapped in some way that was convenient. None of us are experienced kite fliers. The 5-yr old picked this kite out.\",\"title\":\"Easy to Use\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███l M███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The kite went together in no time. 5 min. Or less. Goes up with ease once you figure out the direction of the support rods. One may think they go towards the string as to form a sail catching the wind. Not so. Flex the support rods away from the string and this kite goes up with ease. Would definitely recommend this kite as one to buy. Easy assembly, easy to fly, and nice strong string!\",\"title\":\"Easy kite to fly!\"},{\"name\":\"She███ Ay███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I received this on a great day to fly and it broke on the first day. My daughter was very disappointed BUT WITHOUT ME ASKING I was sent a replacement and now my daughter is so full of happiness. Customer service is excellent. I will definitely purchase from this vendor again. Thank you!\",\"title\":\"Updated- Broke on the first day.\"},{\"name\":\"Ppat\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very easy to break. Cheap plastic. You have to be careful when put it together. Very expensive for what I got. Edited: best customer service!! After I wrote three stars review they sent me a new kite and a hand written letter. I support this business 100%\",\"title\":\"Best customer service\"},{\"name\":\"ner███oo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought this butterfly kite for a day at the beach- easy to assemble, and it took flight pretty quickly. Lasted the whole day and also easy to disassemble. Its not as big as some of the other kites on this site, but its still pretty to look at in the air and many bystanders stopped to take a look at it. Havent take it out again since I took it out of the packaging, but it seems sturdy enough to handle a couple more flights. Even so, would buy again!\",\"title\":\"Pretty in the Sky\"},{\"name\":\"Adam\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"amazing definitely get extra string. it can maneuver with ease in the air.\"},{\"name\":\"Bae███om\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was really hoping this would be great and it is.  A little pricey but considering it wont tear up after the first use, at least Im not wasting any money. My 8 year old was able to assemble it on her own...super simple. Take off is great and flys like a dream and it crashed and still held together.  Definitely a good purchase that wont irrate the littles....the most important part!\",\"title\":\"Finally a kite that will LAST!\"},{\"name\":\"Gab███la\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Its reusable but careful with strong winds. Had two small tears at the top where the sticks attach, but this is after a really windy flight. String is strong wont snap. Second time flying I had to tie a loop where the string attached to the kite bc it was too long/loose and the kite kept coming down.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful, always get compliments.\"},{\"name\":\"Tif███y S███lun███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This has been edited/adding the second paragraph. My daughter looked at many pictures online and she picked this one as her favorite! It is beautiful...but it came not put together correctly and the poles wouldnt even go in, so she could not fly it. It was unusable and a huge disappointment to her.After writing this review (but not actually reaching out to the company) we randomly received a new updated kite in the mail. They sent it to fix their mistake...stating in a letter that the kite has been updated with better parts to ensure the quality of their product. Im shocked. The kite now flies beautifully, my daughter is very happy and I have to say their customer service has blown me away!!\",\"title\":\"A company that backs their product! Wow\"},{\"name\":\"Mag███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I was pleasantly surprised at the quality of this kite. It held up perfectly during three hours of flying in20 MPH winds. It came with plenty of high quality string. Some other flyers had brands that sent very limited quantities of string which was very disappointing for them. Would definitely buy this brand again.\",\"title\":\"Great kite! Very pretty in flight!\"}]','polyester fiberglass',16.99,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"polyester fiberglass\"}]','[\"Toys\",\"Outdoor Toys\",\"Sports Toys\",\"Kites\"]'),(498,'Big and Tall Shorts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/KingSize-Men-s-Big-Tall-Comfort-Flex-Full-Elastic-Shorts-5XL-Dark-Khaki_6a18e16e-ecec-40cb-8c31-776a607f75a9.b164cd954123fd0eef51e7e5031c9b29.jpeg\"',3.70,'[\"Big - XL\",\"Tall - L\",\"Tall - XL\",\"Big - 2XL\",\"Tall - 2XL\",\"Big - 3XL\",\"Tall - 3XL\",\"Big - 4XL\",\"Tall - 4XL\",\"Big - 5XL\",\"Tall - 5XL\",\"Big - 6XL\",\"Tall - 6XL\",\"Big - 7XL\",\"Tall - 7XL\",\"Big - 8XL\",\"Big - 9XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Dark Khaki\",\"Navy\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Sha███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nice and comfy for the price.\"},{\"name\":\"pea███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great  shorts  always quality from King Size.\",\"title\":\"Would Buy Again\"},{\"name\":\"ROB███ B\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"very comfortable and perfect fit for size ordered.  would have liked them a bit shorter but we can take care of that.  Very good buy and would order again.\",\"title\":\"Good buy and comfortable fit\"},{\"name\":\"PAT███K K███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I had bought this for a friend of mine and I must say the size, the style, the product in all was outstanding and very comfortable. This is a must have, you or your loved ones will enjoy the this product.\",\"title\":\"A must have\"},{\"name\":\"CAL███!!!███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"FIT  AND MATERIAL WERE GOOD.  SEEMED TO RUN A LITTLE LONG DOWN THE KNEE FOR MY LIKING . HAD TO RETURN THEM.   MORE COLOR OPTIONS WOULD BE AWESOME AS WELL!!!!!\",\"title\":\"NOT BAD !!!!!\"},{\"name\":\"SAL███B\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I don\'t give perfects to anyone, but you receive a high 4. They fit great, and were in awesome shape\",\"title\":\"Agora review\"},{\"name\":\"Rob███ M\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"These fit well and the fabric was very good . The limit to 4 stars is due to the pockets not being deep enough and when sitting the contents come out.\",\"title\":\"Good shorts\"},{\"name\":\"Jam███L\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"These are great shorts with just the right amount of stretch. Unfortunately one of the three pairs arrived in a completely different material. Quality control is lacking.\"},{\"name\":\"Tho███ W\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Cuffs were not properly sewn. Had large creased.\"},{\"name\":\"Ed L\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The fit is good and the stretch fabric is extremely comfortable to wear all day long. The VERY BIG NEGATIVE is because the color bleeds and fades starting with the first washing. I have needed to buy the shorts multiple times just because the color fade. I accidentally put my blue color shorts that had been washed 5-6 times already in a wash load that had white tshirts.  Needless to say, the tshirts are no longer white.\",\"title\":\"Nice Fit but the Color Fades\"}]',NULL,41.09,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Big and Tall\",\"Big and Tall Shorts\",\"Big and Tall Shorts\"]'),(499,'Toddler Sandals','[\"Flash Deal\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Drecage-Toddler-Boys-Girls-Cartoon-Clogs-Kids-Slip-On-Garden-Shoes-Lightweight-Beach-Pool-Sandals_771eca56-3834-4ff4-94ff-2dfaefa0fbd7.499b241ea99be5c3f2f922b57013612f.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"1 Big Kid\",\"1.5 Big Kid\",\"8 Toddler\",\"9 Toddler\",\"10 Toddler\",\"11 Little Kid\",\"12 Little Kid\",\"12.5 Little Kid\",\"13 Little Kid\",\"13.5 Little Kid\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black-2\",\"Blue\",\"Dark Blue\",\"Dark Blue-2\",\"Gray\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Rose\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Toni\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought the name brand %26 they were to big so I was on the hunt on something that would fit his feet. These were adorable, prices right %26 fit a wit all around.\",\"title\":\"Grandson loves them!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My grandchild loved to wear these everyday and every where\",\"title\":\"Kids would love\"},{\"name\":\"Bri███t\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are true to size and my toddler LOVES his “Digger” shoes\",\"title\":\"Toddler in love!!\"},{\"name\":\"Yol███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"like the color like the design, my great grandson really love them.\",\"title\":\"nice shoes\"},{\"name\":\"Bec███on\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My 2 yr old and 4 yr old grands love them!! They are so cute and looks great! Best deal ever!! True to size!! They love them\",\"title\":\"Cute and colorful!!! Great shoe with a great Price\"},{\"name\":\"MrY███bo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They seem to fit well and be comfy. My son loves the dinosaurs along the bottom.\",\"title\":\"My son loves them\"},{\"name\":\"Ste███nie███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"We bought these for our crocs-addicted grandson and he loves them.  The colors are vibrant and the insides are soft.  Couldn\'t be happier with them.\",\"title\":\"SOOOOOOOOOOO CUTE!!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Vic███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Nice design, fits as expected. Comparable to Crocs and Foamies except the strap doesn\'t feel all that strong. My son doesn\'t use the strap so they\'re perfect for him.\",\"title\":\"Great for the price!\"},{\"name\":\"Jun███n\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Received a damage item and wrong size. I order a smaller size for little kid but why sending me the wrong size my son can\'t even use it because its so big.😢 He been waiting for this order and excited but get disappointed when its too big for his foot.\",\"title\":\"Damage item and wrong size😔\"},{\"name\":\"Hai███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"My son had these for less than 24 hours. Wore them to school (on a rain day with no recess) and they broke mid day.\",\"title\":\"Cheap product\"}]',NULL,19.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Kids Shoes\",\"Toddler Shoes\",\"Toddler Sandals\"]'),(500,'Garlic Pills','[\"Best seller\",\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amazing-Formulas-Garlic-Supplement_02ba918e-e058-4589-8a2d-2e25cef3d745.0ac2dad4eb196ef9f26110780525c45b.jpeg\"',4.90,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Dosage\",\"value\":\"Take 1 softgel 1 to 2 times daily, preferably with meals or as directed by a health care professional.\"},{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"As a dietary supplement, adults take one,(1) softgel 1 to 2 times daily, preferably with meals or as,directed by a health care professional.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Edw███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"what i like about it is that garlic has a lot of healthy benefits.\",\"title\":\"softgel Garlic 5000mg\"},{\"name\":\"Mis███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I just know it\'s heart healthy and I have to take it so I\'m glad you guys have it. I just wish it was on. I can buy it with food stamps because I don\'t like to eat raw garlic hello\"},{\"name\":\"Tana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have taken Garlic for years and it has helped my heart.  I buy it from Wal Mart as it is cheaper and just as good as any other`.  I\",\"title\":\"Keep healthy on a budget\"},{\"name\":\"Ronda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the fact that this supplement has helped to lower my LDL(cholesterol).\\nIt shipped fairly quickly, and it was well packaged.\",\"title\":\"Love it!\"},{\"name\":\"Shawn\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"REALLY strong Garlic smell\",\"title\":\"Wheeeeew weee! So stinky\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███ets███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"MrC███n\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Ann███e\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"nonia\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":5}]','Garlic',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Garlic\"}]','[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Vitamins and Supplements\",\"Herbal Supplements\",\"Garlic Pills\"]'),(501,'Toddler Dress Shoes','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/PatPat-Little-Kid-Girls-Princess-Shoes-Toddler-Sequin-Shoes-Sweet-3D-Bow-Tie-Shiny-Rhinestone-Pearl-Fairy-Leather-Shoes-for-Gift-Pink-Size-5-5-11-5_9cb7f46d-8198-4bd2-9331-061014ce8d74.871175102f9348f340765407c5b31827.webp\"',5.00,'[\"Toddler US 5.5\",\"Toddler US 6\",\"Toddler US 6.5\",\"Toddler US 7.5\",\"Toddler US 8\",\"Toddler US 8.5\",\"Little Kid US 9\",\"Little Kid US 9.5\",\"Little Kid US 10.5\",\"Little Kid US 11\",\"Little Kid US 11.5\",\"Little Kid US 12\",\"Little Kid US 12.5\"]','[\"Gold\",\"Pink\",\"Pink 1#\",\"Silver\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Avoid high temperatures and direct sunlight. Use a dry cloth to clean the synthetic leather.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Emily\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got these for my niece. The shoes look exactly like the picture. The shoes are a true fit and have so far lasted.\",\"title\":\"The shoes look exactly the picture.\"}]',NULL,28.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Kids Shoes\",\"Toddler Shoes\",\"Toddler Dress Shoes\"]'),(502,'Juniors Rompers & Jumpsuits','[\"Reviewers highlighted: fit, stretch\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/VIP-JEANS-Teen-Girls-s-Size-Skinny-Sleeveless-Zip-Jumpsuit-Romper-Black-Denim-Plus-24W_391cd847-caab-4fdb-94c9-79c0cd0fa86b.0301e2dba5629f3ea16ce44d040776f6.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"14W\",\"16W\",\"18W\",\"20W\",\"22W\",\"24W\",\"1\",\"3\",\"5\",\"7\",\"9\",\"11\",\"13\",\"15\",\"S\",\"L\",\"XL\"]','[\"Acid Washed\",\"Arctic Camo\",\"Black Blue\",\"Black Denim\",\"Camouflage\",\"Classic Camo\",\"Dark Blue\",\"Jungle Camo\",\"Light Green\",\"Medium Blue\",\"Rainbow Camo\",\"White Denim\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jan███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It looks so cute on!!!! It hugs all the right places!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Sta███r\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Crazy nice and fits well for the low cost. I highly recommend. It has good stretch.\",\"title\":\"Good Buy\"},{\"name\":\"Cry███l\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This jumper is wonderful!!!! It fits well! I will be ordering another one!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Cha███sa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I like the way it looks but it doesn\'t have good instructions\",\"title\":\"watch\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It is very nice. Soft and stretch material. True to size. Form fitting. Hug your curves. I wish they get more camo colors. I recommend this items for plus sizelove\",\"title\":\"Love this overall jumper\"},{\"name\":\"mar███et\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"very nice. Nice n scretches good.\"},{\"name\":\"Dmcs\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Love this jumpsuit but the top runs a good bit small. Bottom fits great and looks great\",\"title\":\"Runs small\"},{\"name\":\"Han███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"If you\'re plus size and in between 2 sizes, order up to the next size after your highest size. Snug fit, but super cute. I like it.\",\"title\":\"Order up a size or 2 plus size ladies\"},{\"name\":\"Lat███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The jumpsuit fit really good except it wasn\'t skinny jeans at the bottom.  I had to have my mother taper the legs to fit as seen on the picture.\",\"title\":\"Not so skinny jeans\"},{\"name\":\"Bar███a\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The bust runs small.  I would estimate it is around  size 40 for a size 20.\",\"title\":\"Bust runs small.\"}]',NULL,19.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Juniors\",\"Juniors Dresses & Rompers\",\"Juniors Rompers & Jumpsuits\"]'),(503,'Tshirts for Women','[\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SHIBEVER-Women-T-Shirts-Summer-Short-Sleeve-Tops-Casual-Loose-Tunic-Tops-Side-Split-Ladies-Comfortable-Crewneck-Tops-Blouse-Purple-M_482e09e2-14ac-4d9d-895d-5268fde06819.cf44e4a6823b661b36f8bf83b350cf29.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Purple\",\"#1 Black\",\"#1 Blue\",\"#1 Coffee\",\"#1 Dark Blue\",\"#1 Gray\",\"#1 Green\",\"#1 Khaki\",\"#1 Light Gray\",\"#1 Pink\",\"#1 Purple\",\"#1 White\",\"#1 WineRed\",\"#2 Blue\",\"#2 Coffee\",\"#2 Green\",\"#2 Grey\",\"#2 Pink\",\"#2 Redwine\",\"#2 White\",\"#3 Black\",\"#3 Blue\",\"#3 Pink\",\"#3 White\",\"#3 Yellow\",\"#5 Blackgrey\",\"#5 Bluegrey\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Nel███Dai███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This top is very comfortable.  The material is very soft and it looks beautiful with a pair of Bermuda shorts.  Love love my new top and l bought it in three different colors.\",\"title\":\"Nice Top\"},{\"name\":\"Robyn\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"As soon as I got it I tried it on.. Love the color and the fit! seems to run a tad larger but not that much. It\'s long like I like it and covers my problem areas! Overall I\'m happy with it!\",\"title\":\"Comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These tops are a perfect fit for me they are  little longer also the sleeves are longer.\\nThey launder just fine. I take them out of the dryer while they are damp and hang them to dry.\\nI have bought several of them in different colors.\",\"title\":\"Great comfortable tops.\"},{\"name\":\"Tamra\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is a great top. I ordered my usual size and is a flattering fit. If you\'re looking for a body contouring fit you may want to go down a size. Its a nice tunic length and doesn\'t cling in the stomach area or hips. There were some loose threads on the front design by neck, hope when clipped won\'t unravel.  Other than that I\'m really pleased. I\'d love to see it in a cooler fabric since has Spandex but will be great to layer in cooler temps!\",\"title\":\"Nice Roomy Fit\"},{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I ordered 3 initially but after I wore them, washed and dried them and realized there was little to no shrinkage, I ordered more.  They are well made and fit true to size.\",\"title\":\"Nice shirts\"},{\"name\":\"Glo\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I ordered this product because of the definite stitching on it. They did a sharp look, but when I received it, you barely can see the stitching which just makes it look like a blue T-shirt. At first, I did not even think I had ordered it and then when I looked it up, I was like oh that\'s supposed to be this, I was disappointed and I am disappointed that the stitching is not bold. Very light makes it look like anyother blue T-shirt.\\nI will say the quality is not bad at all and it feels very nice on the only complaint I have is the stitching\",\"title\":\"Disappointed\"},{\"name\":\"Eva\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Prior to purchasing this t-shirt I tried to find out what it was made out of but it didn\'t say anywhere. It is a mix of polyester, rayon and spandex, which is very comfortable. However, I bought a 2X and it fits like a 1x or XL. Fits very snug because it\'s too small. Then to top it off, the tag says professionally dry clean, can be washed. You better hope it doesn\'t shrink.\",\"title\":\"Shirt not the Length as pictured.\"},{\"name\":\"Tonya\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"It was too long for me at 5\'4” at 175 pounds. I wanted something to wear with workout leggings not past my butt. I\'m short wasted though. I ordered a white and a gray and got two white.\",\"title\":\"Long.\"},{\"name\":\"KJ\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"In the photo the outer stitching design is a darker grey than the shirt which makes it cute, what I received was a the stitching was same color as shirt and it looks like an oversized night-shirt, I can\'t wear this outside. I look like I didn\'t change my night chothes... Just not happy.\",\"title\":\"Not what it looks like in photo\"},{\"name\":\"Tonya\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered two XL tshirts. One in white and one in light gray. I got two in white. They are really long. Looks more like a man tshirt. I\'m 5\'5” 180 pounds DD breast. It covers my butt completely. I am going to use them as night shirts to sleep in. I do recommend if this is what you are looking for. It is not wide and loose like a man tshirt. If you want it loose size up. I could have worn a large if not for DD breast. I wish it was 6” shorter. And I wish they sent me two colors instead of one like I ordered.\",\"title\":\"5\'5” 180 pounds DD breast. Size XL\"}]',NULL,19.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Tshirts for Women\",\"Tshirts for Women\"]'),(504,'Plus Size Jeans','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Roaman-s-Women-s-Plus-Size-360-Stretch-Lace-Applique-Jean-22-W-Black_9d03ba99-d952-4d27-8844-701734b8d723.40b2ff44480c37b020657f4d7a09bbc6.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"14W\",\"16W\",\"18W\",\"20W\",\"22W\",\"24W\",\"26W\",\"28W\",\"30W\",\"32W\",\"34W\",\"12W\",\"36 W\",\"38 W\",\"40 W\",\"42 W\",\"44 W\"]','[\"Black\",\"Dark Wash\",\"Medium Stonewash\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"BRE███ C\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These leggings are so lovely, comfortable and affordable.  I enjoy wearing them each time I put them on.  They make you feel special.  Thank you Roamans for your lovely creation!\",\"title\":\"Comfortable, Classy Leggings\"},{\"name\":\"Lin W\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought these jeans to wear with the lace blouse that matches the lace on these jeans. They go together perfectly.  I look gorgeous when I wear this outfit. The fit is great. These jeans are very comfortable.\",\"title\":\"Absolutely gorgeous!!!\"},{\"name\":\"DOR███Y B███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These pants are just as described! Very cute! Great fit! Well made and comfortable! They look fabulous with the cold shoulder lace white top. What a great match!!!\",\"title\":\"Must Buy To See!\"},{\"name\":\"ARL███ P\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these jeans - they are just so pretty, comfortable, and fit perfectly.  If they were available in another color, I would definitely get them.  Just sorry I can\'t wear jeans to work.\",\"title\":\"Love Love These Jeans\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███ S\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These jeans go with everything, and I get a compliment every single time I wear them.  Very comfortable, too.\",\"title\":\"Lace Jeans\"},{\"name\":\"Tam███ H\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Get tons of compliments when I wear them even by men and women I don\'t know.\"},{\"name\":\"Sca███tt ███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I absolutely love the look of this Jean. It says no gap but mine gaps at the white part. I still love them but was disappointed . They are still gorgeous and  I get a lot of compliments when I wear them.\",\"title\":\"White Lace  Jean with Chambray\"},{\"name\":\"Ren███H\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Cute but 12W were way too small! Couldn’t pull them up at all! I wear a normal size 12 ladies. What’s wrong with your sizing? And I was worried about them being too big. My size 4 granddaughter wouldn’t be able to wear these\",\"title\":\"TOO SMALL!\"},{\"name\":\"NAN███R\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Wanted these jeans for months but was very disappointed when i got them. First of all they run way small! I normally wear 20W so that\'s what I ordered. Not even close to fitting so I exchanged them for 22W and they are also too tight. Just not comfortable. They also are much longer that the picture suggests, so check your length if you want ankle length. The material is not very stretchy and they are heavier than I expected. Paid too much to hang in the closet.\",\"title\":\"Very Disappointing\"},{\"name\":\"Kia███sam███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These fit tight like leggings, not jeans, and did not look good on me. The size is smaller, so order at least one size bigger. The lace was beautiful and stunning.\",\"title\":\"More like Leggings\"}]',NULL,71.11,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Jeans\",\"Plus Size Jeans\"]'),(505,'All Baseball Gear & Equipments',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/