y birthday came and my friend was taking me for dinner-so u decided to wear it-even though it was in the 80s… so glad I wore that too out-it was so comfortable-so now I\'m going to order a few more!!\",\"title\":\"My Mother\'s Day/Birthday top\"},{\"name\":\"Eena\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Good sleeve length. Comfortable fit.\",\"title\":\"Perfect Sleeves\"},{\"name\":\"joker\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The shirt is true to size \\nsoft,comfortable,breathable and just write for summer.\",\"title\":\"worth the wait\"},{\"name\":\"Ann\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these tops. I have 4 of them. They fit perfectly. I like that the short sleeves are a little longer. They are comfortable, cool, and pretty colors!\",\"title\":\"Pretty tops\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the fit and feel of the material.\"},{\"name\":\"NCKat\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I should have read more of the crticial reviews before ordering this shirt. I saw that it was rated as \\\"runs large\\\", which is a total joke. I sized down but it wouldn\'t have mattered. The shirt is clingy and tight in style - not \\\"flowy\\\" or tailed at the bottom. Very disappointed.\",\"title\":\"RUNS VERY SMALL, STYLE NOT AS SHOWN\"},{\"name\":\"mis███g6k███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Very disappointed in this top. I hate the type of material, it is thin and why can\'t items be made of cotton; even a blend of cotton and polyester would be better. This top made me look like I was wearing a maternity top....it would be good for any woman who was pregnant. Sorry, but I will be putting this top in the give away bag to Good Will.\",\"title\":\"Not My Cup of Tea\"},{\"name\":\"eli███eth███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The top is cute. Love the color. Purchased the same size I always do but it was too small. The main reason I only gave it 2 stars is that I tried to return it only to be told I can\'t return it to Walmart I have to contact another company and have them email me a return label. Then I have to go to UPS to get the label printed and ship it back. I am not at all happy about this!\",\"title\":\"Less than desirable return policy\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███e\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I bought these tops and the 2x was to small, I ordered the 3x and they are fine. I\'ve tried to returm 3 of the 2x for a refund THREE TIMES to Walmart.  when they scan the barcode it says unreturnable. I was able to return the one that came a few days ago with no problem.  I waited till I got it so I could return all 4 at the same time. Why can\'t I return them...I went on line clicked that I was returning to nearest Walmart,  it sa6s return by September 5th....not a happy customer!!\",\"title\":\"stressful\"}]',NULL,39.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Blouses\",\"Womens Blouses\"]'),(509,'Womens Blouses','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/IBTOM-CASTLE-Women-Long-Sleeve-Metalic-Shiny-Leather-Turtleneck-One-Piece-Gymnastics-Leotard-Ballet-Dancewear-Athletic-Train-Top-XS-Black_2a2abd4a-19a3-48b3-91e6-8735496d12d5.b597d1e6f56df02aa704372c27e79636.jpeg\"',3.60,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Dark Green\",\"Gold\",\"Gray\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Light Green\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Silver\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Turn garment inside-out, hand wash separately in cold water with mild detergent,line dry, do not bleach\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Betty\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Took too long to come ordered the wrong size and couldnt figure out how to exchange \\nso took it to Walmart\",\"title\":\"Very shiny and beautiful  loved the color looked e\"},{\"name\":\"VN\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I normally wear a small or size 6, I\'m 5\'6, 120 pounds. I\'m sending the large back, couldn\'t even get it zipped up the back. I\'m giving it another shot, ordering an XL, hopefullt that will work. Whoever wrote the size chart for this product is either blind or is really bad at measuring things.\",\"title\":\"Runs VERY VERY small\"},{\"name\":\"Hea███r\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"runs couple sizes small, zipper not made well.\",\"title\":\"Order couple sizes up\"},{\"name\":\"Con███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Und███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Maria\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"ineka\",\"rating\":1}]',NULL,26.98,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Blouses\",\"Womens Blouses\"]'),(510,'Womens Tank Tops',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/ZXSXSY-Women-Sleeveless-Square-Neck-Spaghetti-Straps-Solid-Color-Velvet-Tank-Top_447cd408-0c40-4854-a0df-927e22ca5bd7.4b6331828af4e8e6e58bbde8f2187bc2.jpeg\"',4.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]','[\"A_Black\",\"A_Dark Khaki\",\"A_Green\",\"A_Light Khaki\",\"A_Royal Blue\",\"A_Wine Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Do not screw, Dry in the air, Hand Wash Better, Accept Wash Machine, Do not Bleach, Non-High-Temperature Ironing, Avoid Over Exposure.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Cliff\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Cute top for winter. Fabric is soft and a little stretchy but does not cling to your body. Hems are nice and neat and the colors do not fade or blend in the wash, this is a concern of mine when buying shirts that are both dark and light colors. I like how you can pair ir both boots and tennis dressing it up or down.\",\"title\":\"Good little casual winter top\"},{\"name\":\"Deb███h\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the shirt.  I increased size to ensure loose fit.  I would recommend this shirt to everyone.  It goes great with jeans or leggings.  It goes great w/ tennis shoes or boots - dress it up or down.\",\"title\":\"Love, love, love this shirt!!\"},{\"name\":\"kat███en\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The top is excellent quality, looks just like the pictures, great fit. I purchased 3 tops and all were fabulous! I will be purchasing from this company again and again!\",\"title\":\"So cute!\"},{\"name\":\"Mel███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"super cute top it makes me look thinner LOL highly recommended and material is a little spandexy but that\'s okay\",\"title\":\"material isnt cotton like i thought but still cute\"},{\"name\":\"Peggy\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The Material is very thin and I was very disappointed with that. It runs small too. It would be nice for spring or fall.\"},{\"name\":\"Vir███ia\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"This blouse is Dry Clean- really? If I had known that I would not have purchased it. It also made in China, ? I also would not have purchased this if I knew that. What happened to products made in the USA?\"},{\"name\":\"Jan\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Colors not the same as picture\",\"title\":\"Disappointed.\"},{\"name\":\"Sho███nmo███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Super thin material. Order a 2 xl it fit like and xl like I normal wear.  But have decided to return it because of the super thin material.\",\"title\":\"Cute shirt but not worth the money\"},{\"name\":\"Mea███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Never received. Ordered in mid October. Here it is the end of December and have requested refund twice with no response from merchant. DO NOT PURCHASE!\",\"title\":\"Never received.\"},{\"name\":\"nic███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Material looked okay, but I cant wear it since I was sent a shirt 4 sizes too big.\",\"title\":\"Received wrong size\"}]',NULL,17.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Tank Tops\",\"Womens Tank Tops\"]'),(511,'Bed Skirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SGI-Bedding-16-Inch-Wrap-Around-Bed-Skirt-Microfiber-Fade-Resistant-Wrinkle-Free-Anti-static-Decorative-Extra-Storage-Space-Clutter-Free-Twin-Navy-Bl_1d63d043-d287-4158-9b03-6776c74ba093.28562c9f6ca89574cbf7d2b044604bb0.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"California King- 14\\\"\",\"Full- 14\\\"\",\"King- 14\\\"\",\"Olympic Queen- 14\\\"\",\"Queen- 14\\\"\",\"Twin- 14\\\"\",\"California King- 16\\\"\",\"Full- 16\\\"\",\"King-16\\\"\",\"Olympic Queen- 16\\\"\",\"Queen- 16\\\"\",\"Twin- 16\\\"\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blood Red\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Egyptian Blue\",\"Golden\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Ivory\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Gray\",\"Lilac\",\"Mediterranean Blue\",\"Moss\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Parrot Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink\",\"Plum\",\"Purple\",\"Rust\",\"Sage\",\"Taupe\",\"Teal\",\"Turquoise Blue\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\",\"Zebra Print\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash Cold. Do Not Bleach. Tumble Dry Low. Remove Promptly.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Bev███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very pretty color, easy to put on box springs by myself. Works better than last bed skirt I ordered.\",\"title\":\"Would order this again.\"},{\"name\":\"Mad███ine███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"What just what I was looking for.\",\"title\":\"Perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Ami███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought this in maroon color and it is very nice. There is no need to iron because it is not crumpled after washing.\",\"title\":\"Good buy\"},{\"name\":\"Rita\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I liked my new bedskirt. Perfect color. Fit great.\"},{\"name\":\"Snow\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"very pleased, loved the color and it was a perfect fit\",\"title\":\"perfect fit\"},{\"name\":\"MM\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"looks amazing but it\'s weird to put on the bed\"},{\"name\":\"Evita\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The bedskirt was fine except it wasn\'t the pale lilac color as shown in the picture, so I had to return it. I\'ve already returned it, so I cannot tae a picture.\",\"title\":\"Bedskirt\"},{\"name\":\"DebNS\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Requested lavender but it was \\npurple-ish pink. By the time I opened the pkg after putting my lavender sheets on, that was when I noticed the color. The invoice stated lavender. It was a couple months after the seasonal weather changes %26 opened the white brand name bag that I noticed the color was definitely purple-ish pink.\\nMuch to late to return. I hope to gift it when I find that person! \\nThank you.\",\"title\":\"My bad not opening sooner\"},{\"name\":\"yel███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Don\'t buy!  YELLOW, not ivory. Perfect for trash bin only.  AWFUL!  Hate it!\",\"title\":\"Don\'t buy!  This bed skirt is YELLOW, not ivory\"},{\"name\":\"Z\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,21.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Skirts\"]'),(512,'Shop Curtains','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/BrylaneHome-BH-Studio-Sheer-Voile-Rod-Pocket-Panel-Pair-120-W-108-L-Lavender_8b7e8ecc-8f76-4507-9734-b220e0d3b3e7.e70e59b8594912a4e513130e0b5bf519.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"120\\\"W 108\\\"L\",\"120\\\"W 63\\\" L\",\"120\\\"W 72\\\" L\",\"120\\\"W 84\\\" L\",\"120\\\"W 95\\\" L\"]','[\"Autumn Leaves\",\"Burgundy\",\"Daffodil\",\"Dark Turquoise\",\"Ecru\",\"Eggshell\",\"Gold\",\"Lavender\",\"Pale Rose\",\"Ruby\",\"Sage\",\"Seaglass\",\"Silver\",\"Slate\",\"Smoke Blue\",\"White\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Gin███R\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love our sheer curtains...great value, great curtains!\",\"title\":\"great curtrains!\"},{\"name\":\"Pam\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The curtains are beautiful and I love the material. Actually my living room looks outstanding.prefect for your living room. I will purchase another set\"},{\"name\":\"rob███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Good quality, not all crooked . Also they look nice 👍\",\"title\":\"Pleased\"},{\"name\":\"Deb███ S\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these sheers!!! Color was spot on and they are good quality material.Stores don\'t carry a wide selection in size or color of sheers. Happy I could order them!\",\"title\":\"Perfect!!\"},{\"name\":\"pat███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Exactly as described.\\n The color was perfect.\",\"title\":\"perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Ana███B\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful curtains, been buying them for years and many different colors.   very durable, generous widths, they filer light well while decorating the rooms.  Thank you Brylane!\",\"title\":\"Great curtains!\"},{\"name\":\"Joyce\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The order was delivered quickly and exactly what I ordered.\",\"title\":\"definitely a 5 star experience\"},{\"name\":\"Gwe███lyn███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Drapes are very sheer compared to linen type.\",\"title\":\"Sheer Drapes\"},{\"name\":\"Sus███3\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Not the color as in the picture\",\"title\":\"Returned\"},{\"name\":\"Diane\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I cant find the exact length I need so I hung them using curtain hanger clips; added some length. Bought autumn orange. Pretty color; like a burnt orange. I bought more to make the sliding glass door look more full.\",\"title\":\"Pretty Orange Color\"}]',NULL,33.33,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(513,'Womens Skirts',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Zenana-Women-Plus-Relaxed-Drawstring-Waist-Draped-Basic-Maxi-Skirts-with-Side-Pockets_fb8c57ed-4380-4caa-bfe1-75078035ef3e.a0b388618c0bdbf458e3515a30ffcd98.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\"]','[\"ALMOND\",\"AMERICANO\",\"ARMY GREEN\",\"ASH BLUE\",\"ASH GREY\",\"ASH MOCHA\",\"Black\",\"BLUE GREY\",\"BRIGHT BLUE\",\"Brown\",\"BURGUNDY\",\"DESERT ROSE\",\"DK BURGUNDY\",\"DK OLIVE\",\"DK RUST\",\"DUSTY TEAL\",\"EGGPLANT\",\"FIRED BRICK\",\"H GREY\",\"HOT PINK\",\"LT GREEN\",\"LT NAVY\",\"LT OLIVE\",\"MAGENTA\",\"MIDNIGHT NAVY\",\"MOCHA\",\"ROSE\",\"RUBY\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ros███ry\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Loved the pockets, true to size, fun to wear a long skirt again, dressy or running errands looks great, very washable %26 no shrink in dryer,,I ordered 3 more in different colors..\",\"title\":\"So comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Dee\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This material is very good quality- doesn\'t cling, drapes well, doesn\'t attract lint. It is soft and  has a bit of form and buttery soft! It is long but can be rolled at waist or hemmed. I have different size heels and flats so customize by rolling the waist over. Love the working drawstring! Love the pockets that fit my keys and stretch for my phone. I bought one, washed in hot water and hung up to dry and no wrinkles at all. Then bought four more. Arrived fast and well packaged!\",\"title\":\"Quality skirt- long but can roll waist\"},{\"name\":\"Ros███ry\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Comfortable, pockets , most important pockets!!!!!! Hangs well, fits well…I will order another one\"},{\"name\":\"Donna\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fit is perfect.  True to size.  Flattering and comfortable.\",\"title\":\"Recommend highly\"},{\"name\":\"Bea███gir███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"i like the idea of a drawstring waist maxi skirt, but this is like sweater fabric, not for me. also runs small\",\"title\":\"soft fabric, like a sweater\"},{\"name\":\"Dee\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Dee\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Dee\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Kim███ly\",\"rating\":4},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":4}]',NULL,23.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Skirts\",\"Womens Skirts\"]'),(514,'Plus Size Pajama Sets','[\"Reduced price\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Cueply-Women-Plus-Size-Pajamas-Set-Short-Sleeve-Pjs-Sleepwear-Loungewear-Nightwear-with-Pockets_a5f43b5b-cb59-41e4-aa59-335443e16060.6b29ae1d676bc4d68006170db0fc308a.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\",\"4X\"]','[\"01 Black\",\"02 Dark Gray\",\"03 FP-Big Leaf Pink\",\"04 FP-Leopard Khaki\",\"05 FP-Light Blue\",\"06 FP-Brown Black\",\"07 FP-Pink Star\",\"08 FP-White\",\"09 FP-Mix Blue\",\"10 FP-Wine Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash and machine wash recommended with cold Water/Do Not Bleach/Hang Or Line Dry.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"mis███l4\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are some of the best pajamas I have purchased ever!  They are extremely comfortable, very soft, and wash very well with no shrinkage.  I have 2 other pair but they are lighter patterned sets and they are not as nice as these.\",\"title\":\"Extremely comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Lori\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I would live in these if I could. Soft and comfortable lightweight summer material. I bought 4 sets and after wearing them I plan on buying the rest to replace my other sleepwear. Buy them, you will not be disappointed.\",\"title\":\"HIGHLY RECOMMEND\"},{\"name\":\"She███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful and very soft. Can\'t tell if you are wearing jammies or a cute capri set. For some reason the white set runs a little larger from how they fit me I have different colors. Definitely perfect for a hospital stay or coming home from the hospital. It\'s what I bought them for but definitely can wear them anywhere.\\n\\nEnjoy 😊😊\",\"title\":\"Very comfy!!\"},{\"name\":\"Lori\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I would live in these if I could. Soft and comfortable lightweight summer material. I bought 4 sets and after wearing them I plan on buying the rest to replace my other sleepwear. Buy them, you will not be disappointed.\",\"title\":\"HIGHLY RECOMMEND\"},{\"name\":\"KG\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Soft, good stretch, lightweight, runs nice %26 full.  I wear a 26/28 %26 the 3X fits great, still relaxed loose fit.  I put just about everything in the dryer, even when the label says not to, and these came out just fine on medium heat.  Bought 1 set to try, loved them, bought 2 more %26 considering a 4th.  Highly recommend.\",\"title\":\"Soft %26 Comfy\"},{\"name\":\"Gwen\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I loved Secret Treasures brand but they seem to be disappearing. This is an okay substitute. Fabric is nice. Styles are different and I miss the Secret Treasures styles but so far, I\'m liking these….just not as much\",\"title\":\"Okay substitute for my fav brand\"},{\"name\":\"Lara\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The fabric is stretchy, breathable and soft. It has cute details like contrasting cuffs on the capris and collar. There were lots of threads that were not trimmed off, which was an easy fix but a little surprising. Shipping was not great but I blame FedEx. They said \\\"business closed\\\" when it was being delivered to a residence, not a business, and I had to go to a FedEx store to pick it up.\",\"title\":\"comfortable fabric, vibrant colors\"},{\"name\":\"Mel███61\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"If you have allergies like I do since getting older, my skin was irritated just taking out of packaging. Made in China. Hoping it gets better or have to throw out.\",\"title\":\"Wash before wearing\"},{\"name\":\"NoJoy\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Loved the color, style %26 print.\\nNo washing instruction tag.  I cautiously washed Cold/Gentle. On low heat.  Sold as a Plus 3X. SHRUNK to child\'s medium.\",\"title\":\"ShrinkyDink!\"},{\"name\":\"Tammy\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I love these pj\'s however, the color was not what I ordered! The background color was supposed to be black, I have ordered this color and design multiple times. This time the flowers were the same the trim was black but the color was gray! Ugly!! Down right ugly!\",\"title\":\"Wrong background color\"}]',NULL,39.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Pajamas & Loungewear\",\"Womens Plus Size Pajamas & Loungewear\",\"Plus Size Pajama Sets\"]'),(515,'Shop All Doormats','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SIXHOME-Outdoor-Mat-Non-Slip-Doormat-17-x30-Front-Door-Absorbent-Rubber-Welcome-Low-Profile-Dirt-Trapper-Indoor-Thick-Crosshatch-Entryway-Rug-Floor-G_8e669fa7-9a1c-4e30-a705-37339f7e6eec.aeb4018a658102761e9dd90f65202a05.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"17\\\" x 30\\\"\",\"24\\\" x 35\\\"\",\"24\\\" x 47\\\"\",\"35\\\" x 59\\\"\"]','[\"Beige\",\"Blue\",\"Brown\",\"Crosshatch-Black\",\"Crosshatch-Blue\",\"Crosshatch-Brown\",\"Crosshatch-Grey\",\"Red\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Simply sweep, vacuum or shake off, and spray with a hose.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ver███ca\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Well priced and excellent quality\",\"title\":\"Winter mat\"},{\"name\":\"Mir███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"it\'s placed outside my front door in a hallway since I live in a condo building. Even though does not see technically debris from the outside area like an outdoor porch area would, this matt catches the dirt from our shoes and the feel is nice and soft. Overall, a good product that I would recommend.\",\"title\":\"sturdy beautiful outdoor matt\"},{\"name\":\"Chris\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"this floor mat is well made and should last years. I have it just on the inside of my entrance/ front door. I have a stiff, plastic grass type mat on the outside of my entrance. the outside mat is to get the dirt from the grooves of tennis shoes and it does a good job. this inside mat is to get whatever remains off of shoes, and it does a good job. I could easily switch the two but I prefer it this way. just a personal choice. bottom line, this is a really good mat and well worth the money.\",\"title\":\"Great mat!\"},{\"name\":\"John\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Not just a door mat, although it would be excellent for that case as well. This is perfect as a rug replacement inside as well such as near a desk, in the kitchen, or by an entryway. It has a nice pattern, cleans very easily by vacuum or rinsing, and is highly durable. It doesn\'t scratch or fray. I use it as a rug to keep my desk chair from sliding on the hardwood and it is much better than the actual rug I used to use. The pets like it too, and even with all that it looks good as new after months of use. Great product!\",\"title\":\"High quality, great indoor/outdoor\"},{\"name\":\"sally\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"it came wrapped well... instantly flattened and has not moved. heavy duty for right inside the back door. replaced a lighter weight larger rug. nice ridges grab dirt from outside. was not bought for looks but they\'re pretty neutral. recommend.\"},{\"name\":\"Tru███ovi███mOK███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i can honestly say these outdoor mats are better than i expected. They\'re sturdy, thick, do not get blown away with the wind and don\'t shift. The only drawback is that when it rains, they hold a whole lot of water and they\'re a bit heavy to lift and drain. Other than that, I love them!\",\"title\":\"Thoroughly impressed\"},{\"name\":\"Kimmi\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I brought this for my front door when you come into house. I love the design. I vacuum it but to get it super its going to have to be washed with a hose or power washer. Very heavy Matt well made too. I got another one for my kitchen for the dogs always dripping water from their mouth. I\'m glad I purchase this and will get another one if and when needed.\",\"title\":\"Great Mat\"},{\"name\":\"Liz\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"These are heavy and appear well made but when rained on, become soggy and hold water causing issues with the underneath wood. I would buy something that drys out.\",\"title\":\"Won\'t Dry Out-Soaking Wet\"},{\"name\":\"Tre███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Just opened the product and it looks to have some manufacturer defects, it looks worn and used. The bevel edge appears grey and worn as if it\'s 10 years old, in the product imagery online it is black as I\'m sure the product is intended to be.\",\"title\":\"Looks damaged\"},{\"name\":\"Rut███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The mat I expected to clean and dry feet before coming into my home, holds onto water in its channels and raised ridges when it rains. It needs to be dumped and hung on a railing to dry. It would be better suited as an indoor mat.\",\"title\":\"Better as an indoor mat.\"}]',NULL,24.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Rugs\",\"Doormats\",\"Shop All Doormats\"]'),(516,'Auburn Hair Color',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/L-Oreal-Paris-Superior-Preference-Fade-Defying-Permanent-Hair-Color-7LA-Lightest-Auburn-1-kit_401dfe9d-4745-47c4-b320-b2890bee8b9f.cfc33c149d57afea756baf569098437e.jpeg\"',4.20,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Instructions vary by shade. For complete instructions, please refer to package insert located inside hair color box.\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got this product for my sister in laws. Smells good and leaves hair soft and conditioned. Caused no damage to fine hair. Their hair color is medium/dark brown with some golden and strawberry highlights when the sun hits it. They both ar3 grown out partial balayage and decided to try a box dye for the first time in their life. This one looked safe for both natural hair with sensitive skin as well as highlights. Activator bottle has a screw top, didn\'t have to look for scissors to open it. The application process was smooth and easy and the scent was pleasant!  The conditioner was lightly scented smooth and also washed out easily . it washed out nicely from the scalp. Overall it was a great product. They were so pleased with the color results!\",\"title\":\"Beautiful Color\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███n\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I liked how easy it was to use for someone that already has blonde hair. I mainly bought this color just to lift my grown out roots a few shades lighter. However, the colors shown on the side of the box didnt exactly match up (which should generally be expected with box color considering it doesnt account for undertones already present in the hair). I already have medium blonde hair with areas of lighter blonde (level 9-10). Over all I think it actually darkened my color some due to the ash tone. For a box color, it served its purpose. I would definitely get a lighter color next time, as this was darker than stated on box.\",\"title\":\"Good for a box color - Go lighter\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Love the overall color, dislike the brassiness towards the roots and the fact my scalp weeped for 2-3 days resulting in crunchy hair and discomfort but with 3 rounds of purple shampoo and purple conditioning mask, it\'s made me overall happy :) pic is after 2 rounds each. Left on 40min I believe. Had mousey cardboard kinda brown before (L\'Oréal\'s 8.5A champagne blonde before this)\",\"title\":\"Don\'t leave on too long, you\'ll end up with scabs.\"},{\"name\":\"Cindy\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I ordered Medium Natural Blonde and was given medium blonde , I hope its not an ash blonde since are no longer being properly descriptive. and even though it does say its a nm. 8 color formula the pic on box lóoks much much lighter then what I ordered .\",\"title\":\"did loreal change wording and pics\"},{\"name\":\"Paige\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I\'m not sure if the actual product has a problem or works well yet. BUT, the box of hair dye only came in a VERY thin bubble mailer and nothing else to keep it from smashing inside the mailer. It should have come in a box with bubble wrap around it. For that reason, I give only 3 stars.\",\"title\":\"Box came smashed to bits due to no care packaging.\"},{\"name\":\"Ama███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I have bought this dye more than 3 times online, I love the color.  But this time it came well packaged on the outside, however one of the boxes was open and the conditioner was missing.  The store should check carefully before sending a product to a customer.\",\"title\":\"Missing parts of the product\"},{\"name\":\"hac███rd7███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Damaged... leaked all over the box. The tip of the bottle was actually broken off. Looked intentional but I wasn\'t there when the packaged the items so I don\'t know.  It wouldn\'t let me do one star. Then they expect me to take the soaked box back in for a refund or replacement??\",\"title\":\"Damaged... the item not my hair.\"},{\"name\":\"Mon███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Even though I buy the same color tint , it really mess me up , a different color was in the box and instead of the color in the box, a different color came out , now I have the wrong color in my head and I’m so mad  . I hate it , won’t write anything else because I can be to aggressive.\",\"title\":\"Hate it\"},{\"name\":\"Den███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I\'ve used preference for 20  years. I use the medium brown number five. I naturally have a medium brown hair. I have always been very pleased with this product. However, they have recently changed the formula so beware! The last three boxes I have used have been horrible. It turns my hair an orangey brown and I can\'t stand orange undertones. In addition, the new formula will only last two weeks so my dye job is gone after two weeks. I\'m just going to have to change to a different brand because I just can\'t be dying my hair every two weeks. It\'s not healthy. In addition, I\'m not getting the color I want anyway. So what\'s the point? I don\'t understand why product manufacturers will go and, change a good thing. This is one of the top dyes on the market for over-the-counter and I don\'t know if they\'re cutting corners or what but this was a big mistake.  Now I need to research what to replace my favorite dye with ☹️. The photo is two weeks after my dye.  It used to dye it a rich brown.  Now it\'s just a red mess.\",\"title\":\"Caution- formula change!!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Lesa\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I don\'t know if someone switched the color in the box or what but this is clearly not medium blonde I put the color on my hair I went and went and did the dishes set the timer and when I came back my take a shower and looked at the color in the mirror before I did it was brown when I rinsed it in the shower I got out and it was still brown so yeah, this is not medium blonde it\'s brown not anything close to my natural color which is the whole idea of coloring your hair is to keep it as close to your natural color as possible!\",\"title\":\"Something clearly went wrong somewhere\"}]','Our Formulas Are Modified From Time To Time, So This Ingredient Listing May Not Exactly Reflect The Ingredients In The Produc