fabric gets holes and becomes torn and then very quickly looks shabby. That\'s disappointing. I wish that my review was able to include a photo and I would show you what I\'m speaking about.\",\"title\":\"Tears in Fabric\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"One shoe was really stretched out when I got it. The top fabric has already ripped after a few weeks of wearing them indoors. The white scuffs easily. Very comfortable and cute though.\",\"title\":\"Already look warn\"},{\"name\":\"Bre███C\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The fabric split the first time I tried on. These shoes looked promising for someone who wears an AFO but sadly not wide enough.\",\"title\":\"Not wide enough for AFO\'s\"},{\"name\":\"Bea███irl███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"the shoe is a beige color not white as described and pictured.\",\"title\":\"Not white as described.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I wore these shoes for 2 days before the fabric began to tear. They are so comfortable and cute, but I wish they were better quality!\",\"title\":\"Poor quality!!\"},{\"name\":\"Jay███1\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Shoes tore apart the first day worn. Holes all over the top of the shoe.\",\"title\":\"Waste of money!\"}]',NULL,80.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Womens Shoes\",\"Womens Sneakers\",\"Womens Slip on Sneakers\"]'),(661,'7 Piece Patio Dining Set','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/c345c4b2-86ad-4403-b41f-e37dd0aede43.9054accc155a75b15d48dafedf54d0ed.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"5 Pcs Round Table Set\",\"5 Pcs Square Table Set\",\"6 Pcs Dining Set\",\"7 Pcs Dining Set\"]','[\"Black\",\"Dark Brown\",\"Dark Green\",\"Gray\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Sand\",\"Teak\",\"Turquoise\",\"Weathered Wood\",\"White\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Ala███h\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The BEST set ever. The white is beautiful so sturdy and perfect for my backyard overlooking the canal. LOVE\"},{\"name\":\"Tommy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This set is was the best price we found anywhere, but an equal to the higher priced one. Living in the South, we experience Pine Pollen time when everything get a fine coat of yellow sticky dust. This table & chairs cleaned up GREAT with a little soap & water.\"},{\"name\":\"Reid\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Perfect outdoor set for our beach house. We are right on the water so we needed something that would not deteriorate after a year.\"},{\"name\":\"Kasey\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nice quality table that I know will last me a long time!\"},{\"name\":\"judy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'ve been looking at this type of furniture for my patio since I was tired of repainting my old set. I wanted something durable and maintenance free. This was the most cost-effective that I found. So far I\'m very impressed with the quality and look. Highly recommend it!\"},{\"name\":\"MeMe\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Bought for our pool deck. Seems to be sturdy and heavy enough the wind won\'t blow it over. Love the teak color and that it has a 20 year warranty.\",\"title\":\"Dining set\"},{\"name\":\"Bill\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This table is beautiful. Nicely made we already had the rocking chairs. Easy to set up, very classy addition to our outdoor area under the pergola. Sturdy and good looking set.\"},{\"name\":\"Bon███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Good quality, durable, easy maintenance outdoor furniture. I reduced one star because a few screws that bolt from the foot base into the legs were not long enough. They were all the same screws but for some reason a few weren�t holding the foot in place.\"},{\"name\":\"Est███e\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Great set! The chairs are a little smaller than I thought though.\"},{\"name\":\"Wyatt\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Solid and durable set! It will weather the elements well. Seat back is a tad uncomfortable.\"}]',NULL,2629.99,NULL,'[\"Patio & Garden\",\"Patio Furniture\",\"Patio Sets\",\"Patio Dining Sets\",\"7 Piece Patio Dining Set\"]'),(662,'Premium Hair Color',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Celeb-Luxury-Gem-Lites-Colorditioner-with-Semi-Permanent-BondFix-Vegan-Hair-Dye-Cocoa-Quartz-8-25-fl-oz_78ac7b32-4c66-45ab-a08e-c208de1611b7.5b5d5e8eb40bd8fe9cb187a9afcb1fe2.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"8.25 fl oz\"]','[\"Blue\",\"Brown\",\"Gem Lites Brown Tahition Colorditioner\",\"Gem Lites Cognac Quartz Colorwash\",\"Gem Lites Flawless Diamond Colorditioner\",\"Pink\",\"Sandy Opal [ Sandy Blonde ]\"]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Use as a mask on clean dry hair for 20 mins for deep moisturizing condition that strengthens hair with a smooth natural glossy finish. To build more color re-apply use daily!\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jenny\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have been using diamond gem lites to refresh my highlights for 5  years. A little bit goes a long way and it\'s the only purple shampoo that actually works. It works quickly too so I\'m not stuck standing in the shower for 10 minutes while it covers the brass. Sometimes I\'ll mix a tiny bit of conditioner with it in the summer if my hair is feeling dried out. I haven\'t tried any other color but imagine they are all good.\",\"title\":\"It\'s the only purple shampoo I\'ll use\"},{\"name\":\"ale███dra███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s a great product for an acceptable price .\\nFast shipping was a plus . The color comes out great in my hair . Make sure you buy a color safe shampoo and conditioner!!\",\"title\":\"Great product !\"},{\"name\":\"Bre███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very easy to use. Use it like regular shampoo in the shower and apply it to the light parts of your hair / bleached areas. The color is pastel, so you\'ll need to apply a generous amount to get it more opaque. The color will stay in your hair for weeks, as long as you use color safe shampoo on your next shower.. or keep using the color shampoo to keep the color in your hair consistently. It will slowly fade if you don\'t consistently use the color shampoo.\"},{\"name\":\"Rab███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I use it to revive the red in my hair when it starts fading. It works well and does not dry my hair out like other products have.\",\"title\":\"It works\"},{\"name\":\"Deb███h O███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Helps to keep the yellow out of my virgin white/grey hair. [This review was collected as part of a promotion.]\",\"title\":\"Great product\"},{\"name\":\"Bra███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is the best shampoo and conditioner for keeping your hair color bright but definitely use gloves it will stain your hands!!\"},{\"name\":\"Kim███lyH███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My hair was ash blonde, after using viral light pink it turned rose gold/ strawberry blonde. \\n\\nSoftens hair and Smells great!\",\"title\":\"Color came out great!\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███n\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Give you GREAT bright color that fades beautifully in around 10-15 washes. The only problem is it is incredibly drying.  I\'d really recommend also purchasing the Blonditioner as well.\\n\\n(Including before with faded pink and after 1 wash following directions)\",\"title\":\"Beautiful, but so drying\"},{\"name\":\"Tina\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I have been using this product (from other sources) for 5 years and this the first time I have been disappointed with it. First of all the product did not have an inner seal on the bottle which always has in the past. The pump was already attached which it never has been in the past. The product was much much thinner than I\'ve ever seen it in the past. The product is normally thick like a lotion, this was a runny like water. Lastly it took five washes to get the same effect that I normally get with one.\",\"title\":\"Has somebody tampered with the product?\"},{\"name\":\"Sha███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It\'s very much a deep red rose (brown red, not a blue red) with some very faint pink color. Not at all what I was expecting so unfortunately I have to return it!\",\"title\":\"NOT A BRIGHT HOT PINK , RED ROSE COLOR\"}]','70% Ethyl Alcohol',40.00,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"70% Ethyl Alcohol\"}]','[\"Premium Beauty\",\"Premium Hair Care\",\"Premium Hair Color\"]'),(663,'Womens Athletic Shorts',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/TheLovely-Women-Plus-Soft-Cotton-Active-Stretch-Outseam-Workout-Capri-Shorts-with-Wide-Wastband-21-Knee-Length-Shorts_6614300f-3f2b-43c9-a65e-f1e26d48a624_1.96c0844d13040397b77fe574564227f5.jpeg\"',3.70,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"2PK-H Grey/Charcoal\",\"3PK-Black/Burgundy/White\",\"3PK-Black/Charcoal/White\",\"3PK-Black/H Grey/White\",\"3PK-Black/MV Blue/White\",\"3PK-Black/Navy/White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"K\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s hard to buy any kind of pants online, b/c all fits are different. These 21\\\" bermuda leggings are perfect for me. They fit according to the charts. the wide waistband is so comfortable, not loose or tight, and the 21\\\" length covers  mid knee, which I wanted. I\'m 5\'4ish, 140lbs, pear shape and the large is just right. I also ordered extra large for sleep shorts for a little extra room. Both perfect! Will order more.\",\"title\":\"Just what I wanted\"},{\"name\":\"Lisa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these shorts for my workouts.\",\"title\":\"So soft and fit is perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Rob███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are a great pair of shorts.  Very comfortable, fit well and well made. Will buy more. Love how they fit and feel.\",\"title\":\"Great buy!\"},{\"name\":\"All███n\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These shorts fit great, feel awesome and I\'m buying a bunch more. I got the 21\\\" and they go to my knees (I\'m 5\'1\\\") which is exactly what I wanted. They are super comfortable, don\'t ride up and are light enough to wear for sleeping or even as underwear. I originally ordered my size and they fit, but I ordered a size up to get them a little looser. They do have stretch. I wish they had more colors but other than that I highly recommend them. Delivery was timely and I think the price is reasonable..\",\"title\":\"Awesome shorts - soooo cozy!\"},{\"name\":\"Flo███a\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I really like them a lot.  The size runs a little small.  The next time I will order next size bigger but I will purchase them again.\",\"title\":\"Good purchase\"},{\"name\":\"Amber\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"These are super comfortable but definitely not squat proof. You\'ll want to wear long shirts unless you don\'t mind everyone knowing what color your panties are.\"},{\"name\":\"Pre███n\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The fabric was soft but the fit was not right. The waist was overly big but the leg opening was too small.\",\"title\":\"Not for Big Legs\"},{\"name\":\"Julie\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"IT ROLLS DOWN WHEN I WALK AND I HAVE TO KEEP PULLING THEM UP.\"},{\"name\":\"len███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I never received this item\"},{\"name\":\"Dlw\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Ordered an xl , the grey pair was an cl and the black pair was a 3xl, I had already washed them before I realized I was sent two different sizes\"}]',NULL,32.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Activewear\",\"Womens Workout Bottoms\",\"Womens Athletic Shorts\"]'),(664,'Cars & SUV Toys',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fast-Go-50-Mph-Mini-RC-Car-Off-Road-Truck-1-32-Scale-Toy-Rechargeable-Remote-Control-High-Speed-2WD-Electric-Vehicle-With-2-4GHzRadio-Controller-Tran_232b71fe-7904-40ce-85ef-67ceeb5056fe.44e9711ca1949536958d8123e7f8bd82.jpeg\"',5.00,'[]','[\"Blue\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jos███\",\"rating\":5}]','Natural Flavors',20.98,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Natural Flavors\"}]','[\"Toys\",\"Cars, RC, Drones & Trains\",\"Cars & SUV Toys\"]'),(665,'Womens Athletic Shorts','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Asklazy-Mid-Waisted-Dolphin-Athletic-Shorts-for-Women-Lightweight-High-Split-Gym-Workout-Shorts-with-Liner-Quick-Dry-US-Size-White-L_15cd8682-77e2-4c0f-bc16-a4551d3fac78.02ad48ff2a13c6366616dfb529660d0c.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"D Pink\",\"D Purple\",\"Green\",\"Gray\",\"M Red\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Han███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These shorts are very soft and comfortable. The purple color is bright and fun for the summer!\",\"title\":\"Love the bright color!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"fabric is light just right for workouts, walking or jogging. color is true and will match anything.\",\"title\":\"light and flowy\"},{\"name\":\"Dog███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are very nice and fit very well. They are definitely for being lazy!\",\"title\":\"So nice and fit so well\"},{\"name\":\"N\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These shorts are so comfortable and pretty. I like the feel and the quality is amazing. I would definitely recommend to all my friends. This was a great purchase.\",\"title\":\"Comfortable shorts\"},{\"name\":\"Hea███r\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Super comfortable. Lighter green than photo.\",\"title\":\"Lighter green, but great shorts\"},{\"name\":\"Tom\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It sure would be good for summer because they’re made an athletic material and their lightweight. The skirt inside is good so that you won’t be exposed.\",\"title\":\"Nice shorts for summer\"},{\"name\":\"Ann\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Angie\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Ann\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,30.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Activewear\",\"Womens Workout Bottoms\",\"Womens Athletic Shorts\"]'),(666,'Plus Size Tops','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Catherines-Women-s-Plus-Size-Heirloom-Two-Point-Tunic-5X-Gold-Lace_328f35c5-ee3b-4617-81cb-ecf35d496018.a129dda30d0d0c228348ecb8858f878e.jpeg\"',4.00,'[\"6X\",\"0X\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\",\"4X\",\"5X\"]','[\"French Blue Lace\",\"Gold Lace\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"She███ W\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Absolutely Beautiful Clothes ,\"},{\"name\":\"Hei███H\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Pretty and comfy.\"},{\"name\":\"PAT███IA ███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Loved it!! Perfect fit. Went well with black pants.\"},{\"name\":\" sue\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Very nice material. Fit as expected.\",\"title\":\"Very Nice!\"},{\"name\":\"Mim███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Top was lovely got lots of compliments but there is an issue with the material. It snags very easily in the end I had to throw the top out. I wash my tops inside out to avoid damage to them. I wore the top yesterday & after I got to work I found 4 different snags in the front of the top & when I took it off I found 5 snags in the back of the top.\",\"title\":\"Lovely top but not worth the cost\"},{\"name\":\"Lau███ R\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"It looked prettier in photo. I did not like the shorter front and longer at the sides as it does not cover the lower belly pooch. It is stretch knit fabric and the blue color is pretty, but I ended up returning due to that higher front.\",\"title\":\"Longer areas needed in front and back, not sides\"},{\"name\":\"Mim███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Top was lovely, please note i wash my tops inside out. When I went to wear this top for only the 2nd time, the top had snags all over it. I ended up throwing it out.\",\"title\":\"Pretty top but it easily snags\"}]',NULL,51.89,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Tops\",\"Plus Size Tops\"]'),(667,'Mens Boots','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Wolverine-Raider-DuraShocks-Waterproof-Met-Guard-CarbonMAX-Work-Wellington-Men-Peanut_87342267-d606-4a54-b9f8-3330adb37b55.72a093ed6586b05c7990f47914f54a00.jpeg\"',4.30,'[\"7\",\"7.5\",\"8\",\"8.5\",\"9\",\"9.5\",\"10\",\"10.5\",\"11\",\"11.5\",\"12\",\"13\",\"14\"]','[\"Peanut\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Simply wipe off the soap solution with a clean, wet cloth. If you can still see the grime on your leather boots, repeat the entire process to get the excess product until they are clean.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"WALLY\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"There boots are of the highest quality  comfortable to the point i ve never had a boot as nice as these boot are\",\"title\":\"Raider durashock s waterproof met -guard wellingto\"},{\"name\":\"SRoy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great Boot for a narrow heel i would suggest 1/2 size smaller. Waterproof comfortably from day one.\",\"title\":\"Shift worker\"},{\"name\":\"Jerry\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"There a really good boot they\'re comfortable they are water resistant wolverine makes the best boot. I have tried a lot of boots and wolverine is the best.\",\"title\":\"Good value\"},{\"name\":\"Jim\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'m a welder with job that requires Metatarsal and Safety Toe Boots. These boots are ideal for me because of hot work area. This is my third pair and I could have still worn the old ones.\",\"title\":\"Work Requirements\"},{\"name\":\"Jor███ W.███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These boots are great!! I work in a facility with water and chemicals, and I walk over 7 miles per day. I have to be able to depend on my boots for protection and comfort, these boots provide both to the highest degree! If you are looking for a comfortable, water proof, and a quality boot, then this may work for you as well! Great products, awesome customer service!! Thank you Wolverine!\",\"title\":\"Quality Boots!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Henry\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These boots are the best comfortable and durable I like these boots they are worth every penny unspend for them\",\"title\":\"Boot\"},{\"name\":\"cruzg\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I\'ve been using work boots like this since several years ago and nothing better than these\",\"title\":\"great work boots even better\"},{\"name\":\"Km\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Their ok. Have along break in time. Been wearing them 3 weeks 12 hrs a day and just now starting to get a little relief. Had to replace insoles immediately. They had no cushion at all.\",\"title\":\"Their ok\"},{\"name\":\"Fre███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I am a long time wolverine fan I have worn wolverines for13 years. These boots how ever they do not deserve to have the wolverine logo on them they are uncomfortable don\'t fit the heel well at all the top of it cuts into your shins even wearing long socks. The side of it feels like its crushing my ankles. I am just very disappointed with these boots.\",\"title\":\"Terrible boots\"},{\"name\":\"Kyle\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Usually love wolverine boots but these are extremely uncomfortable for me. The bottom of my feet are sore all day and the met gaurd puts pressure on the top of my foot. Seem well made though\",\"title\":\"They are ok\"}]',NULL,204.95,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Mens Shoes\",\"Mens Boots\",\"Mens Boots\"]'),(668,'Plus Size Tops','[\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Fantaslook-Blouses-for-Women-Pleated-Short-Sleeve-Tunic-Tops-Dressy-Casual-Summer-Shirts_1a5d6f65-e08f-4996-b263-42e81556743d.07dd4fd3997a8585d87094559a88ca3b.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"1 Long Sleeve Black Floral\",\"1 Long Sleeve Khaki\",\"1 Long Sleeve Lake Green\",\"Black Floral\",\"Blue Floral\",\"Green Floral\",\"Grey Blue Floral\",\"Pink Floral\",\"Purple Floral\",\"Red Floral\",\"Sky Blue Floral\",\"W Army Green Floral\",\"White Blue Floral\",\"White Floral\",\"White Red Floral\",\"Z Light Green\",\"Z Solid Black\",\"Z Solid Lake Blue\",\"Z Solid Pink\",\"Z Solid White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash or hand wash /Line Dry /Do Not Bleach\"}]','[{\"name\":\"nur███om\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is beautiful,  lightweight,  comfortable, and runs true to size. I see myself enjoying wearing this one this summer.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful and true to size\"},{\"name\":\"Laura\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the fabric, the print and the comfort. It\'s just thin enough for the summer TX heat and stylish for a casual work environment. I didn\'t feel myself tugging or trying to “feel comfortable” in it. I was comfortable and felt good in it. You can wear with jeans, shorts, skirt or dress pants. So versatile.\",\"title\":\"Love This Shirt\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ina███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I should have bought more. I bought 3 different tops and they all fit perfectly. They are very flattering and can be dressy or casual. I\'m very pleased with my purchase.\",\"title\":\"Happy Buyer!\"},{\"name\":\"NEE███n\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I absolutely love this shirt! Comfortable and stylish with very soft fabric. The pleats look great and give me a great shape.I also like that its rounded off around bottom instead of being squated off.\"},{\"name\":\"Sunny\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I usually have to put a gathering stitch on the back collar of shirts to keep them from siding to one shoulder. This fits great out of the package! I love the rouch/gathers/pleats (whatever you want to call them) in the front, you can\'t see my muffin top.\",\"title\":\"finally! A shirt that stays up on my shoulders!\"},{\"name\":\"Dana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The shape of the top is flattering with pin tucks across the chest leading to an empire waist and loose flowing fit. Plus, the top is comfortable. I bought the top for my mom. It is a great value.\",\"title\":\"Comfortable and flattering\"},{\"name\":\"Hum███ger███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Ordering clothing online can be tricky.  You never know if the material is thick or thin.  The material on this item proved to be on the thin side, thus affecting the quality of the item.  See the photo that I took.  Behind the front panel of the shirt you can see 2 (two) lights and the television with a figure of a person.\\n\\nThe color was pretty, though.\",\"title\":\"Material Too Thin\"},{\"name\":\"Cat███an\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This top fits nicely, but the color is not what\'s showing in picture. The background color is between a pink and rose color. Not earth tone color at all. The print is a really nice design and would look great with denim or navy. I want it to wearvwith brown pants. Packaging is very nice.\",\"title\":\"Color in picture misleading\"},{\"name\":\"rho███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The blouse came in a timely matter. I picked the green floral. The green was ugly, not like the picture. I ordered xxl and it was slightly too small. I really needed 2x. The material was okay but I did not like the color at all. Did nothing for me. It felt comfortable. I returned it to Walmart with no problem.\",\"title\":\"Shirt quality\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███y\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I did not like this product,  the material was very itchy and I don\'t think it was worth what I paid\",\"title\":\"Poor Quality of blouse\"}]',NULL,16.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Tops\",\"Plus Size Tops\"]'),(669,'Men\'s Movies and TV Tees','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Men-s-Jurassic-Park-T-Rex-Logo-Graphic-Tee-Athletic-Heather-Large_ee0fcf85-6749-4b92-9d84-ec1f72f55d20.deea6af61875c454b8315aa095610593.jpeg\"',3.90,'[\"Big & Tall\",\"Men\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\"]','[\"Athletic Heather\",\"Charcoal\",\"Charcoal Heather\",\"Kelly Green\",\"Kelly Heather\",\"Light Blue\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Navy Blue Heather\",\"Red\",\"Red Heather\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Royal Blue Heather\",\"Silver\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash & Tumble dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"tea███ran███the██████\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nice soft fabric, fast shipping, as described\",\"title\":\"Great purchase\"},{\"name\":\"Reb███h\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered several colors of this shirt. The 3 different blue colors all had the same problem - there\'s no black ink! The dinosaur is the same color as the shirt, not black. I will be returning.\",\"title\":\"Shirt design doesn\'t match description\"},{\"name\":\"Reb███h\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered several colors of this shirt. The 3 different blue colors all had the same problem - there\'s no black ink! The dinosaur is the same color as the shirt, not black. I will be returning.\",\"title\":\"Actual shirt does not fit description.\"},{\"name\":\"Reb███h\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered several colors of this shirt. The 3 different blue colors all had the same problem - there\'s no black ink! The dinosaur is the same color as the shirt, not black. I will be returning.\",\"title\":\"Shirt design doesn\'t match description\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███le\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"dawn\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Shane\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"James\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Bro███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Cur███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,18.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Graphics Shop\",\"Graphic Tees\",\"Movies & TV Tees\",\"Men\'s Movies and TV Tees\"]'),(670,'Womens Workout Shirts','[\"Reduced price\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/NELEUS-Womens-Quick-Drying-Running-Long-Sleeve-Shirt-for-Workout-With-Thumb-Hole-Cuffs-Black-Pink-White-US-Size-XL_e411799e-8918-413c-8fac-15c8f8b45c1d.26839227c7f18383dda82db2b303bb1f.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"09# Black+Gray+Dark Green\",\"09# Black+Gray+Navy Blue\",\"09# Black+Gray+Purple\",\"09# Black+Gray+White\",\"09# Black+Pink+White\",\"09# Light Pink+Purple+Dark Green\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"me\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"perfect, true to size. ordered more already.\",\"title\":\"perfect\"},{\"name\":\"Mary\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recommend them 💯 for exercises , the fabric is super soft , dried fast\",\"title\":\"I love\"},{\"name\":\"me\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"these are so comfortable. buying more in diff colors next time.\",\"title\":\"love these buying more next mnth\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███ell███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I Love the material and fabric on these shirts and the way they fit.  I would recommend them to anyone.\",\"title\":\"Great Quality\"},{\"name\":\"scb███n\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Shirts are comfy really nice thank gosh they\'re not moldy because they sat out in the rain for two flipping weeks because I didn\'t know they were here\",\"title\":\"Shirts\"},{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Ordered XL but received large instead. Now I have to make time to take them back to the store. Defeats the whole purpose of shopping online.\",\"title\":\"Received wrong size\"},{\"name\":\"Bon███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Elza\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Betty\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,66.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Activewear\",\"Womens Workout Tops\",\"Womens Workout Shirts\"]'),(671,'Womens Slide Slippers','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Dearfoams-Women-s-Mickey-Terry-Slide_bfd7557c-da71-45d1-a7ca-fe9643c07b72.21e9fc1d44c4bf738c14da4610aa4b65.jpeg\"',4.00,'[\"S (5-6)\",\"M (7-8)\",\"L (9-10)\",\"XL (11-12)\"]','[\"Deep Green\",\"Paradise Pink\",\"SLEET\",\"Sleet\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Spot Clean and Lay Flat to Dry\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mic███e\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"We ordered the Medium which is generally  size 8-9 but these are 7-8 way too small.  Good quality but sizing is way off.  I would recommend this item BUT you need to really check the size first.  If you want Medium, you need to order the LARGE.\",\"title\":\"Adjustable Slippers\"},{\"name\":\"PR\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,42.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Womens Shoes\",\"Womens Slippers\",\"Womens Slide Slippers\"]'),(672,'Women\'s Multivitamins',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SmartyPants-Women-s-Multi-Omegas-3-Fish-Oil-Gummy-Vitamins-with-D3-C-B12-120ct_fdc8bf98-f9ea-42cb-b333-eb87df50c541.8268e1abd4624a753555d8324b4d8316.jpeg\"',4.40,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Dosage\",\"value\":\"Directions: For adult women, take six (6) gummies daily, may be taken with or without food.\"},{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Directions: For adult women, take six (6) gummies daily, may be taken with or without food.\"},{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"None\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Gma███psP███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I received the SmartyPants Women’s Complete Dietary Supplement, 2.5 Week Supply in exchange for this review. Love the flavor and love the consistency is very soft unlike some gummy vitamins that require a lot of chewing. The great thing is they are free of artificial colors, flavors and preservatives. They do however have organic cane sugar so if your restricting your carbs you’ll need to count them in to your diet. The only issue is you need to eat 6 to get 1 full serving. Now this could be bad or good, a nay if you consider the amount per serving in your cost because a 120 count bottle is just a 20 day supply but a Yay! because you get to eat 6 , they really do taste good!!! \\r\\nThey would be good for anyone who doesn’t like or has trouble swallowing pills they are so soft to chew and seem like a treat.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey described it as follows:\\r\\nSmartyPants Women’s Complete dietary supplement is more than a women’s multivitamin – it’s an all-in-one multitasker that manages to do it all, just like you. Each serving contains 15 essential nutrients, including omega 3 EPA and DHA fish oil, CoQ10, vitamin K2, and methylfolate. At SmartyPants, we use only premium, non-GMO ingredients for our gummy multivitamins and avoid the funky stuff, like synthetic colors and artificial flavors. Our delicious, all-in-one dietary supplement gives you the nutrients you want without additives or preservatives. Healthy never tasted so good with three delectable flavors: orange, lemon crème, and blueberry. Choose SmartyPants Women’s Complete Dietary Supplements. Our chewable multivitamin is for the multitasker that does it all.\",\"title\":\"Love them!!! Great flavors & a Very Soft Gummy!!!\"},{\"name\":\"mul███ale███d1\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"As soon as I broke the seal, I could smell a fresh fruity scent. I decided that since the serving size recommendations are 6 pieces, I will take 2 each throughout the day to total 6. Can be taken with or without food. The texture is a very delicate gummy. Not overly chewy at all, and taste as the flavor specifies, i.e., orange. I feel great! More vibrant, more functional in my joints and alert. I have a bottle of 120, which is a 20 day supply. However, being that I felt amazing results after the first 2 piece gummy dosage, the product will last me a bit longer if I decide to take less than 6 per day. I have the Women\'s Complete, but there is also a range of supplements to suit the entire family. No premeasuring/mixing. I call these, my \\\"Gummy Go Buttons\\\". As in stop & go. Taken morning noon and night, I was always ready to \\\"go\\\". Oh yeah, the label warns of consulting your physician prior to use. I am on 2 medications for 2 separate conditions and have noticed no adverse reactions. My energy level is gradual and sustainable, not a significant burst all at once. Also, I slept great after my evening dose.\",\"title\":\"Great tasting health-help-mate.\"},{\"name\":\"Fir███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Smarty Pants Gummie Vitamin in the pink bottles are design specifically for women it\'s a complete dietary supplement to help improve overall well-being health. They are in a nice hard round container with a screw on cap for freshness this sample bottle has a 2 year expiration date. The are packed with high quality ingredients all listed on each bottle, 6 gummies are recommended per day and can be taken throughout the day. The bottle has 120 gummies enough for a month supply as per instructions. They are soft, chewy easy to take and dissolve fast in the mouth without sticking to the teeth or your fillings like candy gummies would. They smell nice and have a pleasant taste not chalky or leave a overwhelming artificial aftertaste. They are easier to absorb in the stomach better than swallowing a large vitamin or multiple pills. They contain organic cane sugar or tapioca syrup for the sweetener in each gummie. There is no soy in the ingredients and they are non GMO (Genetically Modified Organism). It does contain Omega 3 EPA + DHA which is derived by (fish), the gelatin is derived by (pork) so this makes these gummies not kosher or vegan. The company smarty pants does carry a separate line of vegetarian vitamin and other vitamins for the entire family. For additional information about this gummie vitamin or other products it can be found on their web site smartypants.com. It also comes in other flavors and larger sizes.\",\"title\":\"Great Gummie Vitamins for Woman\"},{\"name\":\"The███der███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am familiar with his brand as we have had the mens multis before as well. I really like this brand a lot.\\r\\nFirst, the flavors are great, the size is great, and the fact that they extend the serving into 6 rather than 2 is fun if you enjoy eating them. Then it\'s almost like a treat to get the 6. However, it is a downside as far as you will have to buy more because you will run out faster.\\r\\n\\r\\nUnlike my regular gummy vitamins, these offer omega and coQ10 which makes me very happy.\\r\\n\\r\\n3 Delicious flavors are Lemon creme, blueberry, and orange. There are 120 vitamins divided by 6 a serving is about 20 days worth of vitamins. It says every batch is 3rd party lab tested which I think is very important.\\r\\n\\r\\nThey are free of gluten, artificial flavors, synthetic colors, preservatives, yeast, wheat, milk, eggs, soy, GMOs, peanuts, tree nut allergens, fish allergens, shellfish, and salicylates.\\r\\n\\r\\nI would recommend them if you have never tried them before.\",\"title\":\"I liked these alot!\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███le\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I don\'t really like to take large \\\"horse pill\\\" vitamins, they always get stuck in my throat when I try to swallow them. So I try to find vitamins that are easy to eat and these gummy vitamins are the best gummy ones that I\'ve tried. They are soft and taste almost like they have a firm jello consistency rather than a hard, chewy gummy bear texture. They have a good balance of vitamins and minerals, and I like that they have fish oil, since I don\'t usually get that in my regular diet. I am really happy with them and they make taking my vitamins fun and easy!\",\"title\":\"Tasty and easy to eat!\"},{\"name\":\"tkb███phi███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"These gummy vitamins have good flavor and texture. I kind of look forward to taking them each day, like a little treat that\'s good for you! The daily dose for an adult women is six gummies, which seems like a lot if you\'re used to swallowing a couple pills for your daily vitamin. But like I said, these are enjoyable to eat so I don\'t mind having to take so many each day. The bottle of 120 does tend to go pretty fast though. This formula includes all the vitamins my doctors always tell me to get plenty of (except calcium!!), and I like that they\'re free of preservatives, artificial colors, etc. Would recommend if you like your vitamins in gummy form and are getting your calcium elsewhere.\",\"title\":\"Taste good!\"},{\"name\":\"Kit███MD\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Smarty Pants Women\'s Complete Vitamins has Omega 3\'s, D3 for immunity, B12 for energy, CoQ10 for heart health and vitamin K2 for bones. Every ingredient that goes into their gummies are carefully chosen based on extensive research. I\'m impressed with the taste of these gummies. They are full of fruity flavor. Smarty pants women\'s complete vitamins are free of GMO\'s, synthetic color, artificial flavors and preserves, yeast, wheat, tree nut allergens, fish allergens, shellfish, and salicylates. Unfortunately, it is not vegan. However, it has super ingredients like folate, biotin and iodine. It\'s good and natural for your body. It\'s recommend for adult women to take six gummies daily. It may be taken with or without food. I would recommend this product.\",\"title\":\"Multivitamins\"},{\"name\":\"Big███913███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"These gummies taste great but taking 6 a day is a lot compare to other brands which requires 2. It seems like eating a lot of candy at once. The gummies look like gumdrops and they are tasty. They have all the necessary vitamins in these but I am not sure if they are working because the serving size too much. I would not recommend it, hopefully they can make the product better by putting all the necessary vitamins in two gummies per serving. The bottle is only 120 so that means it will only last 20 days which isn’t much. I cant see anyone buying more than a bottle every month.\",\"title\":\"6 gummies per serving\"},{\"name\":\"Edw███sGi███7\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Sorry to say that I am not happy with these gummie vitamins, the taste and flavors are fine, I just can\'t get past that you have to eat six gummies for one serving, in my book that is way too much, yes I understand that you don\'t have to eat them all at once and you can spread it out throughout the day but there is only 120 gummies per bottle and it will only last you 20 days. The other problem I have is that they do not contain any iron which for me is something I need and I have yet to find a gummie vitamin that has it. I will say that as far as quality and ingredients go these are very good, if you don\'t mind taking 6 gummies everyday and you don\'t need or want iron in the vitamin than these are for you, but for me I can hardly remember to take one vitamin so I know I won\'t remember to take six.\",\"title\":\"Serving size is 6 gummies??!!\"},{\"name\":\"Mim███vie███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I\'m going to preface this review by saying I\'m a big fan of gummies. I eat gummy candy and take gummy vitamins almost daily and I\'ve tried many brands, so you could definitely consider me a bit of a gummy connoisseur. That said, I just didn\'t like the taste or texture of these vitamins, which is a shame because they contain many great ingredients like Omega 3 fish oil, vitamin D3, folate, vitamin B12, CoQ10, vitamin K, biotin, and iodine. They\'re free of GMOs, synthetic colors, artificial flavors and preservatives as well as common allergens, etc. The problem, for me, is they just don\'t taste good - the the fish oil is very noticeable and leaves a bad aftertaste in my mouth that lingers for a good half hour or more. The texture is off, too. It\'s not a true gummy texture with a bit of bounce and snap to it. More like sinking your teeth into a semi-soft fruit snack that\'s been sitting out on the kitchen counter on a hot day. Not very appealing. I took six of these over a two day period, but just couldn\'t bring myself to take anymore. Sorry, Smarty Pants, but I\'m just not a fan!\",\"title\":\"Strange taste and texture - not a fan!\"}]','Other Ingredients: Organic Cane Sugar, Organic Tapioca Syrup, Gelatin, Pectin, Citric Acid, Natural Flavors, Colors Added (Organic Black Carrot Juice Concentrate, Organic Turmeric), Organic Sunflower Oil, Organic Carnauba Wax.',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Active Ingredient Name\",\"values\":\"0\"},{\"type\":\"Active Ingredients\",\"values\":\"0\"},{\"type\":\"Inactive Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Other Ingredients: Organic Cane Sugar, Organic Tapioca Syrup, Gelatin, Pectin, Citric Acid, Natural Flavors, Colors added (Organic Black Carrot Juice Concentrate, Organic Turmeric), Organic Sunflower Oil, Organic Carnauba Wax\"},{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Other Ingredients: Organic Cane Sugar, Organic Tapioca Syrup, Gelatin, Pectin, Citric Acid, Natural Flavors, Colors Added (Organic Black Carrot Juice Concentrate, Organic Turmeric), Organic Sunflower Oil, Organic Carnauba Wax.\"}]','[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Vitamins and Supplements\",\"Multivitamins\",\"Women\'s Multivitamins\"]'),(673,'Mens T-Shirts',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/BELLA-CANVAS-Adult-Unisex-T-Shirt_ed8e3ad5-520b-472e-a923-1a984cf1c134_1.659d07f0ed848b9f55f8cf7280350977.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\"]','[\"Aqua\",\"Asphalt\",\"Autumn\",\"Berry\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Canvas Red\",\"CanvasRed\",\"Carolina Blue\",\"Citron\",\"Columbia Blue\",\"Dark Lavender\",\"DarkOlive\",\"Deep Teal\",\"DeepTeal\",\"Dust\",\"Electric Blue\",\"Evergreen\",\"Forest\",\"Gold\",\"Kelly\",\"Lavender Dust\",\"Leaf\",\"LightBlue\",\"Lilac\",\"MaizeYellow\",\"Marine\",\"Maroon\",\"Mustard\",\"Navy\",\"Ocean Blue\",\"OceanBlue\",\"Olive\",\"Orange\",\"Orchid\",\"Oxblood Black\",\"OxbloodBlack\",\"Pebble Brown\",\"Pink\",\"Red\",\"Silver\",\"Slate\",\"SteelBlue\",\"Storm\",\"Sunset\",\"Synthetic Green\",\"Teal\",\"Team Navy\",\"TeamPurple\",\"TrueRoyal\",\"VintageBlack\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"tammy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the shirt just has a straight fit.\"},{\"name\":\"Lec███a T███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Normal length for this size shirt. Material was wonderful, so soft felt like a cloud. I just received the shirts so I have not washed them yet but they look well made. The colors are as pictured and described. Very glad I ordered these shirts. Good quality for the price.\",\"title\":\"So soft Tee\"},{\"name\":\"Kelly\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This shirt is super comfy and love the variety of colors. This is one of the cheapest places I could find these shirt and the shipping combine was very reasonable. The company shipped my order super quick. Will do business again for sure!\",\"title\":\"Great Shirt Great Prices\"},{\"name\":\"Tori\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The seams unraveled on first wash unfortunately but I love these shirts so much and the price is right! So comfortable and soft.\"},{\"name\":\"AL\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Well sewn, soft material, color matches pictures\",\"title\":\"Very soft\"},{\"name\":\"Bri███ny\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very soft shirt and it fits true to size. I used vinyl on it without any issues.\",\"title\":\"Very soft shirt\"},{\"name\":\"della\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Fit nice even after washing\",\"title\":\"Good shirt\"},{\"name\":\"Rob███a\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I\'ve only had this for a few days, but so far it is basically pretty good.  It has a soft, lightweight material, and a vibrantly \\\"cool\\\" color.  However, the one I received seems to have less of a heather look to it than what appears in the picture, and the cut is contoured in the center (which I don\'t particularly like).  Something I think is also important to note is that, I have one I prefer in the Bella   Canvas \\\"marble\\\" series that is even more lightweight, and the cut is not tapered - so there is evidently a lack of uniformity between series, at least in the case of the one that this review is about.  Nevertheless, the price was good, including pretty fast and free shipping, and that was a bargain!\"},{\"name\":\"James\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I specifically ordered a tan shirt (went out of my way to find one on Walmart.com), but they sent me a \\\"heather tan\\\" shirt which is about two shades lighter. The shirt fits okay and returning it sounds like a pain in the neck so I\'m just going to keep it.\",\"title\":\"Ordered tan, received heather tan\"},{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This shirt ran small compared to my other BC purchases.  After I washed it the second time the thread came out of one of the sleeves so I lost one t-shirt cuff pretty much immediately.\"}]',NULL,9.77,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Mens Clothing\",\"Mens Shirts\",\"Mens T-Shirts\"]'),(674,'Snack Bars',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Nature-s-Bakery-Gluten-Free-Pomegranate-Fig-Bars-6-Twin-Packs-2-oz-Each_c5d56e62-cb4e-4e5c-91cd-386181a8a453.fdc5d478c41fd23bd695d44d6f3281cc.jpeg\"',3.70,'[]','[]',NULL,'[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Delicious any time, but especially with tea and coffee\",\"title\":\"Lovely treat with my breakfast coffee\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███le\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Normally I do like these. I can\'t complain if they are gluten free,  but I was surprised to find out how many carbs. I just reordered them. I don\'t know if it\'s the bars or me, but they tasted pretty awful.\",\"title\":\"Is it Me?\"},{\"name\":\"Jon███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The item says it is  a 10 twin pack but the  item I received was a 5 twin  pack and gluten free. fabulous and delicious product\"},{\"name\":\"Jenny\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Really like these!  Wish they made actual fig bars!  For the price I paid really wish there were more in the package as well!  It’s very aggravating to be forced to have to pay 2-3 times more because I have no choice but to eat gluten free and yet have to settle for products that contain far less than gluten filled items.\",\"title\":\"Yum!\"},{\"name\":\"Kk\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Some people can only eat gluten free. This is a great tasty option for those people and if you don’t HAVE to eat gluten free I don’t see why you’d buy these and complain. Go eat the regular ones.\",\"title\":\"Great for GF community!\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These things are amazing especially for being gluten-free! It\'s really hard to find a good snack being gluten sensitive but these taste amazing!\",\"title\":\"Ah-mazingly tasty!\"},{\"name\":\"Aly███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Inaccurate description- 6 pack, not 10. So not as good of value. My kids love the raspberry bars but won’t eat these. We’re not actually gluten intolerant though, so probably not a fair comparison\",\"title\":\"Meh\"},{\"name\":\"Gwe███lyn███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Each package(6 little packages with 2 bars each) is only 2 ounces (both bars). \\nEach package has two minute size bars in a package that could easily fit 3 bars but companies have to play psychological game. Of course blame it on covid and supply chain issues. It\'s insulting. \\n\\nLoaded with syrups and sugar. minimal pomegranate in juice form.\",\"title\":\"Not healthy AT ALL.  Eat a candy bar instead.\"},{\"name\":\"And███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Dislike the product description says 10 but it is not accurate. There are only 6\",\"title\":\"Description not accurate\"},{\"name\":\"Kris\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Got 5x less than expected... trickery not appreciated..\",\"title\":\"Overpriced!\"}]','Brown Rice Syrup, Fig Paste, Gluten Free Flour (Tapioca Starch, Rice Flour), Canola Oil, Gluten Free Five Grain Flour (Amaranth, Quinoa, Millet, Sorghum, Teff), Brown Rice Flour (Rice Flour, Rice Bran), Cane Sugar, Date Paste, Gluten Rolled Oats, Pomegranate Juice Concentrate, Flaxseed, Natural Flavor, Leavening (Monocalcium Phosphate, Baking Soda), Sea Salt, Citric Acid, Xanthan Gum.',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Brown Rice Syrup, Fig Paste, Gluten Free Flour (Tapioca Starch, Rice Flour), Canola Oil, Gluten Free Five Grain Flour (Amaranth, Quinoa, Millet, Sorghum, Teff), Brown Rice Flour (Rice Flour, Rice Bran), Cane Sugar, Date Paste, Gluten Rolled Oats, Pomegranate Juice Concentrate, Flaxseed, Natural Flavor, Leavening (Monocalcium Phosphate, Baking Soda), Sea Salt, Citric Acid, Xanthan Gum.\"}]','[\"Food\",\"Breakfast & Cereal\",\"Grab & Go Bars & Toaster Pastries\",\"Snack Bars\"]'),(675,'Medgear Scrubs','[\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/2-PACK-Medgear-Scrubs-for-Men-and-Women-Scrubs-Set-Medical-Uniform-Scrubs-Top-and-Pants_dca184e1-36e4-42ad-b39b-d0d9c1b043ef.656eb4602281f0c6b0c3aa4a446dd560.jpeg\"',4.00,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\",\"4XL\",\"5XL\"]','[\"Black/Black\",\"Black/Burgundy\",\"Black/Caribbean\",\"Black/Charcoal\",\"Black/Hunter\",\"Black/Navy\",\"Black/Pewter\",\"Black/Purple\",\"Black/Sand\",\"Burgundy/Burgundy\",\"Burgundy/Caribbean\",\"Burgundy/Charcoal\",\"Burgundy/Hunter\",\"Burgundy/Navy\",\"Burgundy/Pewter\",\"Burgundy/Purple\",\"Burgundy/Royal\",\"Burgundy/Sand\",\"Caribbean/Caribbean\",\"Caribbean/Charcoal\",\"Caribbean/Hunter\",\"Caribbean/Navy\",\"Caribbean/Pewter\",\"Caribbean/Purple\",\"Caribbean/Royal\",\"Caribbean/Sand\",\"Charcoal/Charcoal\",\"Charcoal/Hunter\",\"Charcoal/Navy\",\"Charcoal/Pewter\",\"Charcoal/Purple\",\"Charcoal/Royal\",\"Charcoal/Sand\",\"Hunter/Hunter\",\"Hunter/Navy\",\"Hunter/Pewter\",\"Hunter/Purple\",\"Hunter/Royal\",\"Hunter/Sand\",\"Navy/Navy\",\"Navy/Pewter\",\"Navy/Purple\",\"Navy/Sand\",\"Pewter/Pewter\",\"Pewter/Purple\",\"Pewter/Royal\",\"Pewter/Sand\",\"Purple/Purple\",\"Purple/Royal\",\"Purple/Sand\",\"Royal/Royal\",\"Royal/Sand\",\"Sand/Sand\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Joc███n\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought this for my husband and they fit amazing!\",\"title\":\"Nice fit!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Edw███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They are nice just a little big in the legs but for the money I would get them again\"},{\"name\":\"Kr\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am working 18 hours daily 7 days, I love them\",\"title\":\"PCA Supervisor\"},{\"name\":\"Betty\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"material ,style, with plenty of pockets ,roomy in size.\"},{\"name\":\"cat███ke\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I ordered large and the shirt fit great but, The Medgear pants are tight (1 size too small?). Afraid to wash. Lots of Pockets came as described. And material feels heavy and durable enough. I would buy again but I wish I could get XL pants with L shirt.\",\"title\":\"Great buy\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███l\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I am totally satisfied with this purchase. The overall description of these scrubs were spot on. The fit is a lot better than the scrubs I\'ve previously bought. I\'m able to move freely and comfortably throughout my full shift. A major plus.\",\"title\":\"Supreme Value\"},{\"name\":\"Deb\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered size xl and got one xl and 2 size 3 xl so I need to return them\",\"title\":\"Sad\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"When I saw the price I kinda figured what I was getting myself into and when I got the scrubs it was the worst brick material ever in my life used, I couldn\'t flex any of my joints not to mention sit down, it\'s made for robots not humans and the sizes are not accurate at all runs way smaller\",\"title\":\"BUY AT YOUR OWN RISK\"},{\"name\":\"Ben███in\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The size was misleading. When ordering there should be an option to select actual waist and chest sizes based on actual sizes of client so that it matches when it arrives. The size I ordered did not fit.\",\"title\":\"Add chest and waist size option\"},{\"name\":\"Fred\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"If you want to pay for something and not get it buy these\",\"title\":\"My package was never delivered\"}]',NULL,34.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Scrubs\",\"Medgear Scrubs\"]'),(676,'Womens Pants','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/MINTREUS-Womens-Knit-Baggy-Wide-Leg-Pants-Casual-Elastic-Waisted-Palazzo-Harem-Pants-with-Pocket_7c2b85b1-88bd-41bc-acac-594dea2371bd.6b2130c278300e2c084b7c3495101b2c.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"01-Khaki\",\"02-White\",\"03-Orange\",\"04-Dark Blue\",\"05-Black\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine washable; Do not bleach\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is true to size! It\'s comfy and feels good on the skin! the design is cute and the 2 pockets are a nice size. It looks a little bit see through, but you would have to get up close and personal to see it, so i would be mindful of the color undies you wear with it! Other than that i love it and i peered them with this cute top i got from here too!\",\"title\":\"Cute design\"},{\"name\":\"Lisa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These pants are ribbed, but thick and soft. The waist is true to size but, being harem style, they have extra room outside of the waistband. \\nI\'m only 5\'0” with a 26” inseam, so these pants are too long, and so long that you can\'t tell they\'re harem. They just hang like wide leg pants on me. I love the softness and the big pockets though!\",\"title\":\"Soft and comfy!\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ine███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So comfy and super cute! Ordering a few more colors!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The product fits perfectly and I can wear them out or just to lounge at home. the pants arrived super fast and I was pleasantly suprised about he quailty since the item was very affordable but I\'m obsessed. plus they have POCKETS\",\"title\":\"cozy and cute!\"},{\"name\":\"Gio███na\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these and wish the other colors were in stock.\"},{\"name\":\"Ama███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"comfortable and cute!! The waistband is stretchy and comfortable, the legs have a cute cross over design and it has pockets!\",\"title\":\"Comfort to the max!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"These are way too thin\",\"title\":\"Too thin\"},{\"name\":\"Amy\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Ama███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Ama███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,48.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Pants\",\"Womens Pants\"]'),(677,'All Area Rugs','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Sensation-Transitional-2-x-7-Red-and-Beige-Polypropylene-Indoor-Area-Rug_309ff89e-4e6a-4346-93c4-b6d62f64dac1.52bfeb8f2ba2be890e20823cfbe2396d.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"2\' x 3\'\",\"2\'3\'\' x 10\'\",\"2\'3\'\' x 7\'3\'\'\",\"5\' Octagon\",\"5\' x 7\' Oval\",\"5\'3\'\' Round\",\"5\'3\'\' x 7\'3\'\'\",\"6\'7\'\' x 9\'6\'\'\",\"6\'7\'\' x 9\'6\'\'