on███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So comfortable, great quality, have been wearing them for many years.\",\"title\":\"High quality, perfect fit at a great price\"},{\"name\":\"Bre███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Reg███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"ruth\",\"rating\":4}]',NULL,40.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Panties\",\"Hipsters\"]'),(681,'Workout Leggings','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/NELEUS-Womens-High-Waist-Yoga-Leggings-for-Workout-Running-Tummy-Control-with-2-Pockets-Black-Gray-Light-Blue-US-Size-S_298548cd-c507-429b-80ac-4dee7a1f2768.7050a898a71252474a44000ba6f0f20d.jpeg\"',4.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"69# Black+Black+Black\",\"69# Black+Gray+Dark Navy Blue\",\"69# Black+Gray+Light Blue\",\"69# Black+Gray+Light Green\",\"69# Black+Gray+Light Pink\",\"69# Black+Gray+Light Purple\",\"69# Black+Gray+Navy Blue\",\"69# Light Blue+Light Purple+Light Pink\",\"79# Black+Black+Black\",\"79# Black+Gray+Light Blue\",\"79# Black+Gray+Light Green\",\"79# Black+Gray+Light Pink\",\"79# Black+Gray+Light Purple\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mary\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the fitness  of the  leggings\"},{\"name\":\"Que███lli███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The leggings are very comfortable, very soft, breathable. Variable colors available.\"},{\"name\":\"Cha███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The order arrived on time and the fit is perfect The material is soft and silky I absolutely love these leggings!\",\"title\":\"satisfied\"},{\"name\":\"Oli███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I\'m 5\'5 and 3 feet of me is legs so it\'s hard to find leggings that are long enough and not too big. I ordered a medium and thought the inseam would be long enough but it isn\'t. But that isn\'t the company\'s fault or product fault it\'s just I have long legs. The fabric quality is quite nice and comparable to other brands you buy online and or in store. The pockets were really nice and well made, the colors were pretty as well, I just wish I was more proportionate so I could enjoy them more. Definitely check your inseam first. But the fit overall minus length was fantastic.\",\"title\":\"Really nice just short\"},{\"name\":\"Karen\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Size runs small, good quality\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Good quality. I like the material.\\nBut they run small. I usuall wear a medium.  The large barely fit so I\'m going to order the extra large.\\nI am 5\'4 and weigh 128 lbs\",\"title\":\"Good deal but run too small\"},{\"name\":\"grs███11\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"these leggings can\'t be dried in a dryers.   they wrinkle on the lowest heat. they are above the ankle after drying. the sizes run small.   I was disappointed  with the fabric.   colors faded.\",\"title\":\"Not Good\"},{\"name\":\"Shi███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"i brought my size 2xl i should\'ve went up a size because they run small keeps rolling down which drives me insane\",\"title\":\"not great fit\"},{\"name\":\"BDu███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I\'m 5\'6\\\" and appx 200lbs and the 2xl is slightly too large. I keep having to pull my pants up even without stuff in the pockets. When I do use those awesome pockets, the pants super sag and quickly. The seam on the left leg spirals inward on all three, but the right one is normal.  All three pants are slightly different lengths. the positives are that they are soft and opaque.\",\"title\":\"annoying\"},{\"name\":\"Mary\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I have not received them . They were ordered Nov. 1 st. Then I didn\'t receive them by the 13 of Nov. so they were reordered and I can\'t seem to track them. Please let me know if they are coming! Thanks\"}]',NULL,90.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Activewear\",\"Womens Workout Bottoms\",\"Workout Leggings\"]'),(682,'Cardigans for Women',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/YEMAK-Women-s-Crewneck-Button-Down-3-4-Sleeve-Cropped-Knit-Cardigan-Sweater-MK3514_39e7f92f-ac28-47a1-9d69-e9e02043ecad.16a8f3835a090dfb41962b4d4e6ed816.jpeg\"',3.50,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\"]','[\"Aqua\",\"Baby Yellow\",\"Black\",\"Blueberry\",\"Blush\",\"Bronze\",\"Camel\",\"Dusty Orange\",\"Honey\",\"Ivory\",\"Kelly Green\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Orange\",\"Light Pink\",\"Magenta\",\"Navy\",\"Oatmeal\",\"Olive\",\"Peach Beige\",\"Peacock\",\"Red\",\"Sage\",\"Tan\",\"Taupe\",\"Teal Blue\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Frank\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Wife loves them, soft, warm, not heavy. easy to wash..\\nGreat item...\",\"title\":\"YEMAK Women\'s Crewneck Button Down 3/4 Sleeve Crop\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really love it! the color is better than what the image shows. it\'s beautiful, and it fits very well.\",\"title\":\"beautiful!\"},{\"name\":\"SUSAN\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very beautiful and fit perfectly!!\"},{\"name\":\"Che███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I bought this for my mother in law who is very tiny!  This sweater, although well made and love the color, is very small!  I bought it as a Christmas gift and I hope it fits her, I ordered the small and this is more like a XS.  Not very long, it\'ll barely go to her waist.\",\"title\":\"Nice quality\"},{\"name\":\"Marty\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"It\'s cute, but it is too small.\",\"title\":\"Too small\"},{\"name\":\"Car███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Doesn\'t line up, at the top or bottom in button band.\",\"title\":\"A large, looks like a medium.\"},{\"name\":\"Car███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Workmanship not making a good rating.\",\"title\":\"Sloppy assembly.\"},{\"name\":\"Jeni\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I normally wear a M (8-10) but ordered a L based on the sizing chart. The L is way too small. Also, the color I ordered was Blueberry, however, the actual color is just dark purple, looks nothing like the picture.\",\"title\":\"Sizing chart/Color  is wrong\"},{\"name\":\"Cat███en\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Car███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,26.95,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Sweaters\",\"Cardigans for Women\"]'),(683,'Pillow Shams','[\"Reviewers highlighted: softness, price, fabric\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Ntbay-2-Pack-Double-Brushed-Microfiber-Queen-Pillow-Shams-with-2-Flange-Wrinkle-Fade-Stain-Resistant-Sham-20-x30-Pink_1e8fcc56-7551-4a5f-ad47-f35c8b936879.217c7c2bea2d9c255181f47aeeb1de24.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"King (20\\\" x 36\\\")\",\"Queen (20\\\" x 30\\\")\",\"Standard (20\\\" x 26\\\")\"]','[\"Aqua Blue\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Brown\",\"Dark Brown\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Ivory\",\"Khaki\",\"Light Gray\",\"Magenta\",\"Mint Green\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Orange\",\"Pale Orange\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Sage Green\",\"Sky Blue\",\"Smoke Gray\",\"White\",\"Wine Red\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"james\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"easy and convenient beautiful color and service really good\",\"title\":\"👍\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Lovely color and soft smooth fabric.  These shams are a great buy. I have two colors and will get more. Very pleased.  Recommended.\",\"title\":\"Very nice shams set\"},{\"name\":\"lisa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"For the price a good value. The deep flap to hide the pillow is perfect so my queen pillows fit beautifully !\",\"title\":\"Great buy\"},{\"name\":\"tat███k\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very nice quality, washes well.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Extremely soft, amazing pillowcases. I find some cotton to be very scratchy, but these are very well-made.\"},{\"name\":\"Mike\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Feel\",\"title\":\"Color\"},{\"name\":\"Cyn███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Good shams. Brilliant blue.\",\"title\":\"Shans are good\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very nice quality and well priced.  I have them in 2 colors so far. Highly recommended\",\"title\":\"Lovely shams\"},{\"name\":\"She███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"looked better online but okay\",\"title\":\"as expected\"},{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Color is dirty yellow and I would never buy these again\"}]',NULL,15.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Pillow Shams\"]'),(684,'Womens Swimsuit Bottoms','[\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/RELLECIGA-Women-s-High-Waisted-Bikini-Bottom-Tummy-Control-Swimsuit-Bottom_23914b4b-5a26-4c0c-90fb-aa095467e3ad.769f9ffc06fc51e1b5cd43cf4aec1f6c.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"XXXL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Leopard\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Neon Rose\",\"Royal Blue\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash in cold water dry in shade only.Do not bleachfold or iron\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fits and looks exactly as promised (haven\'t wash it yet)\"},{\"name\":\"Pri███lla███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Only wore it twice before it got saggy in the crotch and butt area. And the elastic began to stretch out. I couldn\'t even wear them the 3rd day without embarrassment\",\"title\":\"Don\'t buy these they don\'t last\"},{\"name\":\"maria\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Kri███na\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Carol\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Gra███o\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"sal███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"lex███gan███ly\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Carol\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,15.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Swimsuits\",\"Womens Swimsuit Bottoms\",\"Womens Swimsuit Bottoms\"]'),(685,'Baby Itching & Rash Treatments','[\"Best seller\",\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Baby-Dove-Eczema-Care-Soothing-Cream-for-Newborn-s-Sensitive-Skin-5-1-oz_e34284ad-5a0f-4a29-a756-7231e9cfe15f.5ba9e53f27dbcae178a8d4bc664df77c.jpeg\"',4.80,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Apply liberally to the affected area as needed.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"que███lmo███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love using this lotion on my son because he was born with really bad eczema . Once I started using this lotion he hasn\'t had any dry patches . The lotion is a little thick and wish it had more of a baby scent .\",\"title\":\"Great for Eczema !!\"},{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very good product. Softens and tones the skin and helps relieve itching. I have eczema all over my body and this really does help.\",\"title\":\"Excellent for Eczema\"},{\"name\":\"Lori\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased this for my granddaughter who had mild eczema, and when paired with the Dove Baby Eczema Body Wash, it improved her skin so much! It\'s now their staple product to help with her skin and using it has become part of their nightly routine. Great product!\",\"title\":\"Great Lotion for Baby Eczema\"},{\"name\":\"aid███z3\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nice cream! I use this product almost every day. It\'s also good for baby\'s skin. Helps well with dry skin. Contains safe ingredients. \\nLove it! Worth the price!\",\"title\":\"Good cream!\"},{\"name\":\"lin███13\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very moisturizing and is perfect for eczema, rosacea, or any rashes on your body. It is great at calming down any redness or itchiness and it applies smoothly on skin.\",\"title\":\"Great for redness and itchiness\"},{\"name\":\"bes3\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This product got rid of the eczema in one week. My baby had it really bad and was complaining. After a few applied a day for a week he was cleared from his skin.\",\"title\":\"Relieve\"},{\"name\":\"bec███aye███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have eczema of the face, so when my newborn started to have “baby acne” in the face, I figured baby has inherited my sensitive skin. This cream helped a lot. I previously used baby Cetaphil since I use the silly kind, which I think dried up the baby acne but also baby\'s skin. So I started to use this Dove baby eczema cream due to reviews on how thick and moisturizing it is. I use on baby\'s body and face, then I put the baby Cetaphil over the spots where the baby acne was (only on face).  I saw improvement within a couple days of softer, more moisturized and smooth skin and less baby acne. Would recommend! Also use the Cetaphil baby wash prior to putting this cream on.\",\"title\":\"Game changer\"},{\"name\":\"con███m54███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"My father has eczema all on his arms. I got this for him to try. He loves it. It helps with the itching and flakes. He says it soothes his arm and is happy to have some of the irritation gone.\",\"title\":\"Helps\"},{\"name\":\"ale███3\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I use it on myself and my 4,6 year olds when they need moisturizers, we love the scent , and how it leaves a smooth texture of our skin . My fav cream to use and bonus for great ingredients\",\"title\":\"Great cream\"},{\"name\":\"Lea\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It\'s no good. It is very thick! It\'s like paste when it comes out of the tube. That\'s fine for an effective moisturizer, but it doesn\'t help with eczema. It\'s very sticky and leaves a thick film on skin. Even with the oatmeal, it\'s not soothing. Didn\'t help eczema or itching at all.\",\"title\":\"Did not help eczema symptoms\"}]','Active Ingredient: Colloidal Oatmeal (1.0%) Inactive Ingredients: Water (Eau), Glycerin, Dimethicone, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax (Cire De Carnauba), Isopropyl Myristate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Hydroxystearic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Cetearyl Glucoside, Sodium Cetearyl Sulfate, Cetyl Palmitate, Sodium Benzoate, Phenoxyethanol, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/Vp Copolymer, Stearic Acid, Tetrasodium Edta',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Active Ingredient Name\",\"values\":\"Colloidal Oatmeal (1.0%)\"},{\"type\":\"Active Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Colloidal Oatmeal (1.0%)\"},{\"type\":\"Inactive Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Active Ingredient: Colloidal Oatmeal (1.0%) Inactive Ingredients: Water (Eau), Glycerin, Dimethicone, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax (Cire De Carnauba), Isopropyl Myristate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Hydroxystearic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Cetearyl Glucoside, Sodium Cetearyl Sulfate, Cetyl Palmitate, Sodium Benzoate, Phenoxyethanol, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/Vp Copolymer, Stearic Acid, Tetrasodium Edta\"},{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Active Ingredient: Colloidal Oatmeal (1.0%) Inactive Ingredients: Water (Eau), Glycerin, Dimethicone, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax (Cire De Carnauba), Isopropyl Myristate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Glyceryl Hydroxystearic Acid, Caprylyl Glycol, Cetearyl Glucoside, Sodium Cetearyl Sulfate, Cetyl Palmitate, Sodium Benzoate, Phenoxyethanol, Ammonium Acryloyldimethyltaurate/Vp Copolymer, Stearic Acid, Tetrasodium Edta\"}]','[\"Baby\",\"Health & Safety\",\"Baby Medicine Cabinet\",\"Baby Itching & Rash Treatments\"]'),(686,'Womens Pajama Sets','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Joyspun-Women-s-Knit-Notch-Collar-Top-and-Capri-Pants-Pajama-Set-2-Piece-Sizes-S-to-3X_19eac639-8086-44a5-8467-42eff7973cc7.6cd13d7e2b84c373353574430267eff5.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2X\",\"3X\"]','[\"Aqua Pond Peacock Feather\",\"Black Soot\",\"Black Soot Shadow Floral\",\"Coral Bell Geo\",\"Kayak Blue\",\"Lavender Sunrise Mixed Fruit\",\"Nautical Navy Sailing\",\"Nautical Navy Stars\",\"Orchid Delight Paisley Flower\",\"Pink Sail Dot\",\"Pink Surf\",\"Vibrant Orchid Floral Dot\",\"Vivid White Animal\",\"Vivid White Plaid\",\"Winter White Animal\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash cold, gentle cycle with like colors, only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Low iron if necessary.\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These pajamas are adorable. The top is button down and had a collar and the pants are matching and very stretchy waist band. The material is soft and comfortable. I am five foot eight inches tall and I weigh two hundred thirty five pounds and I typically wear a size 2x. This 2x fit me perfectly.\",\"title\":\"Polka dot matching pajama set\"},{\"name\":\"soz███arm███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Wow these are great feeding pajamas. I am wearing a size small and they fit me perfectly. I like that I have room to move around and still feel cozy and comfortable. The bright navy blue has white checks throughout and is super adorable. These were a great price and I will definitely order more from this style and brand\",\"title\":\"Two piece navy pajama set\"},{\"name\":\"soz███leo███8\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This set was extremely comfortable. It was very soft and stretchy. I was very surprised at the quality of this item since it was such a great price. It was warm enough for the winter months but could wear in the summer as well. I would definitely recommend these. I am wearing the xl which is my normal size and it fits well\",\"title\":\"Comfortable and great quality pajamas\"},{\"name\":\"soz███hh2███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These pajamas are the best! They are so cute and comfy! I ordered a size medium, eight to ten and they fit a bit big bit bit too big to need to return or exchange them. The fabric is super soft and comfortable and the star print on the navy is tasteful and subtle. I like that the pants are cropped but can work for many seasons.\",\"title\":\"Adorable soft knit pajamas\"},{\"name\":\"soz███omo███nce███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This pajama set is a size Medium or 8 to 10 and these fit me true to size.  The pant length was just above the ankle and these were not tight at the waist.  The material of these pajamas is some of the softest I have ever felt!  These are so comfortable for sleeping and I could lounge in these all day if I was able to!\",\"title\":\"Soft and comfy two piece pajama set\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These pajamas are super comfortable to wear. They are stretchy and feel very soft and silky as well. I love the collar and the matching buttons to add to the design. I am five foot ten inches tall and I weigh two hundred forty five pounds. I typically wear a size 3x and this 3x fit me perfectly. Highly recommend.\",\"title\":\"Purple polka dotted pajamas\"},{\"name\":\"Ari\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So comfortable! I already love them. I consider this a Mothers Day gift to myself :\') I usually wear large to fit comfortable but I got the medium instead due to the reviews and it was worth the risk. Runs stretchy and comfy so I don\'t regret my decision.\",\"title\":\"So Comfy!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These stars are brightly shining in this soft, lightweight two piece pajama set. I am in an X Large or size range 16 to 18 and it fits just right! Featuring a front button short sleeved shirt and front pocket and capri pants that tie at the waist. Very affordable price for the quality and highly recommended by me!\",\"title\":\"Shine Bright Tonight is this sleepset\"},{\"name\":\"Kenji\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I love the comfort of this brand. But sadly these are not like the vibrant color depicted in the photo. Just a dull looking teal. Still cute but really wanted that vibrant color ugh\",\"title\":\"Cute but dull color\"},{\"name\":\"Ale███G\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Noticed a huge hole along seam second time wearing. Poor quality. Probably wasn\'t even sewn to begin with. Hole is about 3 inches long, not a small hole.\",\"title\":\"Poor quality\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Pajamas & Loungewear\",\"Womens Pajama Sets\"]'),(687,'Sandals & Flip-Flops','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Chaco-ZX-1-EcoTread-Sandal-Big-Kid-Burlap-Heather_148dce13-c99b-46e4-a256-88e6ab125d99.a6bdb29bc203b11e1869b8a1bb003f5b.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"1 M US\",\"1 M US Big Kid\",\"2 M US Big Kid\",\"3 M US Big Kid\",\"4 M US Big Kid\",\"5 M US Big Kid\",\"6 M US Big Kid\",\"11 M US\",\"11 M US Big Kid\",\"12\",\"12 M US Big Kid\",\"13 M US\",\"13 M US Big Kid\"]','[\"Burlap Heather\",\"Crust Multi\",\"Hugs and Kisses\",\"Rising Navy\",\"Vary Purple Rose\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Bro███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these! I wear a women\'s 7 and was able to purchase the kids 6. It\'s a perfect fit and the color is 😍\",\"title\":\"Awesome sandals\"},{\"name\":\"Kri███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great shoe! Wore today for the 1st time and extremly pleased. Very confortable with great arch support\",\"title\":\"Great shoe!\"},{\"name\":\"Guy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Exactly what I was expecting. Great sandal for the river\",\"title\":\"Exactly what I was expecting. Great sandal for the\"},{\"name\":\"JDo███lly███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"After hearing great things about Chacos for years, I finally got myself a pair.  I lucked out and fit in the kids sizes even though I\'m an adult, so they were a great deal.  I wore them on a 10 day trip to Colorado, much of it spent camping in the mountains.  They were incredibly comfortable and hugged my foot like a tennis shoe.  I generally blister very easily, and even though I had not broken these in at all, I didn\'t get a single blister.  When it was cold at night, I adjusted the straps and wore them with thick wool socks.  I hiked and biked in them.  I wore them in the lake.  They definitely lived up to the hype and I\'m certain I will buy many more pairs.\",\"title\":\"Fantastic shoe!\"},{\"name\":\"S A███jo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They are so beautiful and comfortable! I love these sandals!\",\"title\":\"They are a must have!\"},{\"name\":\"She███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought them for my granddaughter and they fit perfect! She loves them!\",\"title\":\"So cute!\"},{\"name\":\"Reg███22\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I tried some a while back and just now remembered them when I saw an ad for them. They are just as great as I remember. I wear between a 6-61/2 in women\'s shoes but I got a kids size 4 and they fit perfect.\",\"title\":\"Love the look and fit\"},{\"name\":\"Lyn███45\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I wear a women\'s size 6.5 and I bought a size 5 in kids and it fits pretty well— a little on the large side but perfect for wearing socks with so no complaint there. These were $50 cheaper than the regular women\'s and I got the hugs and kisses style so they match EVERYTHING. They\'re great sandals to hike in, they have fantastic arch support and are super comfortable so even when I\'m on my feet all day, my feet don\'t hurt. I have had them for over a year and they are still in great condition. These are my go to shoes in pretty much any situation and I couldn\'t be happier with my purchase.\",\"title\":\"My favorite sandals EVER\"},{\"name\":\"Jenna\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Best sandals around! This sandal fits my foot perfectly, the material is soft and durable. Perfect arch support.\",\"title\":\"Perfect summer adventure sandal\"},{\"name\":\"AJ ███e\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"These are unwearable because the straps are too long, and some of them are too short.\",\"title\":\"Weird\"}]',NULL,60.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Sandals & Flip-Flops\",\"Sandals & Flip-Flops\"]'),(688,'Depend for Women',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Depend-Fresh-Protection-Women-s-Incontinence-Postpartum-Bladder-Leak-Underwear-XXL-44-Count_aaf03e67-0ded-4e20-9118-797c1134a05a.23ecb334a1700b17442f576ede24a0db.jpeg\"',4.40,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Warning: To avoid danger of suffocation, keep plastic bag away from babies and children\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Mom███3\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is the first time I\'ve used these pull ups for incontinence and I am very pleased. I wasn\'t sure how they would fit and how effective they would turn out to be. I can definitely recommend them to any woman because they score 100% in my experience.\",\"title\":\"I am very happy!\"},{\"name\":\"Moira\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Minimal urine catch guard. Lots of spills. Losey distribution of catch material. The market has worse but better. That\'s the function.\\nAesthetics? It\'s pretty good. The lines are smoother and there\'s a design....why does everything need to be pink? How about a rainbow combo?\",\"title\":\"Do not use it at night or while traveling.\"},{\"name\":\"Karen\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I have never liked wearing maxi pads or anything that comes close to them so needless to say, I greatly dislike having to wear these. I don\'t wear them for incontinence but for bowel issues and when those things have occurred, these have spared my clothes and some embarrassment. I normally wear a 2X in pants but the XXL Depends are huge on me. They droop down and really do make me feel like I\'m wearing a diaper. They are bulky between my legs and if I sit too long, they make my buttocks red and irritated. The other ones aren\'t much better. The gathering around the legs has rubbed so much it has made me bleed. I don\'t have any other options at this point. \\nI guess all in all, I hate these, no matter who manufactures them and I hope my bowel issues will be resolved very soon. Good luck shoppers!\",\"title\":\"Hard to like\"},{\"name\":\"Eud███184███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Out of the last box and starting my next box I have had 10 all together rip down the side. Always on left side. I am sending pictures. Also the front is glued together with the beck, you have to tear them apart.  I have worn depend for 2 years and never had any problems. I\'m not sure what is going on with your product but I will be looking around for other products. I did not photograph the early depends as I thought it was just a mistake.  I\'m 82 and living on fixed income, one was a mistake 10 is ridiculous.\",\"title\":\"Sorry to say these come apart\"},{\"name\":\"Sam\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"They are way too small- I bought this brand before with a large or a xl and it was too small and tight I could barely get it over my butt. I started buying a different brand of 2xl and they are roomy and spacious- this time they didn\'t have the brand I usually buy so I got this one again in a 2xl there is no way this is a 2xl it\'s squeezing me and almost didnt pull up. I wear these for my period I\'m extremely irritated because I\'m on a fixed income I buy these way ahead of my period to make sure I have something for my period. These ones are extremely uncomfortable\",\"title\":\"Way too small\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The depends are NOT as good as they use to be!  The glue that holds the pad in place pulls apart easily!!!  I got a ripped up depend in one package, absolutely not usable???  I have to spend money wisely, on a fixed budget,  these may go off my budget!!! Will have to try a different brand!!\",\"title\":\"Not Happy!!\"},{\"name\":\"Donna\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"disliked - these pull ups although listed as size 2 XL, are not sized as issued quite small and unable to pull up to designated area coverage.  Have worn different brands even some real inexpensive ones that fit true to size, and Depend being a local company where I use to live should size them better, therefore will not be buying them again.  They were very expensive and I gave them to someone else who could use them\",\"title\":\"Depend not true to size\"},{\"name\":\"Lau███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These underwear are NOT 2X. I ordered a large quantity of these because Walmart did not have my favorite brand in stock, at the store or warehouse. Now I am stuck with all these worthless underwear. I thought I could trust the brand, but that was wrong. Will never order these again!\",\"title\":\"Very disappointed!\"},{\"name\":\"Tanya\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This is not size XXL, I purchased a case before. This fits like the XL. I would like a refund\",\"title\":\"Depends XXL\"},{\"name\":\"Lau███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These underwear for incontinence\\nadvertise as being 2XL and they definitely are not. My regular choice was out of stock so I ordered a large order of these. I knew when I put the first pair on that they were not 2XL. So now I am stuck with all these underwear that do not fit, I have paid for a large order, and I have to go somewhere and purchase the ones that fit! This brand is terrible.\",\"title\":\"Very disappointing purchase.\"}]','Polypropylene, Sodium Polyacrylate, Wood Pulp, Polyester, Polyethylene, Polyurethane elastics, Adhesives, and Colorants',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Polypropylene, Sodium Polyacrylate, Wood Pulp, Polyester, Polyethylene, Polyurethane elastics, Adhesives, and Colorants\"}]','[\"Personal Care\",\"Incontinence\",\"Depend\",\"Depend for Women\"]'),(689,'Party Dresses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Aiyino-Women-s-Sleeveless-Hollow-Out-Twist-Bodycon-Dress-Wrap-Slim-Fit-Party-Evening-Dresses-L-Grey_2485d6cc-2360-44a0-a755-0a00aa7c7bbf.517028ad8bfa6bf836922fc88d9fa0ec.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black Flower\",\"Blue Leaf\",\"Green\",\"Gray\",\"Grey Leaf\",\"Pink\",\"Purple Gradient\",\"Royal Blue\",\"Yellow Gradient\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"soz███mac███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Every now and then I try to get out of my comfort zone and with this dress, it was definitely that however, I was so surprised how much I liked it once it was on. I ordered a size large, which is my usual size, and it fit perfectly, and was not overly revealing, which is what I was looking for. I love that it is classic black.\",\"title\":\"Loved this dress and very tts\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The dress did not have a size tag but I believe it is a medium. This dress was SO cute and a very pleasant surprise. The cutouts are flirty and fun and the black color makes the dress very slimming. Throw a blazer over this for a workday outfit or add a pop with some colored heels for a sexy date night!\",\"title\":\"Flirty Sexy Date Night Dress\"},{\"name\":\"soz███iam███eni█████████\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Tjis durable fabric twist open front dress is very cute and comfortable. The fabric and style is great for a summer day at the beach or for a day out with friends and family. I have matched this dress with a simple pair of shoes. I am wearing a size XLarge. My measurements are Height 5\'6 Waist 28\\\" Hip 48\\\" Bra 36C\",\"title\":\"Twist Out Open Front Dress size XLarge\"},{\"name\":\"soz███ild███eph██████\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This size M dress is super sleek and sexy. I\'m a five feet five woman at 145 lbs, waist 29, hips 38, and chest 34A. It could be a casual or a dressy dress. Also, its price and range of color selections to choose from without breaking the bank makes this the ultimate go to. Get it now. At first glance, it looks asymmetrical, but if you move it a little, it is not.\",\"title\":\"Size M dress for petite or average sized woman.\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got this black dress in a size small and it fit pretty loose and long on me but I\'m very short. I really liked the cut out design in the middle I thought it was very stylish. The material was extremely soft too. I think this would be super cute on a night out just size down if you want a tighter fit.\",\"title\":\"Very stylish and cute dress\"}]',NULL,14.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"Party Dresses\"]'),(690,'Womens Blouses','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/LELINTA-Women-Plus-Size-Summer-Tunic-Dress-V-Neck-Casual-Loose-Flowy-Swing-Shift-Dresses-Black-Green-Navy-Blue-Wine-Red-Caramel-S-2XL_d98a9d27-b068-4e1b-bd18-1f62135a0e4e_1.5ba7485a45bdc711553f31087a0c9ab9.jpeg\"',3.90,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue-A\",\"Caramel\",\"Dark Grey-A\",\"Green\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Purple-A\",\"Red-A\",\"Wine Red\",\"Wine Red-A\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand wash cold. Only non-chlorine bleach when needed. Line dry. Do not iron.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"PAM███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The fit was true to size and really like the top.\",\"title\":\"Fast and efficient\"},{\"name\":\"ter███2\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very nice tunic.  Soft material.  Great fit.\",\"title\":\"Super nice!\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███en\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful Color and Material\\nGreat value for the money. Runs small, I think, I sized up a size but I like lots of room in my clothes\",\"title\":\"Beautiful top\"},{\"name\":\"Jan███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"light weight, color is as in pictures, fabric is light weight\",\"title\":\"good\"},{\"name\":\"Diane\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This top fits very nicely, but the material is a little thin.  All and all, its a keeper!\"},{\"name\":\"GM\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Good fit and soft material.\"},{\"name\":\"Ros███o\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"over all I love it  I just runs small for me. so I have to return it and order 1 size larger.\",\"title\":\"it runs small.\"},{\"name\":\"Ela███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This is not true to size. I would order up 1 size. The material is very clingy.\"},{\"name\":\"Carol\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"if I could give a zero or a minus I would.   that is how bad the quality is\"},{\"name\":\"The███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"They claim to be 3/4 length sleeves....NOT.  totally long sleeve.  So disappointed\"}]',NULL,13.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Tops\",\"Womens Blouses\",\"Womens Blouses\"]'),(691,'Womens Swimsuits','[\"Reviewers highlighted: fit, comfort\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SHEWIN-Bikinis-for-Women-2-Piece-Sexy-Swimsuits-Set-Turquoise-High-Waisted-Swimwear_3582b253-2cd3-43ee-a261-b7f37b74b59f.ccfa89316909450d3a423a5900931dcf.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"AB Yellow\",\"AC Yellow\",\"B Turquoise\",\"D Blue\",\"E Pink\",\"F Green\",\"I Multicolor\",\"J USA Flag\",\"K Red\",\"L Orange\",\"M Yellow\",\"USA Flag\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Amber\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love how you can tighten the back and the straps. And since i just had another child 11 months ago how it don\'t show as much. I put my old one on and my husband was like no. 🤣🤣\",\"title\":\"True to size\"},{\"name\":\"Vic███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love my new bikini. It is true to size and it\'s very well made. It\'s very heavy and thick material. It feels and looks great on!!! I love it so much that  I\'m going to order another one in a different color.\",\"title\":\"extremely satisfied\"},{\"name\":\"Che███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Fit perfectly and is just as vibrant/bright as pictures\",\"title\":\"Love\"},{\"name\":\"shn███es\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"this swimsuit has exceeeded my expectations above and beyond with how well the size chart helped me get the perfect size, the quality of the suit looks like it cost way more than what I payed for it. the color I got lime greeen/black n white stripes in XL, I payed only 14.99, also the top part is very comfortable and supportive especially if you have larger top parts that need a decent hold and support! thank you for the amazing swimsuit!! best quality , price, and fit!\",\"title\":\"amazing quality, fit, and price!\"},{\"name\":\"Kelly\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This swim suit exceeded my expectations. It has all the features I was looking for at a low price, AND the padded cups are sewn in. No more fumbling or crooked boobs. I cannot verify the durability as of yet, but the fabric feels great and the color was exceptional!\",\"title\":\"Highly recommend\"},{\"name\":\"Debra\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The swim suit is very cute and I love the colors. The only drawback is the bottoms are a little large on me and the top is tight. I wish they were sold as individual pieces. The sizing is not the manufacturers error it’s my body. No butt and big top side\",\"title\":\"Love the colors and design.\"},{\"name\":\"Tom\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"It is a very cute 2 pc. I like the full coverage. The material is soft and fit true to size. The top was not as much of a push up as just a formed cups. I liked that the straps were interchangeable between crisscross and normal.\",\"title\":\"Working on my tan\"},{\"name\":\"Les███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Very cute my boobs are larger 36DD, so the large top fit however I could have used a smaller size than a large in the bottoms. They fit but as soon as they get wet they are a little saggy. But for the price I’m not mad at all because it’s cute as heck and I love it\",\"title\":\"Very cute suit\"},{\"name\":\"lau███lou███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"i loved the bottoms but didn\'t realize the top was a push up and the cups were so stiff. it was too big for my chest and i couldn\'t remove the padding.\",\"title\":\"yellow bikini\"},{\"name\":\"swe███aby███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"It\'s very cute and looks just like the pictures. However, the cup size was too big and no side slot to add padding so unfortunately it had to be returned. Bottoms fit good though!\",\"title\":\"Wish it would\'ve fit!\"}]',NULL,29.98,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Swimsuits\",\"Womens Swimsuits\"]'),(692,'White Headboards',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Modway-Serena-King-Powder-Coated-Steel-Headboard-in-White-Finish_71bf5f97-a5d7-46c1-863c-519b7e0daae6.3902c367dcb950d163f163c43394b111.jpeg\"',3.70,'[\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\"]','[\"Brown\",\"Gray\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Easy Care, Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Sher\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased the king size bedframe. It is more of a black looking for brushed bronze look than brown as listed. Thats what i was looking for so it sorked perfect for my needs. It gives a beautiful farmhouse look on a budget! It is made of a very lightweight material so its easily moved and easy to put together. Im bery happy with the purchase and look.\",\"title\":\"Lightweight and beautiful!\"},{\"name\":\"Diana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The headboard came on time, and in good condition.  The only problem was no hardware was enclosed to attach it to the bed frame, even though the enclosed instructions indicated the hardware was enclosed.\",\"title\":\"I would buy again.\"},{\"name\":\"Becky\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This is beautiful and just what I wanted. It is short so Im going to make some adjustments but I love it!!  Price was amazing.\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███ian███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I was searching for an inexpensive head board for our guest room. The quality of Modway Serena Steel Headboard is what I hoped and expected. It is sturdy and has the look I was going for. I assume this would easily attach to a traditional bedframe, however the holes do not line up with the platform like bedframe we have so we had to to rig up a piece of wood to bridge the gap. If I would have purchased this from a local store I would probably return it for something that fit better, but for the price of this product I feel like it was easier to make the modifications we needed than to try to return by mail.\",\"title\":\"Great Value\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███le\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The brown color is almost black which I liked. It\'s not very tall, after you put pillows on you can\'t see much of it. Good quality. Hardware is included, it\'s attached to the inside of the box lid.\",\"title\":\"Nice Headboard\"},{\"name\":\"tmc\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Color is more black, very short and didn\'t fit our frame, we were able to modify it but it took some work\",\"title\":\"Okay, not great\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███er\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The product itself is nice but I thought a King size Headboard would fit a King Size bed Frame, this is bigger than my frame. So now I have to buy some brackets to make it work. So just a heads up just cause it says King size doesn\'t mean it will work.\",\"title\":\"Measure your frame before you buy\"},{\"name\":\"Lizzy\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I purchased the full size headboard. Was so excited when it arrived, and it did arrive early which is great! My bed rests under my window and I needed something to hold my pillows better. The condition of the actual metal is great nothing wrong. It did come with screws and tools to attach to a frame.\\nThe one bad thing about this is the fact that it did not come with any adjusters where the headboard can adjust to any size. PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU MEASURE!! There is only one length to this headboard and there are no plates to adjust it.\",\"title\":\"Great only if it fit\"},{\"name\":\"Mike\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"First of all, it\'s super short. My bed isn\'t that tall, just a standard frame, box spring and mattress and you can barely see the headboard. Also, it didn\'t come with any hardware to attach it to my frame (even though it uses them in the intructions) so that\'s extremely inconvenient. So now it\'s just flimsly hiding behind my bed.\",\"title\":\"Inconvenient\"},{\"name\":\"sally\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It\'s too small for double bed frame.  I\'m saying that after ALL the work of painting the WALMART dbl headboard, it\'s too small for the WALMART dbl bedframe.\",\"title\":\"TOO SMALL FOR FRAME.\"}]',NULL,209.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Furniture\",\"Bedroom Furniture\",\"Headboards\",\"White Headboards\"]'),(693,'Bikinis','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/FINETOO-6-Pack-Lace-Underwear-For-Women-Invisible-High-Waist-Thongs-V-Shape-Embroidery-Floral-Bikini-Panties-S-XL_980d1e66-5a8d-4f43-9bdc-b321e7707cac.2bdf71d25546be05c76de1b19c500ef1.jpeg\"',3.70,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]','[\"6Pack A\",\"6Pack B\",\"6Pack C\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Hand Wash Only\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Too large. Order a size down. Also these are meant to be high waisted so remember that when u put them on.\",\"title\":\"Too Large, pretty though. Order size down.\"},{\"name\":\"Ala███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"fuller coverage; high quality lace; sexy panty\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Shapes everything just right\",\"title\":\"Sexy\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really like these. They have enough stretch. Soft and very pretty. Best of all as a woman with a fupa it\'s hard to find something that looks good. These fit great and make me feel sexy. I couldn\'t even feel them under my pants. 200 pounds and 5\'4. I got an extra-large and i am going to get more. The colors are beautiful.\",\"title\":\"Sexy\"},{\"name\":\"ME\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love them - great fit high waisted!\",\"title\":\"Great fit!\"},{\"name\":\"Tana\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I Liked The Colors But they were All 6 Individually wrapped??%26 I ordered Size Small .... ONLY 4 of them were a Size Small. The Other 2 Are A Bigger Size ❓Weird....%26 Took a Long Time to receive These.\",\"title\":\"Just Okay\"},{\"name\":\"Lil███om\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"The small fits like a large. To call them high waisted is an understatement. I could hike them up to my ribs.\"},{\"name\":\"Val\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"To high and to low and didn\'t get a look of excitement\",\"title\":\"Not happy don\'t look as good as the model did with\"},{\"name\":\"Cam███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered the size that was recommended and they did not fit at all. Were not flattering in the least and were not like the ones pictured. They were like a cheaper unflattering version.\",\"title\":\"Did not fit like pictured\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███ine███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Runs large, poor quality, gusset set to far back and too short.\",\"title\":\"Don\'t buy these\"}]',NULL,12.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Bras, Panties & Lingerie\",\"Womens Panties\",\"Bikinis\"]'),(694,'Baby Boys Dressy Outfit Sets','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Lolanta-Summer-Boys-Suit-Kids-Wedding-Ring-Bearing-Costume-4-Pcs-Shirt-Vest-Shorts-Set_f00b997e-24ee-4083-8a34-8dffb30efec5.d62badf669b6efadfb270b1141ddb9a1.jpeg\"',4.70,'[\"2T\",\"3T\",\"4T\",\"5T\",\"6Years\",\"7-8Years\",\"8-9Years\",\"10-11Years\"]','[\"Blue\",\"Khaki\",\"Gray\",\"Pink\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Merchine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"F. ███oy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Purchased two. For comparison, my 6-year-old is wearing the 7-year-old size and weighs 46 pounds. My four-year-old is wearing a six-year-old size and weighs 38 pounds. They fit flawlessly; the only issue was that the rose came off, which I believe was caused by my kid yanking on them. There is excellent quality. Worth the money. The color was amazing. Very versatile.\",\"title\":\"Adore them.\"},{\"name\":\"wen███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I liked how this clothing looked on my kid, and he did too. I only wish the trousers were more tapered around his legs, but it was nice any way. It did come with a bow tie, but he removed it since he wasn\'t feeling it. Lol\",\"title\":\"Adorable.\"},{\"name\":\"tex███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Happy with the size and color. The only downside was that the material was really thin, giving me the impression that it was cheap. But at that price, what else can you get? It presented itself wonderfully, and my kid was quite attractive.\",\"title\":\"Excellent fit at a very affordable price.\"},{\"name\":\"M. ███yen███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Order the precise size you want. It fit well for the size he wears. He likes it. He calls it his magician costume.\",\"title\":\"My youngster was enthralled by it.\"},{\"name\":\"Nad███ Sm███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My baby looked adorable in it and received several attention, but he didn\'t make it through the first wash.\",\"title\":\"adorable yet inexpensive content.\"},{\"name\":\"Sta███y B███ham███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"When I opened the box, I realized I had made an excellent decision. I love the fabric. This outfit was just what I anticipated.\",\"title\":\"Perfect.\"},{\"name\":\"Gla███ De███no\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This was just as anticipated! I received this for my aunt\'s wedding. My kid looked like a dashing little gentlemen in this! He received accolades from everyone!\",\"title\":\"Charming small chap.\"},{\"name\":\"May███ewi███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I loved the outfit! Absolutely perfect! Order two different sizes! The first costume that arrived was just wonderful, and the second outfit was nearly great except that they neglected to include the bow tie! And I was expecting they could assist me with that little problem.\",\"title\":\"bow tie.\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███Gof███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These suited both of my babies pretty well, and we received several remarks on how lovely they were. They wore them to a mid-July function, and the fabric was quite lightweight, making them comfortable.\",\"title\":\"Looks lovely and fits well.\"},{\"name\":\"Bob███mon███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Son generally wears a size 6/7, so that\'s what I got; it fits well! So many compliments!The only thing I didn\'t like about it was the bow it came with, which was just a bow fastened to a safety pin.\",\"title\":\"Excellent fit and really adorable.\"}]',NULL,30.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Kids Clothing\",\"Baby Clothes\",\"Baby Boys Clothing\",\"Baby Boys Outfit Sets\",\"Baby Boys Dressy Outfit Sets\"]'),(695,'Bed Skirts','[\"Best seller\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Mellanni-Iconic-Collection-Pleated-Microfiber-Bed-Skirt-15-Drop-Queen-Gray_74aaf4d2-d066-4336-bfe0-e32fe3099b5d.2930c66f72d7fa88a0c4b6022ce2a05c.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"Twin\",\"Twin-XL\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\"]','[\"1102 White\",\"1364 Light Gray\",\"1394 Gray\",\"1573 Blue Hydrangea\",\"1583 Spa Blue\",\"1597 Royal Blue\",\"1752 Brick Red\",\"1812 Sand\",\"1877 Dark Taupe\",\"1959 Navy Blue\",\"1990 Black\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash cold on permanent press or gentle cycle with like colors. Tumble dry low, remove promptly. Do not bleach, iron or dry-clean.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"jac███lin███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Looks beautiful and exactly what i was looking for\",\"title\":\"Bed skirt\"},{\"name\":\"erma\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Really soft and love the color\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really like the fabric and fit.\",\"title\":\"Very good\"},{\"name\":\"pat\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My daughter bought this for the guest room bed.  I thought it looked kind of cheap when I took it out of the package, but when my daughter put it on the bed, it looked great!\",\"title\":\"Good buy\"},{\"name\":\"Grace\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The skirt is as pictured. Color is the same light beige pictured. As any skirt if you want it stiff it will need to be pressed, but it flows as it should not pressed. Queen size matches 10in high queen box spring perfectly and meets the floor.\",\"title\":\"Nice simple bed skirt.\"},{\"name\":\"Chr███oph███B.\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The transformation this pleated bed skirt brought to my bed is truly remarkable. The sharp pleats and sumptuous fabric combine to create an atmosphere of luxury and style that I adore.\",\"title\":\"Impeccable Material, Wrinkle-Free, Adore it!\"},{\"name\":\"Bra███n T███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The addition of this pleated bed skirt has brought a new level of sophistication to my bedroom. Its tailored design and luxurious fabric create an atmosphere of elegance that I absolutely adore.\",\"title\":\"Marvelous Bedskirt\"},{\"name\":\"Ash███ J.███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"This pleated bed skirt has become the focal point of my bedroom decor. Its well-defined pleats and luxurious fabric combine to create a stunning visual impact that I can\'t get enough of.\",\"title\":\"Chic Appeal\"},{\"name\":\"Bar███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Seemed very flimsy,  I will reorder one that is more expensive and maybe the quality will be better.\",\"title\":\"Negative\"},{\"name\":\"Kel\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I popped this in the washer when I got it and when I pulled it out of the dryer, ALL of the wrinkles were still there, and prominent.   Went to iron it and the tag says \\\"Do not bleach, iron, or dry clean\\\".  So I tried ironing through a washcloth and the wrinkles only got slightly better.  So, if you want a wrinkly, too-thin dust ruffle, definitely buy this.\",\"title\":\"Thin, wrinkles won\'t come out\"}]',NULL,27.97,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Skirts\"]'),(696,'Womens Dresses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/asr/c18e06b5-256e-4437-8f86-a4dfa7747eb3.83398273f8b8987c11c1b50defd39ed1.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blue Polka Dot\",\"Burgundy Polka Dot\",\"Dark Blue\",\"Dusty Blue\",\"Mint Green\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Navy Blue Flower Print\",\"Pink\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable Wash in Cold Water and Dry On Low Heat\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Gra███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the material and it fit nicely, large, 150lb, \\nWell made, not see through. Love the pattern \\nTrue to size\",\"title\":\"Worth the price\"},{\"name\":\"Me\",\"rating\":4}]',NULL,24.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"Womens Dresses\"]'),(697,'Bathroom Cleaners',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Seventh-Generation-Toilet-Bowl-Cleaner-Fresh-Mint-Chlorine-Bleach-Ammonia-Free-24-oz_b8368986-f1c5-4898-a12b-271f7853046c.b285902a8e20cdd88144ae12103335a6.jpeg\"',4.50,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Squirt under toilet bowl rim. Brush the bowl and then flush. Septic safe.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"We\'ve been using this bowl cleaner for years at our house, along with many other 7th Generation products, because it works, is not tested on animals, doesn\'t contain any bleach or other harmful chemicals or perfumes (7th Gen uses botanical oils for its scent). \",\"title\":\"Works very well\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"cleans very well, though smells a bit strong. I\'ve been using this brand for years, when a baking soda scrub isn\'t enough for cleaning the toilet bowl...\",\"title\":\"strong fragrance but effective product\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I choose this products to avoid nasty products in my house to protect the health of our family when we clean our home. it has natural source ingredients \",\"title\":\"good product\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I like this Cleaner. It has a pleasant smell. Gets the job done without any harsh chemicals and fragrance. I\'d definitely recommend it for weekly cleaning usage. The package will last you for a while and the price is excellent for the quality you\'re getting\",\"title\":\"Great Eco Friendly Cleaner\"},{\"name\":\"mlf███ll\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I LOVE this cleaner. I add it to my mop water, clean my counters, clean my sink and faucets, children tables and toys. The house smells wonderful afterward and is sparkly shiny clean.\",\"title\":\"Sparkly Clean\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great product. Been using it for years and happy to be able to have it shipped to our home. Safe around pets and gets the toilet bowel super clean. Will be purchasing this item over and over again thanks to IHerb for carrying it. \",\"title\":\"Trustworthy and Safe\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███ust███r\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Love how I can remove the lid & rinse out the packaging when it\'s empty. Didn\'t like the squeeze lid (similar to the shampoo & conditioner lids) as the product dribbled & got messy when I lifted the product up from the toilet bowl. I do love the mild scent though & how the product is better for the environment. May buy again. Please give a thumbs up if you find this useful.\",\"title\":\"Difficult lid\"},{\"name\":\"Boh███ick███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Bought this cleaner to try a natural cleaner different than Mrs. meyer\'s. I prefer a strong smell, especially for toilets and this one is rather neutral. The toilet was however clean afterwards, so it works. \\n\\nIt did seem to get dirtier faster than when I have used other products.\\n\\nOverall Meh. \",\"title\":\"Nothing spectacular\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I like this brand and have found it to be consistently good quality for over a decade. The toilet bowl cleaner is no exception, worked well and cleaned the bowl --- but I did not notice the scent before buying was mint, which I think is a little odd for a toilet. So I would buy again, but a different smell.\",\"title\":\"Ok\"},{\"name\":\"gh ga\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"We purchased two bottles that have both cracked at mid height at a rounded edge - just where we press to expel cleaner. I thought the first was a result of a stocker having accidentally cut the bottle. With the second bottle doing this it is clear that the bottle is defective. This results in spilled and wasted product.\",\"title\":\"Plastic bottle cracks\"}]','Water, Lactic Acid (Plant-Derived pH Adjuster), Octyl/Decyl Glucoside (Plant-Derived Cleaning Agent), Xanthan Gum (Plant-Derived Thickener), Sodium Benzoate (Synthetic Preservative), Plant-Derived Fragrances: Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Peel Oil, Eucalyptus Globulus Leaf Oil, Mentha Arvensis (Mint) Leaf Oil, Mentha Viridis (Spearmint) Leaf Oil.',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Water, Lactic Acid (Plant-Derived pH Adjuster), Octyl/Decyl Glucoside (Plant-Derived Cleaning Agent), Xanthan Gum (Plant-Derived Thickener), Sodium Benzoate (Synthetic Preservative), Plant-Derived Fragrances: Citrus Aurantium Dulcis (Orange) Peel Oil, Eucalyptus Globulus Leaf Oil, Mentha Arvensis (Mint) Leaf Oil, Mentha Viridis (Spearmint) Leaf Oil.\"}]','[\"Household Essentials\",\"Bathroom Cleaning Supplies\",\"Bathroom Cleaners\"]'),(698,'High School Supplies','[\"500+ bought since yesterday\",\"In 200+ people\'s carts\",\"Reduced price\",\"Popular pick\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/HP-Victus-15-6-inch-FHD-144Hz-Gaming-Laptop-AMD-Ryzen-5-8645HS-NVIDIA-GeForce-RTX-4050-8GB-DDR4-512GB-SSD-Mica-Silver-2024_04abf048-d9d8-4116-a0bf-68803329aa55.cffd7bcccd71823b93806434d2d23b60.jpeg\"',4.60,'[]','[]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Chr███ian███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"When i first saw this laptop i was skeptical... Mine came with an RTX 4050 and ryzen 5. I paid $665.40. When it arrived i was pleased to find out that HP Victus delivers everything it promised. great performance for a great price. The computer is fast and responsive. and plays all the games I have at frame rates. The only downside I would say is the battery, it could use more capacity. Other than that im very happy with my purchase. I would gladly recommend to others looking for a budget gaming laptop.\",\"title\":\"great performance for the price.\"},{\"name\":\"R2D2\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I hit it for a very good deal, 599$, I think it was listed for 949$ or something like that. It\'s a very good gaming laptop with last generation hardware. It does need the 8 gb ram boost to pull off those more demanding games. But I can\'t complain. It came in its own box, HP seal was on the plastic bag, and all parts came from a good manufacturer like Micron and so on. No delays on the delivery either.\",\"title\":\"Good deal, best product\"},{\"name\":\"keith\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"just add another stick of ram ($20 on newegg) and you\'ll have a laptop that competes with others that are twice the price. don\'t pay any attention to marks review saying this is a bait and switch. It\'s a great deal, and mark is a jaded individual, who has zero idea what he is talking about.\",\"title\":\"great bang for the buck\"},{\"name\":\"Leo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"An amazing product for just about anyone looking for a good laptop. Great for gaming and great for just about anything you could throw at it. It comes with 500GB NVME SSD. 8Gb of DRR5, if you\'re gonna run higher end games or stuff of the sorts, I recommend buying another 8GB of DDR5 to increase the performance even more. You can upgrade the RAM up to 16GB of DDR5 and you can upgrade your storage but you\'ll have to use software to pass your current drive to your new one as there is no second SSD spot. Overall an amazing laptop, can run most games at really nice speeds and with good FPS. Like i said, crazy good price for such a good laptop.\",\"title\":\"Best bang for your buck. Absolute Unit!!!\"},{\"name\":\"Skye\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The laptop is very good, for gaming, work and browsing. Im\'a upgrade the ram when i get the chance too, I recommend you do too. If you\'ve never used a windows keyboard then you may press other buttons by accident like me. Now others reviews about hinges, honestly mines is sturdy and perfectly fine, unless you are constantly moving around, then it\'ll shake a little.\",\"title\":\"100% worth it right now, though upgrade if you can\"},{\"name\":\"Mauro\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Ok you are getting a RTX4050 i, Ryzen 5-8645- 600 dollars and running at DDR5 5200. Well done Walmart. I am just going to upgrade it to 16 Gb ddr5, and I will be set for a long time. You can check other places same computer almost the same price but with lower CPU and GPU. You have to go for this computer auntil it last. What a great deal.\",\"title\":\"What a computer for the price.\"},{\"name\":\"H7L███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Powered by the AMD Ryzen 5-8645HS and NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4050, it delivers exceptional performance for both gaming and multitasking. The 144Hz display ensures smooth visuals, enhancing your gaming experience. One of its standout features is the upgradable RAM and storage, allowing you to boost its capabilities as needed. Overall, this laptop is a fantastic investment for anyone looking for a high-performance, future-proof gaming machine.\\n\\nHighly recommend that you change the RAM and SSD for a more optimal performance.\",\"title\":\"TECH-BEST\"},{\"name\":\"Wol███rco███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"It\'s a great GPU for the price, but the 8 gb ram is not enough for gaming with that GPU. It\'s a bizzare combination. You\'ll have to buy a 16 GB (2x8) DDR5 kit which is fairly expensive, but even so this laptop is a great value. What I don\'t like about it is the cooling airflow is not as strong as the MSI Bravo 15, and the fans are a higher pitch. Not a deal breaker, but notable.\",\"title\":\"Great GPU (graphics power) but needs more RAM\"},{\"name\":\"Tiz███at\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I thought this was supposed to be a gaming laptop? It lags A LOT!!! It even lags when you are just scrolling a website! It does okay with simple games, but I can\'t imagine how it would perform with intensive gaming...I am very disappointed in this laptop. I should have known better than to buy another HP.....smh\",\"title\":\"Gaming Laptop???\"},{\"name\":\"Mark\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"during their big Walmart days sale have listed a regular price for this that was almost $300 over with this computer sells for regularly everywhere else. where they got that list price if you look even on the website where you could buy it direct from the manufacturer it described a completely different version of that computer with much more memory for that price. never even opened it. I made the mistake of trusting what they put in their savings for the sale.\",\"title\":\"Bait and switch\"}]',NULL,979.00,NULL,'[\"Seasonal\",\"Back to School\",\"Shop all Back to School\",\"School Supplies by Grade\",\"High School Supplies\"]'),(699,'Reebok Womens Socks','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Reebok-Women-s-Pro-Series-Performance-Lightweight-Ankle-Socks-10-Pack_9a357366-e36c-49bc-ad19-f34a9e95b542.cda88d9bb098de418fbcabd9ea1f343e.jpeg\"',4.60,'[\"4-9\",\"9-12\"]','[\"Assorted\",\"Black\",\"Black Grey Assorted\",\"Blue Assorted\",\"Gray\",\"Pink/Gray\",\"Tan Multi\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Eli███eth███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I first have to say that the price on these are great!! Yay! I actually bought three sets because my own socks are so worn out that they\'re basically useless. I saw these on clearance, and I thought it was the perfect time to stock up. Then I don\'t have to think about it anymore. Also, I\'d always bought low cut socks in the past, and I wanted to switch to ankle socks. I have some arthritis and occasional swelling in my right ankle, and these are perfect for that. The socks are lightweight, very nice material, well-made and fit so comfortably. Everything I want in a sock! I don\'t think you can go wrong with these, if you\'re on the fence.\",\"title\":\"Cute, Comfy, Great Socks!\"},{\"name\":\"Sarah\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"They fit just like they should, the ankle cuff  a has little extra strength , elasticizes to them and I like that. It lets you know that it won\'t roll or just slip into your shoes like some have I\'ve owned. They feel good and I\'m gonna buy more cause the price for quality and quantity is awesome.\",\"title\":\"stunning feel\"},{\"name\":\"amber\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My items came on time and they fit the form of the foot perfectly and are breathable and super comfortable! Love them!!💕\",\"title\":\"10 pair of reebox socks fit great and very com\"},{\"name\":\"Jan███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"if you are looking for a thicker sock, this is not for you but i wanted a thin song. but not so thin that two wears and they are coming apart. these are excellent\",\"title\":\"thin, just what i wanted\"},{\"name\":\"Lisa\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are light and comfy for summer wear. They are not a no-show style, but they are a great choice for low-cut socks that fit well.\",\"title\":\"Comfy and Affordable!\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███er\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"These socks are light, breathable, and very comfortable, however, the first pair I wore had a hole in the toe after just a few hours wear so I definitely question the quality.\",\"title\":\"light %26,comfy but cheap quality\"},{\"name\":\"Jes███a\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I absolutely love the socks but the lettering was messed up on some\"},{\"name\":\"Rrr███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Socks in the package were not all the same size - some were longer heel to toe, some shorter. In all cases, the elastic around the ankle was too tight.\",\"title\":\"ankles tight, inconsistent sizing\"},{\"name\":\"Reg███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"i bought 2 sets, and they are shrinking every time you wash. \\ni wash on delicate and dry on low.\\nTop sock is washed, bottom sock is new not washed yet!\",\"title\":\"They shrink bad\"},{\"name\":\"Kayla\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These were not worth 15 bucks so thin as soon as they get washed they\'re going to be so small\",\"title\":\"1st pic 2nd pic the ones I wanted\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Fashion Brands\",\"Reebok\",\"Reebok Womens\",\"Reebok Womens Socks\"]'),(700,'Big and Tall Polo Shirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Liberty-Blues-Men-s-Big-Tall-Longer-Length-Shrink-Less-Piqu-Polo_c539a2cf-3723-431e-95c7-e0837b3f9a1e.08dc895f91c5e912fc1fd55021456b48.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"Big - XL\",\"Tall - L\",\"Tall - XL\",\"Big - 2XL\",\"Tall - 2XL\",\"Big - 3XL\",\"Tall - 3XL\",\"Big - 4XL\",\"Tall - 4XL\",\"Big - 5XL\",\"Tall - 5XL\",\"Big - 6XL\",\"Tall - 6XL\",\"Big - 7XL\",\"Big - 8XL\",\"Big - 9XL\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black Ground Multi Stripe\",\"Cobalt Stripe\",\"Deep Burgundy\",\"Deep Olive\",\"Heather Navy\",\"Heather Slate\",\"Navy\",\"Teal\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash; imported\"}]','[{\"name\":\"DAN███ A\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Good shirt.\",\"title\":\"Shirt\"},{\"name\":\"San███W\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"So far these have been just what he was wanting. They are plenty long enough to cover his belly and a little bit bigger in the shoulders. As long as they don\'t shrink in length they will be reordered.\"},{\"name\":\"MrB███ins███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these shirts if you are tall & big man like me they are the best I\'m 6 foot 4 1/2 inches tall and size 9x and I hate reading these reviews of people complains it to long no chit sherlock it says longer length on the discerption buy a regular one if your short or regular size. Its tuff to find stuff that\'s both big and tall at my size you short people quit ruing it for us giants and go buy the regular length cut shirts. Giving longer length clothing bad reviews because you did not read it saying there to long what did you expect. There not meant for you I don\'t want them to stop making them so go buy regular size shirt and leave us giants alone lol Thank ya\",\"title\":\"Its suppose be long duh\"},{\"name\":\"Dia███ C\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These high quality shirts are perfect for my son, who is a teacher.  He can wear them untucked, be comfortable, and still dress professionally.  Love King Size for my two sons who need the Big Man\'s sizes, and my youngest, who is tall and needs the longer length and sleeves of the Tall Man\'s sizes.\",\"title\":\"Professional and Comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"JAM███P\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Prompt delivery.  Product as described.\",\"title\":\"Polo\"},{\"name\":\"Wil███m J███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great fitting shirt and quality material. Would reccomend to anyone.\",\"title\":\"Great fitting shirt.\"},{\"name\":\"KAR███B\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Purchased for my husband. The length is actually a little longer than needed, but it still looks great. The material is great and holds up well after washing.\",\"title\":\"Great Shirt!\"},{\"name\":\"Ton███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I ordered a Liberty Blues long sleeve pocket Polo 2 or 3 years ago, & it became my favorite shirt,  I have worn it out. I decided to order short/sleeve Pocket-Polos of the same brand this spring & I like them just as well. I have had several compliments on all 3 shirts about the colors & styles, I like the fit and comfort as much as the older long sleeve.\"},{\"name\":\"Too███han███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Was a little longer then expected but didn\'t matter as it tore after the first wash. Right along the button hole seam.\",\"title\":\"Long but tore after first wash\"},{\"name\":\"RIC███D B███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The shirt was not completely sewed together where the buttons are located. It was not wearable. I had also ordered the wrong size. I should have ordered 3XL and I ordered 4XL. Due to my satisfaction with the many items I have received, I just placed the shirt in Goodwill.\"}]',NULL,36.10,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Big and Tall\",\"Big and Tall Shirts\",\"Big and Tall Polo Shirts\"]'),(701,'Womens Leggings','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Woman-Within-Women-s-Plus-Size-Stretch-Cotton-Printed-Legging-3X-Black-White-Tie-Dye_2f37f78a-c0b5-406f-9614-0218a2b7d93b.f07e145d1634f7e699f9c356c5c96460.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"1X (22-24)\",\"2X (26-28)\",\"3X (30-32)\",\"4X (34-36)\",\"5X (38-40)\",\"6X (42-44)\",\"S (12)\",\"M (14-16)\",\"L (18-20)\"]','[\"Black Abstract\",\"Black Batik Floral\",\"Black Dot\",\"Black Multi Florals\",\"Black Pretty Bouquet\",\"Black Tossed Hearts\",\"Black Watercolor Flowers\",\"Black White Tie Dye\",\"Blue Tie Dye\",\"Multi Graphic Floral\",\"Navy Batik Floral\",\"Navy Happy Ditsy\",\"Navy Multi Florals\",\"Radiant Purple Soft Floral\",\"Sweet Coral Dots\",\"Waterfall Dots\",\"White Tropical Floral\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Bar███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful leggings just what i wanted for me summer,i love it ,shipping super fast  order the June 14 got it the 19 of June\",\"title\":\"Love it love it\"},{\"name\":\"Sta███All███n\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have lived in these leggings for years and they are pretty perfect.  My only gripe is that the fabric rarely changes.  PLEASE add some new designs/fabrics/colors to these leggings.  I\'m tired of the same old patterns and these are so wonderful, they deserve more designs and colors.  Otherwise, five stars is not enough.  They are comfortable, a great weight of the fabric, and the talls are perfect for me at 5\'9\\\".  I\'ll buy them forever but please, add more designs and colors!!\",\"title\":\"NEED MORE DESIGNS AND COLORS ~ OTHERWISE, PERFECT!!\"},{\"name\":\"Bar███a S███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Wish these had pockets but...still nice to wear and fun prints.  These are not quite as stretchy and soft as the leggings with pockets but still a good choice.  I liked the prints available in this style which is why I gave them a try.Since I made my size choice based on my hips which are not that large and ignored my waist (which is large), when I took them out of the package, I was afraid that they would not have enough give to feel comfortable at the waist. However, the ones that I am wearing feel fine. They washed up great and I just hang dry them.  Look great!\",\"title\":\"Very comfortable! Nice prints.\"},{\"name\":\"LIN███P\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I have bought many, many pairs of these Stretch Cotton Legging over the last several years, they are my favorite non-winter leggings. I have found the sizing very consistent in the solid colors, but not so much with the prints. Some are too big, & others, like this print, run small. The first pair of this black floral print, that I ordered a couple of years ago, ran small but were still wearable. They have faded more than I expected, so I wanted a new pair. The pair I just got are a full size smaller, & are not wearable. I am exchanging it for a Large instead of the Medium that I always order. Very cute print.\",\"title\":\"Very cute print, this item ran a full size smaller.\"},{\"name\":\"Peg███Y\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"This waterfall pattern is cute and colorful but too long for the petite size I ordered. The material is stiff and not form-fitting but comfort may improve with washings.\",\"title\":\"Cute but lengthy\"},{\"name\":\"LAU███ T\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I fell in love with these leggings and bought them when they were on sale to get three pairs. I got them in black, rose, and mint and was so excited to pair them with my variety of solid-colored dresses. Alas, the leggings were stiff and uncomfortable. I felt like I could never actually pull them up to a comfortable position and I could not get them to stay in a comfortable position. This caused me to have back pain from the pulling down of the leggings. I did not like how they looked when stretched over my thighs and calves as it greatly affected the pattern and the coloring. A wider waistband would probably help as well as wider calf areas. PS. I\'m 5\'3\\\" and these leggings are hella-long!\",\"title\":\"My Leggings are Falling Down . . .\"},{\"name\":\"Kim███rgo███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I bought the black w/white polka dots leggings.  They run small and short ~ I have short legs and they fit me more like capris.  I have a full rear-end, they barely cover the back end and when I sit, they show crack.  After 1 washing in cold water they faded like I had had them for years. I only feel comfortable wearing them as lounging pants or EXTREMELY casual attire. I would NOT recommend buying them for the price.\",\"title\":\"Not impressed\"},{\"name\":\"LIN███V\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I found that they were a bit stiff, unlike the others i have had in the past these for some reason were a bit stiff. After I washed them they got really tight. So now my younger daughter can fit into them. I will not buy them again. The original ones I did buy from you the ones with the little flowers they were really nice. they fit nice washed nice and did really good, but the latest ones with the red and pink were very tight, did not fit really well, when people buy these buy the next size up, me i got 2 xl and they were too snug, tight.\",\"title\":\"Buy next bigger size after washing they shrink\"},{\"name\":\"Karen\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The sizing is different from regular store items, so these were much to large, and I will be exchanging them.\",\"title\":\"Fair and honest.\"},{\"name\":\"Jea███te ███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I think the size was mid marked on these because I ordered the size I always wear and they are too small to get into. The material is not stretchy at all.\",\"title\":\"Very small!\"}]',NULL,34.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Pants\",\"Womens Leggings\"]'),(702,'Boys Athletic Shoes','[\"Reviewers highlighted: comfort, quality\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Saucony-Jazz-Kid-s-Easy-On-Off-Sneaker-Sizes-4-12_c36eb644-78fa-4967-bbf1-68564ae4da6c.5fd8d7c0d9cabfd8fc197bfce8d7edef.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"4\",\"4.5\",\"5\",\"5.5\",\"6\",\"6.5\",\"7\",\"7.5\",\"8\",\"8.5\",\"9\",\"9.5\",\"10\",\"10.5\",\"11\",\"11.5\",\"11.5 Little Kid\",\"12\"]','[\"Black/Grey/Orange\",\"Blue/Grey\",\"Cobalt/White\",\"Dark Grey/Pink\",\"Grey/Black/Purple\",\"Grey/Orange\",\"Grey/Red\",\"Grey/White/Green\",\"Magenta\",\"Navy/Pink\",\"Navy/Red\",\"Navy/Yellow\",\"Periwinkle\",\"Pink/Turq/Lime\",\"Red/Blue/Lime\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"nylon|suede\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Alice\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These shoes are the best for toddler feet, they are easy to learn to walk in. Super easy to put on. I wish they came in more colors, additionally I wish they came in adult jazz colors so we could match with our kids. There needs to be a version with a smooth, non-suade bottoms, because they get too dirty too fast. 3 other toddler moms got these as presents from me, and they all agree - it\'s super easy for babies to learn to walk in these because the soles are so soft and easy to manipulate with tiny feet.\",\"title\":\"Best toddler shoe EVER\"},{\"name\":\"Coo███hoe███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My son loves them he hasn\'t taken them off since!!\",\"title\":\"Great shoe for wild toddler\"},{\"name\":\"Lov███egi███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My granddaughter had a pair of these shoes that she loved   Their family went on vacation and one shoe was lost. She was heartbroken. We gave her a new pair for her birthday and she was so excited!\\nThank you\",\"title\":\"Granddaughter loves these shoes!\"},{\"name\":\"Raft\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Amazing! Velcro, comfort and FAST! My kid has two modes, run and sleep. Now my kid has an extra mode, super fast and sleep. Love these shoes. I wish they made them for adults to!!!\",\"title\":\"Amazing\"},{\"name\":\"Emi███N.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Best toddler tennis shoe.  Cool-looking and easy to put on!\",\"title\":\"Rockin\' shoe\"},{\"name\":\"HVT\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These shoes are great for my three year old. They\'re a sturdy little play shoe and she can get them on/off easily on her own. These were on the APMA list so I know they\'re shaped appropriately for her developing feet.\",\"title\":\"Great little play shoes\"},{\"name\":\"Ron J\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I bought these to replace a pair of my Nike shoes. These shoes are much more supportive and comfortable than my old Nikes.\"},{\"name\":\"Mom\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Durable shoe and great quality. Bought two years ago for my first daughter and had to go for it again for my 1yo\",\"title\":\"Great first shoe\"},{\"name\":\"View\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Got it last month. My girl 2 years old loves it so much. Easy to wear by herself.\\nGive 4 of 5 because one day she walk in the water. I wash it for her but the color is change. It looks old after that.\"},{\"name\":\"Katy\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I really like these shoes but they are hard to clean. The insert came out of one of them right away. Hopefully they will continue to hold up pretty well as my daughter is not easy on them!\",\"title\":\"Overall good\"}]',NULL,49.81,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Kids Shoes\",\"Boys Shoes\",\"Boys Sneakers\",\"Boys Athletic Shoes\"]'),(703,'Casual Dresses',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Zenana-Women-s-Relaxed-Fit-V-Neck-Short-Sleeve-Full-Length-Maxi-Long-Dress-w-Side-Pockets_77bae55d-caf5-4ff0-9639-a9855269521d.303c6ae8a2735d71216de5e194dca0c2.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"1X\",\"2X\",\"3X\"]','[\"AMERICANO\",\"AQUA MARINE\",\"ARMY GREEN\",\"ASH BLUE\",\"ASH COPPER\",\"ASH GREY\",\"ASH MINT\",\"ASH MOCHA\",\"ASH MUSTARD\",\"ASH ROSE\",\"BABY BLUE\",\"Black\",\"BLUE GREY\",\"BRICK RED\",\"BURGUNDY\",\"BUTTER ORANGE\",\"CABERNET\",\"CAMEL\",\"CEMENT\",\"CHARCOAL\",\"COFFEE\",\"COPPER\",\"CORAL\",\"DEEP CORAL\",\"DENIM BLUE\",\"DESERT MUSTARD\",\"DESERT ROSE\",\"DK BURGUNDY\",\"DK OLIVE\",\"DK PLUM\",\"DK RED\",\"DK RUST\",\"DUSTY BLUSH\",\"DUSTY CORAL\",\"DUSTY GREEN\",\"DUSTY LAVENDER\",\"DUSTY MINT\",\"DUSTY PINK\",\"DUSTY TEAL\",\"EGG SHELL\",\"EGGPLANT\",\"FIRED BRICK\",\"FOREST GREEN\",\"FUCHSIA\",\"GOLDEN WASABI\",\"GREEN MINT\",\"GREY MIST\",\"H BEIGE\",\"H GREY\",\"HOT PINK\",\"HUNTER GREEN\",\"ICE BLUE\",\"IVORY\",\"K GREEN\",\"LAVENDER\",\"LILAC GREY\",\"LT GREEN\",\"LT GREY\",\"LT MUSTARD\",\"LT OLIVE\",\"LT ROSE\",\"LT SAGE\",\"MAGENTA\",\"MID GREY\",\"MID NAVY\",\"MINT\",\"MOCHA\",\"N CORAL PINK\",\"NAVY\",\"NEON CORAL\",\"ROSE\",\"RUBY\",\"SAGE\",\"SPRING BLUE\",\"SUNSHINE\",\"TITANIUM\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"rebs\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very nice maxie dress, made well. Fits like a dream.\\nwould purchase again two thumb 👍 up\",\"title\":\"Got a Good One\"},{\"name\":\"rebs\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Has side pockets fits perfect. Lenght is good. \\nam pleasantly suprised\",\"title\":\"Two thumbs up\"},{\"name\":\"Suzan\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have 7 of these dresses and love them. They wash beautifully and when wearing them they do not wrinkle. The Dresses have Pockets which is a plus.\",\"title\":\"Zenana Dresses are Great\"},{\"name\":\"ljb\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The price was good and the fit of the dress was good, a little long but overall a good fit.\",\"title\":\"Good purchase for the price\"},{\"name\":\"Anna\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Nice easy top but was a little wide at the hips\",\"title\":\"Great leggings top\"},{\"name\":\"cathy\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Nat███a\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Nat███a\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,29.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"Casual Dresses\"]'),(704,'Girls T Shirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Girl-s-Harry-Potter-List-of-Spells-Graphic-Tee-Purple-Berry-X-Large_9720096d-e1c7-4d71-94a2-554d3a772b6a.d8c9f636a2d38dfe45d69ee0a8fdbd3e.jpeg\"',3.30,'[\"XS\",\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]','[\"Purple Berry\",\"Tahiti Blue\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine wash & Tumble dry\"}]','[{\"name\":null,\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Runs small. Had to go up a size.\"},{\"name\":\"Karen\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Lovely fabric but buy a larger size. It runs too small!\",\"title\":\"Nice but runs small!\"},{\"name\":\"PWM\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"This shirt runs very small. The one I received also has a stain on it.\",\"title\":\"runs small.\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███a\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,16.99,