rating\":5,\"review\":\"These towels are really great and for the price u can\'t beat it. I love them. Would definitely recommend them.\"},{\"name\":\"Kim\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These towels are very lightweight and extremely absorbent. I use them for myself and for my four golden retrievers. I generally use two towels each for them, but they are nice and dry after swimming!\",\"title\":\"Fantastic Absorbent Towels\"},{\"name\":\"S\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Exactly as advertised, although they are very thin. Lightweight - yes, but because they are thin. The picture makes them look much fluffier than they are. They absorb well. I keep these on hand for my young nieces and nephews to use when they stay with us and shower or swim in the pool. They held up through a couple of washes, color hasn\'t faded. Long term- not sure how long they\'ll last, but so far i am happy with them.  Fair items for the price.\",\"title\":\"Very soft, does the job.\"},{\"name\":\"ivana\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I just got these because they were on sale. They are poor quality and don\'t absorb moisture at all. Costs  too much even with half off.\",\"title\":\"Not a deal\"},{\"name\":\"Mic███le\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"Item missing 4 packs ! I m not happy!\"},{\"name\":\"SHE███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"These towels are not ideal for beach or pool . They do not dry you . Material is cheap. Definitely would not purchase again .\",\"title\":\"Waste of money\"},{\"name\":\"Tali\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"They are cute and the color is beautiful, but they are so small, and they are very thin.  Not a thick towel at all.\",\"title\":\"Towels\"},{\"name\":\"Emily\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These towels feel like microfiber towels. They are super thin and don\'t do well wiping off the water from your body. We returned ours.\",\"title\":\"Beach towels\"},{\"name\":\"ser███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"These towels were so cheap and thin. We\'re returning. I should have read the other reviews before buying. Don\'t make my same mistake.\",\"title\":\"Paper thin! Don\'t waste your money!\"}]',NULL,79.98,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bath\",\"Beach Towels\"]'),(863,'Bed Sheets',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Comfort-Canopy-4-Piece-Gray-Small-Polka-Dot-Bed-Sheets-for-California-King-Bedding_1b06d116-551d-4290-aace-88d670abf5c8.fa4cfe07c684a917fa4aa30b98018427.jpeg\"',4.90,'[\"Twin\",\"Full\",\"Queen\",\"King\",\"California King\"]','[\"Aqua / Plaid\",\"Forest / Plaid\",\"Gray / Plaid\",\"Gray / Polka Dot\",\"Gray / Striped\",\"Light Gray / Geometric\",\"Light Gray / Pinstripe\",\"Light Gray / Plaid\",\"Light Gray / Polka Dot\",\"Light Gray / Striped\",\"Light Gray / Triangle\",\"Navy / Polka Dot\",\"Navy / Striped\",\"Ray / Plaid\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash Cold; Tumble Dry Low\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Tin███.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These sheets are absolutely wonderful. And they wash great too\",\"title\":\"Sheets\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███en ███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Sent these as a gift and they were thrilled with the fit, feel and style of these sheets!!\",\"title\":\"perfect sheets!\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███A.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] These sheets are extremely comfortable. They feel so comfortable when you are laying on them and are the right thickness whereas I don\'t feel like I have heavy sheets on.\",\"title\":\"Amazing sheets\"},{\"name\":\"Joh███.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I washed them and they will be used next. their just what I was looking for. ( THANKS )\",\"title\":\"John W.\"},{\"name\":\"Jen███A.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] I ordered these sheets for the spare bed in one of our bedrooms. The quality is very nice and it\'s very comfortab