tion.] The price to performance on these are outrageous! They aren\'t like the end all be all of shoes and to expect so is silly, but they are really good! They are comfortable, smooth, and have no hot spots! #sweepstakes\",\"title\":\"Man what a shoe!\"},{\"name\":\"Glenn\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Fit good. They are comfortable. I like the looks of them on my feet.\",\"title\":\"Comfortable %26 fit good\"},{\"name\":\"Sta███n\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I was looking for the best for long walk. Found this, bought in the offer. Perfect fit and immenece comfort.\",\"title\":\"Perfect Fit\"}]',NULL,65.00,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Fashion Brands\",\"Reebok\",\"Reebok Mens\",\"Reebok Mens Shoes\"]'),(931,'Shop Curtains','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-Blackout-Double-Pinch-Pleat-Curtain-Panel-Draperies-Navy-Blue-84-W-x-132-L-1-Panel_d101952e-e4bb-45f8-82e0-aa01db843172.9e37082b4a0c1796a443ed1f5f2da838.jpeg\"',4.20,'[\"84 W x 108 L\",\"84 W x 120 L\",\"84 W x 132 L\",\"84 W x 72 L\",\"84 W x 84 L\",\"84 W x 96 L\",\"100 W x 108 L\",\"100 W x 120 L\",\"100 W x 132 L\",\"100 W x 72 L\",\"100 W x 84 L\",\"100 W x 96 L\"]','[\"Baby Pink\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Burgundy\",\"Fresh Green\",\"Gray\",\"Greyish White\",\"Ivory\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"True Red\",\"White\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Dod███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I haven\'t put them up yet but the material is beautiful .  The painter will be finished soon. and up they go.   Thanks Walmart\",\"title\":\"Great drapery\"},{\"name\":\"hah███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I ordered these drapes for my large living room window, and they are perfect! The color and length are precisely what I needed to match my colors. They are absolutely gorgeous! They are professionally made and look amazing. I will be ordering more. We\'ve had lots of compliments on them.\",\"title\":\"Gorgeous Drapes\"},{\"name\":\"wipec\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I ordered these drapes for my large living room window, and they are perfect! The color and length are precisely what I needed to match my colors. They are absolutely gorgeous! They are professionally made and look amazing. I will be ordering more. We\'ve had lots of compliments on them. Stunning!\",\"title\":\"Gorgeous Drapes\"},{\"name\":\"Kak███66\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Too long measured 88” instead of 84\\nThe fabric slots for the pinch pleat hooks\\nWere thin as paper and had strings peeling \\nOff!! So dissatisfied\",\"title\":\"Too long, poorly made\"}]',NULL,156.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(932,'Pantry staples',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Ragu-Chunky-Garden-Pasta-Sauce-with-Tomatoes-Onions-Celery-Carrots-Zucchini-Green-Bell-Peppers-24-oz_553f1043-244f-433b-9e86-1ddd165dc991.63b208cb9e130f7a3503061122a7457d.jpeg\"',4.20,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Heat Sauce on stovetop or microwave, stirring occasionally.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Car███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love love love this sauce. I not only use it for spaghetti but I use this sauce for goulash, lasagna, and many other recipes. This sauce is a staple in my house\",\"title\":\"This sauce is a staple in my house\"},{\"name\":\"Amy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"they got all my list of things perfect 😀 thank you Walmart\"},{\"name\":\"hea███r\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"great sauce to have on hand for quick spaghetti when i dont have time to make my own sauce.\",\"title\":\"sauce\"},{\"name\":\"Tara\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Been eating this same flavor for 25 years. It\'s delicious and a family favorite!!\",\"title\":\"Delicious and sweet\"},{\"name\":\"JOA███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It was opened when I made it home with this item\",\"title\":\"Damaged goods\"},{\"name\":\"Bea███ce\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Only received 1\"},{\"name\":\"Jud███\",\"r