name\":\"Julie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really have enjoyed all of the swimsuits that I have purchased.  It is nice to find a swimsuit without so much trouble.\",\"title\":\"A Really Great Swimsuit for the  Pool\"},{\"name\":\"wat███own███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Runs extremely small, but very nice bathing suit. Order 2 sizes bigger\",\"title\":\"Bathing suit\"},{\"name\":\"Bev███y\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This item was poor quality and too small\",\"title\":\"Too Small\"},{\"name\":\"Ter███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"The suit itself is really pretty and feels like it would hold up well, but they really need to get the size right! It is at least 2 sizes too small, so order up. I\'m really, really tired of these foreign  products and their sizes based  of  a 98 lb asian girl!!\",\"title\":\"Size off...\"},{\"name\":\"Sandy\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Size runs small and it smelled\",\"title\":\"Too small and uncomfortable\"},{\"name\":\"Kat███n\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This doesnt just run small, its super small. I even sized up based on the sizing guide! Do not recommend unless you can try on all sizes in the store vs delivery like I did.\",\"title\":\"Runs very small\"},{\"name\":\"Suz███e\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"This bathing suit is not XXL. It is so small it\'s ridiculous. I will be returning it. Now to see if they have a 4X available. I\'ve never worn a 4X in my life\",\"title\":\"Sizing is way off.\"}]',NULL,19.99,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Swimsuits\",\"Womens One-Piece Swimsuits\",\"Womens One-piece Swimsuits\"]'),(962,'Men\'s Multivitamins','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Men-s-Multivitamin-Super-Nutrition-Vitamin-Mineral-Blend-Supporting-Herbs-Whole-Foods-Energy-Immune-Support-Gluten-Free-Non-GMO-30-Chewable-Tablets-W_9030abc1-bc03-49c2-a6b5-70b0639e17bb.876c96370c16e39893a99bd71dcfb055.jpeg\"',4.60,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Dosage\",\"value\":\"Take 1 chewable tablet daily with food.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"very tasty, feels like having a candy that helps you \",\"title\":\"great product came on time\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Bought this for my husband and the women\'s version for myself. My husband LOVES this supplement, truly. Tablets are a decent size, easy to chew and smells/ tastes great. Love that this daily multivitamin is of great quality and due to its content, will be able to help with any vitamin or mineral deficiencies. Will definitely repurchase! \",\"title\":\"Tastes great! \"},{\"name\":\"iHe███ust███r\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The ingrediends seems to be very clean, hopefully my husband will benefit from taking them/\",\"title\":\"Excellent!\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"One of my choices of multi vitamins with Iron that was working well with my stomach and not causing any constipation that usually comes when taking a supplement high in Iron!\",\"title\":\"Excellent!\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Waited months until these chewable pills available again. So glad they\'re back!\",\"title\":\"Glad They\'re Back!\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I bought these vitamins for my husband. Not sure if he really liked the flavour. \",\"title\":\"Good\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Very good, limited choice in flavor\\nUsed to be able to get chewables from Centrum for men over 50 with a citrus flavor, but since the pandemic, chewables are gone.\\nThis is the only chewable available , everything else is gummies.\\nYou cant leave gummies in a car or they will melt into one solid glob.\\nBring back chewables!\\n\\n\",\"title\":\"Very good but limited choice in flavor\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"These chewable tablets are a breeze to take, with a pleasant wild berry flavor that makes them more candy than chore. Plus, one tablet a day is all it takes, keeping my morning routine streamlined.\\n\\nSpeaking of mornings, I\'ve noticed a definite boost in energy since starting SimplyOne. No more afternoon slumps for this guy! I also appreciate the inclusion of supporting herbs like ashwagandha and nettle root, which seem to help with stress and overall well-being.\\n\\nNot everything\'s perfect, though. The tablets are a bit large and can be crumbly, and while the wild berry flavor is nice, it might not be for everyone. Additionally, the price tag is a little higher than some other multivitamins.\",\"title\":\"Supercharge Your Day\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"easy tot are. tastes okay. it\'ll gas a good amount of ingredients in it for a gummy.\",\"title\":\"good for people that don\'t like taking vitamins\"},{\"name\":\"iHe███Cus███er\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The taste is so bad…. like orange mixed with pill powder. I bought this for my boyfriend but we ended up throwing them away… and tablets are huge in size ( even though chewable)  ! \",\"title\":\"Below average\"}]','Main IngredientsVitamin A (as retinyl',10.19,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Main IngredientsVitamin A (as retinyl\"}]','[\"Health and Medicine\",\"Vitamins and Supplements\",\"Multivitamins\",\"Men\'s Multivitamins\"]'),(963,'Mini Dresses','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Dresses-for-Women-Summer-Wedding-Guest-Short-Sleeve-V-neck-Fashion-Pleated-Ruffles-Mini-Beach-Dress_1a8f52b2-8daa-42be-a8bf-c70ad542ab35.28dc24c75b8af6ade97e68ec4dfd9f5d.jpeg\"',3.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"2XL\"]','[\"Blue\",\"Pink\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"hand wash, or low temperature for machine washing, and hang to dry clean your maxi dress\"}]','[{\"name\":\"San███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Everything seems okay until I was not able to get the sleeve past my elbow I am an xl for a comfy fit I went a size up it was a 2x with a  size L sleeves\"}]',NULL,9.59,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Dresses\",\"Mini Dresses\"]'),(964,'Womens Booties','[\"Reviewers highlighted: fit, appearance, style\",\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Comfortview-Wide-Width-Meredith-Bootie-Short-Ankle-Boot-Women-s-Winter-Shoes-7-M-Houndstooth_20461477-b7aa-4c38-8a67-e92b307a5ebb.f991db8395f35e7f95f435fa4887b444.jpeg\"',4.40,'[\"7\",\"7 1/2\",\"8\",\"8 1/2\",\"9\",\"9 1/2\",\"10\",\"10 1/2\",\"11\",\"12\"]','[\"Floral Metallic\",\"Houndstooth\",\"Leopard\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"No fabric care instructions provided.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"San███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I wanted a show stopper boot these boots didn’t disappoint. Beautiful boots and the fit is perfect. I wanted a pair of dress boots I could sneak a pair of fluffy socks in but still look dressy and these are them. I got a lot of compliments when I wore them.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful boots\"},{\"name\":\"MEL███J\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love them, they are very comfortable and beautiful and I purchased the same pattern in the pump which I also love. I wore them to a Christmas party and got compliments from men and women. My niece wanted to borrow next day, so I ordered her her own pair and ordered another pair for me in different color. Love love love\",\"title\":\"Exceptionally Lovely and Comfortable\"},{\"name\":\"dol███ion███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These are nothing short of spectacular in person. The heel is adorable and the material of the boot is exquisite. They remind me of a true 1950\'s style. The fit is right on the mark - I bought my normal size 8 1/2 with a Medium width and they fit like a glove. LOVE LOVE these booties! I got them on sale...SOOOO lucky!!\",\"title\":\"Most adorable bootie ever! Fits great!\"},{\"name\":\"Lau███w\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This booth is do beautiful true to size\"},{\"name\":\"MAR███C\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It\'s a nice bootie and it\'s look like a good quality\"},{\"name\":\"Del███s R███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love these boots!\"},{\"name\":\"Emm███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"love it.Fits well. Right height\",\"title\":\"Best shootie\"},{\"name\":\"SUZ███E K███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I love these gold and black brocade boots! If you like shoes or boots that are unusual patterns/designs, you will enjoy these. I am a big Comfortview fan, as all their boots and shoes are truly comfortable. Also, it is wonderful to be able to buy your exact size and width. The only negative comment I have is that the Meredith boot\'s toes are designed too pointed for me. I enjoy a toe box that is either rounded or slightly squared.\",\"title\":\"Stylish & Extraordinary Booties\"},{\"name\":\"LINDA\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Feet good on right foot but left a little snug and wide around ankle a little but overall love the shoe\",\"title\":\"Perfect heel length for dress up or casual wear\"},{\"name\":\"Nie███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Soo Disappointed! Leopard print looks nothing like the images! I have these boots in black patent leather and I absolutely love them. So when I saw the leopard print it was a must buy. When it came in I was so let down...it is a very fake hair calf...like bad doll hair and the color is more like mustard brown and tan. It NOT black and gold like the image...BE Warned!\",\"title\":\"Soo Disappointed! Leopard print looks nothing like the images\"}]',NULL,77.29,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Shoes\",\"Womens Shoes\",\"Womens Booties\"]'),(965,'Shop All Patio Furniture','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/WestinTrends-Malibu-3-Pieces-Outdoor-Patio-Furniture-Set-All-Weather-Seating-Plastic-Adirondack-Chair-Set-2-Coffee-Table-Porch-Lawn-Backyard-Turquois_88dc8049-ecfa-4de4-8238-d009538f25cd.35a2a693a092a6996cf82ffd87209bda.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"2pc Patio Set\",\"3pc set with Coffee Table\",\"3pc set with Side Table\",\"4pc Patio Set\",\"7pc Patio Set\"]','[\"Black\",\"Dark Brown\",\"Dark Green\",\"Gray\",\"Lime\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Orange\",\"Pacific Blue\",\"Red\",\"Sand\",\"Teak\",\"Turquoise\",\"Weathered Wood\",\"White\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"Lori\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Great set, really brighten up our back yard.  Reviews are correct easy to assemble, everything lines up & 15 minutes per chair are all accurate.\\nComfortable and perfect for us!\",\"title\":\"Very Happy\"},{\"name\":\"Jor███ D.███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"After trying to buy locally and finding prices to be exorbitant, I searched online. The price and quality of these Adirondack chairs was unmatched. The excellent packaging, timely delivery and ease of assembly was wonderful. I acquired two chaired and table for under the price of one chair sold locally. When I saw they were from Ontario I was doubly pleased. Thanks for providing me with exactly what I was looking for!\"},{\"name\":\"Fel███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these comfortable Adirondack chairs with the side table. I ordered two sets and also my second time ordering from this reliable company. I\'ve referred to other people and definitely would buy from them again. Thank you!\",\"title\":\"3 pc. Conversation piece\"},{\"name\":\"Phy███s P███nha███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Happy with my purchase of the 3 pc set. Easy to put together and looks great in my front porch\",\"title\":\"Lovely 3pc set\"},{\"name\":\"Tro███um\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Excellent quality and at great price. Easy to assemble very sturdy i have no dislikes about anything\",\"title\":\"Very good quality\"},{\"name\":\"lat\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"[This review was collected as part of a promotion.] Very easy to put together.  We bought 3 different sets and have them around our fire pit.  Love the durability!\",\"title\":\"Great Find!\"},{\"name\":\"Ela███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I got these about a week or two ago. They were fairly easy to put together and are very sturdy. The red is not orange but is IS very bright. Just a heads up. They stand up to high winds and so far have been easy to wipe off. Hoping to leave them out all year so I\'ll update if they break or fade!\",\"title\":\"great chairs (so far!)\"},{\"name\":\"Car███B.\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"One of the best purchases I ever Made. Well packs. Easy to put together. So very sturdy and beautiful. Even better than I thought It would be. Very pleased and highly recommend!\"},{\"name\":\"Sou███adr███ve\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My wife looked through numerous sites and read hundreds of reviews on each site before we decided on these chairs. We wanted something sturdy, easy to assemble, comfortable, and easy to fold and store. We were not disappointed and got the best price compared to similar products. Delivery was very quick and great!\",\"title\":\"Best product for the price!\"},{\"name\":\"John\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"We are extremely happy with the chairs, they seem to be built well and were easy to put together. It took about 40 minutes to assemble the first chair and about 25 minutes for the second one. We weren\'t as happy with the table as they had use a defective piece for the top of the table , but for the price i don\'t think you can find any better value. I gave these 4 stars just because of the one defective piece on the table.\",\"title\":\"Customer\"}]',NULL,629.99,NULL,'[\"Patio & Garden\",\"Patio Furniture\",\"Shop All Patio Furniture\"]'),(966,'Womens Swimsuit Tops','[\"Reduced price\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Pink-Queen-Women-s-Tankini-Swimsuit-2-Piece-Tummy-Control-Bathing-Suit-Ruched-Tankini-Tops-with-Swim-Skirt-Swimwear_2e17fc16-6a92-4b77-9227-28ff18bf2073.b0c1f1c5c839f60ad05490a007cb2afe.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\"]','[\"Army Green\",\"Black\",\"Sapphire Blue\",\"Sky Blue\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love the style and color\",\"title\":\"Swimsuit\"},{\"name\":\"Zul███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My review is true to the size it makes you look skinny love it the only thing is that it doesn\'t have underwire but I made it work I\'m satisfied\"},{\"name\":\"Linda\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,33.88,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Clothing\",\"Womens Swimsuits\",\"Womens Swimsuit Tops\",\"Womens Swimsuit Tops\"]'),(967,'Hand Creams','[\"50+ bought since yesterday\",\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/O-Keeffe-s-Working-Hands-Hand-Cream-3-Ounce-85-Gram-Tube_368e5610-f07b-4e1b-bc04-c0007498cda2.e122d0c50894ade681821f41a77dea0f.jpeg\"',4.70,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Start with a small amount; it\'s all you need. More is not necessarily better, and over-application can lead to stickiness. Apply to problem areas on hands and fingers as needed throughout the day and night.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Ann███rie███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I\'ve been a nurse for 32 years. My brothers told me about this product. He is a mechanic we jokingly compare hands to see whose hands are worse. This product is one of the best I\'ve used. I use it in the morning and at night before I go to bed it\'s incredible.\",\"title\":\"Nurse approved\"},{\"name\":\"Kar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I am amazed with this hand cream as it worked great on my hands. I have to say it worked so good I tried it on my feet, OMG it worked miracles fast. Plus one of the best features is that it has NO SCENT to it either. Thank you O\'keeffe\'s for a great product!\",\"title\":\"Finally one that works\"},{\"name\":\"Mar███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i don\'t use it got it for my daughter her hands are rough and has cuts on them she said it\'s the only thing that works\"},{\"name\":\"Nor███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My Mom\'s hands were always cracked %26 bleeding … cleaning house %26 doing dishes incessantly.  No skin creams helped her -  she tried them all.  She got to the point where she would thickly coat her hands with Vaseline and then put plastic gloves on over night to heal them a little.   My hands are now extremely dry and hurt %26 will crack … I\'m so glad I found O\'Keefe\'s … it actually works.  It\'s the only thing I found that does.  Thank goodness for O\'Keefe\'s.  I recommend the squeeze tube - it\'s the easiest %26 least messy to apply.  I keep one at the office, one by my chair in the living room, one in my bathroom, one on my bedside table … and I always have one with me in my travel bag.  This product is amazing!\",\"title\":\"Heal Your Sore Dry Hands\"},{\"name\":\"Duk███l12███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I decided to purchase this because I\'m an educator and wash my hands a lot during the day and evening, and my hands were very dry, and I was encountering some issues with skin cracking near my nail tips. This hand cream definitely lives up to the hype. Fantastic healing cream.\",\"title\":\"Believe the hype!\"},{\"name\":\"Belle\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I worked in as a dishwasher for a while and my hands were so dry that they were cracking and bleeding, this lotion healed the in No Time! Wonderful Product %26 Well worth the price!\",\"title\":\"Miracle Lotion!!\"},{\"name\":\"Jo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have been purchasing this product for years and the results are amazing! It\'s not greasy or sticky, and it actually heals your hands in real time. If you have chapped hands in winter, this item is a must-have. No strong fragrances and no worrying about smelling too feminine. I have two on hand now, I keep on in my bathroom and one in my work bag. I 100% recommend this product and I definitely have recommended it to friends.\",\"title\":\"This stuff has saved my hands\"},{\"name\":\"AB\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Husband works a lot in his woodworking shop. Bought for him because fingers were cracking during the winter. Said he liked this better than utter balm. Less oily.\",\"title\":\"Worked to soothe working hands\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I work at a place of employment where Iâm constantly washing my hands. As a result, mainly my fingers have been suffering from dry, peeling, crusty white and sometimes painful cracked skin. Iâve used \\\"intensive repair\\\" hand lotion many times - although temporarily solaced-  I yet have failed to see the \\\"intensive\\\" results to \\\"repair\\\" my lovable 10  digits (aka fingers). Well now! I have used O\'Keeffe\'s Hand Cream for a couple of days now. Say hello to my little friend! I had some \\\"concern\\\" paying for a 3 oz. tube of hand cream but, sir or m\'am, I wasn\'t let down. The directions instruct using only a small dab. Im not sure why some of the reviews complain about it feeling too sticky. The directions DO convey that using too much will give that glue-like feel. Anyhoo...That small dab is all it took, folks. My hands n\' fingers drank that dab up like a camel gulping on cold water in the dry Gobi desert. I\'m not saying my hands and fingers are ready for being a hand model - but now people can shake my hands without them thinking they just grasped onto a dry branch from an old oak tree. I will purchase more of these for home and at work. Thank you, O\'Keeffe!\",\"title\":\"BUH-BYE to dry, cracked n\' crusty skin!\"},{\"name\":\"Pai███l\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I\'ve used the working hands cream that comes in the round tub before and never experienced any issues, but I figured the bottle would be a bit more convenient. Terrible mistake. I\'ve used it several times over a period of a few months, and each time it caused an intense burning and itching sensation, and made the red irritation in my skin 10x worse than before. I\'m really frustrated. Picture is from 10 minutes after using on clean, dry hands 😑\",\"title\":\"Made My Hands WORSE!!\"}]','Water, Glycerin, Stearic Acid, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, Propylene Glycol, Octyldodecyl Stearate, Polyquaternium-10, Diazolidinyl Urea, Paraffin, Acrylates/Acrylamide Copolymer, Mineral Oil, Dimethicone, Sodium Hydroxide, Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate, Ceteth-10, Laureth-4, Polysorbate 85.',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Inactive Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Water, Glycerin\"},{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Water, Glycerin, Stearic Acid, Aluminum Starch Octenylsuccinate, Propylene Glycol, Octyldodecyl Stearate, Polyquaternium-10, Diazolidinyl Urea, Paraffin, Acrylates/Acrylamide Copolymer, Mineral Oil, Dimethicone, Sodium Hydroxide, Iodopropynyl Butylcarbamate, Ceteth-10, Laureth-4, Polysorbate 85.\"}]','[\"Personal Care\",\"Bath & Body\",\"Hand Creams\"]'),(968,'Bed Pillows','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/DONAMA-Cervical-Neck-Pillow-Pain-Relief-Sleeping-Memory-Foam-Breathable-Pillowcase-Orthopedic-Ergonomic-Contoured-Support-Side-Back-Stomach-Queen-Siz_8709b0f7-e42e-4652-ab75-014ea02621a5.65ce683906614896c75714e7efc1e954.jpeg\"',4.70,'[]','[\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Gray\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable;\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Sak███ha\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have tried many different pillows because the older you get the more problems you have. And I use to have a neck pillow but I didn\'t see it. And bad bones is genetic in the family, I have a mattress cushion to, but I had to get another one because that was taken off my mattress 😞. Although the mattress is soft, it is nothing like having a cushion! But back to the pillow, I slept better, I just wish that the neck curvings were a little higher like my other neck pillow.\",\"title\":\"Good Purchase,\"},{\"name\":\"chris\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have had multiple neck surgeries, and most pillows don\'t support neck so wake up with pain or migraines.   This pillow had wierd shape but on sale bought it with little hope of any improvement.  From night one little to no pain. Reduced pain and headaches. Then my wife asked to try and she loved it. But then her mom need pillow one night and used it and won\'t give back. Now have 3. Great item.\",\"title\":\"Quality pillow\"},{\"name\":\"sty███onc███s\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I need to sleep on my -back after my surgery and I am usually a side sleeper. This pillow helps keep my head and neck in place for the entire night. It did take a week to get used to just with anything new. I like that it has a removable pillow cover.\",\"title\":\"good pillow good price\"},{\"name\":\"david\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"i love the way this pillow cradles your neck, i sleep on my back or side, my hand no longer falls asleep because of the side rests built in this pillow where you can put your arms and hands.there was a little off gassing of the memory foam the first night but then was fine.this is not too firm but not too soft either, i would say medium soft which is what i needed, the cover is very high quality and zips off to wash.\",\"title\":\"wonderful pillow\"},{\"name\":\"Sandy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"If you have back or neck pain or suffer from sciatica - this pillow will help you get much needed rest whether you are a side or back sleeper.  I\'ve tried others but this one is the best hands down.  Soft and comfortable; cover easily comes off to wash.  I\'ll never go back to an ordinary pillow even when my pain stops.  You won\'t be disappointed.\",\"title\":\"The absolute best !\"},{\"name\":\"Jill\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I had seen this type of pillow advertised on FB. We went to Walmarts\'s website and ordered our first one for myself. My husband decided he\'d try it first and kept it. We ordered a second one for myself and…..we no longer sleep with 2 pillows each. No more neck pain for either us of. My husband is a belly sleeper and he loves this pillow too. I\'m finding I\'m sleeping more on my back rather than my side anymore.\\nIt arrived in a box, that no way would I have thought this pillow was going to be worth what was being advertised. Surprise! It\'s All That! \\nThe pillow cover easily comes off for washing and just as easy to put back on. \\nWe have no more neck pain. \\nWe really love our new pillows!\",\"title\":\"Sleeping Better\"},{\"name\":\"con███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have bought many pillows over 60.00 each. This pillow the first night I could tell the differences in my neck and shoulder. Now to see how long it last.\",\"title\":\"Good night sleep\"},{\"name\":\"Mau███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have recently found out 2 years ago that I had some neck issues and I noticed when I wake up in the morning my neck be hurting with my regular pillows I use less I use more I use none at all and it still hurts I come across this I sleep like a baby I wake up with no pain I recommend this to anyone with neck issues\",\"title\":\"love it\"},{\"name\":\"Gigi\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Super comfortable! I finally woke up with no neck pain. The only thing I wish is that it were a little bit longer. In order to use the arm rest part it\'s almost like basically tucking your arms under the pillow. Just a little short.\",\"title\":\"Great pillow!\"},{\"name\":\"san███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It was sort of comfortable.\\nWoke up the next morning with HORRIBLE neck pain. Headache all day long.  Also had stains. Was this already returned?\",\"title\":\"Disappointed\"}]',NULL,79.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Pillows\"]'),(969,'Deep Conditioner','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Hask-Keratin-Protein-Repairing-nourishing-Smoothing-Deep-Conditioner-1-75-oz-Travel-Size_4ba257bb-7a4c-41d9-8260-ea25a297c4a0.94a7f86dd37303c261ebbb8a394afeda.jpeg\"',4.60,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"For best results, use with the rest of the HASK Argan Oil from Morocco Repairing collection.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Lil███hea███rl\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"When an amazing hair product like \\\"Hask Keratin\\\" is priced affordable, we all win. Stop spending too much money! The variety of products that are offered fit your every need. My long rd head is so smooth and healthy. Thanks to \\\"Hask\\\"\",\"title\":\"\\\"HASK\\\" Yourself Why You Spend TOO Much $$\"},{\"name\":\"Tar███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Thick solution and coats the hair easily. Within seconds the tangles start to loosen. Clean rinse, no left over residue or sticky feeling on the hair.\",\"title\":\"The best!\"},{\"name\":\"tra███f78███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I wasn\'t sure at first about this deep conditioning product but it works like it says it does it makes your hair frizz and dry free my hair is so soft after using it and smells so good, it has a cute packaging for being so\\nSmall, the texture is very good and leave your hair greasy or oily and it\'s well worth the money, i definitely will be using more of this awesome product and recommend it to others as well to try.\",\"title\":\"The absolute best for your hair\"},{\"name\":\"ams\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I have been treating my hair once a week for about two months now. The hair around my temples was constantly breaking off to about 1/2\\\". Since using these treatments, my hair is an inch or more longer. I use this in conjunction with shampoo and conditioner made for the same issue.\",\"title\":\"Hair is growing; not breaking\"},{\"name\":\"Iag███72\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My hair was pretty rough after repeated coloring and having extensions in for a year. This Hask product definitely gave it life and supreme shine and softness....something that I thought would take awhile to get back. I only wish that a bigger portion, as in a bottle was available!!!! I will for sure be buying again!\",\"title\":\"Hask Keratin Treatment....I loved it!\"},{\"name\":\"Karen\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very good for hair that needs a deep conditioning! Plenty in the package to cover medium length hair!\",\"title\":\"Good treatment for hair\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"This is an average deep conditioner. It does provide a slightly more sleek look than your every day conditioner, but it\'s not comparable to slightly more expense options that leave you\'re hair feeling soft for days after.  This is a 1 day boost.\",\"title\":\"Get What You Pay For\"},{\"name\":\"Sou███aw\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I bought this to help repair my bleached hair. It didn\'t make any difference than the conditioners I already have. My hair felt a bit dry, actually. I highly recommend following up with a good leave-in conditioner.\",\"title\":\"Doesn\'t deep condition\"},{\"name\":\"lex███rl\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I received this sample to try, and try I did. I have long hair that has some damage. This product was tacky and left my hair sticky and dry. My skin on my face, back and neck was left with a oily layer too. I think that this mask was not designed for my hair type (thick but fine shafted). I would not recommend this mask if you have fine hair. The scent is okay but very powerful.\",\"title\":\"Thick, Overkill if you have fine hair\"},{\"name\":\"sup███an\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"My bread was completely destroyed because it was bagged under a heavy item\",\"title\":\"Bagging\"}]','Aqua/Water/Eau, Cetearyl alcohol, Cetrimonium chloride, Keratin amino acids, Simmondsia chinensis (jojoba) seed oil, Hydroxypropyltrimonium hydrolyzed rice protein/siloxysilicate, Oryza sativa (rice) extract, Leuconostoc/radish root ferment filtrate, Populus tremuloides bark extract, Panthenol, Sodium PCA, Glycerin, Isopropyl palmitate, Tocopherol, Caprylyl glycol, Tetrasodium glutamate diacetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Distearyldimonium chloride, Chlorphenesin, Potassium hydroxide, Citric acid, Parfum/Fragrance, Hexyl cinnamal',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Active Ingredient Name\",\"values\":\"Keratin\"},{\"type\":\"Active Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Keratin\"},{\"type\":\"Inactive Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Aqua/Water/Eau, Cetearyl alcohol, Cetrimonium chloride, Keratin amino acids, Simmondsia chinensis (jojoba) seed oil, Hydroxypropyltrimonium hydrolyzed rice protein/siloxysilicate, Oryza sativa (rice) extract, Leuconostoc/radish root ferment filtrate, Populus tremuloides bark extract, Panthenol, Sodium PCA, Glycerin, Isopropyl palmitate, Tocopherol, Caprylyl glycol, Tetrasodium glutamate diacetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Distearyldimonium chloride, Chlorphenesin, Potassium hydroxide, Citric acid, Parfum/Fragrance, Hexyl cinnamal\"},{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Aqua/Water/Eau, Cetearyl alcohol, Cetrimonium chloride, Keratin amino acids, Simmondsia chinensis (jojoba) seed oil, Hydroxypropyltrimonium hydrolyzed rice protein/siloxysilicate, Oryza sativa (rice) extract, Leuconostoc/radish root ferment filtrate, Populus tremuloides bark extract, Panthenol, Sodium PCA, Glycerin, Isopropyl palmitate, Tocopherol, Caprylyl glycol, Tetrasodium glutamate diacetate, Ethylhexylglycerin, Distearyldimonium chloride, Chlorphenesin, Potassium hydroxide, Citric acid, Parfum/Fragrance, Hexyl cinnamal\"}]','[\"Beauty\",\"Hair Care\",\"Conditioner\",\"Deep Conditioner\"]'),(970,'Plus Size Tops','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Giftesty-Womens-Plus-Size-Clearance-Women-Short-Sleeves-O-Neck-Heart-Shaped-Print-Casual-Tops-Blouse-T-Shirt_a7d2e9ea-57fb-42e9-b801-326f2a3389da.83580f372faf79c8d36ed3b7f39a43b6.jpeg\"',3.70,'[\"S\",\"M\",\"L\",\"XL\",\"XXL\",\"2XL\",\"XXXL\",\"3XL\"]','[\"A-Gray\",\"A-Green\",\"Army Green\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Blue\",\"Gray\",\"Green\",\"Navy\",\"Pink\",\"Purple\",\"Red\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Washable; Hand Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Pat███ia\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I really liked the way the heart was designed on the shirt. Not sure what the material is but it\'s very soft. Can\'t wait to wear it.\",\"title\":\"Love the Heart!\"},{\"name\":\"Mel\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I love the short for the quality and feel of the fabric.\",\"title\":\"Heart shirt.\"},{\"name\":\"LaN███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This soft, comfortable T-shirt is designed with me in mind.  It fits nicely, is comfortable to wear all day, and is soft against my skin!  The price is great!\",\"title\":\"Soft T-Shirt\"},{\"name\":\"Nol███e\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Very cute and the fabric is nice and sturdy for a tee shirt which l always look for. I bought an XL for myself but as they run small l passed it on to a family member who typically fits a medium. She likes it. \\nNext time l purchase this brand l will size up a bit.\",\"title\":\"Very cute but size up.\"},{\"name\":\"Tami\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Love the shirt . The color and fabric is nice. The shirt seems to be more narrow than I like. I usually buy a size small in these I have the pink color same size but a boxier fit and softer stretchy fabric. They both say 100% polyester but they feel and fit like two different fabrics. The gray one is like cotton and not much stretch to it at all.\",\"title\":\"Gray T-shirt\"},{\"name\":\"Jew███fro███rri███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I fell in love with this shirt and it was good quality, looked great, but the sizing is way off. I recommend ordering at least 2 sizes larger than you normally wear to get a comfortable fit.  The price was great and it was really cute, but just doesn\'t fit me unless I lose about 25 lbs or more.\",\"title\":\"Cute but runs very small\"},{\"name\":\"Pad███i\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"the tee is pretty but will fit a toddler, not a woman. I am giving the 3 tee shirts I bought from you over to the Good Will Store and not even asking for a receipt as I have done for the last 20 years. Further, I will not be buying any clothes from you.\",\"title\":\"Good for a toddler.\"},{\"name\":\"Pam███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I was excited to get this TShirt. i ordered a size 3X because i like bigger sizes and it SAYS its a 3X but it definitely isnt.  Im a big girl and it was too tight. These shirts are definitely not true to size.\",\"title\":\"Not True To Size\"},{\"name\":\"patty\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered xxl cuz things usually run small well this was beyond small \\nLike actually fits like a small!! \\nThe design also wasn\'t centered which makes it weird\",\"title\":\"Incredibly small\"},{\"name\":\"Mel███a\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I really wanted this T-Shirt and after I got it and tried it on I felt like it wasn\'t the true size and it ran like 2 sizes smaller for it to be a plus size tshirt.\",\"title\":\"Heart Shirt\"}]',NULL,12.11,NULL,'[\"Clothing\",\"Womens Plus\",\"Plus Size Tops\",\"Plus Size Tops\"]'),(971,'Bed Skirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/36-Inch-Drop-Twin-XL-Size-Dorm-Bed-Lavender-Solid-Skirt-Lightweight-Ruffled-Pattern-Split-Corner-Premium-Hotal-Quality-With-Flexible-Elastic-Fade-Res_8805c60c-4af3-4950-8016-f806894b5a0f.ccd7335dbade9d5eab4ff6213758b6f7.jpeg\"',4.00,'[\"Twin XL 30\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 32\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 34\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 36\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 40\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 42\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 46\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 50\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 52\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 54\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 56\\\" Drop\",\"Twin XL 60\\\" Drop\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blood Red\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Egyptian Blue\",\"Golden\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Ivory\",\"Lavender\",\"Mediterranean Blue\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Parrot Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink\",\"Plum\",\"Purple\",\"Sage\",\"Taupe\",\"Teal\",\"Turquoise Blue\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash Cold. Do Not Bleach. Tumble Dry Low. Remove Promptly.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"tanya\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It shipped fast! Great communication from the shipper! The bedskirt is nice thick material. Will purchase again!\",\"title\":\"True to size great length\"},{\"name\":\"Cry███l\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I ordered 7-3-24, as of 7-14-24 , no item , no contact from seller after reaching out and no shipping information . Walmart needs to stop allowing this business partner . I have asked for a refund\",\"title\":\"never received\"},{\"name\":\"Mark\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"ang███\",\"rating\":5}]',NULL,35.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Skirts\"]'),(972,'Bed Skirts','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/SGI-Bedding-21-Inch-Wrap-Around-Bed-Skirt-Microfiber-Fade-Resistant-Wrinkle-Free-Anti-static-Decorative-Extra-Storage-Space-Clutter-Free-Full-Teal_ac54187d-075e-4731-a28e-724b789f0943.68e17458c16d7a7886d58c7f5b7d4d85.jpeg\"',4.80,'[\"California King- 18\\\"\",\"Full- 18\\\"\",\"King- 18\\\"\",\"Olympic Queen- 18\\\"\",\"Queen- 18\\\"\",\"Twin- 18\\\"\",\"California King- 21\\\"\",\"Full- 21\\\"\",\"King-21\\\"\",\"Olympic Queen- 21\\\"\",\"Queen- 21\\\"\",\"Twin- 21\\\"\"]','[\"Black\",\"Blood Red\",\"Burgundy\",\"Chocolate\",\"Dark Gray\",\"Egyptian Blue\",\"Golden\",\"Hot Pink\",\"Ivory\",\"Light Blue\",\"Light Gray\",\"Lilac\",\"Mediterranean Blue\",\"Moss\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Parrot Green\",\"Peach\",\"Pink\",\"Plum\",\"Purple\",\"Rust\",\"Sage\",\"Taupe\",\"Teal\",\"Turquoise Blue\",\"White\",\"Wine\",\"Yellow\",\"Zebra Print\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash Cold. Do Not Bleach. Tumble Dry Low. Remove Promptly.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jua███a\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The color  purple its hard getting \\n right.\",\"title\":\"The right color\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"A very long delayed delivery but finally arrived yesterday.  It\'s just as advertised no concerns nor issues. Great fit. Very snug. A bit pricey but I couldn\'t locate anymore so I paid the price.\",\"title\":\"Pretty in pink!\"},{\"name\":\"Julie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love it! Wrinkles came out in the dryer. Easy to put on the bed . Looks great\",\"title\":\"Great buy\"},{\"name\":\"Bre███\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Alice\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Den██��\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Dara\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Jerry\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Lio███18\",\"rating\":5},{\"name\":\"Dia███\",\"rating\":3}]',NULL,24.99,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Bedding\",\"Bed Skirts\"]'),(973,'Wood Sheds','[\"Best seller\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Aiho-6-x-4-Shed-on-Clearance-Outdoor-Storage-Shed-with-Metal-Base-Frame-Air-Vent-Lockable-Doors-for-Garden-and-Backyard-Grey_cc8c0076-8a9f-41c0-9d73-a277078f7b03.44d1bb591742888e6c4af76185cf6236.jpeg\"',4.30,'[\"6x4-Flat Roof-Gray\",\"6x4-Flat Roof-Green\",\"6x4-Spire Roof-Gray\",\"8x6-Spire Roof-Brown\",\"8x6-Spire Roof-Gray\",\"8x6-Spire Roof-Green\"]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Each part is labeled in detail, so you can follow the instructions to clearly guide the installation steps.\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Jus███lee███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"It is a nice space and went together well. It did take longer than usual but we wanted to make sure it was done correctly! It looks great!\",\"title\":\"Storage Shed\"},{\"name\":\"Jamie\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Clear instructions, super lightweight, easy to assemble by yourself. I bought this just to cover our pool pump/filter assembly. I did not install the flooring for this reason. I recommend anchoring it down if it will be in any kind of windy area.  The doors have a little gap between them that is a little annoying but you get what you pay for with that. It comes with a latch and lock that are crap. Gave the lock to my kids. I wouldn\'t recommend placing anything of great value in here. Overall I\'m happy with it for my needs. It has a plastic coating on every panel. I couldn\'t get it to come off so I just left it on.\",\"title\":\"It\'s lightweight, don\'t store valuables inside.\"},{\"name\":\"Cyn███a\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I order a shed. Which came in 2 boxes. I received the 2nd on another day. The box were torn. I hope all the parts are here I have not put it together as of yet.\",\"title\":\"Outdoor shed\"},{\"name\":\"Que███fCa███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I really liked that the pieces were properly labeled and the price point was within my budget. And that\'s where the likes end.\\nI purchased this shed to house my new generator so when the boxes arrived (at the same time!) and one appeared to have been a little too tightly bound I wasn\'t too concerned as I knew I would be making modifications for ventilation. I will preface the next part by saying that I am a PRO at putting anything from IKEA together in half the time stated alone.\\nAs stated above I was expecting a few dents and dings to a couple of pieces, but every single piece was either dented or just downright bent! The bent pieces being the top parts of the A-frame,I thought \\\"No biggie, the roof will straighten it out\\\" because it is made of metal just shy being able to be called aluminum foil! All the parts were accounted for, well labeled ( that bared repeating!) \\nThe instructions are a complete joke! I found this link that saved the shed from being thrown over the fence (https://www.manualslib.com/manual/3029884/Patiowell-T-Ps1146s0bn-1a.html%23manual)\\nThe bottom frame went together well then everything went downhill from there. Nothing matched up, \\\"holes\\\" didn\'t line up and I had to use a square and level on every single corner top and bottom to stay true! Fast forward over two weeks later (yep...2 WEEKS‼️) I\'m getting the doors on and buckle up buttercup cause you\'re in for the fight of your life! The hinges straight from the bowels of hades... They went on the doors with the ease and Grace of an ice dancer (one of the easy things I was talking about) then came the time to hang them... one actually almost landed in a tree as I sent it flying across the yard in shear frustration due to the fact that the screws would NOT screw into the God forsaken holes! Well three hours and the \\\"phone a friend\\\" option later the doors were up‼️ Can I get a hallelujah up in here! Then I close the doors... You\'ve. Got. To. Be. Kidding. Me! There is a legit 1/2\\\" gap between the doors! In what universe is this ok? \\nThis shed is nowhere near waterproof, water resistant or any other term they want to use. Not only due to the door gap, but also due to the fact that the roof leaks like a sieve!\\nSo in summary.... \\nNO I do NOT recommend this product unless you\'re ok with everything you put in it getting wet.\",\"title\":\"Just don\'t\"},{\"name\":\"Sas███irl███8\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"The shed was delivered in two boxes.  It definitely needed two people to put it together.  Once we were almost done, the wind blew it over and it broke apart.  It was unrepairable so I sent it to the scrap yard!!  Don\'t buy unless you intend to assemble in one day.\",\"title\":\"Not a good experience!!\"},{\"name\":\"Lori\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It states it takes four hours to put together more like eight, very tedious. It does not have a floor to it, which it does not state so you have to go buy plywood or whatever you wanna put down for flooring had numerous dents in it.\",\"title\":\"Very difficult to put together\"},{\"name\":\"Kim███ly\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It did not come with all the parts\"},{\"name\":\"Kas███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Item was delayed and when I received it item was damaged and missing parts customer service wasn\'t able to help me out with my issue\",\"title\":\"item arrive late damage and missing parts\"},{\"name\":\"Ant███o\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"I received my shed full of dent, scratch, and missing part. I will never buy anything from this person ever again.\",\"title\":\"Disappointed\"},{\"name\":\"Tam███\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Hi, we purchased the shed a couple days ago. My husband took all day to put it up. A lot of the parts were not fitting properly and there was no proper directions on putting it together. The shed is very poor quality very thin and I do not recommend this.!!\",\"title\":\"Poor Quality\"}]',NULL,447.99,NULL,'[\"Patio & Garden\",\"Sheds & Outdoor Storage\",\"Sheds\",\"Shop Sheds by Material\",\"Wood Sheds\"]'),(974,'Shop Curtains','[\"Reduced price\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Amay-Grommet-Top-Blackout-Curtain-Panel-Grey-60-Inch-Wide-by-84-Inch-Long-1Panel_b1f5adcd-f2f4-4b3b-b723-d29771934190.fefaacd81fb13b7e89178968ed9088e6.jpeg\"',5.00,'[\"60 W x 108 L\",\"60 W x 120 L\",\"60 W x 132 L\",\"60 W x 72 L\",\"60 W x 84 L\",\"60 W x 95 L\",\"72 W x 108 L\",\"72 W x 120 L\",\"72 W x 132 L\",\"72 W x 72 L\",\"72 W x 84 L\",\"72 W x 96 L\"]','[\"Baby Pink\",\"Beige\",\"Black\",\"Brown\",\"Burgundy\",\"Gold\",\"Green\",\"Gray\",\"Greyish White\",\"Ivory\",\"Navy Blue\",\"Red\",\"Silver Grey\",\"Taupe\",\"White\"]','[{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"Machine Wash\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Susie\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"As a daytime sleeper, it\'s always been a challenge to block out the sunlight and noise. This curtain panel, at 60 inches wide by 108 inches long, is the ideal solution. It\'s easy to install, and the grommet top design adds a stylish touch. Plus, it genuinely blocks out the light, creating a peaceful, dark environment for me to sleep during the day. The quality is excellent, and I\'m thrilled with my purchase.\",\"title\":\"Love these\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey has surpassed my expectations. Not only do they provide exceptional blackout capabilities, but they also add a touch of elegance to my room. The grey color complements my décor perfectly. The curtains are easy to install and slide smoothly on the grommets. The size is generous and fits my window effortlessly. If you\'re looking for curtains that combine style and functionality, these are an excellent choice. Totally satisfied with this purchase!!!\",\"title\":\"Aesthetic and Functional Addition\"},{\"name\":\"Mor███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"These curtains strike the perfect balance between elegance and functionality. The grey color is sleek and modern, and the grommet top design makes them easy to install. I appreciate how well they block out light and noise, creating a serene atmosphere in my living space.\",\"title\":\"Great for price\"},{\"name\":\"Sta███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently updated my living room with the \\\"Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel\\\" in grey, and I couldn\'t be happier. The 60-inch width by 108-inch length is perfect for my large windows. These curtains are not only functional but also stylish. They add an elegant touch to the room, and the blackout feature is fantastic for movie nights or when I want to escape the outside world. The quality of the fabric and grommet design are impressive. I highly recommend these curtains for anyone looking to elevate their home decor.\",\"title\":\"Great product\"},{\"name\":\"Jef███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"A significant difference in my home. Its grey color adds a touch of sophistication to my decor, and the blackout feature ensures that I get a restful night\'s sleep. The 60x108 size is perfect for my window, and the grommet top design makes it easy to hang. This panel is a wonderful blend of quality and comfort, providing both style and functionality. It\'s a must-have for anyone looking to enhance their living space.\",\"title\":\"Quality and Comfort Combined!\"},{\"name\":\"David\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey. It\'s like having a piece of elegance and tranquility in my room. The blackout feature is incredible; it completely eliminates outside light, allowing me to enjoy total darkness when needed. The 60x108 size is generous and covers my window beautifully. If you want to transform your space into a serene retreat, look no further than this curtain panel.\",\"title\":\"Elegance in One Panel!\"},{\"name\":null,\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"The Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey is a fantastic addition to my home. The 60-inch width by 108-inch length provides ample coverage, and the blackout feature is incredibly effective. My room is now dark and cozy, perfect for a good night\'s sleep.\",\"title\":\"Great product\"},{\"name\":\"Diana\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I recently purchased the Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey, and I could be happier with my choice. These curtains not only look stylish with their sleek grey color but also perform exceptionally well. The blackout feature is incredible; it truly blocks out all unwanted light, providing a peaceful and dark environment for sleeping or watching movies during the day. The 60-inch width and 108-inch length were perfect for my window, and the grommet top design makes them easy to hang. If you\'re in search of both style and functionality in curtains, look no further.\",\"title\":\"Stylish and Effective\"},{\"name\":\"Novo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I purchased the Amay Grommet Top Blackout Curtain Panel in Grey, 60 Inch Wide by 108 Inch Long, and I am extremely satisfied with its performance. These curtains truly deliver on their promise of blackout capabilities. They effectively block out all external light, making my bedroom a perfect sanctuary for a good night\'s sleep, even during daylight hours. The quality of the fabric is excellent, and the grommets make them easy to install. I highly recommend these curtains to anyone in need of a reliable blackout solution.\",\"title\":\"Exceptional Blackout Performance\"},{\"name\":\"lav███y\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"I will start by saying all the parts for this project came from Walmart including the mounting bracket, curtain rod, black-out curtains, and curtain ties. The curtains will black out all of the light from the parking lot at night and dim the light in the room to be able to nap during the day. Overall very happy with the color and performance of the curtains.\",\"title\":\"Works really well for muting light\"}]',NULL,92.00,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Curtains & Window Treatments\",\"Curtains\",\"Shop Curtains\"]'),(975,'Picture Frames Shop All','[\"Reviewers highlighted: quality, size, sturdiness\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Gallery-Solutions-8-x10-Wall-Mount-Tabletop-Picture-Frame-for-5-x7-Photos-Black_81b98612-bccf-46e1-a1df-d3f71c0a901f.90be35080d5e69b17e1d9863275414de.jpeg\"',4.50,'[\"5 x 7\",\"8 x 10\",\"8 x 8\",\"8x19 2-Opening\",\"11 x 14\",\"12 x 12\",\"14 x 18\",\"16 x 20\",\"20 x 24\"]','[\"Black\",\"Black-White\",\"Black/white\",\"Gray\",\"Walnut\",\"White\"]',NULL,'[{\"name\":\"MWelf\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Love these frames and the double matting was perfect\",\"title\":\"Love this frame!\"},{\"name\":\"Ron███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"This frame is exactly what I have been searching for months. I have a Victorian print from an old Valentine. It was in a round glass frame when I bought it back in 1970. It got broken when I moved in 2007 and I packed it away in a box and forgot about it.  Now, I can hang it again and enjoy an item I have had for 50 years. Be aware that this frame is a regular picture frame that I am mounting at an angle to feature my print.\",\"title\":\"Great Frame for a Pretty Lady\"},{\"name\":\"JoJo\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Exceeded my expectations.\"},{\"name\":\"Roy\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Beautiful frame with high quality.\",\"title\":\"Repurposed for military patch display.\"},{\"name\":\"crz███dyc███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Nice. Great for my grey bathroom. Perfect size, nice quality.\"},{\"name\":\"SUZ███E\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I like the looks of this frame very much however, the matting is a tiny bit off left to right and since it is glued together there is no way to adjust it.  Most people probably wouldn\'t notice but I will see it every time I look at it.  One thing I do not like is the hanging method.  There are two plastic triangles at the corners with saw-tooth edges. \\n You are expected to put TWO screws into your wall.  It\'s supposed to make levelling your picture easier.  I don\'t know about you, but I prefer to put as few holes as possible into my walls.  Screws not included.  If they want to try something new, they should give us the option to hang it the usual way.  Very good brackets holding the back in nice and tight.  I like it too much to return it.\",\"title\":\"Mostly good\"},{\"name\":\"Fai███ss\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I am not sure how to rate it. It is lovely but despite careful packaging it arrived broken.\",\"title\":\"Beautiful but broken\"},{\"name\":\"Tre███\",\"rating\":2,\"review\":\"I ordered 3 frames and 1 of them came in a different color. So i asked for a replacement and sent it back and again I got the replacement in a different color. I do not want to take the hassle to return it again! But a disappointed customer!\",\"title\":\"Not the same color!\"},{\"name\":\"Deb███h\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Frame would gave been okay, but it arrived scratched and damage. Husband unknowingly threw away box it came in, otherwise it would be going back.\",\"title\":\"Buy at your own risk\"},{\"name\":\"julie\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"It arrived, broken as shown in the photo.\"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL,'[\"Home\",\"Decor\",\"Picture Frames\",\"Picture Frames Shop All\"]'),(976,'All American Crew',NULL,'\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/American-Crew-3-In-1-Shampoo-Conditioner-and-Body-Wash-250ml-8-45oz_912b8793-2fc9-4033-89ed-06a9b1569823.293b45869047789dc2d257f360f933d2.jpeg\"',4.60,'[]','[]','[{\"name\":\"Instructions\",\"value\":\"Apply generous amount over wet hair and body. Rinse well.\"},{\"name\":\"Fabric Care Instructions\",\"value\":\"none\"}]','[{\"name\":\"Liz███\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"My son absolutely lives this product.  So do I, he started throughly washing his hair when he started using it. His hair smells awesome and it looks great too.\",\"title\":\"Gorgeous Hair\"},{\"name\":\"Dan███ g\",\"rating\":5,\"review\":\"Literally the best shampoo I\'ve ever tried and one of the most best smells and 3n1 got to love it\",\"title\":\"The best smell in a bottle\"},{\"name\":\"Gre███io\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"The 3-in-1 shampoo and body wash is a great product I have used before. It smells very good and fresh. The only issue I have is my package arrived with a damaged bottle. But otherwise it\'s still a great product. Thank you\",\"title\":\"Satisfied Unsatisfied\"},{\"name\":\"Tec███\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"Love the shampoo. Great smell and feel. The only problem we had was shipping, one of the bottles leaked, because of the way it was packed.\",\"title\":\"Great product, but shipping needs better packaging\"},{\"name\":\"eme███aw\",\"rating\":4,\"review\":\"I really like the product. It goes on well, smells good, and it works as both a shampoo and conditioner. I would have given it 5 stars except that it doesn\'t have a pump top and you have to squeeze the bottle to get the shampoo out. This becomes a pain, especially when the shampoo is near the bottom of the bottle.\",\"title\":\"Good product but it needs a pump top\"},{\"name\":\"AST███S\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"I purchased this for Christmas for my son who has been using the product for a few years now and really likes.  I love the way it smells! However, I will be going to a salon for now on to buy it.  The shipping took close to month (needless to say he didn\'t have it at Christmas) and the bottle leaked in the box.\",\"title\":\"Not a good idea to order online.\"},{\"name\":\"Lore\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"My boyfriend is the one who gets his product and he likes it.  My  issue was with the shipping. There was no type of seal, wrapping or a protection for this product it was just tossed in a box and ended up leaking because the box was smashed during delivery. I just think it\'s basic care to at least wrap the product. The things I get shipped from a retailer are in much better condition than this.\",\"title\":\"Ok Product Bad Shipping\"},{\"name\":\"bob███par███\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"tea tree oil is so good for the scalp and for your body, so I was excited to try this! I saw it in my boyfriends shower and I love it use it as a body wash! Love the scent, how it lathers, and how my skin feels after. For a 3 in 1, you can\'t go wrong!\",\"title\":\"3 in 1\"},{\"name\":\"Rick1\",\"rating\":3,\"review\":\"Packaging could have been better as the product leaked during shipping.\",\"title\":\"Packaging could have been better as the product le\"},{\"name\":\"Bala\",\"rating\":1,\"review\":\"Bottle was open and half the shampoo was in the package.\",\"title\":\"Package was open\"}]','Aqua/Water/Eau, Sodium Laureth Sulfate, Dimethicone, Lauryl Glucoside, Acrylates Copolymer, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Parfum (Fragrance), Caprylyl Glycol, Citric Acid, Coco-Glucoside, Disodium Edta, Glyceryl Oleate, Glycol Distearate, Humulus Lupulus (Hops) Flower Extract, Hydroxypropyl Guar Hydroxypropyltrimonium Chloride, Laureth-23, Laureth-4, Propylene Glycol, Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Leaf Extract, Sodium Chloride, Sodium Hydroxide, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Salicylate, Citronellol, Eugenol, Hexyl Cinnamal, Limonene, Linalool, Benzyl Alcohol, Phenoxyethanol',NULL,'[{\"type\":\"Ingredients\",\"values\":\"Aqua/Water/Eau, Sodium Laureth Sulfate, Dimethicone, Lauryl Glucoside, Acrylates Copolymer, Cocamidopropyl Betaine, Parfum (Fragrance), Caprylyl Glycol, Citric Acid, Coco-Glucoside, Disodium Edta, Glyceryl Oleate, Glycol Distearate, Humulus Lupulus (Hops) Flower Extract, Hydroxypropyl Guar Hydroxypropyltrimonium Chloride, Laureth-23, Laureth-4, Propylene Glycol, Salvia Officinalis (Sage) Leaf Extract, Sodium Chloride, Sodium Hydroxide, Alpha-Isomethyl Ionone, Benzyl Salicylate, Citronellol, Eugenol, Hexyl Cinnamal, Limonene, Linalool, Benzyl Alcohol, Phenoxyethanol\"}]','[\"Premium Beauty\",\"Featured Premium Beauty Brands\",\"American Crew\",\"All American Crew\"]'),(977,'Womens Pants','[\"Clearance\"]','\"https://i5.walmartimages.com/seo/Summer-Savings-Wycnly-Sale-Capri-Pants-Women-Womens-Drawstring-Elastic-Waist-Capris-Casual-Plus-Size-Button-Straight-Leg-3-4-Trousers-Comfy-Cotton-Li_3bcf3b9d-18fd-4386-999b-8